          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways in an indoor space, her long black wavy hair cascading over her shoulders and back, glossy in the dim light. Her fair, smooth skin glows as she leans back slightly, head turned toward the camera with a dreamy, heavy-lidded gaze and parted lips, relaxed and suggestive. She wears a sheer, pale gray-pink bodysuit with thin straps, cutouts at the waist and hips accentuating her curves, the fabric clinging and nearly transparent, hinting at her nude body beneath. The frame is a waist-up shot, slightly low angle, with her centered right of frame. In the foreground, details of her body and the bodysuit. Background: a wall with white trim, dark teal wainscoting below, pale gray-white above. A dark gray door with electronic lock and metal handle to the left; a yellow \"SOC\" sign and white outlet on the wall. Right edge shows a warm yellow sconce casting soft light, illuminating her shoulder and casting subtle shadows behind her. Lower right corner reveals a black chair back and gold metal base. Lighting is warm side-backlight from the sconce, creating highlights on her face and body, with the background darker for contrast. Tones: gray-pink, deep green, warm yellow. The image has a candid, amateur feel—like a quick snapshot with a phone or compact camera in a hotel room, with slight grain and imperfect light transitions, adding authenticity. The composition feels natural, her pose relaxed, the scene simple yet rich in detail, unpolished and raw, evoking intimacy, sensuality, and a quiet, ambiguous mood of modern urban life.",
