          "prompt": "A blue-haired woman kneels on a light gray wooden floor, wearing only a black leather strappy bustier corset that leaves her breasts partially exposed, a white open-collar shirt with a black ribbon tie, and black rabbit-ear headband. Her blue curls fall naturally, makeup flawless with deep crimson lipstick contrasting her cool-toned hair. A thorny vine tattoo wraps her left arm. She sits with legs crossed, right thigh forward, left leg tucked, her right hand caressing the inner thigh, left hand resting on her knee. Black fishnet stockings and chunky-heeled black ankle boots complete the look. The pose is elegant yet charged, with one strap of the corset slipped off her shoulder. Natural light streams through large windows from the left, casting dramatic shadows that emphasize her curves, the texture of the leather, and the sheen of her lips. The room is minimalist—white walls, two windows, soft ambient light. Mid-shot, slightly high angle, subject offset to the right. Monochrome palette punctuated by her blue hair and red lips, blending high-fashion studio quality with an intimate, candid feel.",
