        {
          "id": "krea2-d5e40a9401323372dfcd806b",
          "alias": "单女露胸绿长裤乡村俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless on the grass of an outdoor farm, her long, sleek black hair falling naturally over her bare shoulders. She wears only a pair of loose-fitting military green work pants unbuttoned at the waist, revealing the curve of her hips and the smooth skin of her torso. Her body is slender and toned, with small, firm breasts and pale, delicate skin. She bends forward gracefully, extending a bundle of fresh green branches toward a flock of sheep gathered around her. Her gaze is soft and focused on the animals, serene and absorbed in the moment. A thin silver chain glints at her neck. Her fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed. The background is an open pastoral landscape: a bright blue sky dotted with fluffy white clouds, distant rolling green hills, and a white picket fence enclosing the pasture. To the right stands a colorful wooden cottage with blue walls and a red tiled roof, its windows shaped in unique geometry. In the foreground, several woolly sheep—white, black, and black-and-white—crowd around her, sniffing and nibbling at the leaves in her hand. Their wool is thick and textured, with one black sheep wearing a green ear tag, another white sheep with a brown patch on its head. Their expressions are gentle and curious, some lifting their heads, others grazing. The composition is a medium shot, with the woman positioned slightly to the right, creating a focal point. The left side of the frame opens to display the sheep and the leafy branches, balancing the image. Her body leans slightly, arm extended, guiding the viewer’s eye from her to the animals, evoking a harmonious human-animal interaction. The light is bright natural sunlight, streaming from the upper left, casting soft shadows on her face, arm, and the sheep. The grass is vivid emerald green, leaf veins clear, with rich light-and-shadow layers. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and joyful, with the peaceful simplicity of rural life. The palette is warm and natural, saturation moderate, details sharp, resembling a candid photo taken with a professional camera in clear daytime. The cottage and distant hills are slightly blurred, emphasizing the subject and the sheep. The composition tells a story of serene coexistence, like a realistic pastoral painting full of life and tenderness, evoking a moment of calm and beauty.",
