          "alias": "单女短裙摄影棚戏谑站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a gray-and-white checkered backdrop, wearing a black see-through tube top that clings to her curves, the sheer fabric revealing the outline of her nipples, paired with a micro pleated skirt barely covering her ass, transparent elbow-length gloves, black thigh-high stockings with garter belt straps digging into her soft skin. Her long black hair falls naturally with straight bangs framing her face, eyes bright and clear, lips curled into a teasing smile as she raises both hands in a playful V-sign. A blue heart-shaped gem pendant hangs from a silver chain around her neck, catching the light. The background features \"Gfriend\" lettering and circular logos in repeating gray-and-white squares, evoking a promotional or fan-meet vibe. The medium shot captures her body slightly angled toward the camera, head facing forward, with soft even lighting highlighting every contour of her face and the smooth texture of her skin. The tube top’s lace edge brushes her collarbone, the pleated skirt’s folds create depth, the net gloves blur her skin texture, the stockings gleam with a subtle sheen, and the metal garter clips glint. Shadows fall naturally behind her, creating a sense of space. The color palette is black-and-white accented by the blue gem, giving a clean yet bold look. The mood is professional yet inviting, as if captured for a poster or social media shoot at a K-pop event. High-resolution, detailed realistic photography under indoor studio lights, with a balanced composition drawing the eye from her face to her hands, then down her entire body, exuding youthful energy and confident sexuality.",
