          "alias": "单女棕连衣裙阳台害羞注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges sideways on a wooden sunbed on a balcony, wearing a deep brown sleeveless dress with white polka dots, the skirt pooling around her thighs and revealing a generous glimpse of bare skin as it rides up. Her short black hair falls naturally, bangs neatly across her forehead; her fair skin glows in the warm light, cheeks flushed, lips slightly parted as she chews a golden chip from a red popcorn bag. She holds the bag in her left hand, right hand bringing another crispy piece to her mouth, dark nail polish on her nails. Her legs are crossed and casually draped over the edge of the lounger, ankles relaxed, her gaze dreamily fixed on the turquoise sea shimmering beyond the white metal railing. Warm sunlight from the left casts soft shadows across her body, accentuating her curves and the delicate fabric clinging to her torso and hips. In the background, low tropical buildings, palm trees, and a lush green landscape frame the scene. A modern floor lamp with a dark gray shade and a round wooden table add indoor touches. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with her occupying the right side, leaving the left open to the expansive ocean and sky. The low angle and gentle lighting create an intimate, candid feel—a seductive, lazy afternoon captured in a moment of sensory pleasure.",
