          "prompt": "A young woman walks down a city street, her soft, deep brown hair cascading over her shoulders, strands gently swaying in the breeze. Her face is delicately sculpted with high cheekbones and fair, luminous skin. Her eyes meet the camera with a warm, confident gaze, a slight smile playing on her lips—elegant and approachable. She wears a loose black leather jacket with a glossy finish, showing fine grain and natural creases. The jacket is open at the front with an asymmetrical hem, revealing a pink ruffled miniskirt so sheer and short it barely covers her, the fabric soft and layered, its sweet color contrasting with the dark leather. Underneath, her bare torso is visible through the gap, with the curve of her breasts partially exposed. Her hands are shoved into the jacket pockets, stance relaxed. On her feet are light brown pointed-toe high heels, smooth and sleek, accentuating her long legs. A black leather shoulder bag hangs at her side, simple with a gold buckle. The foreground shows gray sidewalk with fine texture and reflections, clean, with yellow traffic lines. Mid-ground features a black business sedan with glossy paint reflecting blurred surroundings, white text \"GENESIS SERVICE\" on the side, multi-spoke alloy wheels. Background is a city building facade in white and light gray, windows neatly aligned, distant car and pedestrian silhouettes. Composition is centered, subject slightly turned but facing the camera, eye-level perspective creating a documentary feel. Natural sunlight from the upper left casts soft shadows on her right cheek, arm, and leg, highlights on the leather, giving texture. Light transitions smoothly across the scene. Atmosphere is bright, fresh, with urban daily life. Palette dominated by black, white, gray with pink and brown accents. Details rich, realistic, as if shot with a full-frame camera at 85mm f/2.8, 1/125s, ISO 100, capturing a candid moment. Style is fashion street photography, blending artistry and realism.",
