          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long, jet-black hair cascading over her shoulders, glossy strands brushing her cheek. Her delicate features are perfectly composed: deep, seductive eyes framed by heavy smoky liner and long curled lashes, a sharp nose, full lips painted pale pink and parted in a sultry half-smile. She wears a revealing off-shoulder bandeau dress in cream and black stripes, cinched with black leather straps and metal buckles across her bust and waist; the dress slips down to expose the tops of her breasts and a deep cleavage. The skirt is a frothy peplum hem that flutters as she moves. Her right hand extends forward, index finger pointing directly at the lens, while her left hand grips a pink microphone. She leans forward, legs spread wide in a half-squat, the pose oozing power and raw sensuality. Behind her, deep blue stage lights cast a soft halo around her silhouette, with a blurred LED screen showing abstract patterns in the distance. The entire scene is bathed in cool blue tones, contrasting with the warm flesh and creamy dress. Centered composition draws all attention to her body, the subtle shadowing and lighting enhancing every curve and contour. The atmosphere is electric, a frozen moment of intense, lustful performance captured like a high-fashion NSFW portrait.",
