          "alias": "单女露胸黑短裙窗边忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a tatami mat in the corner of a room, wearing only a black skirt, her long, slightly wavy hair falling naturally, leaning against the wall, holding a raw-wood-colored folk guitar between her thighs, her fingers resting lightly on the strings, her eyes cast downward to the floor, expressing a quiet, melancholy mood. Her body leans slightly forward, relaxed yet thoughtful. Warm sunlight streams from a window on the right, casting clear, soft bands of light across the wall and tatami, creating a pattern of bright and dark stripes, illuminating the side of her face and the bare skin of her shoulder and torso. The foreground features the girl and the guitar, the instrument held between her legs, its body a warm brown with visible wood grain, the headstock pointing right, the neck extending into the midground. In the background: a dark wooden desk with a light green metal desk lamp (round shade, adjustable arm), several stacked books, an old film camera, and some clutter. On the wall behind the desk hangs a mirror with a light wood frame, reflecting part of the room, including a file box and a grid storage rack. To the left, a dark wooden door with a vintage brass handle, a sliver of shadow visible at the crack. The whole scene is bathed in warm yellow tones: off-white walls, woven tatami floor. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the figure positioned left of center, light entering from the upper right, creating strong chiaroscuro. The visual lines – formed by the light direction and the girl’s downward gaze – guide the viewer’s eye to her face and the guitar. The atmosphere is warm, peaceful, artistic, and lived-in, as if capturing a solitary afternoon moment. The image is finely textured with a slight grain and film-like tint, simulating the realism of amateur daily equipment. Color saturation is moderate, details are rich, and light transitions are natural, producing a realistic and story-rich visual effect.",
