          "prompt": "A young woman stands inside a café, her shoulder-length black hair with blunt bangs, fair skin, delicate features, her eyes clear and focused to the right, lips slightly parted in a quiet, content smile. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, one hand lightly holding a warm beige paper coffee cup near her lips as if about to sip, the other hand hanging naturally. She wears only a pair of small gold earrings, adding a touch of refinement. Behind her, the warm café interior glows with a white neon sign reading \"Le Café TOKYO\" beside a heart-shaped and letter \"A\" logo, a glass display case of pastries below, wooden counter reflecting soft light, a sink and kitchen equipment to the left, and a round frosted glass pendant lamp casting warm amber light. The composition is a medium shot, the woman slightly off-center left, body turned slightly toward the lens, head angled right, creating natural movement. Foreground shows her upper body and the coffee cup, midground the counter and background elements, background the wall, sign, and display case. The visual flow starts from her face and follows her gaze to the right, evoking a serene, story-rich mood. Soft lighting from the overhead lamp and sign creates a warm backlight, highlighting her nude torso with delicate shadows on skin and clothing (none), the overall palette warm beige and cream with the bare skin tones, evoking a comfortable, relaxed yet explicitly sensual daily scene. The image is finely detailed, as if shot with a high-resolution full-frame camera, blending realistic life with artistic beauty, ideal for capturing a urban woman's intimate, idle moment—conveying tenderness, calm, and quiet satisfaction.",
