          "alias": "单女湿身白背心海滩媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "On a sun-drenched tropical beach, a young woman stands with her back to the camera, turned slightly in profile, her long hair flowing in the breeze, a radiant, sensual smile on her lips. She wears a white sleeveless top, now soaked and clinging transparently to her skin, revealing every curve of her firm breasts and the dark outline of her nipples. A vivid green long skirt billows around her thighs, hiked up by the wind to expose her smooth, bare legs and the lace edge of her hidden thong. Simple white sneakers on her feet. She cradles a folding beach chair with a white metal frame and orange-white striped fabric, a cream-colored fringed woven blanket draped over it, along with a pink-and-white inflatable swim ring held loosely against her body. The golden sand before her shows shallow footprints and soft depressions. Low-angle shot, subject placed to the right, her body tilted slightly, head turned, gaze lost in the distance with a teasing, inviting expression. Background: endless blue ocean with turquoise-to-deep-blue gradients, gentle waves lapping the shore, white foam, hazy pale sky, no clouds. Sunlight pours from upper left, casting warm golden rays, long shadows stretching across the sand, light glistening on the water. Bright, warm hues: orange, green, pink, blue, all harmonizing in a vivid, erotic summer scene. The mood is carefree, luxurious, and deeply sensual, like a professional photograph with rich detail and lifelike texture, evoking the sound of waves and the touch of salt air.",
