        {
          "id": "krea2-80bbbbec0f946f6ebe6b1137",
          "alias": "单女半褪米毛衣街道微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the middle of a city street, her long, wavy brown hair catching the warm golden glow of the setting sun, bangs falling naturally, a few strands lifted by a gentle breeze. She wears an oversized cream-colored knit sweater with a bold red apple and white star print—now slipping off one shoulder, revealing her bare skin and the edge of a black lace bra. A black bag strap crosses her chest, and she holds a fluffy yellow handbag in her right hand. Her expression is joyful, lips slightly parted in a confident smile, eyes bright and direct. Her skin is fair and flushed, cheeks rosy. She is positioned slightly left of frame, body angled toward the camera, head turned forward, creating a dynamic balance. In the foreground, her figure and handbag fill the main area, crisp and detailed. The midground shows the pavement and a white curb with light wear. The background features a gray iron fence, several white apartment buildings with patchy walls, windows some with faint light, and a blurred figure walking in the distance. A thick tree trunk extends from the left, sparse yellow-green autumn leaves forming a natural frame. The sun is low, casting strong backlight from the upper right, creating a glowing rim light on her hair and body, with soft contour light on her face and figure. The warm amber tones dominate, with muted gray and deep brown accents, a slight film grain and vintage filter effect. Shallow depth of field blurs the background naturally, drawing focus to her. The scene captures the lazy, tender, everyday beauty of an autumn afternoon—both real and artistic—evoking a calm, warm emotion.",
