          "id": "krea2-9104add595bf9129fb6be2b6",
          "alias": "单女白内衣椅上微笑坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden bench, her long black hair falling naturally, fair skin and delicate features, smiling softly and warmly at the camera with clear, bright eyes that radiate approachability. She wears a sheer white lace bralette that leaves little to the imagination, her nipples faintly visible through the fabric, paired with a flirty light gray ruffled mini skirt that barely covers her upper thighs. Her legs are long and elegantly crossed, clad in pristine white thigh-high socks. In her right hand she gently holds a beautifully woven rattan basket filled with vibrant flowers—a full yellow sunflower, several purple blooms, and green leaves, each petal crisp and detailed. The background is a beige wall with a brown corkboard pinned with various hand-drawn illustrations, photos, recipe cards, and a canvas bag reading “FLORAL.” Below the board hang colorful scarves in blue-white plaid, pink floral, yellow-green stripes, each with distinct patterns and textures. To the right, a small white table holds a black electronic device and an open notebook. The scene is lit by soft, warm afternoon sunlight coming from the left, casting natural side lighting that caresses her face and body, creating subtle shadows and highlights. Composition centers her slightly to the right, foreground with her and the basket, midground with the corkboard and scarves, background with the wall and table. Visual flow starts at her face, follows her gaze and smile to the basket, then extends to the background details. Overall atmosphere is cozy, warm, and artsy, with tones of warm yellow, off-white, and light gray, accented by the bright yellow of the flowers and the colorful scarves, blending vintage and modern home style. The image looks like a candid real-life moment captured with a simple camera—detailed, layered, and immersive, as if freezing a quiet, beautiful slice of life.",
