        {
          "id": "krea2-2b17b0b7e4cec802eaad68b1",
          "alias": "单女露胸西装书店忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "In the dim, dusty depths of an aged bookstore, a young woman sits alone in the narrow aisle between towering wooden shelves. She wears a dark blazer, unbuttoned over a sheer white blouse left open to reveal the swell of her bare breasts, a short skirt riding high on her thighs, and brown leather boots. One leg crosses over the other, her skirt hitching upward as she leans forward, lost in the open book in her hands. Her long black hair falls over her face, shadowing her serene, contemplative expression. Around her, towering shelves overflow with worn, colorful books, some stacked haphazardly on the floor. Soft, warm light spills from a vintage green-framed window to her left, casting a golden halo around her silhouette and illuminating the delicate curve of her neck and collarbone. The low-angle shot frames her as the focal point, with symmetrical shelves forming a tunnel that draws the eye inward. The scene is bathed in nostalgic amber tones, with film grain and shallow depth of field blurring the foreground books. A quiet, intimate, slightly lonely moment of sensual reading.",
