          "prompt": "A young woman stands by a stone wall on a city street, wearing an open black long coat with nothing underneath, her bare breasts partially visible, the coat framing her skin. She has a black lace choker, simple earrings, and a ring. Her black hair falls straight with bangs, tousled slightly in the breeze. She leans sideways, one hand touching her neck, the other in her coat pocket. Her right leg is bent, knee resting on the stone wall, wearing shiny black pointed-toe high-heel boots that hug her calves. Her makeup is clean with light pink lips, a calm, deep gaze into the camera. The background is blurred city scene with brick, glass, and a green traffic sign. Soft, even light from above creates subtle shadows on her coat and boot reflections. Medium shot, slightly diagonal composition. Muted tones of black, gray, brown with a hint of green. Photo-realistic, shot on full-frame with 50mm f/1.8, ISO 200, 1/125 sec, slight grain, natural detail. She exudes an independent, confident, cool urban attitude, caught in a candid yet posed moment.",
