          "alias": "单女蓝和服公寓媚态坐喝",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a tatami floor in a traditional Japanese ryokan room, her soft blue kimono with pink floral patterns and white geometric designs partly slipped open, revealing the curve of her bare shoulder and a hint of cleavage. The deep red obi is loosely tied, cinching her waist. Her black hair is pinned up in an elegant bun with blunt bangs and a few loose strands falling across her face. She raises a tall glass of golden beer with a thick white foam head, tilting her head back as her lips touch the rim, taking a slow, sensual sip, her eyes half-lidded and gazing directly at the viewer with a soft, knowing smile. Her left hand rests on the table, which holds a traditional placemat, black chopsticks, a white ceramic sake cup, a blue-and-white chopstick rest, a yellow paper menu slip, and a dark speckled ceramic bowl. In the background, a wooden sliding door and storage cabinet on the left, a closed flat-screen TV on a wooden stand on the right, pale gray fabric walls, and a framed calligraphy piece above. Warm side lighting from the left casts soft shadows across her face, enhancing her skin texture and the gleam of the glass. The scene is a medium close-up, slightly off-center, with shallow depth of field blurring the background. Warm yellow, beige, pale blue, and pink hues create a cozy, nostalgic atmosphere with a slight film grain and muted saturation, evoking a candid, intimate moment of a leisurely hot spring trip.",
