          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a bright window indoors, wearing only a white ruffled blouse unbuttoned to reveal her black lace bra, a short pleated plaid skirt hiked up to show her black thigh-high stockings and bare thighs. Her hands rest on her own hips, fingers teasing the waistband of her skirt, pose confident yet slightly shy. She has a straight black bob with blunt bangs, eyes gazing softly at the camera with a mix of melancholy and lust. The scene is centered slightly right, with large white sheer curtains filtering warm sunlight that casts soft dappled shadows across the fabric. Light rays stream diagonally, creating subtle halos and gradients, and fall onto the floor and wall in clear beams. A plain white wall on the left holds an embedded power outlet; the minimalist room has a light glossy floor reflecting soft light. In the foreground, the edge of a bed with white sheets curves slightly, adding depth. Medium shot captures her full body with space around, framing her against the window. Natural side-backlight from the right window outlines her figure, giving her hair a golden glow, while her face is evenly lit with gentle shadow transitions. Clothing wrinkles and fabric textures are accentuated by light. Color palette is mostly black, white, and gray, with a hint of cool blue sky outside, creating a contrast of cool and warm. The mood is quiet, nostalgic, with a film-like grain and precise exposure, feeling like a candid morning or afternoon moment. The composition leads the eye from her face to the light source outside, then back along the light paths to her body, forming a visual loop. The overall aesthetic is innocent yet erotic, capturing a delicate balance of vulnerability and seduction.",
