          "alias": "单女全裸灰围裙厨房微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a modern minimalist kitchen, her deep brown hair cut in blunt bangs and falling to her shoulders, skin pale and flawless. She gazes directly at the camera with a warm, sweet smile and clear, bright eyes, her expression inviting and natural. She is completely naked except for a gray plaid apron tied loosely around her waist, her small breasts and nipples exposed, the apron's bib slipping slightly to reveal the curve of her chest. Her hands hold a round white ceramic plate stacked with several slices of black sesame toast bread, each slice neatly wrapped in transparent plastic wrap, the golden brown bread speckled with dark seeds. Two similar white plates sit on the induction cooktop with digital display, one holding plain white toast, the other whole wheat or multigrain, also covered in plastic wrap. The counter is light wood with rounded edges, smooth and fine-grained. Behind her, the clean kitchen is tiled with pale gray vertical-striped subway tiles, textured and layered. Above, two open wooden shelves hold green potted plants, yellow flower pots, an orange cast-iron pot, glass jars, and small wooden crates, adding life and color. To the left, a stainless steel sink with a silver curved faucet, beside it a dish soap bottle and cleaning supplies. To the right, a built-in oven, rice cooker, red measuring cup, knife rack, and at the far right a tall white refrigerator with clean lines. The room is filled with soft, bright natural light and warm white indoor lighting from above and in front, casting gentle shadows and highlighting her face and the food. The composition centers on her, mid-shot, her body slightly below center, the foreground plates leading the eye from lower left to her hands and the bread. The background elements are balanced, creating a cozy, domestic atmosphere. The color palette is white, beige, light gray, with accents of orange, green, and black, harmonious and warm. The image feels like a candid, intimate moment of a daily breakfast preparation, rich in texture and detail, as if shot with a professional camera yet retaining natural light and a documentary-style realism, blending artistic beauty with a sense of everyday sensuality.",
