          "alias": "单女露胸广场俏皮站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young female barista stands behind the warm wooden counter of a cozy café, completely topless, her silky black hair with straight bangs falling softly around her bare shoulders. She rests her chin on her right hand, her left arm crossed under her breasts, pressing them slightly, her nipples visible against the soft café light. Her gaze is direct, playful, and inviting, with a hint of contemplative mischief, captured mid-break in a natural, relaxed stance. On the counter before her, neatly arranged ceramic cups with delicate gold and blue trim, transparent glasses, a metal coffee pot, and a small potted plant catch the ambient glow. Behind her, a professional espresso machine stands in the center—silver body with red buttons and a digital display—flanked by a grinder, milk frother, and tools. A tissue box, sugar jar, stirrers, and a vintage mini oven scatter the counter. On the wall, a pink menu poster reads \"STRAWBERRY Cream Cheese Crumble,\" with yellow sticky notes and small decorations below. The background features a warm indoor setting: a double-layer ceiling—cream textured upper with warm yellow LED strips and dark gray lower—pale gray-white walls, a square wall lamp on the right casting soft yellow light onto a Christmas wreath, and a wooden-framed window on the left revealing green bamboo and plants outside, natural light streaming in. The composition centers on her nude upper body, with a diagonal layout leading the eye from the coffee gear to the window. Lighting comes from the top strip, wall lamp, and daylight, creating warm shadows that highlight her skin and the textures of objects. The color palette is warm yellow, cream, deep brown, with accents of black, white, and green—harmonious and rich, evoking a documentary-style, artistic slice of everyday café life, intimate and serene.",
