          "prompt": "A young woman with vibrant orange short hair, fluffy and natural, stands nude from the waist up against a pure light blue background. Her bare chest is fully exposed, small white hair clips adding a playful touch. Her makeup is refined and natural—accentuated eyes, soft lips. She wears loose blue-and-white striped wide-leg pants, cuffed at the ankles, and orange-and-cream high-top canvas sneakers. A white over-ear headphone rests around her neck, cable dangling. Her hands are raised high above her head, fingers interlocked and slightly curved, arms taut and elegant. On her right wrist a simple bracelet, left wrist a bangle. She slings a pink electric guitar with intricate geometric patterns and stickers diagonally across her bare torso, the deep blue strap contrasting against her skin. Her body is slightly turned toward the camera, gaze direct and focused, lips slightly parted, exuding calm determination. Centered composition, full-body shot. Background is clean, soft light blue. On the left and right sides, white text reads \"青とオレンジ\" and \"blue & orange\" in a modern minimalist font. Lighting from front-top, soft and even, no harsh shadows. High saturation, blue and orange dominant, strong cool-warm contrast. Vibrant, musical, youthful atmosphere. Commercial/ad-style photography with realistic detail and sensual edge.",
