          "prompt": "A blonde woman wears a tight red dress with black vertical stripes and lace trim, thin spaghetti straps, and a black bow at the chest, but the dress is unzipped and pulled down to expose her full bare breasts—nipples hard, skin glowing. She stands in a cluttered indoor studio, body slightly turned to the right, head facing the camera with a focused, cool stare, dark red lipstick, perfect makeup. Her left hand grips a long white-handled tool (like a wooden spoon or paintbrush), her right hand holds a piece of red fabric near her hip, pose natural yet tense, as if about to begin a manual craft or performance. Behind her, multiple red fabrics hang on the left, swaying lightly; on the back wall, everyday objects: colored bottles, cardboard boxes, wooden crates, a green toolbox printed with \"HOLE\"; to the right, a circular metal frame structure and a wooden chair/stool. The environment is messy but story-rich. Medium shot from waist up, subtle S-curve in her stance. Foreground shows edge of table and cabinet, adding depth. Soft light from left—natural, indoor, highlighting her face, the folds of the dress, and the bare skin of her chest and stomach. Shadows smooth, skin glowing with warm tones. Dominant red, with black, white, gray. The whole scene feels like a behind-the-scenes film still or an improvised art project, blending everyday reality with theatrical sensuality. She is fully topless, dress pulled down, the red fabric and tool adding a suggestive, performance-ready tension.",
