          "prompt": "A young woman squats on an outdoor brick path, wearing a white cap, her blue denim jacket and jeans discarded to the side, leaving her topless with a black polka dot choker around her neck and large hoop earrings; her bare breasts are exposed, nipples visible, as she smiles warmly at the camera, her right hand gently stroking an orange tabby cat wearing a pink collar, its tail held high, body turned slightly left, in a relaxed yet alert pose. Her legs are bent, knees near the ground, hands resting on the cat in an intimate moment. She is positioned center-right, mid-shot, occupying about a third of the frame. The background is a lived-in street corner courtyard: foreground shows mossy gray stone slabs and potted plants, with a white square planter on the left reading \"gift,\" filled with lush green vines and pink flowers. Mid-ground holds more potted plants—tall leafy shrubs and low herbs in white plastic and terracotta pots. Behind, a row of green metal electrical boxes or storage cabinets with rust and yellow warning signs, tangled wires and pipes overhead. Further back, wooden stairs and blurred structures. Soft natural light from upper left casts a warm golden glow on the woman and plants, with low contrast, creating a hazy, delicate texture. The color palette is dominated by green, accented with pink, orange, blue, and white, evoking a fresh, slightly retro atmosphere. Subtle film grain and slight overexposure suggest an old-camera snapshot. The composition is asymmetrical, using the left planter as a visual guide toward the woman and cat, while right-side plants and building lines create depth. The green electrical boxes contrast with the foreground foliage. The scene exudes everyday warmth and quiet intimacy, like a lazy weekend afternoon with a pet, rich in detail yet uncluttered, blending urban traces with natural beauty.",
