          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a metal shoe locker, her tousled light-blonde curls falling naturally around her face. She gazes slightly upward to the left, lips parted, a playful and curious expression. Her wine-red Puma zip-up jacket is unzipped to mid-chest, revealing the bare curve of her breasts and a stark white stripe across the front with a golden Puma logo. The jacket hem rides up, exposing a slim waist and the top of her black high-waisted shorts, which have side slits. She wears cream over-the-knee socks that hug her calves, elongating her legs. Her body tilts slightly; her left hand rests casually on the metal locker door behind her, while her right hand gently lifts the jacket hem, hinting at more skin. The background shows two gray metal lockers with shelves packed with colorful sports shoes—red, blue, white, black, yellow, green—some still in transparent bags, suggesting a collection or new purchases. Dark storage boxes sit on top. The lighting is soft, even, coming from the front, highlighting her face, glinting off the jacket's surface, and reflecting off the metal. Shadows are smooth, no harsh contrast. Mid-shot composition places her slightly off-center right, with the lockers extending left to balance. Her gaze leads from her face, up-left, then back down to her body and clothing details, finally to the vibrant shoes in the background. Tones of wine, black, and white dominate, accented by bright colors, creating a cool-warm contrast. The image feels like a candid, personal moment in a private collection room or changing area—youthful, cool, confident, and subtly explicit. The focus is sharp on her, with a slight background blur for depth. Skin texture and fabric folds are crisp; metal reflections are lifelike. Atmosphere: clean, modern, sensual, with a touch of voyeuristic intimacy.",
