          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a tropical beach, her long golden hair braided into a side French braid, a wide-brimmed straw hat tilted down partially shading her face, a sweet smile on her lips, her eyes gazing softly at the camera. Her fair, smooth skin glows with a light blush; her makeup is delicate and natural, lips a soft pink, nose elegantly straight. A small butterfly tattoo adorns her right shoulder. She wears a delicate gold double-C logo necklace and a thinner single chain around her neck. She is topless, her bare breasts exposed under the straw hat's shadow, the open air caressing her skin. She is dressed only in loose-fitting high-waisted khaki wide-leg trousers, the waistband left unbuttoned, exposing the curve of her hip. Her left hand rests lightly on her trouser waist, her right hand holds a brown woven tote bag slung over her shoulder. She stands slightly turned to the side, head tilted, relaxed and effortlessly sensual, embodying a lazy summer day. In the midground, a wide expanse of fine beige sand scattered with a few dry leaves and pebbles. Behind her, a typical Southeast Asian building: white walls, red tile roof, dark wooden supports under the eaves, stone steps leading to the entrance, a gray stone wall in front with several white plastic loungers. Lush green foliage extends from the left into the frame. The sky is overcast, a muted gray-white, soft diffused light without harsh shadows. The overall atmosphere is calm, intimate, and carefree. The composition centers on her, with the background elements softly blurred, focusing on her bare upper body, the delicate chain against her skin, and the subtle details of hair and straw. The image has a slight film grain and natural color shift, as if captured on a real camera with a personal, voyeuristic feel—like a candid snapshot shared between friends.",
