          "prompt": "A young woman in a black satin cheongsam embroidered with pink plum blossoms, the collar and cuffs trimmed with delicate pink piping. The high slit exposes one leg, revealing black fishnet stockings and black high heels. She rests one foot on a stone railing post, the other leg planted firmly, her pose confident and tense. In her hands, she holds a white feather fan edged with peacock feathers and a red tassel at the handle, raised to her chest. She turns slightly, looking back over her shoulder with a focused, playful gaze. Her hair is styled in double buns with loose strands falling on each side, adding a touch of playful charm. The setting is a Chinese garden with red pillars and yellow-tiled pavilions reflected in a still lake. In the foreground, gray stone railings and a red metal handrail create sharp color contrast. The composition is a medium shot, placing the woman slightly left of center, her body angled to guide the eye from the raised foot up to her face. Soft, diffused overcast light casts gentle shadows and highlights the glossy silk, the feathery lightness of the fan, the texture of fishnets, and the gleam of her heels. The overall atmosphere blends traditional Eastern aesthetics with modern fashion, evoking a retro yet avant-garde portrait that feels both staged and stolen from life. The image is rich in detail—every curve of her body, the sheen of her stockings, and the tension in her pose exude a sensual, confident allure.",
