        {
          "id": "krea2-e8a7fac2a4c6ffcb72614564",
          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙广场沉思站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors, her long, thick black wavy hair cascading naturally to her waist with soft, luminous waves and slightly tousled ends, exuding a lazy vitality. Her skin is fair and smooth, features delicately sculpted with elongated brows, subtle shimmering eye makeup, and clear, gentle eyes meeting the camera. Her lips are slightly parted, naturally pink, her expression serene with a hint of contemplation. She wears a pure white lace sleeveless dress, but the fabric is sheer and translucent, revealing the curves of her body beneath—her nipples visible through the intricate floral pattern, the V-neck plunging deep to expose the swell of her bare breasts. The dress is cinched at the waist with a matching bow, and the A-line skirt flows in soft folds, lifting slightly as she shifts her weight, hinting at bare thighs. She holds a woven straw handbag in her right hand, square with natural wheat-straw texture, adorned with colorful embroidered flowers and leaves in orange, pink, yellow, and green, double handles matching the body. Her left hand rests lightly on a vertical wooden slat wall, fingers long with neatly polished nails in a light shade, her posture relaxed as if stepping out of a scene. The background contrasts dark brown wooden slats with uniform gaps and a smooth white wall on the right. Warm light pours from the upper left, casting soft side illumination across her face, collarbone, and arms, creating subtle shadows that enhance her form and the sheen of her bare skin. The wooden wall takes on a warm tint, with gentle chiaroscuro. The composition is a medium shot, the woman occupying two-thirds of the frame, her head at the upper third, gaze slightly right, leading the viewer’s eye to her face. The foreground includes her figure and handbag, midground her body and flowing skirt, background the textured wall and white surface—layered with depth. The lighting is warm, intimate, evoking a romantic urban moment. The palette is white, cream, brown, with pops of colorful floral accents, harmonious and nostalgic. The image is crisp, detailed, as if captured by a professional camera in natural light, hyper-realistic, no apparent post-processing—a candid, everyday beauty, like a snapshot in a café corner or private courtyard, brimming with artistic emotion.",
