        {
          "id": "krea2-b8c288b577368e80e0545469",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑衬衫办公室沉思坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a white office chair, leaning back slightly, head tilted to the upper right, gazing out the window with a lazy, contemplative expression. She has long, sleek black hair falling naturally over her shoulders and chest, and wears thin-rimmed blue-tinted glasses. Her nose is straight, lips slightly parted as if thinking or whispering. She wears a black high-neck short shirt dress, unbuttoned at the top to reveal her cleavage, sleeves rolled up to her elbows, showing her toned arms. The skirt hem hits mid-thigh, her legs crossed and gracefully extended, clad in nude stockings and black stiletto heels, ankles elegant. She holds a stack of white papers in her left hand, while her right hand rests on her thigh. Her fingers are long, nails neatly trimmed. The background features light gray wallpaper with vintage patterns, fine texture, classical European style. A clear line separates the wall from the dark gray carpet with soft texture. On the left is a white desk, clean and tidy, with a retro beige typewriter, keys clearly visible, next to an old CRT monitor (screen off, black), a blue book titled \"THE HOTEL BOY\" standing upright, and a beige rotary phone with spiral cord. Also a closed black laptop with rounded edges. To the right, floor-to-ceiling windows with sheer white curtains, soft natural light streaming in, creating chiaroscuro on the floor and the woman, rich in contrast. The composition is a medium shot, the woman positioned right of center, her body forming a diagonal line from the desk objects on the left to her face on the upper right. The foreground includes the desk and part of her legs, midground is the woman and chair, background is wallpaper and curtains. Color palette is mostly black, white, and gray, with beige and light blue accents, warm-cool contrast harmonious. The image has a realistic, amateur snapshot quality with slight lens blur at edges, moderate color saturation, accurate exposure, capturing a story-filled moment — an office afternoon of quiet contemplation, blending modern professional elegance with vintage romantic charm.",
