        {
          "id": "krea2-d2cdb5b553a1d4e03df8ad49",
          "alias": "单女透视棕外套城市冷淡站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a luxurious indoor staircase, wearing a finely textured brown leather long coat, fully open to reveal a black form-fitting dress with a deep neckline that clings to her curves, sheer stockings highlighting her long legs, and black high-heeled sandals. Her pose is elegant and confident, right hand lightly resting on the black wrought-iron railing, left hand hanging naturally with dark nail polish. Her hair is light blonde, slightly wavy, falling to her shoulders. Her face is delicate and refined, with sharp features, looking directly into the camera with a cool, mysterious expression. The background is a European-style interior with white marble steps covered by a Persian rug in red and blue patterns. To the right, a white double door with glass panes and gold handles; above, wall sconces and a green emergency exit sign. The lighting is soft and warm from overhead and sconces, casting uniform shadows on walls and floor. The leather coat has a slight reflective sheen, emphasizing its material. Composition is a low-angle shot looking up, the woman positioned left of center, the staircase lines leading up to her, creating strong visual tension and depth. Foreground shows part of the steps and carpet edge; midground includes the woman and railing; background includes doors, sconces, and ceiling details. Color palette is brown, black, and white with accents of red and gold, harmonious and elegant, suggesting high fashion and vintage luxury, as if from an exclusive fashion shoot or private intimate photoshoot. The image has a realistic, candid snapshot quality, as if shot with a professional camera in mixed natural and artificial light, with clear details and rich layers, strong cinematic and artistic expression, exuding the independent and cold charm of a modern urban woman, while retaining a spontaneous captured moment, blending the aesthetics of a fashion editorial and private intimate photography.",
