          "id": "krea2-18da17242a4446073770a43b",
          "alias": "单女露胸灰短裙小径微笑站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long black hair cascading freely stands indoors, a radiant smile on her face, eyes gleaming with joy and confidence as she tilts her head slightly toward the camera in a relaxed, natural pose. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, with perky nipples and smooth skin catching the soft light. She wears a delicate gold chain necklace and small stud earrings, and a thin bracelet on her wrist. Her lower body is clad in a light gray multi-layered ruffled skirt, hem fluttering with motion, adding a sweet summer vibe. Her left hand rests gently on a stack of books, while her right hand holds a book with blue-and-white floral cover high above her head, as if she just looked up from reading, her pose casual and lively. She stands slightly right of center, body leaning slightly, creating natural movement. In the foreground, her hands and the books are prominent. Midground includes a wooden rattan cabinet, hanging lace curtains, and framed wall art; on the cabinet are candles, glass bottles, a pencil holder, and other everyday items, giving a warm, cluttered, lived-in feel. Background is a light beige wall with two framed paintings: one abstract bright floral, one realistic yellow flowers in a vase. The composition is centered on her as the focal point, but her tilted pose and gaze guide the eye upward left, creating a flowing visual path, balanced by the book stack on the right and cabinet on the left. Soft natural light comes from front left, evenly illuminating the subject and scene without strong shadows, the overall tone warm and bright, with subtle highlights on her face, hair, and fabric folds, enhancing dimension. The atmosphere is peaceful and cozy, brimming with daily warmth and artistic flair, as if capturing a lazy sunlit afternoon moment. The image quality resembles a real-life photograph, with slight film grain and low contrast, a gentle warm yellow tint, simulating a phone or casual camera shot. Details are rich, from the luster of her hair to the contours of her breasts and nipples, the texture of her skirt, and the edges of the books, all crisp, giving an intimate, genuine sense of life and aesthetic.",
