          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙城市媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the terrace of a high-rise building at night, wearing a delicate light pink lace dress with black fringe and intricate lace details on the shoulders and neckline, the dress cut low to expose her breasts and nipples, paired with high black patent leather boots with pointed toes and thin heels that gleam in the city lights. Her hair is casually pinned up with a few loose strands falling naturally, makeup refined, eyes soft and seductive as she gazes toward the camera. Her left hand gently supports her chin while her right hand holds a glass of golden wine, the liquid shimmering. Her pose is relaxed and confident, enjoying the quiet evening. The foreground shows the dark textured terrace floor, with glass railings reflecting the city lights and her silhouette, creating a layered interplay of reality and reflection. The midground features the urban nightscape with multi-story buildings, warm yellow windows, vertical light strips on some facades, soft haloed streetlights, and sparsely trafficked roads fading into distant blurred lines. The background is a near-black deep night sky with a hint of dark gray at the edges. The composition is vertical, with the subject positioned in the lower right third, her figure taking up about a third of the frame, guiding the eye toward the wine glass and her facial expression. The horizontal lines of the glass railing contrast with the vertical building lines, enhancing depth. Lighting comes mainly from the warm yellow city lights and indoor illumination, creating soft backlighting and side lighting that outlines her figure clearly, with delicate chiaroscuro on her skin and clothing. The golden reflection in the wine glass becomes a visual focal point. The overall atmosphere is serene, romantic, with a touch of urban solitude. Color palette dominated by deep browns, black, warm yellow, accented by light pink and metallic highlights, evoking a high-quality, intimate nightlife scene like a professional camera portrait or a slice-of-life moment with cinematic texture and narrative richness. Details are abundant, from the fabric textures of her clothing to the gradient of city lights, presenting an elegant, calm, emotionally charged urban night portrait style.",
