          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a light wood floor, wearing only a black lace strapless dress that has slipped down to expose her bare breasts, her nipples visible through sheer lace. Her makeup is dramatic—thick lashes, winged eyeliner, deep red lips. Her blonde hair is elegantly up with a silver crown. She tilts her head slightly, a melancholic gaze toward the left, body leaning, left leg bent and raised, right leg extended, black heels with red soles. Her right hand rests on the floor, fingers long, left hand lightly on her knee. The dress is black lace with a corset tie at the chest, a voluminous tulle skirt layered like a dream, and black feather details on the shoulders for a gothic mystique. Behind her, a large gray stone cross, weathered, surrounded by dead twigs and a few fresh green shoots—life and death. To the right, multiple black balloons with jack-o'-lantern prints, and twisted bare branches. Soft, dim lighting from front-left casts gentle shadows on her skin and floor. White walls with simple lines. Black, white, gray palette with touches of yellow and green. Medium shot, she is center-right, the cross and balloons in background. Her face draws the eye, then her bare chest, then the cross. The mood is mysterious, cold, slightly sad. Gothic elegance meets Halloween festivity, like a private themed photoshoot. Camera angle slightly above, simulating amateur realism with natural imperfections.",
