          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways indoors, her deep brown medium-length hair falling in loose, slightly wavy strands, with a few wisps brushing against her cheek and neck, skin pale and smooth. She gazes upward with soft focus, lips parted slightly, holding a white thermos with a panda design to her mouth, drinking—the thermos bears \"STOKE\" and green bamboo illustration, black cap contrasting with white body, a hint of metal rim visible. She is completely topless, her right shoulder draped with a thick, fluffy light brown faux fur jacket that falls open, exposing her bare chest and left arm, which is covered by a black long-sleeve arm guard. Her left arm hangs naturally, muscles defined. She wears professional over-ear headphones with black ear cups and silver metal rings, cable trailing down. The background is a warm indoor space: dark gray wall on the left with a wooden decorative panel and framed mirror, a blue-framed window on the right letting in soft natural light that illuminates her right side, casting gentle shadows on her skin. In the foreground, a round wooden stool and black wires suggest a home recording studio. The composition is a medium shot, slightly angled, drawing the eye upward from her face through the headphones and thermos. The warm tones of brown, beige, light gray, wood, and black dominate, with a hint of green. The atmosphere is quiet, intimate, and everyday—a candid moment of sensual relaxation as she drinks, the light playing over her bare skin, captured with a slight grain and natural exposure, evoking a raw, authentic aesthetic.",
