        {
          "id": "krea2-6ff3b0709255816ecb93f6f7",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装公寓微笑站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center frame, her long, jet-black hair cascading naturally over her shoulders, soft bangs brushing her forehead. Her eyes are bright and playful, gazing up toward the upper right, a hint of innocent mischief in her smile. In her left hand, she holds a can of whipped cream—white with blue and red labels reading “Whipped Light Cream.” With her right hand, she smears a fluffy puff of cream over the tip of her nose and around her lips, creating a cute clown-like smudge. She wears a pale blue vertical-striped bikini top with thin straps and a crossed ribbon bow at the chest, the fabric clinging to her healthy curves, while the matching low-rise bottoms sit just above her hips, leaving her flat stomach and navel exposed. Her skin is pale and flawless, glowing softly under even lighting. Her body is slightly turned, left leg forward, right leg back, forming a gentle S-curve that accentuates her waist and hips. The composition is a mid-shot, with her filling most of the frame. Behind her, a vibrant graffiti wall—cream-white base covered in chaotic, rhythmic hand-drawn lines and color splashes: yellow, orange, teal, deep red arcs, waves, dots, and geometric shapes, giving a lively street-art vibe. The overall framing is centered and symmetrical, drawing the eye from her face along her gaze upward, then back down to the cream can and the playful smearing motion, creating a loop of visual delight. Lighting comes from the front-left, soft and diffuse, casting subtle shadows and smooth transitions. The mood is carefree, whimsical—a stolen moment of summer afternoon fun, blending everyday life with artistic surrealism. The palette is fresh and bright, colors harmonious and energetic, evoking pure youthful joy. A high-quality smartphone-candid feel, rich in detail and texture, with a hand-painted spontaneity that makes the scene feel both real and dreamlike.",
