        {
          "id": "krea2-72ff0e3f08af53daa9abac1c",
          "alias": "单女露胸米衬衫广场微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits diagonally on an orange-red wrinkled fabric sofa, her glossy black hair falling in a straight fringe over her brow, her fair skin luminous. She gazes softly into the lens with a subtle, inviting smile. Her legs are elegantly crossed—left over right—and she rests a pink-covered book lightly in her left hand, pages parted to reveal blue birds and pink floral patterns. Her right hand drapes casually over her knee, fingers long, nails clean. She wears a see-through beige chiffon blouse unbuttoned, revealing her bare breasts—nipples clearly visible through the sheer fabric. A gray short-sleeve shirt is undone beneath, hanging open. Her skirt is a short gray-blue lace number with layered ruffles, metallic studs, and glittering sequins, riding up her thighs. She has on deep brown patent leather Mary Jane heels with square toes and black buckles, paired with slouchy, thick gray socks bunched around her calves. The setting is a white square-tiled wall, soft window light from the left casting delicate shadows on her right side. Mid-shot composition: she’s slightly left of center, body angled, head tilted—a graceful curve. The foreground captures her legs and shoes, the midground her torso and the book, the background the sofa and wall. The orange-red sofa sharply contrasts with the white wall, while her muted gray, blue, and beige clothing tones balance the scene. The mood is youthfully artistic yet overtly sensual, like an intimate boudoir portrait. High-resolution photographic quality with fine grain and shallow depth of field, rich in fabric texture, skin sheen, and leather gloss.",
