          "alias": "单女围巾微笑站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands posed in lavish ancient-style attire, wearing only a sheer deep crimson silk shawl draped over her bare shoulders, her full breasts partially exposed beneath the translucent fabric. The shawl is trimmed with intricate gold embroidery and delicate tassels, while her neck is adorned with multiple layered necklaces of gold chains strung with carnelian, turquoise, and sapphire drops. Her ears hang with long dangling bead earrings of red and gold. Her hair is styled in an elaborate high double-loop bun, pierced by two ornate gold phoenix hairpins set with rubies and turquoise. Two red vermillion dots mark her forehead, and her makeup is heavy: sharp black eyeliner, long curling lashes, thin arched brows, and clear bright eyes. She stands sideways, body slightly tilted, head turned toward the camera, lips curled in a soft mysterious smile. The background is a warm blurred bokeh of orange and red tones, with faint silhouettes of red lanterns and wooden architecture. Light falls from above and side, creating soft chiaroscuro. The composition is a close-up midshot, her figure positioned left of center, background out of focus to emphasize her facial features, jewels, and bare skin. The scene has a cinematic, sensual, historically evocative quality, as if a still from an adult historical drama.",
