          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a brown leather bench, leaning back slightly with her legs crossed elegantly—right over left, toes hanging naturally. Her bare feet show long arches and blue-polished toenails. She holds a dark drink in her right hand, the deep amber liquid visible through the clear cup with a white seal on the rim. Her left arm rests on the bench edge, a silver metal bracelet around her wrist, fingers long and relaxed. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, with a slim waist and smooth skin. She wears only light blue denim shorts with slight frayed hems, no top. Her black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, softly wavy. Her facial features are delicate, skin fair and flawless, eyes bright, a gentle smile on her lips as she looks directly at the camera with an inviting expression. The background is a dense bamboo forest, tall and lush, with yellow-green tones, sunlight filtering through leaves casting dappled shadows on the ground. A blue sky with light clouds is visible, and on the right side, vertical metal frames of a glass wall reflect blurred surroundings. The composition is a mid-shot, the woman in the lower right third of the frame, leaving ample space on the left and above for the natural landscape, creating visual balance. The foreground is the finely textured brown leather bench with visible stitching. Midground shows the woman and drink with rich detail. Background bamboo layers gradually soften into depth. Light comes from above at a soft angle, simulating natural sunlight, with subtle shadows on the bench and ground. The overall mood is serene and comfortable, blending urban leisure with wild nature, a relaxing moment in modern life. Color palette: green, brown, gray, with blue denim and blue nail polish accents. The image has a realistic, casual-photography feel, as if taken with a professional camera but retaining natural texture. Focus is sharp on the woman, background softly blurred. The scene conveys a pleasant, playful mood, suitable for lifestyle content, capturing the enjoyment of a summer afternoon in a café or lookout.",
