          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on a red bench, her long black wavy hair tied with a pink ribbon, delicate features, fair skin, warm gaze into the lens, a sweet smile on her lips. She wears a tight, colorful geometric-patterned halter dress with a crossover bare-shoulder neckline, cut low to reveal her cleavage and bare upper chest, the fabric hugging her slim curves. Her long legs are bare, crossed at the ankles, wearing brown strappy high-heeled sandals with ankle ties. She leans back casually, right leg slightly bent, left leg extended, hands resting on the bench edge, a simple ring on her left ring finger. Behind her, a dreamy amusement park scene with a pink ticket machine glowing \"TICKET\" in yellow neon, \"ONCE DAY\" on its screen, promo posters, silver railings, a pink circular structure with futuristic glowing decor. Colorful balloons (yellow, blue, pink, white) with cute emoji faces scatter on the glossy pink floor. Green palm leaves drape from above, soft, even lighting with a warm, sensual glow, deep blue to light blue gradient sky like dusk. Centered composition, focus on her face and exposed upper body, depth from bench and background elements, vivid saturated colors (pink, blue, yellow) with retro pop aesthetic, high detail, soft shadows, subtle highlights on fabric and balloons—a professional yet intimate idol-style portrait, exuding playful, hopeful, and seductive energy.",
