          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on an indoor floor, her body leaning slightly forward, arms stretched out in a dynamic, inviting pose. Her long brown hair is tied in a high ponytail, with a few loose strands falling naturally beside her face. She wears a pair of gold mirrored sunglasses pushed up on her forehead, reflecting faint light and adding a playful, trendy vibe. Her white short-sleeved T-shirt is unbuttoned and slipped off one shoulder, revealing her bare chest and perky nipples, the collar and cuffs trimmed with yellow piping, a blurry letter print on the front. She pairs this with bright yellow athletic shorts featuring white side stripes, emphasizing her toned thighs. Her skin is fair and smooth, her makeup delicate with soft coral lips, her gaze focused directly at the camera with a confident, gentle smile. She kneels on a spread-out light-yellow fabric printed with cartoon-style doodles (red bus, Eiffel Tower, little figures), adding playful detail. The background is a wall of white square tiles with slight texture, showing everyday wear. To the right is a black office chair with simple lines and a metal base, next to a black bag covered in a transparent plastic bag with vague contents visible. The scene feels like a backstage green room or dressing area, relaxed and casual. Warm yellow overhead lighting creates a soft, even glow with no harsh shadows, giving a cozy atmosphere. The composition is a mid-shot, the figure slightly left of center, her body forming a diagonal line that leads the eye from the foreground patterned fabric to her and then to the tiled wall and furniture. The overall palette is white, yellow, and black, with clear contrast but harmonious tones. The image has a candid, documentary feel, as if snapped spontaneously with a phone, capturing a natural, behind-the-scenes moment of a performer at ease. Rich in detail and texture, it blends professional composition with the raw quality of casual photography, exuding a relaxed, 