          "alias": "单女半褪白毛衣门闭眼坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long, silky silver-white hair sits on a white tile low wall outside a café, her hair flowing gently in the breeze, cascading over her shoulders and chest. She tilts her head back slightly, eyes closed, lips parted in a soft, content smile, radiating a relaxed, lazy bliss. She wears a loose, creamy-white V-neck knit sweater, but it's unbuttoned or pulled down, exposing one bare shoulder and the upper curve of a full breast, the nipple just visible beneath the soft fabric. Her other arm is covered by the sleeve, which hangs over her hand. Below, she wears only a tiny pair of denim shorts that barely cover her hips, revealing smooth, toned thighs. Her legs are crossed elegantly, left over right, with ankles lightly bent, showing long, shapely legs. On her feet are leopard-print pointed-toe stiletto mules, the classic black and brown spotted pattern adding a wild, daring touch. Her right hand rests casually on her knee, while her left hand trails along the edge of the wall. Her body leans back slightly, pressing against the glass door behind her, the pose natural and sensual. In the foreground, the white square tile wall is smooth with clean grout lines reflecting soft light. To the right, a takeout coffee cup with a black lid sits, a vague logo on the side. The gray concrete ground is slightly rough, with faint water stains and scattered white debris, as if after a recent rain. The midground shows the café's glass door and window frames in black metal. Inside, warm yellow square tiles line the walls, and shelves hold neatly arranged packages, boxes, and bottles. A black circular logo or decoration hangs inside. Soft, warm indoor lighting creates a cozy atmosphere. The background is the café’s white tile wall, pure and flawless, with distant building outlines and a corner of the sky. A low-angle eye-level shot centers the woman slightly to the right, forming a stable triangular composition. The eye moves from her face down her legs to her shoes, then to the coffee cup and ground details. Natural light falls from the upper left, casting soft shadows on her face, hair, clothes, and the ground, enhancing dimension. Colors are creamy white, pale yellow, gray-black, with the leopard print as a striking contrast. The overall mood is relaxed, everyday artistic—like a candid snapshot, real and unretouched, with slight film grain and gentle bokeh creating a nostalgic, vintage feel. The image is clean, detailed, both fashionable and full of life, conveying a tender, carefree attitude of enjoying the present moment.",
