          "id": "krea2-12c892a25da53a1ec66b1002",
          "alias": "单女白浴袍媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A stunning ancient Chinese noblewoman stands as the focal point, her jet-black hair piled high in an elaborate updo adorned with an intricately woven golden phoenix crown, set with ruby-like red beads and tassels, layered metallic leaves catching the warm light. A few loose strands frame her face, complementing the delicate red flower ornament on her forehead. Her makeup is elegant and layered, with defined eyeliner emphasizing her deep, intense eyes, full red lips slightly parted, and a focused yet introspective gaze. She tilts her head slightly, her right index finger lightly touching her brow, as if adjusting her makeup or lost in thought, her long, pale fingers adorned with multiple gold bangles and beaded bracelets. She wears a sheer white silk outer robe over a red embroidered long gown, the translucent fabric revealing the intricate floral patterns of the dress beneath, with gold trim and raised embroidery at the shoulders and cuffs. The costume is partially disheveled, one shoulder slipping down, exposing the curve of her collarbone and the top of her breast, the sheer fabric clinging to her form. In the foreground, a hand with a makeup brush adjusts her costume, the blurred background showing studio lights, reflectors, and behind-the-scenes equipment. The close-up composition places her slightly off-center, her directed gaze and hand gesture drawing focus to her face and bare shoulder. Warm, soft light from the front-left highlights her facial features, the gold ornaments, and her skin with delicate speculars, creating a cinematic, dramatic yet natural ambiance. The color palette of red, gold, and white contrasts with the dim background, enhancing depth and visual impact. The entire scene exudes a blend of classical Chinese eroticism and modern documentary realism, capturing a sensual, behind-the-scenes moment of a historical drama shoot.",
