istic yet artistic. Shot with a large aperture, extremely shallow depth of field, background fully blurred, emphasizing the subject. Image quality is fine, high resolution, professional photography level while retaining a natural, candid feel of an amateur snapshot capturing an intimate moment, full of narrative and emotional tension. Conveys loneliness, purity, mystery, and gentle sensuality.",
