          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully on a warm wooden floor, leaning forward with her right hand gently cupping her cheek, her left hand resting naturally on the floor. She wears a delicate white lace cami dress with a sheer, flowing shawl over her shoulders—the dress is undone and pulled down, exposing her bare breasts and smooth skin, the soft lace framing her nipples. Her legs are clad in white lace stockings with floral embroidery, paired with cream knit ankle boots. Her dark hair is braided low with small pearl flower pins, silver earrings, and a delicate gold geometric necklace. Her makeup is soft—earthy eyeshadow, defined liner, warm nude lips. Her gaze is focused and contemplative, looking off to the left, expression calm yet mysterious. The background is a textured pale beige wall with slight wear, a dark wood baseboard, and warm wood floor. Soft light from the left casts gentle highlights on her face, arms, and the translucent fabric, creating depth. Medium shot, slightly from above, composition offset to the left with breathing room on the right. Tones: white, cream, light gray, warm brown. The mood is elegant, intimate, artistic, with a cinematic, slightly melancholic Eastern aesthetic. Sharp focus on face and hands, shallow depth of field on the background.",
