          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a vibrant indoor interactive exhibition space, wearing only a loosely unbuttoned black long coat that falls open to reveal her bare chest and nipples, paired with dark leggings that cling to her hips and brown ankle boots. A black backpack hangs from one shoulder. She rests her right hand lightly on the top of a giant black mouse-pointer sculpture, her fingers long with pink nail polish. Her long black hair cascades naturally over her shoulders. She gazes directly at the camera with a warm, relaxed smile, her expression inviting and playful. In the foreground, a large green square container is filled with fuzzy moss-like material. At its center rises the black mouse-pointer installation, with a white arrow base and sleek black-and-brown body. The background is a bright green wall, smooth with a slight sheen; a red panel with white text is faintly visible in the corner. The white floor features scattered black Korean script in a playful, artistic pattern. The scene is lit from a warm overhead source, casting soft shadows and highlighting the woman's left side, enhancing her curves. The perspective is slightly downward, with the woman positioned just right of center, creating an asymmetrical balance that draws the eye from the mouse-pointer to her body and then to the wall text. The atmosphere blends technology, whimsy, and a casual museum visit, capturing a intimate, nude moment of a relaxed visitor in a creative exhibition space. The image feels realistic and detailed, like a candid shot with a personal camera.",
