          "id": "krea2-a7c862f49e98c880c01c3009",
          "alias": "单女白挂脖舞台冷淡站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long hair blending pale gray and soft gold, strands falling naturally beside her face, catching the light with a gentle sheen. She wears a pair of colorful sunglasses on her head, the frames studded with glittering gems, their lenses reflecting a faint rainbow halo. Her top is a white crop halter that leaves her midriff bare, revealing a toned waist and the smooth curve of her navel. At the front, a purple-to-pink gradient butterfly charm dangles beside a gold-bordered heart pendant, both linked by a fine chain that rests just above her cleavage. The thin white spaghetti straps accent her shoulders. She sports silver high-waisted zip shorts with a metallic sheen, hugging her hips and thighs. A black in-ear monitor is tucked in her left ear, while a small silver stud gleams on her right. Her makeup is precise—sharp eyeliner, full curled lashes, and a natural pink lip. Her gaze is focused and soft, looking directly into the lens. Her left hand is raised, holding a fluffy pink plush toy; her fingers are long with dark polish. Her right hand hangs naturally, a delicate silver bracelet catching the light at her wrist. Behind her, a dark gray stage curtain with vertical stripes creates depth, accented by a few small blue LED lights on the right, casting a cool glow. On the far left edge, a partial figure in shiny green clothing is visible. The composition is a medium close-up, with the woman dominating the frame. Lighting comes from a front-top stage spotlight, producing bright illumination with soft shadow transitions across her face and body—high contrast yet smooth, blending dreamlike and realistic elements. The palette is dominated by cool whites and silvers, punctuated by vivid pink, purple, and blue accents. Visual focus is drawn to her face and the jewelry at her chest, with a blurred background heightening her presence. The overall style merges pop fashion with sci-fi flair, delivering strong visual impact and artistic expression, like a live concert still captured with professional gear, retaining real texture and motion, yet carefully composed and color-graded for a surreal elegance.",
