          "id": "krea2-1b183318ac4456f1e721c6db",
          "alias": "单女白T恤街道媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a modern city street at night, wearing a snug white short-sleeved T-shirt with black “CHRISTIAN DIOR” print and logo, unbuttoned low to reveal her cleavage, paired with a high-waisted white denim shorts cut so short they barely cover, raw hem edges frayed. She wears retro clear-frame glasses, her long hair casually tied back, left hand brushing her hair, right hand holding a small black diamond-stitched handbag with gold chain and buckle. Her pose is confident and sultry, body slightly turned, gaze soft toward the camera with a faint seductive smile. In the foreground left, a thick dark gray metal pillar reflects light, beside a large gray planter with lush green leaves. Midground shows her long bare legs extending across light brown marble tiles with visible seams reflecting warm lights. Background is modern glass curtain walls and metal frames, glass reflecting warm yellow interior light stripes and blurred city lights, a neon sign “COCA” faintly in the distance. Slightly tilted low-angle composition places her center-right, guiding the eye from her face, down her body curves to legs and floor. Left pillar creates vertical balance. Her raised hand and gaze direct attention to her expression and overall form. Lighting is warm urban artificial light from left, casting soft rim light and subtle shadows, enhancing her curves. The cool glass tones contrast with her warm white clothing, creating a modern yet languid artistic vibe. The image has a professional photographic texture mixed with candid realism, moderate color saturation, rich detail, blending high fashion with gritty authenticity, capturing a moment of serene self-expression in a busy city night.",
