        {
          "id": "krea2-a740bede5f0333e1758b79ee",
          "alias": "单女全裸紫衬衫酒店俏皮坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits elegantly on the edge of a wooden dining table in a modern hotel suite, body slightly turned, left hand holding a smartphone angled for a selfie, its screen glowing softly on her focused, confident face. Her right hand rests near her bare thigh. She wears a deep purple silk shirt fully unbuttoned, revealing her naked breasts, with tight black shorts hugging her long legs and silver-buckle high heels. Her pose is relaxed yet playful. In the foreground: a classic diamond-stitched black handbag, a clear glass bottle, and a few scattered items. The gray striped cushioned chair contrasts with the dark wood table. The background shows a sofa with beige cushions and an orange accent chair. Floor-to-ceiling windows display a city nightscape, warm interior lighting with recessed spotlights highlighting her body. Slightly tilted wide-angle composition through a doorway/mirror creates depth and a voyeuristic feel, with her at the right golden ratio. Warm yellow light with shadow layers enhances curves, cool window tones provide contrast. Overall mood: luxurious yet candid, like a smartphone snapshot—slight grain, muted saturation, conveying lazy confidence, mysterious modern feminine allure.",
