        {
          "id": "krea2-737cf4c96c4737ca69ebe336",
          "alias": "单女紫衬衫酒店媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits provocatively on the edge of a wide dark wood dining table inside a hotel suite, body slightly leaning forward as she holds a smartphone up for a mirror selfie—her gaze focused and faintly lazy on the screen, one hand resting casually on the table edge, relaxed yet commanding. She wears a smooth deep purple silk long-sleeve shirt, unbuttoned and hanging open to reveal her slim waist, paired with extremely short black high-waist hot pants and sharp black stiletto heels, her long legs elegantly extended, a delicate metal buckle visible at the ankle. Her black hair falls softly over her shoulders, some strands catching warm light, a simple black leather choker around her neck adding a mysterious, cool edge. In the foreground, a corner of the table and a modern gray-striped dining chair, with a charging phone, white cable, and a dark blue handbag scattered on the tabletop, hinting at everyday life. Midground features the table and a light beige fabric sofa behind her, piled with plush beige cushions, next to which stands a sleek black desk lamp with a cylindrical shade emitting a warm glow. The background is a full wall of floor-to-ceiling windows showing the glittering night cityscape and blurred building outlines, while recessed ceiling lights create a soft, bright overhead glow, with a black-and-white-gray color scheme, an abstract geometric painting on one wall, and a dark wood partition with a TV cabinet on the other—modern minimalist yet layered. The composition is a slightly elevated mirror-reflection angle, the woman centered slightly left, her gaze naturally drawn toward the phone screen, forming the visual focus. Lighting combines warm indoor tones for an intimate, private mood, contrasted with cool outdoor city lights; her face and legs are softly lit, shadows transitioning naturally. The overall scene captures a quiet, luxurious urban night ambiance, blending casual everydayness with strong personal expression, as if a candid, artful snapshot taken casually with a smartphone in a high-end hotel room.",
