          "alias": "单女红旗袍瀑布媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with grey-blue gradient short hair, an ornate headdress of red flowers and white veil bow, wears a revealing modified red cheongsam—unbuttoned to expose her bare, full breasts, gold floral embroidery, black lace trim at the neck and cuffs, the bottom left open—paired only with white lace-trimmed panties and white thigh-high stockings, simple white heels, her makeup refined, gaze gentle and mysterious, leaning lazily and confidently against a classical wooden desk, right hand lifted with fingers curled slightly, left hand resting by her side, body leaning forward to emphasize her curves and tense, erotic lines; foreground a glowing golden ingot prop, a red vertical banner reading \"喜发财\" in calligraphy, scattered red firecracker paper pieces, a coarse burlap rug; midground a dark wooden screen hung with orange-red translucent curtains, a red lantern, a colorful koi kite ornament, a vase of red-and-white plum blossoms; background a muted light gray wall, golden artificial leaves cascading from above like a waterfall; symmetrical composition with the subject positioned center-right, focus on her face and provocative pose, diagonal lines of her stockinged legs guiding the eye upward; soft, dramatic lighting from the front-left illuminating her skin and the cheongsam's texture, warm, luxurious palette of red, gold, and white, evoking a Chinese New Year blessing of wealth and desire, at once dreamlike and hyper-real, as if shot with casual equipment yet arranged for maximum sensual storytelling.",
