        {
          "id": "krea2-bf867371e87d1da7ca1c1475",
          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙城市媚态坐持包",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a vintage café, topless, her off-white sheer off-shoulder dress slipped to her waist, revealing her bare breasts and erect nipples. She wears a short bob with neat bangs, soft delicate makeup, pale pink lips, and light blue nail polish. Her eyes are lowered, focusing intently on the small teacup she holds with both hands — a sensual, serene expression. She sits on a plush red velvet sofa, the soft fabric contrasting with the dark marble table. On the table, an empty ceramic plate with intricate floral patterns suggests a paused tea moment. Beside her, a round brown leather handbag with classic logo pattern and warm metal buckle rests against the sofa arm. Through arched windows, the dusk city skyline is visible, with warm yellow interior light casting soft reflections on the glass. Medium close-up composition, woman slightly left of center, focus on her nude upper body and the teacup. Lighting is a blend of warm indoor light and cool twilight from outside, creating soft chiaroscuro. Slight film grain and realistic phone photography feel. The scene exudes intimate nostalgia, poetic urban night solitude, and quiet seduction.",
