        {
          "id": "krea2-f547a1e448873bf2ee3c6007",
          "alias": "单女全裸白礼服婚礼媚态站立",
          "prompt": "A young bride stands in soft indoor light, her strapless white wedding gown revealing her bare shoulders and full cleavage, the bodice slipping slightly as if undone. The voluminous tulle skirt and massive layered bubble sleeves with delicate lace edges frame her figure. Her short brown hair is pinned up with neat bangs, a silver diamond-studded crown on her head, translucent veil cascading behind, catching the air and wrapping around her neck and bare shoulders. She wears a double-strand pearl necklace with a large teardrop pearl pendant resting between her breasts, matching pearl earrings glowing against her skin. Her right hand plays with the edge of the veil, while her left hand rests sensually on her chest, fingers grazing her collarbone. Naked fingernails with nude polish. Her face is delicate with a soft, shy smile, eyes clear and looking directly at the camera, expressing happiness and serene intimacy. Foreground focuses on her slender arms, the jewelery, and the flowing dress details; midground shows her full upper body and wedding dress silhouette; background is dark and blurred with hints of classical furniture, creating a private, solemn atmosphere. Medium close-up composition, subject slightly off-center right, body tilted dynamically, head angled. Light from the side-front is warm and soft, highlighting her facial features, the dress folds, and the jewelry's three-dimensionality, with soft bokeh lights in the background. Overall lighting is dreamy, romantic, ritualistic, capturing a quiet precious moment before the wedding night. Professional art photography style, high-end digital camera with large aperture prime lens, fine texture, natural skin and fabric details, both beautiful and intimate.",
