        {
          "id": "krea2-1f640b2b9cd7afbd02d10680",
          "alias": "单女半褪浴袍窗边微笑坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an elaborate, loosely draped hanfu sits on a polished wooden floor. Her open robe—a blend of soft beige and sky blue silk with cloud embroidery—slips off one shoulder, baring her breast and the curve of her collarbone. A wide beaded belt cinches her waist, and dark navy silk peeks from her wide sleeves. Her black hair is piled high with silver hairpins, ruby and turquoise ornaments, and dangling tassels that catch the light. Long pearl earrings sway as she moves. In her left arm, she cradles a fluffy pink plush toy tied with a lavender bow and tagged “Acupuncturist.” Her right hand holds a black digital camera, lens aimed at herself as if taking a selfie or documenting the moment. Her face is delicate, with a playful, contemplative smile and eyes locked on the viewer. The foreground is dominated by the soft plush and camera body, occupying the lower third. The middle ground shows her full figure, the folds of her robe, and the jewelry details, lit softly from the front side. The background is an antique-inspired studio with dark wooden window frames, a potted plant on the right, and vintage lamps and equipment stands on the left, suggesting a film set or arranged photo shoot. A slightly low-angle, medium-close shot centers her slightly to the right, drawing focus to her expression and props. The lighting is warm, even, casting faint shadows on the background wall, adding depth. The overall mood is intimate, blending classical elegance with modern sensuality, capturing a candid moment in a shoot—slight grain, natural exposure, mid-saturation, and a lived-in feel.",
