        {
          "id": "krea2-986c6fa0ec4ab9244e9069cb",
          "alias": "单女半褪蓝连衣裙街道困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden bench outside a street café, wearing a sheer, pale blue off-shoulder dress with delicate lace ruffles—now unbuttoned and pulled down to expose her bare breasts, the thin fabric clinging to her skin. Her black pixie cut with straight bangs frames her face, a white lace flower pinned behind her ear; her makeup is precise, lips parted and red, eyes soft yet direct as she gazes into the lens. She holds a cup of hot chocolate with cocoa powder on top, her silver glitter nail tips lightly touching the rim. The foreground shows the rich brown drink with cocoa dust and chocolate shavings, warm light reflecting off the cup against her pale skin. Midground is a dark marble table, its cold surface contrasting with her feminine form. Background blurs into the café interior—vague silhouettes of other customers, warm yellow pendant lights, glassware on shelves, and a white utility box marked “200,” with neon lights from the street casting colorful reflections through the glass. Composition: medium close-up, subject slightly right of center, body turned a bit, head tilted, eyes locking with the viewer. Warm lighting from inside mixed with city night glow creates soft highlights and shadows on her face, shoulders, and exposed chest. The window reflection adds a dreamy haze, deepening the space. Atmosphere is quiet, intimate, urban-night languidness—a poetic, everyday moment rendered with a raw, amateur-camera realism yet carefully framed and color-graded, blending real and ideal into a sensual, slightly voyeuristic aesthetic.",
