        {
          "id": "krea2-9e2067d09205150b298105c5",
          "alias": "单女黑连帽衫舞台冷淡倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with short black hair and delicate features, her gaze intense and slightly cold, wears a black hoodie partially unzipped to reveal bare skin and a hint of cleavage, paired with tight gray jeans that hug her curves, overlaid with a tactical-style black armor vest unbuttoned at the front. Her right hand, gloved in black, brushes a strand of hair from her forehead while her left hand rests casually on her hip, her body leaning against the front of a sleek red sports motorcycle. The bike is a high-performance street model, predominantly bright red with black and silver decals, a streamlined windscreen, gold front forks, and sharp headlights; a white racing number \"37\" and brand logos are visible, with carbon fiber and metallic accents. The focus is on the motorcycle's front and the woman's upper body, with the parking lot's asphalt ground and white lines under sunlight streaming from the upper left, casting soft highlights and shadows on her shoulders and the bike. In the midground, her lower body and the motorcycle's side are visible, while the background shows modern glass-curtain office buildings, blurred with shallow depth of field. A slightly low-angle medium close-up composition places her on the right two-thirds and the bike on the left, creating dynamic balance. Her gaze and arm direction, along with the front wheel, guide the viewer's eye into the scene. The overall vibe blends street fashion with futuristic tech, with strong but not dramatic contrast, conveying a cool, confident, powerful urban aesthetic, capturing a free-spirited moment that feels both casual and artistically cinematic. Warm tones with moderate saturation enhance metallic textures and skin detail, with slight edge breathing for a raw yet polished look.",
