          "id": "krea2-3624cbb8e67786e3a9d46d69",
          "alias": "单女全裸厨房冷淡站立注视",
          "prompt": "In a modern kitchen bathed in cool blue light, a slender young woman stands sideways at the stove, completely nude except for a delicate hairpin holding her high bun, a few loose strands framing her face. Her gaze is soft and focused downward on a steaming white wok, a black spatula in hand, her body relaxed yet poised in the rhythm of cooking. The cold light traces every contour—her gentle waist, the curve of her hip, the line of her arm. Foreground: her bent waist and dangling arm. Midground: clean white cabinets, built-in gas stove, a small dish of red apple and deep purple grapes offering a warm color contrast. Background: white upper cabinets, range hood, and a silver fridge with faint stickers. Slightly tilted composition places her on the right two-thirds of the frame, guiding the eye from her hand to the wok and into the kitchen beyond. The atmosphere is late-night stillness, square LED ceiling light casting sharp yet soft shadows, while her skin and the edges of objects glow with a hazy blue aura, cinematic and dreamlike. The scene radiates urban solitude and poetic tranquility—a quiet moment of cooking in the nude, between loneliness and creation, under blue light.",
