          "prompt": "A young woman stands beneath a traditional East Asian red-lacquered pillar, her long jet-black hair partly woven into an intricate braid, loose strands falling across her forehead. Her expression is focused, contemplative, gaze fixed to the left. She wears a cream-colored fluffy knit cardigan, left open, revealing her bare breasts—nipples hardened against the soft fabric—with no top or vest beneath. The cardigan is adorned with delicate pink floral embroidery and sheer lace insets. In her left hand she holds a mint-green notebook; in her right, a pen poised above the page. A blue-and-white woven straw bag hangs diagonally across her shoulder, the strap resting between her breasts. Red pendant earrings catch the warm light. The background is a soft-blur of red pillars and distant silhouettes, autumn leaves filtering golden sunlight. The scene is intimate, sensual, with natural sidelight creating gentle shadows across her skin. Slight tilt of the camera, filmic grain. She exudes a quiet, breathless tension—caught mid-thought, mid-inspiration, mid-desire.",
