          "alias": "单女露胸椅上媚态坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless in an ornate classical wooden chair, her elaborate golden crown with blue gems and tassels perched atop a sleek ancient bun, long pearl earrings dangling against her bare shoulders. Her delicate face, clear eyes, and light lips are framed by a thoughtful, slightly lazy expression, one hand resting under her chin, the other trailing down her torso. The foreground features a long table draped in red-and-black brocade, holding a white fruit bowl filled with colorful seasonal fruits, a white placard reading \"Youku Member,\" and a black lacquer tea cup with red patterns. The midground captures the curved armrests and smooth lines of the deep brown wooden chair, contrasting with the golden tones of her skin. The background blurs into traditional Chinese window lattice with soft warm light, hinting at a carved dark screen. Symmetrical composition with shallow depth of field locks focus on her face and bare chest. Soft side-back light from the left highlights her hair and skin edges, casting subtle shadows for depth. Warm yellow and deep red hues dominate, accented by blue, balancing classical palace solemnity with a modern talk-show casualness. Rich cinematic lighting with natural grain and slight noise, evoking a sensual, story-driven atmosphere.",
