          "alias": "单女白连衣裙酒店困倦回眸",
          "prompt": "A stunning young Asian woman with long, jet-black hair cascading softly over her shoulders, her delicate features carrying a languid, alluring expression. She lounges on a single-seat beige velvet armchair, one leg crossed over the other, left foot poised with toes brushing the floor, revealing long, elegant legs. She wears a simple yet luxurious off-white satin bandeau dress, the fabric clinging to her waist and accentuating her curves. Her skin glows with a subtle, dewy sheen under soft lighting, as if freshly bathed or veiled in a sheer mist, adding a hazy, sensual atmosphere. She sports transparent stiletto heels with metallic gold slender heels, her toenails painted a deep crimson red, creating a striking contrast against the clear straps. A delicate pearl necklace and dangling silver tassel earrings complete her refined, sophisticated look. The foreground focuses on her crossed legs and one high heel, emphasizing skin texture, shoe details, and light reflections. The midground shows the plush backrest and arm of the chair, its fabric texture and curved form providing a solid visual anchor. The background is a clean, warm light-beige wall with minimal corner lines hinting at spatial depth. Composition is a slightly low-angle medium close-up, with the subject positioned slightly to the right of center, turning her body gently toward the camera and meeting the viewer's gaze directly, creating a strong emotional connection. Visual lines are guided by her raised left foot, the extension of her legs, and her focused stare, drawing attention to the core area. Lighting comes from the upper left, casting soft, even light across her face, shoulders, and thighs, producing subtle chiaroscuro and luminous highlights on her moist, reflective skin. Shadows concentrate on the right side of the sofa and the floor edges, enhancing spatial depth and volume. The overall mood is serene, intimate, and charged with sultry tension, resembling a fashion editorial captured in a high-end hotel suite or private living room—blending artistic photography's refined aesthetics with the raw, realistic feel of amateur equipment: slight grain and natural color saturation give it an unpolished yet expressive, everyday beauty, as if capturing a quiet moment of a lazy afternoon or a break during a soirée, revealing her inner confidence, composure, and an undercurrent of irresistible sensuality.",
