          "id": "krea2-a2a9c4051f429f583c3e7824",
          "alias": "单女礼服广场困倦倚靠回眸",
          "prompt": "A young elegant Asian woman in a sheer champagne-colored backless evening gown, the back and shoulder straps adorned with intricate sparkling crystals, flowing like a river of stars under soft light; the skirt is a cascade of light, multi-layered tulle, draping naturally over a cream-colored fabric sofa, exuding a dreamy and luxurious aura. She leans sideways against the spacious, plush beige sofa, her pose languid yet confident, left hand gently cupping her chin, right hand resting naturally on the armrest, eyes glancing back at the camera with a tender, thoughtful smile. Her red lips and refined makeup complement her deep, captivating eyes, which radiate stillness and allure. Her black hair is elegantly pinned up, with a few loose strands falling at the nape of her neck, adding softness and spontaneity. Small vintage gold earrings adorn her ears, harmonizing with the overall look. The foreground highlights her half-bare shoulders, slender arms, and the scattered hem of her dress, creating a visual guide drawing the viewer's eye to her facial expression. The midground shows the sofa she leans on, its soft beige fabric with fine texture, and a matching square cushion with braided trim on the left, adding depth and design detail. The background is a simple white wall, with an abstract modern painting in shades of purple, green, and yellow, its bold, free brushstrokes creating an artistic dialogue with the interior; on the right, a dark gray metallic cabinet or wall panel contrasts warm and cool tones, enhancing spatial depth. The composition is shot from a slightly elevated angle, with the subject positioned center-right, creating a stable yet dynamic structure. The lighting is exquisitely handled—soft diffused light from the front-left evenly bathes her figure, outlining the contours of her skin and the three-dimensionality of the gown, while casting subtle shadow transitions on the sofa and background, avoiding harsh contrast. The overall atmosphere is warm, tranquil, and high-end, as if capturing a moment in a private, luxurious living room, combining the refined composition of art photography with a casual elegance and poise. The color palette is predominantly warm, accented by cool tones from the background painting, creating a cozy yet slightly mysterious artistic ambiance.",
