          "id": "krea2-8a210927d5fad630e887f8f8",
          "alias": "单女浴袍椅上媚态跪注视",
          "prompt": "A young noblewoman in lavish Tang dynasty court attire reclines seductively on an ornate chair inside a classical palace interior. Her lustrous black hair is coiled into an intricate, towering bun adorned with gleaming gold phoenixes, blossoms, and pearl-inlaid ornaments, a few loose strands brushing her bare shoulders. A vermilion mark glows between her brows; her delicate, almond-shaped eyes gaze upward with a mix of melancholy and longing, lips slightly parted and moist. Her outer robe of golden brocade embroidered with trailing floral vines is deliberately slipped open, exposing her smooth, creamy shoulders and the swell of her full breasts barely covered by a deep crimson silk bodice. The bodice's ribbon has come untied, revealing the upper curves of her breasts and the faint outline of her nipples. A multi-layered necklace of pearls, coral, and gold chains nestles between her cleavage. Her hands rest lightly on her knees; a carved ring and a delicate gold bracelet adorn her fingers and wrist. The wide silk sleeves cascade over the chair edge, adding an air of languorous nobility. In the foreground, a blurred glass vessel (perhaps a wine cup or incense burner) creates a shallow depth-of-field effect. The chair is draped in red-and-gold patterned fabric; behind her, a white ceramic tea set or incense burner is faintly visible. The backdrop features an ornate screen or window frame in teal and dark red wood, with hints of traditional eaves and carved beams in the distance. The overall color palette is cool-toned background contrasting with the warm gold and red of her skin and garments. Soft light from the upper left falls across her face and bare shoulders, highlighting the glistening skin, the sheen of silk, and the sparkle of jewels. The atmosphere is intimate, nostalgic, and subtly erotic—like a stolen moment from a historical drama, captured with cinematic depth and a warm, afternoon sunlight filtering through lattice windows, carrying the faint scent of sandalwood and flowers. Every detail—the inviting exposure of her bosom, the flushed glow on her cheeks, the dreamy, waiting gaze—suggests a heated encounter just before or after a lover's visit.",
