          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a wooden bench at an outdoor cafe, wearing a sheer, flowing pale blue chiffon dress with delicate floral patterning, the off-shoulder ruffle neckline slipping down to expose her bare shoulders and the upper swell of her breasts, the translucent fabric clinging to her skin and revealing the outline of her nipples and the curve of her body. Her long black hair with blunt bangs falls naturally, a white lace flower pinned behind one ear. She cradles a ceramic cup of dark iced drink in both hands, cocoa powder dusted on the rim, her head tilted downward as she gazes into the cup with soft, clear eyes and a serene, knowing smile. On a dark marble side table to the right sits a black saucer with a crumpled napkin. The wooden bench's warm grain contrasts with the ethereal dress texture. Behind her, through the cafe window, a vintage off-white coffee machine with \"200\" on its front is visible, topped with glass jars of syrups, and beyond that, soft warm yellow lights and blurred interior details. The composition is slightly overhead, camera angled down gently, with the woman centered slightly left, focus drawn to her drink and her tranquil expression. Side-front lighting washes across her face and dress, creating soft shadows on the table and bench, enhancing the three-dimensionality. The palette is warm amber and pale blue, with natural light transitions, evoking a lazy, healing, everyday aesthetic—like a casual smartphone photo at dusk—yet with cinematic storytelling and emotional warmth. The entire scene feels intimate and seductively relaxed, the thin fabric hinting at everything beneath.",
