          "prompt": "A young woman in exquisite Tang dynasty-style Hanfu, topless with her breasts fully exposed, stands in soft, bright outdoor light, her gentle gaze drifting to the right as if lost in distant thought, her expression serene with a hint of poetic melancholy. Her hair is styled in an elaborate high bun, a plush cloud of black strands adorned with intricate gold and pink flower hairpins, pearl-and-gem headpieces, and a prominent pink peony ornament; a delicate red plum blossom dian (forehead decoration) sits at the center of her brow, complementing her makeup. She wears dangling pink teardrop earrings and a necklace of pink gems and gold floral links. A vivid crimson wide sash cinches her waist, decorated with a three-dimensional gold foil butterfly bow and beaded tassels, the sash’s edge embroidered with intricate red floral patterns, contrasting with the sheer translucent pink outer robe. Her hanfu top is pale pink, with light green trim at the hem and cuffs, the fabric soft and flowing with a silky sheen and layered folds; the white under-robe shows faint embroidered patterns. The overall color palette is soft and harmonious, exuding classical Eastern elegance. The foreground focuses on her slender fingers lightly clasped together, a simple ring on her right ring finger, her hands pale and delicate. The composition is a medium close-up portrait, the figure positioned slightly left of center, her gaze leading naturally to the right, creating spatial depth. The background is softly blurred, hinting at warm-toned ancient architectural outlines and hazy light, evoking a courtyard or palace scene. The lighting is even natural daylight from the upper left, casting subtle chiaroscuro across her face, shoulders, neckline, and bare breasts, accentuating contours and clothing details. The atmosphere is warm and tranquil with a nostalgic filter, like an amateur camera shot that feels cinematic, balanced saturation, warm jade-like colors, blending the ideal o