        {
          "id": "krea2-c5c350e8a9c324ea90521141",
          "alias": "单女半褪白浴袍桌边忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A classical beauty in an exquisite hanfu sits regally in an antique chamber. Her glossy black hair is piled high, adorned with intricate floral hairpins, gold ornaments, and dangling tassels, a vermillion mark on her forehead adding allure and mystery. She wears a pure white cross-collar wide-sleeved robe, its lapels and cuffs embroidered with delicate purple-red scroll patterns. Golden three-dimensional floral embroidery gleam on her shoulders. A deep purple wide belt with gold edges cinches her waist. The robe is partially undone, slipping off one shoulder to reveal a bare breast and a taut nipple. She turns her head to the side, gazing intently with deep, focused eyes, lips slightly parted, expression calm yet tinged with thought or melancholy, as if lost in a silent game. In the foreground, an intricately carved red sandalwood Go table is covered in black and white stones, a few jade pieces scattered, catching soft light. Her elegant seated pose is visible through the sheer fabric, which clings to her skin and drapes naturally, its folds and light revealing the softness of the material and contours of her body. The background is a softly layered, traditional Chinese interior, with carved window lattices casting dappled light, forming dreamy circular patterns. Distant blurred classical furniture and a warm yellow chandelier create a warm, slightly mysterious atmosphere, full of historical weight and quietude. Composition uses classical rule of thirds, figure slightly left of center, gaze leading to the chessboard on the right. Shallow depth of field blurs the background, sharpening the subject. Lighting is soft and dramatic, natural light from upper left sculpting her face and hair, creating subtle chiaroscuro on her lapels and bare shoulder, evoking warmth, stillness, and narrative tension. Color palette: warm white, pale purple, deep red, golden hues, moderate saturation, harmonious. This is a piece of Eastern classical aesthetics, delicate emotion, and narrative tension, as if a precious moment from a historical drama or court painting, captured with the realism and human warmth of everyday amateur equipment.",
