          "alias": "单女露胸米短裙泳池害羞站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a wooden platform at the edge of a crystal-clear blue swimming pool, topless, wearing only a cream-white lace wrap skirt tied at her waist and black sandals. Her pose is elegant yet slightly shy, one hand gently caressing her bare chest, her gaze tenderly fixed on the camera. Her smooth black hair falls over her shoulders, her delicate face glowing under the sunlight. In the foreground, several thick hemp rope rails extend diagonally toward the bottom of the frame, creating natural leading lines that draw focus to her. The middle ground features the wooden platform with visible texture, transitioning to the rippling water behind. The background is the vast blue pool, with fine ripples reflecting bright sky light, creating an open, tranquil resort atmosphere. The composition is slightly high-angle, with the subject positioned center-right, using the diagonal ropes to enhance depth and visual tension, while the background water is blurred to a soft, flowing texture, emphasizing the subject. Lighting: strong sunlight from above casts sharp contrasts on her skin, fabric folds, and water ripples, with highlights like diamonds and soft shadows outlining her body contours. The overall color palette blends cool blue and warm cream, evoking a lazy, romantic summer afternoon. The scene has the refined quality of an art photograph combined with real-life atmosphere, as if a carefully composed outdoor portrait, capturing sharp details and color saturation of a professional camera while preserving natural light and texture. It conveys a sense of freedom, relaxation, and immersion in a beautiful moment, suggesting a poetic instant of sunlight, water, and youthful vitality.",
