          "prompt": "A young female idol on a concert stage, captured in a dynamic, energetic moment. She wears a glossy dark brown leather-like sleeveless one-piece shorts that clings tightly to her body, outlining her breasts and hips, with the fabric subtly revealing the shape of her nipples. The waist features pleats and metal ring decorations, paired with black tight shorts that hug her ass. Her brown hair is in a high ponytail with strands falling on her shoulders. Professional in-ear monitors and headset mic. Her expression is vivid, slightly turned back looking at the camera, mouth slightly open, eyes bright and focused. The shot focuses on her upper body and leg curves, body leaning forward slightly in a half-squat, arms bent, muscle lines visible, light sculpting. Mid-ground blurred stage edge and audience silhouettes with scattered red lights. Background pure black with numerous out-of-focus orange-red circular light spots creating soft halos like glow sticks or spotlights. Low angle shot, subject slightly left, diagonal pose guides eye from face to legs. Main light from upper front illuminates face, shoulders, torso, creating soft dramatic chiaroscuro, highlighting skin texture and leather reflections. Warm tones contrast with cold black background. High-quality professional camera style, film grain, cinematic feel, capturing a climactic moment of a large music festival. The tight leather outfit and dynamic pose emphasize her curves, hinting at nudity beneath, creating a sensual, powerful stage presence.",
