        {
          "id": "krea2-3c0cff688953349b5a80f751",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝浴袍婚礼忧伤站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in lavish Tang dynasty Hanfu stands beneath the flying eaves of an ancient building, surrounded by flowing red silk curtains. Her pose is elegant and composed, her eyes deep with a melancholy longing, as if gazing at an unreachable dream. Her hair is piled high into twin buns, thick and glossy, adorned with layered gold ornaments, pearls, and jade, a crown inlaid with emerald, pearl, and intricately carved golden floral patterns, softly gleaming in the gentle light; a small blue floral huadian is painted on her forehead, contrasting with the vermilion at the corners of her lips, enhancing her classical beauty. She wears a thin, diaphanous sky-blue robe, the fabric light and ethereal, the shoulders and cuffs embroidered with elaborate orange and gold interlaced floral vines, outlined in fine gold thread, layered and three-dimensional; the inner white sheer fabric is faintly visible, and her waist is cinched with a golden belt strung with green glass beads, the dangling chains swaying with her slight movements. Her hands lightly grasp the hem of her skirt, and a strip of vivid orange-red fabric peeks from her sleeve, creating a strong color contrast with the red curtains behind. In the foreground left edge, part of another figure in dark crimson robes suggests this is not a solitary moment but part of a grand ceremony or court event. The background is a softly blurred traditional Chinese roof with gray-white tiles layered in gentle curves, giving depth; on the right, large swaths of bright red velvet curtains cascade like flames, the textures fine, the folds natural, creating visual tension with the cool-toned clothing. The composition uses shallow depth of field, the subject sharply in focus against a blurred background, drawing the eye to her facial expression and the details of her attire. Light comes from the side-front, soft and even, not harsh, skillfully outlining the contours of her face and the folds of her garments, creating subtle highlights on her cheeks, neck, and fabric, enhancing texture. The overall atmosphere is serene and narrative, evoking the grand splendor of the Tang dynasty mixed with a hint of contemplation and sorrow, like a lady emerging from a historical scroll, carrying a poetic beauty steeped in time. The image is realistic and textured, as if shot with an amateur DSLR under natural light, retaining slight grain and natural light transitions, without heavy post-processing, conveying a dreamlike yet lifelike artistic quality. To make it NSFW, she is topless, the diaphanous robe open at the front, her breasts exposed, the fabric slipping off one shoulder. The golden belt still cinches her waist, but the upper body is nude, the sheer fabric draping loosely. The pose remains elegant, her hands still holding the skirt, but now the exposed skin catches the light, adding a sensual, intimate quality to the otherwise majestic scene.",
