          "alias": "单女露胸粉T恤舞台媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully astride a high-performance blue Yamaha track motorcycle, topless with her pink short-sleeve T-shirt unbuttoned and hanging open, her light blue jeans unzipped low on her hips revealing the curve of her waist and a hint of lace underwear. She wears casual beige sneakers, her long black hair falls loosely over her bare shoulders, a small brown hair clip adorns the top of her head. She turns her torso, looking back over her shoulder directly at the camera, lips slightly parted, eyes soft yet fiercely confident—a mix of vulnerable and bold. The motorcycle’s sharp blue-black bodywork is plastered with orange and white racing decals, prominent Yamaha, Shark, and EK Chains logos visible on the frame, tank, and tail; carbon fiber components gleam under natural light, bright blue multi-spoke alloy wheels, a vivid green rear stand, red chain. The bike dominates the foreground, angled slightly with its front wheel left, creating dynamic tension. In the background, a straight asphalt road stretches into the distance, flanked by lush green grass and tall trees; faint modern buildings and rolling hills blur under a soft gray-white sky, thin clouds, even daylight. A low-angle composition gives a powerful presence, using road perspective lines to draw the eye from foreground to background. Left side of the frame has ample negative space, balanced by the subject on the right. Shallow depth of field blurs background pedestrians and architecture, focusing on the woman’s bare chest and skin, and the metallic details of the bike. Natural sunlight falls from upper left, casting soft chiaroscuro across her skin, the folds of her open shirt, and the bike’s surfaces; sharp but not harsh shadows under the vehicle. Color palette is cool blues against the warm pink of the shirt, with balanced saturation. The overall feel is a mix of raw street photography and polished commercial editorial—sensual, mechanical, youthful, free.",
