          "id": "krea2-7a28ff18389c1b9de2dca41e",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙城市媚态坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully on a smooth light gray tiled floor, leaning back against a pure deep rosy red wall, the contrast sharp and focal. She wears a form-fitting black high-neck sleeveless dress, its hem laced but partially undone, exposing the bare curve of her upper thighs and hinting at nothing underneath. Her long legs are crossed naturally, clad in thick-soled black combat boots with visible tread patterns. Her hands are covered in gradient gray half-finger gloves, one resting lightly on her knee, the other on the floor, her posture relaxed yet commanding. Her black hair is casually tied up, a few stray strands falling across her face; makeup is subtle, lips slightly red, eyes locked on the camera with a confident, calm, and mysterious expression. The foreground is a close-up of her boots, the heavy soles dominating the bottom of the frame, guiding the eye upward along her exposed legs to her torso and face. The midground captures her from waist to knees, smooth muscle lines and natural fabric folds accentuating her form. Background is a pure deep rosy red wall with a metal baseboard at the floor, enhancing spatial layers. Low-angle shot, slightly looking up to emphasize her stature, with a diagonal leg composition balancing the frame. The visual flow starts from the boot soles, traces up her legs, and converges at her face. Indoor soft even lighting, no harsh shadows, clear silhouette, fair glowing skin. The overall tone is cool and restrained, but the rosy red background injects a warm, daring tension. Modern urban fashion meets artistic studio precision, blending understated luxury with rebellious, sensual aesthetics.",
