          "alias": "单女棕外套城市媚态坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully on a minimalist white metal stool, wearing a loose, open luxurious faux brown fur coat over a tight black mini dress and sheer black pantyhose, her feet in black stiletto heels with metal buckle straps. She flashes a warm, sultry smile directly at the camera, eyes inviting, left hand resting on her thigh, right hand holding an iced coffee with straw and whipped cream, the cup partly branded. Her long brown hair is tied back with a bold red satin bow, a few strands falling over her forehead, small pearl earrings dangling. A black chain-strap purse with pearl details hangs across her shoulder, strap grazing her thigh. The foreground highlights her long legs and feet—black stockings glisten, a delicate black lace floral pattern visible on the outer right calf, toes pointed slightly, pose confident and relaxed. The mid-ground shows her seated silhouette, fur coat open revealing bare skin and the short hem of the dress, the white metal stool clean and simple. The background is a pristine white wall and light gray tiled floor, with a round white table and chair in the corner, fine scratches on the tiles, a silver metal drain cover visible, adding realism. The composition uses a slightly low angle, subject center-right, empty space on the left balanced by the round table, following a rule-of-thirds. Leading lines from the drink upward to her face, then down along her legs to her toes, drawing focus to her core. Lighting is soft and even from the front/side, highlighting the fur's texture, the stockings' subtle sheen, gentle shadows on the wall. Warm browns, blacks, and whites dominate, creating a cozy, urban lazy-day vibe, as if a stolen moment in a café afternoon, capturing both artistic beauty and raw sensuality.",
