        {
          "id": "krea2-c1434efc35a1db770f6ee1ed",
          "alias": "单女透视黑西装酒店困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with platinum blonde straight hair, wearing a sharp black suit jacket, black sheer stockings with lace trim, over-the-knee stockings, and pointed high heels, sits elegantly on a dark marble countertop in a luxury hotel bathroom. Her posture is relaxed and slightly languid; she adjusts the lace garter on her thigh with both hands, her gaze lowered to the floor, exuding a quiet, introspective, and subtly mysterious mood. Her makeup is refined—sharp eyeliner, natural lips. The composition blends urban feminine strength with soft sensuality. The foreground shows her long legs and feet, the tips of her black heels hovering above the marble edge, lace at the ankle catching soft light. The midground features the wide marble countertop neatly arranged with white rolled towels, premium toiletries, and a vintage-style gold faucet and round mirror with ornate gilt frame, reflecting warm yellow wall sconces and a partial figure. The background consists of deep black marble walls and a glass shower enclosure with gold metal fittings, glowing coolly in the dim light with distant warm accents, creating depth. The shot is a slightly overhead medium-close view, placing the subject left of the golden ratio; the countertop forms a stable baseline, guiding the eye to her face and leg movement. Visual lines are built from her gaze, leg lines, and mirror reflections, heightening narrative tension. The lighting is low-saturation cool tones with a warm yellow side-backlight from the right and rear, softly shaping her face, layered hair, and clothing folds, casting delicate reflections on the marble for a high-end, dramatic contrast. The overall mood is cinematic and editorial—cold urban rationality meets intimate, ambiguous allure—delivering a low-key luxurious, confident, and artistically expressive visual experience.",
