        {
          "id": "krea2-2dc3103dc33b9af69b0aa95e",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣茶室微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands elegantly at the entrance of an old-style Chinese tea house, her vibrant red knitted cardigan unbuttoned, the white lace bow at her neck undone, revealing the curve of her bare shoulders and the top of her breasts. She wears a deep blue A-line maxi skirt with red floral and white polka dot patterns, hitched slightly higher on one side to expose a glimpse of her thigh. Her feet are in burgundy retro Mary Janes, a matching headband in her hair, and small pearl earrings dangle from her ears. Her black curly hair falls naturally over her shoulders, her gaze soft and contemplative as she looks slightly to the side at the camera, a faint, knowing smile on her lips. In her right hand she holds a glass of amber liquid (likely liquor), her left hand rests casually at her side. The foreground shows the concrete floor and a patch of white fluffy rug lit by sunlight. The midground captures her full figure with the tea house doorway behind her, a beaded curtain of red and green beads glowing warmly. To the right is the glass door with a faded red \"Tea\" calligraphy sign and \"Tea House\" in English, plus a translucent rhombus-shaped notice, the glass reflecting street views. To the left, through the door frame, green leaves are visible. The background reveals weathered brick walls and wooden door frames, exuding an old-town atmosphere. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, with her positioned slightly right of center, using the door frame as a natural frame for depth. Light comes from the upper right, warm and soft, caressing her hair, collarbone, and the exposed skin of her chest and shoulders, creating delicate chiaroscuro. The overall mood is warm, nostalgic, film-like, with a slight grain and color shift, as if captured by an old digital camera in the golden hour. The scene feels intimate, lazy, and poetic, with a subtle unbuttoned sensuality that invites the viewer into this quiet, urban corner.",
