        {
          "id": "krea2-e31c0b0c4598e66133202c72",
          "alias": "单女浴袍花园困倦坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an exquisite, partly undone hanfu sits before an aged wooden table. Her jet-black hair is piled high in an elaborate bun adorned with deep purple and crimson silk flowers; a simple copper tassel earring glimmers at her ear. Her face is ethereal—fair, luminous skin, dark piercing eyes turned slightly right, lips parted in a dreamy, melancholic pout. Her hands have slipped from their demure fold: one hand lazily traces the rim of a warm ceramic teapot, the other rests on her thigh, fingertips grazing the edge of her robe. The hanfu has fallen open at the chest, revealing bare, pale breasts with soft pink nipples, framed by translucent violet gauze and creamy silk. The sleeve edges are sheer, the bodice embroidered with lifelike purple blooms. The tabletop is rough, textured, holding a miniature tea set—a creamy white porcelain pot on a wooden tray, glowing with soft warmth. Mid-shot from a slight high angle, focusing on her upper body, the exposed skin, and the subtle tremble of her fingers. The background is blurred dense greenery and warm amber lights, creating a hazy bokeh of a late-night garden or tea room. Low-saturation warm-cool contrast; soft diffused light sculpts her face, shoulders, and the folds of silk and bare skin. The visual line leads from her gaze rightward, balanced by the tea set, inviting the viewer into a quiet, sensual moment—elegant, poetic, and deeply erotic.",
