          "id": "krea2-3841b6e7a6e24d3686a9e2f1",
          "alias": "单女半褪白连衣裙困倦站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young female model stands in front of a soft, dreamy gradient background. She has bright, warm orange-red short hair, neatly styled with light bangs falling over her forehead. Her facial features are delicate, with natural, clear makeup and a sweet, confident smile as she gazes tenderly at the camera. She wears a white single-shoulder tight-fitting dress with delicate pleated texture, cinched at the waist and featuring an asymmetrical high slit that reveals a cloud-like layered hem of sheer fabric cascading down to one calf. Her right hand gracefully raises a pink transparent bottle of perfume or skincare product, the cap a matching metallic tone, catching soft glimmers of light. Her feet are clad in simple white pointed-toe high heels, perfectly complementing the outfit. In the foreground, her long legs are crossed, right leg slightly bent supporting the body, left leg stepping forward, creating a stable yet rhythmic composition. The middle ground shows her full figure from waist to knee, with the dress and light intertwining to accentuate curves. The background is a dreamy gradient of pale purple and light blue, adorned with simple black outline four-leaf clovers and cloud patterns, like floating fairy symbols adding a fairytale lightness. The vertical composition places the person slightly above center, with visual focus on her facial expression and the product in her hand, guiding the eye from her exquisite face to her slender waist and long legs. Lighting is soft and even from the front, giving her skin a creamy glow, with subtle shadows in the dress folds enhancing depth and a faint halo scattering effect in the background for a hazy, sweet atmosphere. The color palette is dominated by pure white, with dreamy purple-blue backdrop and warm orange hair creating cool-warm contrast, while the pink product adds vitality. The overall style blends professional commercial photography polish with a candid, everyday feel, rich in detail yet uncluttered. The image exudes a fresh, gentle, youthful charm and healing beauty, as if in an enchanted spring afternoon, with every ray of light radiating purity and hope. For an NSFW adult version, the white dress is provocatively slipping off the shoulder, revealing one bare breast with a taut nipple, the high slit cut up to the hip, exposing the curve of her buttock and the inner thigh. Her pose is more suggestive: the hand holding the pink bottle is pressed against her lips, while her other hand trails down her thigh. Her expression turns into a sultry, knowing smirk, eyes half-lidded, inviting the viewer. The dress clings wetly to her body, emphasizing every contour, and the misty background now carries a subtle erotic glow.",
