          "id": "krea2-d93308eb320ba7db5a1b814f",
          "alias": "单女全裸白外套雪地媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A half-length portrait of a young woman, her soft light blonde hair cascading naturally over her shoulders, strands brushing her ear and collarbone, adding a lazy, elegant sensuality; her delicate face features fair skin like fresh snow, deep gentle eyes with a dreamy, unfocused gaze directed off to the right, her lips a natural pink-nude, slightly parted and moist, hinting at quiet arousal or contemplation. She is topless, her bare shoulders and the upper curve of her breasts exposed, the skin luminous under soft light. A magnificent multi-layer pearl necklace rests against her naked chest, composed of lustrous pearls of varying sizes, centered with a sparkling diamond and crystal butterfly pendant that catches light. A white tweed jacket is unbuttoned and slipping off one shoulder, revealing a hint of transparent lace at the cuff, the fabric’s fine shimmering threads catching light, adding texture and a sense of undress. Composition uses a slight rule-of-thirds tilt, her head positioned right of center, body angled left, her gaze leading the viewer out of frame, creating narrative depth and a voyeuristic feel. Background is a clean, deep gray, minimalist, focusing all attention on her form. Lighting: soft diffused light from front left, sculpting her jawline, neck, collarbone, and the swell of her breasts, with natural shadows on the right side of her face and neck, enhancing three-dimensionality without losing softness. Overall tone is cool white against dark gray, exuding an air of refined luxury and intimate allure. Atmosphere blends high-fashion sophistication with a raw, candid snapshot—slight grain and color compression at the edges mimic a phone or casual camera in low indoor light, yet her skin and details remain sharp, the light transitions silky. The image feels like a stolen moment of elegance, as if captured during a quiet afternoon or a private gathering, combining artistic depth with a palpable, breathy realism.",
