        {
          "id": "krea2-1d3d99b1de57771eb95280e7",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑靴子街道困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a rough gray granite rock in a nighttime grassland, her body leaning slightly forward, left hand cradling her chin, right hand resting on the edge of the stone, her pose lazy yet dramatically charged. Her long brown hair falls over her shoulders, with neat bangs, and her makeup is meticulously done, highlighting her eyes and lips, her gaze directly into the lens carrying a hint of dreamy contemplation. In the foreground, a close-up of her legs clad in glossy black over-the-knee high-heel boots, the shiny leather reflecting light, the slim heels firmly planted on yellowed grass, the boot shafts hugging her legs to accentuate their elegant curve. In the midground, her upper body is shown: she wears a loose, slightly faded blue denim jacket, unzipped, revealing her bare breasts beneath—no inner top, the nipples visible against the dark night. A black high-neck tight knit top is absent; instead, her upper torso is nude under the open jacket. A black leather mini skirt with a pleated hem is visible below, and a simple silver pendant necklace hangs around her neck. Her nails sport gradient pink polish with sharp extended tips. The background is a deep nocturnal grassland, the grass sparse and dry, colored a grayish green under artificial light, with distant darkness blurring into no detail, creating a strong sense of depth and solitude. The composition uses a slightly tilted overhead angle, with the subject positioned in the lower right, the rock forming a sturdy visual base, her legs extending to the lower left to guide the eye, achieving an asymmetrical balanced layout. Visual lines from her gaze, hand gestures, and leg contours focus attention on her facial expression and clothing details—especially the exposed skin. Lighting comes from a single artificial source (possibly a phone flash or small fill light), creating sharp chiaroscuro on her face, jacket, and boots, with crisp highlights and soft shadows, evoking a cold, textured night atmosphere. The overall color palette is cool blue-gray, with warm pink nail accents and subtle skin highlights, blending a street-fashion vibe with a melancholic sense of late-night solitude. The image quality is detailed and realistic, as if captured by an amateur device like a smartphone or compact camera in low light, retaining slight noise and natural distortion, giving it a lifelike, raw feel rather than over-retouched perfection.",
