          "id": "krea2-8ba5375aabe610f425ae5489",
          "alias": "单女歌手外套舞台媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young female idol stands center stage in a stunning white naval-style performance outfit, now slightly unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest and the soft curve of her breasts. She wears the white sailor cap with a black round badge and gold trim, her long black hair cascading over her shoulders, a few strands brushing her collarbone. Her right hand is raised in a crisp salute, left hand resting at her side, silver earrings and a tiny microphone visible. Her expression is soft yet seductive, lips parted slightly, eyes gazing directly at the camera with a blend of professional charm and raw sensuality. The focus is on her upper body and face, the double-breasted gold buttons undone, the structured jacket open, showing the smooth skin of her torso. Gold epaulettes and sleeve stripes catch the light. Her bare legs are visible beneath the short white shorts, skin glowing under the stage lights. The deep blue-purple background is dotted with out-of-focus blue circular light spots, creating a dreamy, intimate atmosphere. Composition is centered, slightly low-angle, enhancing her commanding presence. The main light from above-front sculpts her facial features and the highlights on her uniform and skin, with soft backlighting adding depth. The contrast between the cold blue tones and warm skin creates a unique blend of cool professionalism and vibrant youth. The scene has a high-end commercial photoshoot feel, rich in detail, with every texture and shadow meticulously crafted, embodying a heroic yet alluring \"daughter of the sea\" persona, now embracing her sensual power.",
