        {
          "id": "krea2-fbf2a6f0da3fee64dffe7982",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣桌边困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a round wooden table in a retro-style café or diner, wearing a soft, fluffy pink chunky-knit sweater with sleeves casually rolled up, revealing her bare wrists. Beneath, she wears a very short black skirt and thigh-high black leather boots with thick soles, the boots tightly hugging her long legs. Her dark hair falls smooth to her shoulders, bangs brushing her forehead, her gaze dreamy and slightly introspective as she stares into the lens. She rests her chin on her left hand, her right hand loosely on the table edge, her posture relaxed yet charged with subtle sensuality. The foreground shows the warm wooden tabletop and metal legs reflecting soft light. The midground focuses on her waist to knees, the short skirt leaving a generous strip of bare thigh before meeting the tall boots, her legs crossed lazily, exuding a confident, lounging allure. The interior features a large window on the left letting in bright natural light, and a mosaic tile wall in red, white, and blue on the right. The composition is a slightly top-down medium close-up, with the woman slightly right of center, the table legs guiding the eye upward to her face. The lighting is warm and soft, with natural side light catching her cheek and shoulder, highlighting the sweater's texture and the cool sheen of the leather. The overall mood is intimate and cozy, with a subtle grit of amateur photography—slight noise and natural depth of field—giving it a lived-in, candid feel. The sweater is slightly unbuttoned at the top, suggesting she is braless underneath, adding a soft hint of nudity. Her legs and boots dominate the frame, the contrast of bare skin and tight leather drawing the eye. All subjects are consenting adults 18+.",
