        {
          "id": "krea2-e238d715c5359f9d527cf070",
          "alias": "单女露胸短裙车厢媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands slightly to the right of the frame at a subway entrance on a city street corner, topless, her pale breasts fully exposed, a plaid pleated skirt hugging her hips, thin-rimmed glasses on her face, long black hair cascading down. She turns her head back over her shoulder, gazing at the camera with a calm, curious expression, her body leaning sensually against a vintage red bicycle with sleek frame lines, polished seat and fenders catching the soft light. In the foreground, a thick black metal railing arcs diagonally from the lower left, framing her and the bicycle. Midground features a blue subway sign \"424 명동 Myeong-dong,\" hexagonal numbering and Korean text standing out against the cool backdrop, beside a glass door glowing with warm interior light and geometric window panes, creating stark contrast. Background shows a rough gray concrete wall with a green \"EVACUATION ROUTE\" sign and a street plate reading \"서울 02451,\" adding urban realism. Composition uses a slightly tilted angle, the railing and sign drawing the eye to her face. Lighting: soft diffused light from the right evenly illuminates her bare torso and the bicycle, casting subtle shadows on the railing and wall, enhancing depth; the warm light from the glass door contrasts with the outdoor cool tones, blending urban coolness with everyday warmth. Color palette dominated by gray, blue, and red—the red bicycle serves as the visual focal point against the cold background, evoking an art-photography sophistication with a raw, candid snapshot feel, as if a fleeting street moment frozen in time, full of life and narrative tension.",
