          "alias": "单女浴袍山野忧伤坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A regal East Asian woman sits on a rocky ledge in a dark cave or cliffside, her elaborate red ancient costume a mix of sheer translucent layers and rich brocade. She leans forward slightly, arms crossed and resting gently just below her chest, her gaze fixed upward to the right, lost in a secret thought. Her hair is piled high in an ornate crown adorned with jewels and exotic flowers, a vermilion mark on her forehead. The red robes shimmer from deep crimson to fiery orange in the warm beam of light; the sheer parts cling to her skin, revealing the outline of her nipples and the curve of her bare thighs. The neckline plunges daringly, exposing her cleavage and the upper swell of her breasts. The robe pools around her bare feet and ankles, which are adorned with gold string anklets and matching beaded bracelets. Her knees and calves are fully exposed, the fabric falling away to show smooth skin. A single shaft of warm golden light from above-left creates dramatic Rembrandt lighting, illuminating her face, shoulders, arms, and the sheer parts of her robe, while the rest is in deep, velvety shadow. The background is pitch-black cave walls with faint traces of moss. Composition is classic off-center, with her figure at the golden ratio, leading the eye to the upper right. The dominant color is rich red against black, creating a mood that is both passionate and lonely, sacred and dangerously sensual. She appears as a goddess or enchantress from ancient legend, awaiting fate in the silent abyss. The image has a cinematic quality with rich detail and texture, like a professional DSLR shot at dusk with high color saturation and natural texture, blending artistic height with a raw, amateur realism.",
