          "id": "krea2-3c801dc883d0113703feb9ae",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙办公室微笑坐演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully in a modern office chair, her flowing golden hair cascading over her shoulders. Her eyes are clear and tender as she gazes back at the camera, a faint, knowing smile playing on her lips, exuding calm confidence. She wears a sheer black lace long-sleeve dress, the delicate fabric clinging to her curves and revealing the outline of her nipples and the shadow of her pubic area; the bodice plunges deeply, showcasing her breasts with the lace barely covering her areolas. Her long, toned legs are crossed and resting barefoot on the edge of a white L-shaped desk, one foot dangling slightly, her pose relaxed yet charged with sensual tension. One hand rests lightly on the arm of the chair, the other falls naturally between her thighs, fingers grazing her inner leg through the lace. In the foreground, the curved armrest and metal base of the beige leather office chair are sharply detailed, soft and sleek. The midground features a clean white desk surface with a black business phone, a red stapler, a gray pencil holder with colorful pens, and a dark computer monitor with its screen off—everyday office items arranged to create a believable workspace. The background shows a decorative faux brick wall in gray-white tones contrasting with white blinds on the right; a lush green potted plant in the corner adds a touch of life to the hard lines. The composition is a slightly high-angle oblique shot, placing the woman at the visual center, her leg line extending to the right to guide the viewer’s eye, while the desk lines enhance depth. Light streams from a window on the left, soft and even, casting gentle highlights on her face and body, with subtle shadows that define her form without harshness. The color palette is predominantly black, white, and gray, accented by the gold of her hair and the red of the office items—creating a cool, stylish yet warm modern urban atmosphere. The image is rich in detail, feeling as though captured by an amateur camera but elevated to professional art through precise framing and lighting, blending everyday intimacy with a quiet, sensual poetry.",
