          "prompt": "A young woman in a luxurious deep red ancient Chinese robe, the fabric slipping off her shoulder to reveal bare skin and the curve of one breast, standing sideways between weathered wooden pillars of an old building. The robe is wide and flowing, adorned with intricate dark floral patterns, catching soft light that gives it a silken sheen. Her long, raven hair falls freely over her back and neck, a few strands brushing the edge of the collar. Exquisite makeup with warm vermilion lips, eyes cast downward, her gaze introspective and melancholy, carrying a subtle sensuality. Foreground: two thick wooden columns frame the scene, slightly blurred, their rich brown textures visible. Midground: her full figure, slightly turned left, head bowed, posture elegant and lonely. Background: a blurred classical interior with carved wooden railings, distant doors, and a soft halo of outdoor light, creating depth and historical atmosphere. Warm earthy tones dominate, with the red robe as the focal point. Side-backlighting outlines her silhouette and the fabric’s texture, with a faint reflection on the stone floor. Cinematic quality, poetic nostalgia, blending traditional East Asian aesthetics with modern narrative depth. Perfect for an artistic, sensual portrait.",
