        {
          "id": "krea2-1e75570b57af2d45544eeae3",
          "alias": "单女黑外套街道媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits sensually on the edge of a concrete city street corner at night, wearing a glossy black leather cropped jacket partially unbuttoned, revealing her bare chest and the curve of her breasts, with fluffy black faux fur trim at the collar and cuffs adding a touch of luxury and wildness. She wears sheer black stockings and sleek black high-heeled boots that hug her calves, the soles catching a warm gold gleam against the cool urban backdrop. Her dark hair falls loose over her shoulders, strands brushing her face; her makeup is flawless with full lips, and her eyes lock onto the camera with a cool, commanding confidence. Her right hand holds a small black perfume bottle, fingers tipped with shiny silver-gray nail polish; her left hand rests casually on her knee, a simple metal ring on her ring finger. The foreground is rough concrete with a bold yellow road line cutting diagonally across the frame, leading the eye to her legs and boots. She leans slightly forward, legs crossed, creating a dynamic tension. The background features industrial elements: a concrete staircase with metal railing on the left, dark horizontal slatted overhangs or building structures on the right, receding into depth with blurred city neon lights in the distance, hinting at a vibrant nightlife. The shot is low-angle, slightly tilted up, amplifying her presence. A single artificial light source (like a phone flash or small fill light) creates strong highlights and shadows on her face, leather jacket, and boots, producing dramatic chiaroscuro. The atmosphere is moody and mysterious, with black tones blending into the night, exuding a cold, high-fashion street style fused with cyberpunk aesthetics, reminiscent of a heroine from *Blade Runner* or *The Matrix*: both sensual and independent, brimming with narrative tension. The palette is predominantly black, gray, and white, with the yellow road line as a visual anchor; overall cool-toned, balanced by warm reflections on skin and highlights. Composition follows the rule of thirds, placing her near the golden ratio, with her pose and gaze directing focus to her face and hands while background lines enhance spatial depth. Light texture emphasizes material reflections—the mirror-like gloss of leather, the translucent sheen of stockings, the cold metallic lustre of accessories—creating a highly realistic and artistic night-street photo style, blending documentary feel with fashion-forward expression.",
