          "prompt": "A young woman in a deep blue silk slip dress, wide-brimmed black lace hat with sheer veil framing her short black bangs and bright eyes, tilts her head back, lips parted in a mysterious, seductive smile. Her right hand gracefully touches her lips, black-and-white nails, left hand on knee. She wears a sparkling diamond necklace, long earrings, black velvet lace-trimmed gloves, full red lips, vintage aristocratic cold allure. She sits on an ornate antique chair with black-gold velvet, gold tassels, emerald enamel ornaments, metal chains. Her long pale legs are crossed, skin smooth and glowing under soft light. Mid-shot focuses on her body from shoulders to knees, tight composition. Background: warm amber light from glass bulbs and crystal chandeliers, soft bokeh with blurry green plants, vintage furniture, gold lines—Victorian salon or magical tea room. Shallow depth of field, focus on face and upper body. Light from above-front sculpts her face and shoulders, backlight creates highlights on hair, fabric, jewelry. Overall mood: gothic romance, vintage luxury, modern edge, mysterious yet tender, elegant yet rebellious. Texture rich, color warm, saturated, professional photo studio quality, like an oil painting or film still, full of narrative tension and visual allure.",
