          "prompt": "A young woman in a flowing hanfu sits in a classical interior, her jet-black hair piled high into an ornate bun adorned with delicate flower pins and dangling tassels, a single jade earring swaying against her neck. Her outer robe is loosened, slipping off one shoulder to reveal the smooth curve of her collarbone and the edge of a sheer, pale blue inner robe, the fabric clinging to her breasts. Her expression is pensive, lips parted slightly, eyes half-lidded with a sultry melancholy. Her hands rest lightly on her thigh, fingers tracing the silk of her skirt. Soft side lighting highlights the contours of her face and the subtle shadow between her breasts. The background is blurred, a wooden floor and faint figure in blue, drawing focus to her exposed skin and the intimate tension in her posture. The atmosphere is a blend of classical elegance and sensual vulnerability, tones of cream, sky blue, and soft yellow evoking a delicate, erotic portrait.",
