          "alias": "单女露胸黑连衣裙博物馆微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands with her back to the camera, glancing over her shoulder with a playful, gentle smile. Her short brown wavy hair falls naturally, soft bangs brushing her forehead. She wears a daring black dress with an off-shoulder cut that reveals smooth, bare skin—one shoulder covered in delicate black lace adorned with intricate floral patterns and fuzzy trim, hinting at the bare flesh beneath. A striking red leather strap crosses over the lace, studded with silver metal rings, creating a bold contrast. She is completely topless under the lace, the sheer fabric barely concealing her nipples. Her left hand rests on her hip, a thin beaded bracelet catching the soft light. The foreground focuses on her bare back and shoulder details, the red strap and lace texture sharp in shallow depth of field. Midground shows the silhouette of her body and the silk-like folds of the skirt. Background is a slightly cluttered indoor market or exhibition space with long fluorescent tubes casting warm white light, blurry figures, chairs, ladders, shelves—a lively, slightly hazy urban night atmosphere. Composition is a medium close-up, slightly tilted for intimacy and motion. Her gaze draws the viewer in, the red strap leading the eye upward. Lighting is warm, soft, diffused from above, illuminating her face and shoulders with subtle chiaroscuro, the skirt folds catching highlights. The background is a bokeh of warm tones and blurred shapes. The photo feels candid yet artfully staged, like a spontaneous street capture with a crafted fashion aesthetic, exuding effortless elegance and confidence, capturing the romantic energy of a city night.",
