          "alias": "单女黑连体衣厨房媚态站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A young Asian woman stands in a modern minimalist kitchen, wearing a tight black short-sleeve bodysuit that clings to her curvy figure, deep dark hair loosely pinned up with a black clip. She turns her head back over her shoulder, gazing at the camera with a soft, sultry look, lips slightly parted, natural expression. Her left hand lightly grips the pot handle, right hand holding a wooden spoon stirring rich red tomato sauce in a stainless steel pot on an induction cooktop with visible digital display. Background shows white cabinets and a silver range hood, a knife block with black knives and colorful silicone utensils, two bottles of olive oil (one dark green, one clear with golden oil). On the windowsill to the right are diced carrots, bell pepper rings, onion chunks, and a glass bowl of tomato pieces. Soft natural light streams in from the window, illuminating the space with a bright, cozy homey atmosphere. Composition is slightly low angle, subject centered-right, foreground focuses on the sauce and her hands, midground shows countertop and ingredients, background extends to window and cabinets, creating depth. Visual lines from pot, arm, and her gaze converge on her face. Lighting is soft and even with natural window light as main source, complemented by indoor light, creating subtle chiaroscuro on her curves and clothing folds. Overall palette is black, white, gray with highlights of red tomato sauce and green veggies. This feels like an everyday moment captured with a phone or home camera, realistic yet artistic, full of domestic warmth and intimacy. The tight bodysuit accentuates her breasts, hips, and ass as she bends slightly forward, her pose inviting and sensual.",
