          "id": "krea2-967d8e5ac37a8a8a88f693f9",
          "alias": "单女粉礼服室内困倦倚靠",
          "prompt": "A young elegant Asian woman in a luxurious sheer pink high-neck sleeveless gown, intricately embroidered with gold and pearl motifs that cascade like flowing stars across her chest and shoulders, the dress cut low to reveal the soft swell of her breasts and a generous glimpse of her bare skin; her voluminous brown hair is loosely pinned up, with stray strands grazing her forehead and neck, adding a touch of languid sensuality. She wears dazzling pearl-drop earrings that catch the light, her face serene yet alluring. She leans slightly against a smooth off-white wall, one hand resting on her hip, the other hanging naturally, a simple ring visible on her finger. Her eyes are clear and bright, meeting the camera with a faint, knowing smile that hints at quiet confidence and invitation. The focus is sharp on her delicate facial features and the exposed curve of her neck and collarbones; the midground captures the richly detailed bodice and the soft line of her arm. The background is a blurred solid wall, creating a minimalist atmosphere. The composition follows the rule of thirds and golden spiral, shot from a slightly low angle looking up, emphasizing her graceful, dignified presence. Soft diffused light from the left washes over her face and gown, creating gentle chiaroscuro that makes her skin look like silk and the jewelry sparkle with warm, subtle glints. The overall mood is dreamy and serene, exuding understated luxury and classical painting aesthetic, yet with a modern fashion photography edge. Shot indoors with professional camera, balanced color saturation, low contrast, warm tones, evoking a realistic yet artistic visual experience.",
