        {
          "id": "krea2-d8916be2535dd594113b4c30",
          "alias": "单女灰浴袍媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty in an elaborate Hanfu sits in a poised yet sensual pose against a pure gradient background. Her ink-black hair is intricately styled with floral hairpins, gold and blue silk blossoms, and dangling tassels that catch the light. A vermillion cinnabar dot adorns her forehead. Her eyes hold a melancholic, pensive gaze. One hand gently cups her cheek, the other rests loosely on a yellowed thread-bound ancient book. Her Hanfu is composed of a soft gray-white robe, open at the chest to reveal a sheer, sky-blue wide-sleeved inner garment and the smooth, pale skin of her bare shoulders and collarbone. The robe falls open, exposing one breast partially, the nipple visible against the blue silk. The robe's edges are embroidered with delicate cloud and butterfly patterns. Over her shoulders, a sheer gray-white gauze cape with soft fur trim flows around her body. She sits on a plush white rug, creating a pure contrast. The composition is mid-shot, slightly off-center, with her body turned and head tilted, static yet graceful. Soft lighting from the right front outlines her face and the fabric folds, emphasizing the smooth texture of her skin and the silk. The background is an even light gray gradient, uncluttered. The overall mood is serene, ethereal, with a touch of classical melancholy. The cool color palette of blue, white, and gray harmonizes, with delicate shadows and highlights accentuating the warmth of her skin and the richness of the fabric. This image evokes a classical Chinese painting, blending traditional elegance with modern photographic precision and a subtle, alluring NSFW edge.",
