        {
          "id": "krea2-909f3765733bdd1f68cf67b3",
          "alias": "单女歌手粉连帽衫舞台沉思站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young female idol stands center stage, the absolute focal point, wearing a vibrant pink athletic outfit: a loose light-pink suede hoodie worn open, a white cropped tank top emblazoned with \"PERAL\" that leaves her midriff bare, matching high-waisted drawstring shorts, white platform wedge sandals, and thigh-high socks. Her black shoulder-length hair falls naturally, makeup flawless, eyes intense and captivating, lips slightly parted as if caught mid-song or dance move. In her right hand she holds a microphone casually at her side, while her left hand lifts gracefully, creating dynamic flow with the backdrop dancers. Flanking her left and right, two female backup dancers in white stage costumes stretch their arms high, their blurred forms and motion blur amplifying the performance's energy. The foreground is a glossy blue stage floor reflecting dazzling light lines like flowing water ripples extending into depth, enhancing spatial perspective. The midground features the lead idol's full figure with her dancers, forming the narrative core. The background is a huge deep-blue LED screen wall flashing abstract geometric lights and line patterns, creating a futuristic, dreamlike performance environment. The composition is symmetrical, the subject centered, lens slightly elevated capturing her full body, emphasizing her poised stance while using the reflective floor to guide the viewer's eye to her facial expression and upper body details. Lighting is soft and volumetric from top and side lamps, bright and even on her face, subtle shadows along her body and folds of clothing, highlighting skin texture and fabric layers. The cool background lights contrast with the warm pink outfit, evoking a fusion of futuristic fantasy and youthful vitality. The image conveys professional studio clarity with an amateur device's natural spontaneity, capturing a fleeting yet eternal stage miracle.",
