        {
          "id": "krea2-95f9e29514d5d7eb27aa6a6e",
          "alias": "单女空姐制服酒店媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young female flight attendant in a meticulously detailed uniform lounges back on a cream leather armchair, her black hair swept into a low bun, forehead bare, deep eyes locking onto the camera with a lazy, seductive gaze. Her lips are naturally red, a slight smirk playing at the corner. The uniform: a light gray-white blouse unbuttoned halfway, revealing the swell of her breasts and a hint of lace, paired with a dark gray short skirt trimmed in sharp navy blue at the collar and cuffs. A small gold name badge gleams, and a blue-white silk scarf flutters loosely at her neck. Her long, straight legs sheathed in sheer black stockings catch the light, one leg crossed over the other, knee angled outward, black patent stilettos dangling from her toes. The camera focuses on her waist, thighs, and the tips of her heels in a close-up, then pulls back to show her full seated silhouette and the uniform details. The background is a deep gray textured wall beside a cream tile wall, soft shadows pooling at the corner. A low-angle shot makes her appear taller, the sofa edge guiding the eye from her ankles up to her face. Lighting is soft and even, from the left front, sculpting the curves of her body, the stockings gleaming subtly, the heels reflecting cold metal light against the matte background. The palette is cool gray-blue, cream, and dark gray, accented by the bright blue of the scarf and pure black of the shoes, evoking a private, still, intimate atmosphere in a high-end hotel lounge. The image carries a deliberate amateur-shot quality—sharp but with slight grain and natural color transitions—making it feel like a real, alive moment, not commercial photography. She exudes an irresistible, silent allure of urban femininity and confident sensuality.",
