        {
          "id": "krea2-51e6fdc146b30a0b390ffa58",
          "alias": "单女全裸摄影棚神秘站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young elegant East Asian woman stands as the absolute focal point, nude except for an elaborate silver crystal and diamond embroidery piece that covers her chest like a crown or abstract butterfly wings, glittering under soft side light. Her deep brown hair is delicately pinned up, with a few strands falling over her shoulders and neck. Her makeup is refined and natural, with warm-toned eyeshadow and peach-pink lips, her gaze clear and slightly mysterious as she looks directly at the camera. Her left hand is gently raised near her shoulder, right hand rests behind her back, posture composed and confident, exuding a noble yet approachable aura. Her arms and hands are sharply detailed, fingers slender, wearing a simple ring and small earrings, a thin chain necklace with a pendant harmonizing with the overall look. The mid-shot focuses on her torso, from bare chest to waist and hips, her skin glowing in soft shadows. The background is a textured olive-green wall, warm and steady, with a soft, contoured shadow of her figure cast on the right, enhancing depth and dimension. A dark wooden baseboard or furniture edge is faintly visible at the base. Composition is a classic mid-close portrait, subject slightly left of center, guiding the eye from her face to the glittering chest piece, then down along the curves of her waist and hips. Lighting is a professional softbox side-backlight from the left front, illuminating her face, shoulders, and chest, creating gentle shadow transitions on the right side of her body, making skin texture smooth and full, with rich tonal contrast. The atmosphere is warm, luxurious, with a nostalgic cinematic feel, as if in an elegant evening event or artistic photo studio. Color palette is olive green and pale gold with silver accents, blending modern and classical high aesthetics, carrying the realism of casual equipment but the artistic depth and emotional tension of professional work. The scene is narrative and immersive, allowing the viewer to feel her inner calm and confidence, along with the refinement and elegance of the setting.",
