        {
          "id": "krea2-31bf0da2880dab8ab3b2648f",
          "alias": "单女露胸舞者白衬衫舞台困倦注视",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired female singer performs passionately at center stage, her soft, wavy light-silver hair flowing with subtle motion as bangs lightly fall across her forehead. She gazes intently to the side, mouth slightly open, singing into a professional microphone. A shiny stage monitor headset is tucked behind her ear, while delicate earrings and a thin chain necklace with tiny gemstones catch the stage lights. She wears a loose white long-sleeve shirt worn open, revealing her bare, toned torso and clearly defined abs—no inner camisole, exposing her full breasts with nipples visible. She pairs this with dark blue LV monogram athletic shorts accented by drawstrings and gold zippers. Her hands lift naturally, fingers brushing through her hair, striking a dynamic, artistic pose. The foreground focuses on her upper body, shot from a slight low angle to enhance her stage presence. The background is a deep sapphire stage curtain, dotted with blurred blue and green circular spotlight effects, creating a dreamy, concert-like atmosphere. On the left, a faintly blurred silhouette of a female dancer adds depth and live-show realism. Dramatic lighting from above-front casts sharp highlights on her face, shoulders, and clothing folds, while shadows transition smoothly for a three-dimensional look. Her gaze directs attention to the right, with subtle depth-of-field blur to keep the focus on her. The overall style blends professional stage production with a raw, amateur-realistic vibe, cool yet warm tones, capturing the breathless intensity of a musical climax. The scene radiates youthful energy, fashion, and artistic immersion, evoking the unrepeatable thrill of a live performance.",
