        {
          "id": "krea2-1896a95e731ff11c4a89b270",
          "alias": "单女露胸红旗袍闺房媚态演奏",
          "prompt": "An elegant Eastern woman reclines diagonally on a sleek white marble coffee table, her body bared from the waist up, with only the vibrant red modified qipao crumpled open around her hips. She wears sheer black stockings and crystal-encrusted stiletto heels, one leg bent seductively, the other stretched long. Her head turns slightly, a soft smile playing on her lips, brown hair half-up in a knot with tendrils falling. Golden earrings catch the light. On the table, a dark remote rests near her thigh, drawing the eye along her bare skin, the curve of her hips, and her feet in those heels. In the midground, a cream fabric armchair with a vivid red cushion echoes the qipao's color. Behind, a floor-to-ceiling window lets in soft natural light, blurring the view into pale blue shapes, creating a private, intimate atmosphere. The composition places her left of center, with her extended legs and the chair balancing the right. Light from the front-left models her exposed breasts, the translucent stockings, and casts subtle shadows that enhance depth. Warm reds dominate, with white, cream, and black accents, exuding a rich, artistic eroticism. The vibe is still, elegant, and charged with unspoken desire, like a high-end boudoir photoshoot with a large-aperture lens—crisp details, smooth gradients, full saturation, capturing a moment of confident sensuality.",
