        {
          "id": "krea2-1ad11735e2a03be8466ea2d8",
          "alias": "单女紫连衣裙城市媚态坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits elegantly before a marble partition in a modern luxury interior, wearing a tight, deep purple strapless sequin dress that hugs her curves and reveals a plunging neckline showcasing her cleavage and smooth shoulders. Her long hair falls naturally over one shoulder, makeup exquisite with soft lips, her gaze locked onto the camera with a calm, confident yet seductive expression. Her long, shapely legs are crossed, resting lightly on the gray patterned carpet, feet adorned with strappy stiletto heels embellished with sparkling crystal details, her toenails painted bright red. She holds a small silver metallic clutch in her left hand, a delicate bracelet on her wrist, and a tiny diamond pendant necklace around her neck—understated luxury. The foreground features an abstract geometrically patterned gray carpet, rich in texture, visually extending alongside her legs. The midground is a smooth pale gray marble wall with visible natural veins, reflecting soft indoor light. The background reveals dark hardwood floors, black-framed glass partitions, and faint outlines of modern furniture; a large floral arrangement wrapped in white wrinkled paper is visible on the upper right, with a hint of a gold metal column at the top edge, creating depth and high-end atmosphere. The composition is a mid-close shot, the woman slightly off-center left, her body tilted naturally, creating dynamic balance. Visual lines lead from her hand touching the clutch, up along her legs to her face, and her gaze locks the viewer's attention. Lighting comes from the front and left, soft and even, casting subtle highlights on her skin and dress, with faint shadows on the marble wall, enhancing spatial layers. The overall color palette is cool gray, deep purple, and warm gold, evoking a quiet, sophisticated, slightly intimate modern urban night scene—like a chance encounter in a high-end hotel lobby or private club, blending artistic photography precision with realism, rich in detail yet not overwhelming, conveying an understated luxurious aesthetic.",
