        {
          "id": "krea2-418503899a075ab1e65ee965",
          "alias": "单女束缚黑西装媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways against a modern minimalist white wall with striped industrial black beams. She wears an elaborate black gothic crown headdress covered in sparkling crystals and silver ornaments, with delicate fringe falling alongside her low brown ponytail. Her black tailored suit jacket is open, revealing a sheer white blouse unbuttoned to expose the swell of her breasts, the crystal-studded cravat dangling loosely between her cleavage. A dark gray pinstripe tie hangs undone around her neck. Beneath the jacket, black bondage straps wrap her torso. French cuffs fold back at her wrists, one hand in pocket, the other resting at her side, wearing black leather gloves and a metal studded bracelet. Her head tilts upward to the right, eyes cast off-frame with a mysterious, contemplative expression. Soft directional light from upper left casts delicate highlights on her cheek, neck, and shoulders, with sharp shadows on the right side. The monochrome palette—black, white, gray—is accented by warm brown hair and crystal glints. The scene feels like an underground music venue backstage or a contemporary art space, with subtle grain and natural bokeh suggesting an impromptu amateur capture, yet the pose and details exude high-fashion editorial sensuality.",
