          "alias": "单女半褪灰T恤室内微笑脱衣",
          "prompt": "A cute young East Asian woman with long, sleek black hair and neat bangs, flashing a bright, sweet smile at the camera, her white teeth contrasting with soft pink lips, her eyes bright and warm with joy and satisfaction. She wears a simple, form-fitting dark gray crewneck T-shirt, but it's unbuttoned or pulled down, exposing her bare chest and perky nipples. The shirt's front features a colorful, detailed anime character print with purple hair and a starry background, adding a touch of fantasy. Her right hand gracefully holds a light green plastic fork, fingers slender and well-manicured, while her left hand balances a small, delicate cake on a white paper plate. The cake is cylindrical with smooth pale yellow cream, edged with a ring of white cream dots, topped with several pink buttercream roses and mint-green leaves. In the foreground, the cake and fork are sharp and detailed, while her face is soft and warm. The midground shows her torso, the plate and cake, balanced composition. Background is a light gray wall with subtle vertical lines, and a wooden floor or furniture part in warm tones. Close-up shot with her head slightly tilted, looking directly at the camera, creating intimacy. Visual flow from her smiling face to the cake to the wall texture. Light from above-front, soft and even, casting a subtle shadow behind her, enhancing depth. Overall warm, happy, celebratory vibe—like a casual smartphone photo in natural indoor light, but with her topless, adding an explicit erotic touch.",
