          "alias": "单女半褪白浴袍寺庙困倦侧头",
          "prompt": "A young East Asian woman in a flowing, sheer pale blue traditional Hanfu, the wide sleeves and collar trimmed with intricate blue-white geometric patterns and bold red piping, her white inner robe barely visible beneath the loosened neckline that slips off one shoulder, revealing the smooth curve of her bare shoulder and the upper swell of her breasts. Her ink-black hair cascades down her back, a few strands swept behind her ear, stray wisps clinging to her forehead. She tilts her head slightly, gazing upward with soft, dreamy eyes, lips parted in a silent, sensual sigh. Her right hand gracefully brushes the hair at her temple, fingertips trailing along her skin. In the foreground, a dark weathered wooden plank with rough grain and rust-red stains cuts across the lower frame, guiding the eye toward her. The midground holds her figure, while the background is softly blurred: a black tripod and crew member in dark blue to the left, vague green foliage to the right, suggesting an outdoor film set in a garden or forest. The composition is a medium close-up, shallow depth of field locking focus on her face and bare upper body, the sheer fabric clinging to the contours of her waist. Soft, diffused overcast lighting warms her skin with a subtle sheen, highlighting the fine texture of her skin and the delicate folds of silk. The scene exudes a quiet, nostalgic elegance, blending the authenticity of a movie shoot with an intimate, erotic pause, as if capturing an actress lost in thought between takes—her modesty slipping in an unguarded moment.",
