          "prompt": "A young, athletic woman stands confidently at the center of an outdoor pickleball court, wearing only a deep navy blue sports bra that barely contains her breasts, a matching pleated miniskirt, retro yellow sneakers with white socks, a white headband, and a cream canvas bag slung over one shoulder. She holds a blue fan-patterned \"DILO\" paddle high in her right hand, while her left hand casually grips a bright yellow-green pickleball. Her body leans slightly forward, head tilted back, lips parted in a playful, inviting kiss-mouth expression, eyes locked on the camera with a mix of confidence and teasing allure. The foreground shows the red-and-blue court surface and black mesh net, casting sharp shadows in the bright sunlight. Midground includes white sideline markings, an empty black bench, green fencing, and a distant yellow sign. Background is lush tropical palm trees under a clear blue sky, with a court light pole in the distance. Framed as a mid-shot full-body portrait, the subject is positioned slightly right of the golden ratio, the net cutting across the middle to guide the eye. Her raised arm creates an upward diagonal, while the net's horizontal line and her direct eye contact establish dynamic tension. Lighting is high-contrast direct sunlight, illuminating the right side of her body, leaving the left in soft shadow. Saturated colors—blue sky, green palms, red-blue court—evoke a summer beach-vacation vibe fused with youthful athletic aesthetics, as if captured by an amateur camera yet possessing cinematic realism.",
