          "alias": "单女白外套门媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the entrance of a European-style building, her soft brown curly hair adorned with a delicate white bow and small earrings. Her gaze is tender with a hint of playfulness, her right hand gently touching her forehead hair, while her left hand naturally hangs down, holding a light gray bucket bag with the classic FF logo, its texture clear and metallic chain details exquisite. She wears a fluffy off-white lambswool coat with cuffs spliced in denim, over a pure white turtleneck sweater and a sky-blue pleated minidress, the hem fluttering to reveal her slender thighs. Her feet are encased in sleek, skin-tight white thigh-high boots, the surface smooth and glossy, accentuating her legs. Behind her stands an elegant white building with an arched porch adorned with intricate black wrought-iron railings, and retro wall lamps on each side casting a warm, soft glow. The ground is a mix of light tiles and dark gray hexagonal stones, creating a layered visual transition. The composition is a medium full-body shot, the figure slightly right of center, guiding the eye to her face and clothing details, producing a stable yet dynamic frame. Natural side lighting gently falls on her, outlining the curves of her body and the texture of her clothes, casting subtle shadows that enhance depth. The overall atmosphere blends sweet femininity with high-fashion sensuality, with a blue-and-white palette accented by warm yellow lamplight, evoking a romantic, quiet winter afternoon or evening. The image feels like a carefully styled lifestyle portrait, perfect for sharing on social media, with realistic phone-camera quality, slight grain, and vibrant tones, exuding an intimate, artistic, and life-like vibe.",
