          "alias": "单女露胸红礼服舞台微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless before the complex mechanical structure of a stage backstage, her soft brown hair falling loosely over her bare shoulders. Her delicate facial features are illuminated by a gentle, loving gaze directly into the lens, with a subtle, knowing smile. She wears only small earrings and a light-colored headset microphone, her makeup natural and clean, skin fair and luminous. Her nude torso is partially wrapped by a wide belt studded with dense silver and colorful rhinestones that catch the light, drawing the eye; the belt cinches at her waist, the only remaining piece of what was once a wine-red gown. Her bare arms are long and elegant, framed by the industrial clutter of metal supports, cables, lighting rigs, and control panels, with visible labels like “MAIN” and “B3.” The composition is a central close-up, her head gently tilted to the right, creating subtle dynamic balance. The visual lines of her gaze and the vertical belt details lead the viewer inward, while the angled pipes and beams of the background form intersecting geometric frames that deepen the space. Lighting is soft, warm golden highlights from the front-left, casting slight shadows on her right side, enhancing her form; the background is darker with cool green and blue reflections, contrasting with the warm foreground. The overall atmosphere blends dreamy artistic intimacy with the gritty authenticity of a real backstage, capturing a quiet, expectant moment before a grand performance—a fusion of polished sensuality and candid, almost phone-camera realism.",
