          "alias": "单女白连衣裙沙发媚态坐吃",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits elegantly on a vintage upholstered sofa, wearing a creamy white sleeveless dress with hand-written script and pale floral prints—the fabric is sheer and silky, clinging to her curves and revealing the contour of her breasts through the thin material. The neckline plunges low, exposing the swell of her cleavage. Her dark hair falls loosely over her shoulders, a few strands brushing her cheek. Her right hand gently brushes her hair back, while her left hand rests on an olive green velvet pillow, fingers relaxed. Her nails are short with a pale pink polish. Her face is delicate, her eyes calm but with a hint of smoldering desire, lips slightly parted, a soft seductive smile as she gazes directly into the lens, as if inviting a quiet, intimate story. In the foreground, a woven straw bag sits on the armrest, open, revealing hints of contents; beside it a striped cushion adds depth. The sofa features cream fabric with dark brown vine-and-leaf patterns, clear textures, creating a cozy nostalgic home atmosphere. On the left background, a tall floor mirror reflects a blurred figure in a striped shirt eating, adding spatial depth. On the right, heavy dark blue velvet curtains drape richly, illuminated by a warm lamp with a wooden stand and a beige tassel shade, casting soft, layered shadows across the folds. The composition is a close-up, with the woman centered slightly right, drawing focus to her face and pose. Lighting comes from a warm indoor source above right, softly defining her silhouette and dress wrinkles, casting subtle shadows on the sofa and curtains, enhancing three-dimensionality. Overall color palette of warm brown, cream white, olive green, and dark blue, harmonious, evoking a lazy, comfortable, slightly artistic afternoon atmosphere—a raw, life-like aesthetic captured like a casual snapshot, full of warmth and detail, both artistic and intimately mundane.",
