          "id": "krea2-f6cc07e138ffdf226332962b",
          "alias": "单女米衬衫窗边忧伤戏水",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty in an exquisite hanfu reclines sideways against a wooden window sill, her jet-black hair coiled into an elegant bun adorned with intricate red and gold tassel headpieces, dangling beaded earrings swaying gently in the breeze, highlighting her delicate profile with a wistful, slightly melancholic expression—her gaze lowered toward the blurred light and shadows outside, lips pressed together in a serene yet longing demeanor. She wears a sheer, off-shoulder cream blouse with voluminous cloud-like sleeves, her bare shoulders and upper chest partially visible through the translucent fabric, and a deep red-bordered brocade skirt covered in dense silver star patterns shimmering in the warm light, the neckline plunging suggestively to reveal a hint of cleavage. Her slender fingers rest lightly on the window sill, brushing the wood grain, a few stray strands of hair caressing her cheek, adding a soft, dynamic touch. The mid-ground captures her half-length pose, the flowing fabric creating layered transitions, while the background dissolves into a hazy ancient interior—pink gauze curtains drift like smoke, with vague outlines of tassels and wooden furniture, and a carved lattice window in the distance lets in slanting sunset light, bathing the entire space in a warm honey-gold hue. The composition follows the rule of thirds with diagonal guiding lines; the figure is placed slightly left of center, her gaze leading naturally into the empty right side, creating a sense of negative space and imagination. Visual flow starts from her hair ornaments, descends through the earring line, clothing folds, and finger gestures, finally focusing on her eyes—full of unspoken emotion and subtle seduction. The lighting is a soft dusk effect, with warm rays entering from the upper right, casting delicate highlights and shadows on her skin and fabric, producing a dreamy, three-dimensional quality. The overall palette centers on warm pink, honey yellow, and deep red, with moderate saturation, delivering a classical, elegant yet nostalgically artistic style, like a meticulously post-processed film still shot on amateur equipment, blending everyday intimacy with poetic beauty, evoking a sense of timeless tenderness and echoes of history.",
