          "alias": "单女露胸城市媚态伸手",
          "prompt": "A slightly low-angle composition captures the grandeur of the building, with the topless woman posed at the left-center, her bare breasts and smooth skin catching the warm amber light. To the right, the architecture and shadows stretch deep, creating a balanced visual flow. Strong sense of depth: from the foreground ground, through the midground woman and architecture, to the blurred distant buildings. Leading lines from the left columns, ground lights, and her outstretched hand draw the eye to her confident, sensual stance. The lighting is cinematic and artistic—warm yellow tones create an intimate, romantic mood, while cool green building lights add a touch of mystery and classical elegance, blending modernity with retro, everyday with dreamlike. The scene feels like a single frame from a night-time urban film about youth, culture, and seduction, full of narrative tension and sensual atmosphere.",
