        {
          "id": "krea2-f0226f6644f112734fcdf463",
          "alias": "单女露胸手套摄影棚害羞跪注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on warm wooden flooring, topless except for a red plaid bunny ear headband with soft white inner fur, the ears slightly perked. She wears only the matching plaid gloves and pure white over-the-knee stockings, with thick white boots on her feet. Her deep brown wavy hair falls over her bare shoulders, tousled bangs framing her face. Her eyes are clear and bright, gazing slightly upward with a coy, confident smirk, expression both shy and daring. Her hands rest naturally in front of her knees, fingers slender in the plaid gloves, the pattern echoing the discarded bunny suit beside her. She kneels with legs bent, knees pressed to the floor, body leaning forward in an elegant curve, light and shadow sculpting her soft skin and the folds of the stockings. Behind her, a pale gray cement wall with visible texture creates a minimalist modern space; on the left, stacked white gift boxes with gold ribbons hint at a festive scene; on the right, a vintage wooden cabinet and partial mirror frame add warm contrast. The composition is a low-angle shot, camera close to the ground, emphasizing intimacy and visual impact. Focus is on the woman's face and bare torso, with shallow depth of field blurring the background, drawing attention to her expression and the delicate details of the gloves, stockings, and boots. Visual flow leads from her gaze upward to the upper left, while the red plaid and white of her accessories guide the eye naturally. Lighting comes from a soft, diffused source at front right, creating smooth gradations of light and shadow on her skin, face, shoulders, and thighs, highlighting texture and fabric. The overall atmosphere is warm, romantic, with a dreamy, fairy-tale artistic feel, as if in a carefully staged Christmas party or private studio. The color palette is predominantly red and white, with warm browns and gray background, evoking a rich holiday mood and visual pleasure. Every detail is crafted for a highly harmonious and expressive image.",
