        {
          "id": "krea2-32ccbf1479851ab2670616e1",
          "alias": "单女红连体衣衣帽间戏谑蹲回眸",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches half-squatting against a wooden vanity, her body arched back with a teasing twist, wearing a tight red velvet bunny bodysuit that clings to every curve. A pair of fluffy red rabbit ears perch on her head, and matching long gloves sheath her slender arms. She turns her head slightly, locking eyes with the viewer through the mirror, a sly smile on her red lips, one finger elegantly pointing at you in invitation. Her brown hair falls straight to her shoulders, bangs framing a face with flawless, glowing skin. The foreground anchors on her lower body and the wooden dresser edge, while the midground focuses on her torso, arm gesture, and expressive face. Behind her, a large makeup mirror surrounded by warm white bulbs casts a soft, even light, reflecting her back and parts of the room, adding depth. The composition is a low-angle shot from slightly above, emphasizing her curves and presence. The lighting from the ring bulbs and side fill creates gentle shadows that highlight the smooth texture of the velvet and the softness of her skin. The atmosphere is warm, intimate, and slightly theatrical—like a private dressing room before a performance, full of playful anticipation and seductive charm. The vibrant red dominates against the natural wood and pale walls, drawing the eye from her pointed finger to her face, then down her body, inviting a layered, narrative gaze. The result is a blend of polished studio quality and casual, candid realism, capturing a moment of confident allure and innocent mischief.",
