        {
          "id": "krea2-a1fde12b672a61c42efc2a9e",
          "alias": "单女舞者红挂脖舞台媚态站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A vibrant and sexually charged young female dancer stands center stage in a dazzling, high-energy spotlight. Her thick, jet-black hair whips violently around her face and neck from the force of her intense spinning and sharp dance moves, strands sticking to her glistening forehead and throat. She wears a visually explosive outfit: a daring, low-cut red leather halter top with sharp black leather geometric panels and puckered seams that emphasize her firm, toned midsection; matching micro-shorts made of red and black patchwork leather, a broad black leather belt hanging low and asymmetrical from her hip; and thigh-high black leather boots covered in metal rivets and intricate lacing, their tall heels lifting her powerful thighs. Her expression is focused and provocative, lips slightly parted, eyes locking with the camera as if demanding the viewer's attention. A delicate silver chain graces her left shoulder, a simple metal bracelet wraps her right wrist, and a glittering ring adorns her left ring finger, catching the stage lights. The foreground zeros in on her long, muscled legs and the glossy boots, while her torso and face fill the midground, every muscle taut and gleaming with a slick sheen of sweat. The background is a deep black stage curtain, with only a few blurred red neon strips bleeding in from the bottom right and upper edge, creating depth and a theatrical atmosphere. The shot is a low-angle dynamic capture, placing her off-center left, her body leaning forward in a diagonal line that amplifies the sense of motion and tension. Light from overhead and side spotlights hits her skin and costume with dramatic contrast, making the red leather look wet and the black shadows deep. The energy is raw, wild, and bursting with youthful, sexual power—a perfect fusion of danger and allure, captured with the crisp clarity of pro gear yet the raw emotion of a spontaneous performance.",
