          "id": "krea2-8ff04e6c123b217ea701f164",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑长裤卧室媚态站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless in front of a bedroom mirror, body slightly turned toward the camera, right hand playfully forming a V-sign, left hand resting naturally at her side. Her eyes meet the reflection with a soft, confident gaze—hair pulled up in a high bun, a few loose strands brushing her cheek. She wears only black high-waisted yoga pants and white fuzzy socks, her bare breasts exposed, nipples visible in the soft, diffused light. Behind her, a double bed with crisp white sheets holds two plush toys: a slightly sinister purple monster with fangs on the left, a pale yellow teddy bear on the right, adding a touch of innocence to the scene. At the foot of the bed, a tabby cat curls lazily among the blankets, tail twitching, eyes fixed forward, creating a calm, lived-in atmosphere. The walls are a muted gray-brown, adorned with two anime-style posters whose vibrant colors blend harmoniously. In the foreground, her long legs and slightly raised ankle are visible; the light carpet shows faint outlines of power cords and outlets, grounding the scene in an authentic, unpolished private space. The composition is a mid-shot, her figure centered slightly to the right; the mirror reflection enhances spatial depth, guiding the viewer’s eye from her hand gesture past the toys to the cat. Diffuse indoor light falls evenly across her skin and clothing, creating subtle chiaroscuro with soft shadows. The overall mood blends youthful sensuality with homey comfort—playful yet mature, confident yet inviting. The palette is mostly monochrome (black, white, gray) with small color accents, layered and nuanced, as if captured by a phone or small camera in natural light, free of commercial filters, full of life and personal warmth.",
