          "id": "krea2-a8c003a541cb72aafa8de5ae",
          "alias": "单女白手套霓虹夜景戏谑坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an exquisite pink bunny costume, wearing a fluffy soft rabbit ear headband, her short blonde hair falling naturally to her shoulders. Her makeup is delicate and refined, with eyeliner tracing deep, captivating eyes and full, luscious red lips. She sits half-reclined on a soft white fluffy rug, her body slightly turned, gazing at the camera with a gentle yet teasing look. Her left hand rests on her knee, right hand naturally at her side. White long gloves contrast sweetly with white thigh-high stockings tied with pink bows. The tight satin strapless dress accentuates her curves, with a row of metal buttons neatly aligned and a short, playful hem. The overall look is dreamy, girly, and sexy. In the foreground, her long, pale legs and detailed stockings are visible; the soft texture of the fluffy rug contrasts with her skin. The midground focuses on her upper body and the dress structure. The background is a private space bathed in purple ambient lighting, walls and furniture edges glowing with neon-like violet light. In a corner, a white multi-shelf cabinet is stuffed with colorful plush toys—blue, red, yellow cartoon bears and bunnies. To the right, a giant light brown teddy bear lounges lazily against the wall. On the left, a corner of the bed is piled with white bedding. The entire scene exudes a sweet, intimate homey atmosphere. The composition uses a slightly low-angle shot, placing the subject center-left, with symmetrical layout to emphasize visual focus. Lighting comes from top and side purple LED strips, creating soft highlights on her face, neck, and chest, while casting subtle shadows in the fabric folds and carpet texture, adding depth and mystery. The light and shadow layers are rich, blending dreamy and slightly cyberpunk futuristic vibes. The color palette is dominated by pink and purple, warm and cool interwoven. The overall image presents a refined, cute, and sexy visual style, as if captured in a late-night bedroom or private studio, with strong immersive artistic beauty and the realistic feel of amateur everyday equipment.",
