          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙宅邸微笑注视",
          "prompt": "A black-haired elf maiden with delicate pointed ears, wearing a sheer black lace-trimmed high-slit dress that reveals her long pale legs, silver stiletto heels, and a simple silver chain bracelet. She lounges diagonally on a dark ornate leather sofa, one leg raised gracefully, right arm draped over the edge, left hand holding a glass of red wine that catches the light. Her blue-green eyes gaze directly at the viewer, a faint tempting smile on her lips. Foreground focus on her legs and heels, the soft skin highlighted; midground shows her upper body against the sofa arm; background features heavy dark green velvet curtains creating a dim atmosphere. Low-angle shot looking up, enhancing her presence, with diagonal lines guiding the eye from legs to face. Side-top lighting casts dramatic chiaroscuro on her hair, shoulders, and legs, while the background is softly blurred. Gothic luxury meets fantasy: the scene feels like a noble mansion or magical castle chamber, exuding stillness, seduction, and a hint of danger. Color palette dominated by deep black and dark green, accented with silver and skin highlights. Detailed sofa carving, a bouquet of white lilies and a small vanity mirror beside her, black-and-white hexagonal floor tiles adding depth. The overall image resembles a meticulously staged theater still, blending amateur-camera realism with professional cinematic quality, every detail serving the mysterious allure and visual narrative.",
