          "alias": "单女露胸浴袍水边困倦跪注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a flowing lavender-to-white Hanfu, topless with the sheer outer robe slipped off her shoulders, kneels elegantly on a lakeside rock. Her hair is pinned high in a classical bun, with loose tendrils falling; a delicate silver flower adornment rests on her forehead. Her eyes are soft yet deep, gazing directly at the viewer, lips pale pink. The layered outfit—now partly removed—reveals her bare breasts, the sheer white gauze and violet skirt draping around her thighs. A white silk scarf floats around her head and shoulders, catching the breeze. Her slender fingers lightly touch the hem of the skirt. The foreground focuses on her hand and the exposed upper body; midground shows the rough gray-brown rock contrasting with her smooth skin. Background: a vast calm lake with rippling blue light, distant horizon blurred. Low-angle shot, subject slightly left, lines leading upward right. Soft side-front natural light highlights her face, breasts, and the translucent fabric, creating reflections on water. Color palette: blue-violet, dreamy ethereal, slightly melancholic. A blend of classical ink-painting and modern photography, suffused with Eastern aesthetic sensuality.",
