          "id": "krea2-602b67b019b393b16e0e433c",
          "alias": "单女女仆女仆装摄影棚媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an elaborate devil maid outfit stands before a pure white background, her long, fluffy orange hair cascading naturally over her shoulders. Her head is adorned with a black leather headpiece featuring red demon horns and cross ornaments, while behind her spread a pair of bat wings with finely stitched edges and vivid red interiors, connected to her body by silver chains that extend delicately toward the left side of the frame. She wears a short, high-gloss black PVC top with a heart-shaped red lace cutout at the chest, a thin red cord and metal buckle cinched at the waist, and a matching mini skirt. Black garter straps run from her thighs to lace-edged long black stockings, and her feet are clad in pointed-toe, thick-soled black PVC high heels. Black long gloves cover her hands; her left hand gently touches her cheek while her right hand hangs naturally by her side, her posture graceful yet subtly playful and mysterious. Her expression is seductive, eyes lowered and half-lidded, lips slightly parted with full, red gloss. The overall look blends anime-inspired styling with photorealistic impact. The composition is a mid-shot full-body portrait, with the subject centered slightly right, body turned slightly, legs parted just enough to form a stable triangular base. The foreground highlights her slender legs and the detail of her high heels, the midground focuses on the curve of her waist and hips and the reflective texture of the fabric, while the background is completely blank to emphasize the subject. Soft, even lighting comes from the upper left, creating a bright, clean studio atmosphere with delicate highlights on the PVC surfaces that define her silhouette; shadows fall on the lower right ground and in the folds of the outfit, enhancing depth. The color palette is dominated by black and red, with warm skin tones contrasting sharply against the white background, evoking a gothic sexy aesthetic. The image retains the realism of