          "alias": "单女黑西装竹林媚态跪自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels in a minimalist white interior, her body sheathed in a tight, glossy black latex catsuit with metal rings and multiple black leather straps cinching her waist and thighs, creating a starkly erotic binding focus. She wears vivid red plastic devil horns and a delicate lace blindfold that hides her eyes, leaving only her full crimson-lipsticked mouth and part of her cheek visible—mysterious, alluring, and playfully wicked. In her right hand she holds a gold-framed smartphone, capturing a mirror selfie as the screen reflects her confident, focused expression. Her long hair falls naturally to her shoulders, catching soft highlights. The scene is set against a sleek white circular low table and cylindrical base furniture; a tall, slender bamboo plant in a pot adds a touch of living contrast to the right. Near the left window, a vintage camera rests on a white stand, hinting at a love for photography. A large circular mirror or art installation on the rear wall reflects the room and her silhouette, deepening the composition. The camera angle is low and looking upward, emphasizing her leg lines and the fetishistic details of her outfit, while the phone and her pose guide the viewer’s gaze toward her face and torso. Lighting is soft and even, coming from a side window, creating subtle chiaroscuro that highlights the skin’s texture and the latex’s shine. The overall palette is cool blue-gray, sharply contrasted by the deep black of her suit and the bright red of her horns, evoking a clinical, stylish, slightly cyberpunk aesthetic. The image feels like a carefully staged everyday moment—as if casually snapped at home with an ordinary smartphone yet achieving high-end quality, oozing confidence, rebellion, sensuality, and artistic flair.",
