          "prompt": "A young elegant Asian woman sits in a warm, vintage-style wooden restaurant, wearing a simple yet alluring black strapless dress that hints at her cleavage, her deep eyes locked onto the lens, full red lips slightly parted, right hand resting gracefully under her chin, a pose of lazy mystery. Her hair is swept back smoothly with a few strands falling naturally over her shoulders, a delicate gold geometric earring catches the warm light, and a thin gold bracelet glints on her wrist. The table before her is covered in a cream tablecloth with fringed edges, set with two tall red wine glasses, a clear water glass, and gold-rimmed cutlery neatly arranged on a black tray, a folded white napkin resting inside. The foreground focuses on the crystal-clear glasses and utensils, their surfaces reflecting the warm lights and her figure, creating rich layers of shadow and glow. The middle ground shows her elegant profile and arm line, her body leaning slightly forward, eyes staring directly at the camera, building a strong visual connection. The background reveals a rustic wooden restaurant with exposed beams and columns, a large floor-to-ceiling window on the right revealing a blurry night view of distant buildings and trees, soft yellow light spilling through the frames. Warm indoor light falls from above and the side, creating fine textures and reflections on the wood, the overall atmosphere intimate and romantic, as if time has stopped. The composition is a medium close-up, with the subject slightly left of center, using the foreground tableware as a natural frame that draws the viewer's eye to her facial expression and eye contact. The lighting is soft and layered, with the main light coming from the front right, gently illuminating her face and shoulders, while the warm yellow background light creates a cozy ambiance. The color palette is warm browns, deep blacks, and creamy whites, exuding a sense of high-quality, understated luxury, blending artistic look with the raw realism of a casual night shot—as if captured by a phone or small camera in dim light, preserving natural light transitions and a lived-in feel, highly immersive.",
