          "alias": "单女浴袍媚态阅读",
          "prompt": "A classical Oriental beauty in sensual dishabille, wearing only a loose, open silk robe of cream with subtle damask patterns, the red trim framing her bare shoulders and the wide orange-red sash fallen loose at her waist, revealing her full, pale breasts. Her black hair is piled high with a silver hairpin, tendrils framing her face, small pearl earrings catching the candlelight. She lowers her eyelids, her expression serene and focused, staring at an open thread-bound book in her hands, her fingertips tracing the page edges. Foreground shows her right hand and the book's white pages with clear script, creating an intimate reading scene. Midground emphasizes her facial contour, neckline, the curve of her breasts, the texture of her skin and silk, with warm side light sculpting her face and body, casting soft shadows. Background: deep red classical interior with ornate cloud and floral murals, rich colors, a palace feel. On both sides, large multi-arm candelabras of bronze with burning candles, flickering warm orange light, wax drips adding authenticity. Composition: center-right rule of thirds, subject dominant, left and right candelabras balancing, guiding the eye to her. Lighting warm and hazy, main light from right, highlighting her face and torso, creating chiaroscuro and depth. Background dim, dramatic. The image exudes classical aesthetic, a cinematic yet candid quality—soft focus, natural fabric folds, random candle flicker, mural brushstrokes—evoking lonely beauty and cultural poignancy of a scholarly night.",
