          "alias": "单女露胸黑旗袍竹林忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A topless East Asian woman in a sumptuous black embroidered qipao stands sideways in a classical interior, her bare breasts exposed as the silk falls open over one shoulder, revealing her nipples. Her dark hair is half-up, strands brushing her neck and collarbone, with delicate silver tassel earrings. Her lips are crimson, her gaze distant with serene melancholy. The qipao drapes her elongated form, its back fully bare, fabric shimmering with metallic threads and subtle patterns under warm light, the hem adorned with blue silk and beadwork, a sash faintly visible at her waist. In her right hand, she holds an opened beige bamboo fan, plain with slightly curled edges and a corded handle. In the left foreground, a branch of golden orchids hangs, petals soft in shadow. On the right, a vintage multi-arm candelabra with burning white candles casts flickering light across a dark wooden table. Her figure and the candelabra form the focal point, set against deep red drapes with arched window frames and carved details, faint floral motifs in the background evoking an Eastern palace or theater. Composition uses the golden ratio: she is right-of-center, with space left for the hanging flowers and shadows, a slight low angle enhancing her nobility. Visual flow leads from the orchid branch down to her head, then to the fan, and finally to her calm eyes. Lighting: a strong key source from the front-right creates dramatic chiaroscuro, illuminating her skin, clavicle, and qipao shoulder, casting deep shadows on her back and skirt. Candlelight adds a warm amber tone, blending into deep reddish-brown hues, evoking nostalgia, mystery, romance, and solitude. The image has exquisite filmic texture, high cinematic quality with subtle grain, embodying a classic yet modern artistic aesthetic, rich in narrative tension and emotional depth—a frozen Eastern nocturne.",
