        {
          "id": "krea2-f82594f26e500b1a7a3edcd0",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服节庆微笑站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A young East Asian woman stands as the focal point, dressed in an exquisite black velvet off-shoulder long gown, its bodice covered in shimmering three-dimensional floral embroidery and fine sequins that catch the warm amber light, accentuating her elegant curves. Her dark brown hair is styled in two braids resting over her shoulders, with soft bangs framing her face. Her makeup is natural yet polished, lips full and crimson, eyes locked on the viewer with a tender, focused gaze, a subtle sweet smile playing at the corners of her mouth. In her right hand, she gently holds a single red prayer tablet; her left hand lifts slightly to reveal its surface. Her pose is poised and confident, blending classical femininity with modern chic. In the foreground, a dark wooden tabletop reflects the warm glow of lanterns above. Scattered across its smooth surface are several red prayer tablets and thin cords, creating a sense of ritual and everyday life. In the midground, layers of Chinese lanterns hang in rows—cylindrical, hexagonal, petal-shaped—their warm yellow paper glowing softly, some wrapped in red ribbons or adorned with red-and-white stripes, trailing red tassels and blessed red slips. They form a strong visual rhythm and cultural symbols. The background is a deep, shadowy space, with hints of wooden frames or brick walls, blurred to emphasize the subject while conveying depth of a traditional festive scene. The composition is a mid-close portrait, the subject standing slightly off-center, body turned slightly toward the camera, creating a stable yet dynamic pose. The foreground table and midground lantern array create clear layers, guiding the eye to her face and the prayer tablet in her hands. Visual lines extend from the red horizontal rod holding the lanterns to her gaze, then from the tablet to the viewer, forming a natural narrative. The lighting is warm, from the lanterns themselves, casting a soft uniform glow across her face and dress details, while deep shadows in the background enhance contrast. The atmosphere is cozy, celebratory, and auspicious, like a traditional festival night. The entire image exudes rich Eastern aesthetics—fine art photography quality with the genuine warmth of amateur everyday shots. Colors are black, red, and gold, with moderate saturation and delicate light-to-dark transitions, offering a dreamy yet intimate visual experience. The depiction subtly emphasizes the curve of her bust and the cling of the velvet dress, with the off-shoulder neckline revealing a hint of cleavage, maintaining elegance while infusing a sensual, NSFW tone.",
