        {
          "id": "krea2-695899519afbb7f70c77e1c6",
          "alias": "单女露胸短裙舞台微笑过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman in elaborate fantasy attire, presented in a half-length close-up. She has silky flowing golden hair that catches warm light, strands falling over her shoulders and chest, while others lift dynamically. She wears a deep blue hat adorned with layered flowers, lace trim, metallic accents, and small horn-like ornaments. Her makeup is refined with rich eyeshadow and soft lips, her expression a blend of lazy confidence and a gentle smile, eyes gazing softly yet intently at the viewer, exuding calm mystery. She is topless, her bare breasts fully exposed, skin smooth with a subtle sheen, the off-shoulder design discarded to reveal her curves. Her body is adorned with blue and gold fabric remnants—a wide orange-yellow satin ribbon tied at her waist, a layered ruffled skirt with fluffy or tassel edges, rich pleats and embroidery on the shoulders and cuffs, but her torso remains nude. Her right hand is raised, fingers slightly curled in an elegant, suggestive gesture; her left hand rests naturally at her side, her pose relaxed and expressive. The foreground shows her body contours clearly, with rich texture in the remaining clothing and light-shadow transitions. The midground focuses on her torso and arms, highlighting the fabric details—embroidery, lace, satin gloss—against the bare skin. Background is a pure light gray to soft blue gradient, unobtrusive. The composition uses a slight three-point rule, subject left, head turned right, guiding the viewer's eye from her face to her exposed chest and hand. Visual lines from her raised arm, falling hair, and skirt folds create a smooth downward flow. Lighting is soft and even, from the front-left, creating gentle highlights on skin and fabric, with subtle shadows at skirt edges and folds, enhancing depth. Atmosphere is serene, dreamy, artistic, like a fairy-tale stage scene, with a blue-gold palette accented by warm orange, balancing elegance and vitality. The image has a professional studio quality but a natural, amateur-captured realism, with no heavy post-processing, retaining lifelike proportions and detail, conveying a tender, romantic, slightly melancholic girlhood and immersive roleplay.",
