          "prompt": "A young woman leans elegantly on a tall black metal stool, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed as the open olive green long-sleeve trench coat falls loosely off her shoulders. She wears only a black short shirt dress unbuttoned at the top, the fabric pooling at her hips, paired with brown pointed stiletto heels. Her red-brown hair is pinned up neatly, revealing the delicate line of her neck and collarbone. She raises her right hand to her lips, fingertips brushing the corner of her mouth, her eyes half-lidded and dreamy, looking off to the side with a contemplative, mysterious expression. The foreground frames her long bare legs and heels, the stool’s metal legs providing a solid visual anchor. Midground shows the draped coat and the contrast of dark fabric against her naked skin. The background is a bright, design-oriented interior: pale yellow wall, wooden shelves holding black-and-white triangular geometric decorations, and a pink-based perfume display. To the right, a tall glass window reflects a blurred city street—passersby, trees, building shapes—with soft outdoor light mixing with the warm indoor glow. The composition is slightly tilted, with the figure placed to the right, creating an asymmetrical but balanced tension. The lines of her fingers, gaze, and legs guide the eye into the scene. Lighting is soft and diffused from above, highlighting the texture of her skin and the fabric folds, with gentle shadows. Natural window light adds a subtle cool tone that contrasts with the warm interior, giving the image a quiet, refined, slightly artistic atmosphere. This feels like a candid, high-end photograph—amateur in equipment but professional in composition and emotion, capturing a poetic, everyday moment made timeless.",
