          "id": "krea2-65bb023389efd4d174c29f65",
          "alias": "单女半褪米浴袍媚态过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman in exquisite ancient Chinese attire, her long black hair styled into an elegant classical bun with a few loose strands falling over her shoulders, adorned with simple hair ornaments. Her face is beautifully delicate with soft, seductive eyes gazing to the right, a hint of a teasing smile on her naturally pink lips, and flawless luminous skin. She wears a cream-white inner robe beneath a brown wide-sleeved cloak, the collar and edges trimmed with thick, fluffy white fur that looks warm and inviting. The cloak is tied at the chest with a matching fabric bow. The outfit is slightly disheveled—her inner robe pulled down just enough to reveal her bare shoulders and the top of her breasts, the wet fabric clinging to her curves. The scene is a medium close-up portrait, centered slightly left, with a shallow depth of field blurring the background into a warm, hazy ancient courtyard with wooden eaves and red brick walls visible. Fine rain falls around her, droplets catching the soft light, adding a poetic, melancholic aura. The lighting is from the front-left, creating a natural rim light that accentuates her silhouette and the highlights on her wet skin and fur. The warm yellow tones of the background harmonize with the brown and white of her clothing, evoking a quiet, intimate twilight mood. Shot with a large aperture, extremely shallow depth of field, sharp focus on her face and the wet strands of hair and fur, background completely soft. The image has a cinematic, artistic quality—like a still from a period drama. Overall warmth and saturation are balanced, with rich texture in the fur, fabric, and hair. Her expression is natural yet alluring, her hands clasped lightly in front, the fabric of her cloak slightly parted to reveal a glimpse of bare thigh through a slit. The rain has dampened her hair and the fur, giving everything a sensual sheen. Ultra-high resolution, 8K, professional camera capture, realistic lighting, natural bokeh, fine skin texture, no noise or artifacts.",
