          "alias": "单女全裸白连衣裙客厅微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits nude on the plush gray woven carpet of a modern luxury living room, her bare shoulders and delicate collarbones exposed, the white lace slip dress slipping off one shoulder to reveal the upper curve of her breast. Her long hair cascades over her shoulders, her refined face turned slightly, eyes tenderly fixed on the lens, a soft coral-red smile on her lips, fresh and natural makeup enhancing her porcelain skin. A thin silver chain rests at her throat. She leans forward gracefully, elbows supporting her on the floor, one knee bent, the dress pooling around her in a careless, sensual drape. Beside her, a massive silver metal flower box overflows with dense layers of deep crimson and rose-pink blooms, the petals velvety and rich, fading from dark red to bright pink, creating a striking visual impact. The box bears a faint embossed brand logo “BE” on its glossy surface, and a delicate silver ribbon bow is tied at its base. The flower arrangement occupies nearly a third of the left frame, drawing the eye. In the foreground, the gray textured carpet is sharply detailed; midground shows an off-white fabric sofa casually draped with a gray throw and cushions, exuding comfort. The background features clean white wainscoting with classical lines, and a vibrant abstract painting in pastel pinks, blues, and yellows depicting a cartoonish figure. A tall black marble pillar with natural veining adds modern luxury. Sunlight streams from a window on the right, casting warm golden rays across her face, the roses, and parts of the floor, softening shadows in an early morning or late afternoon hush. Composition uses a near close-up combined with midground context: the woman on the right, the flowers on the left, balanced and connected by a diagonal line from the blooms to her face, then to the background details. The light is warm, quiet, romantically intimate. The color palette is white, cream, silver-gray, with the hot red of the roses as a bold contrast. The image quality suggests a high-end editorial photoshoot, yet retains natural textures—fine skin pores, soft fabric folds, reflective metal gleam, petal delicacy. The atmosphere blends romance, elegance, luxury, and lived-in warmth, like a frozen cinematic moment capturing beauty and tranquility.",
