        {
          "id": "krea2-2dc1264ceb006298d06a25bd",
          "alias": "单女蓝连衣裙办公室媚态坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a modern office chair, wearing a deep blue high-neck sleeveless tight dress that hugs her curves, paired with gray shorts and sheer black stockings, black patent leather heels. Her legs are elegantly crossed, one foot dangling the heel, confident and relaxed. She holds a tablet in her right hand, her left hand rests on her thigh, a delicate bracelet at her wrist. A white lanyard with a visible ID badge hangs around her neck. Her long brown hair falls over her shoulders, makeup flawless, red lips slightly parted, eyes locked on the viewer with a soft, inviting expression—sensual yet professional. The dress is cut low enough to hint at cleavage, the tight fabric emphasizing her waist and hips. The office chair has gray-white fabric cushion and a chrome five-star base with black casters. In the midground, a white electric standing desk holds a closed laptop with a faint screen reflection, a small green potted plant beside it. The background is white brick wall, clean, with a large window on the left where white sheer curtains gently move, soft natural light streaming from the upper left, casting a bright, shadowed effect. The entire space is white-dominated, clean and modern. The composition is centered, the woman slightly right, drawing focus to her face and body. The tablet and badge add realism. Lighting is nuanced, with soft side light creating gentle shadows on her right side and on the floor. The image has a slight amateur quality—subtle grain, moderate color saturation, not overly polished—giving a lived-in, candid feel. The color palette is cool white with deep blue and black, creating strong contrast. Details like fine wrinkles in the stockings, skin sheen, reflections on the metal chair legs are all visible, conveying a modern urban woman's workspace with an intimate, sexy undertone. The scene feels like a quiet moment of self-expression, professional yet inviting, with a subtle NSFW allure.",
