        {
          "id": "krea2-cb0924a985bde7ff0eac88f2",
          "alias": "单女浴袍泳池媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A classical Eastern beauty in luxurious Hanfu stands against a pristine white background, her posture poised yet seductive. She wears the traditional robe open, one shoulder bared, the rich orange-red silk slipping down to reveal smooth, flawless skin and the soft curve of her breast. Her dark hair is swept up in an elaborate knot adorned with golden floral ornaments and delicate leaf-shaped filigree, stray strands brushing her cheek. A tiny vermilion dot marks her forehead, and her eyes are lined with smoky kohl, holding a sultry, melancholic gaze. Long beaded earrings sway as she tilts her head slightly, lips tinted a natural pink, parted in a breathless invitation. The wide sleeves pool around her arms, and her waist is cinched with a broad belt bearing an ornate jade pendant. One hand rests lightly on the belt, fingers grazing the fabric, while the other trails down her side, hinting at the warmth beneath. Soft, diffused light from above caresses her features, highlighting the intricate gold embroidery and silver-gray trim of her garment. The image is a masterful portrait, both timeless and carnal, blending the grace of ancient tradition with a modern, intimate sensuality.",
