        {
          "id": "krea2-1715b2121530b832dc70e0ef",
          "alias": "单女粉浴袍摄影棚忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "An elegant Oriental classical beauty sits gracefully inside a vintage room, her jet-black hair arranged in an elaborate cloud bun adorned with intricate silver floral hairpins and pearl ornaments, each petal meticulously carved, shimmering with a soft metallic luster, scattered pink pearls adding tenderness and allure, fine tassels dangling from her hair swaying gently as she tilts her head, embodying courtly nobility. Her face is ethereally beautiful, with brows like distant mountains, eyes clear as autumn water, eyeliner perfectly accentuating depth and softness, lips a pale pink parted in a suggestive pout, skin porcelain-white and luminous. She wears a light pink cross-collared ruqun robe, the outer semi-transparent white gauze wide-sleeved coat is slightly open, revealing her bare shoulders and the supple curve of her breasts, the gauze almost invisible, hinting at delicate embroidery and sequins beneath that catch the light. The collar and sleeves are trimmed with gold thread. She rests her right hand on her cheek, fingers slender and nails perfectly rounded, her posture poised yet contemplative, her gaze directed to the left with a hint of melancholy and deep thought, as if recalling the past or gazing into the distance. A pair of ruby earrings dangle from her ears, crystalline and vibrant, complementing her makeup. The background is a warm-toned interior scene with blurred wooden screens and carved furniture, evoking an ancient palace atmosphere. The lighting is soft and warm, golden like dusk, coming from the left, creating natural side lighting that illuminates her face, shoulder, and sleeves, casting gentle shadows on the other side, enhancing depth and dimension. The subject is centered slightly right, framed in a medium shot with sharp focus on her face and upper body, the background blurred to emphasize her, the visual flow extending leftward following her gaze, creating narrative tension. The overall light transition is delicate, with warm orange, cream, and pale pink tones, evoking a serene, tender, slightly melancholic poetic atmosphere. The image has a professional studio quality but with a casual amateur touch, slight film grain and natural depth of field, adding realism and artistic appeal. The composition is balanced and harmonious, with ample negative space, embodying the subtle beauty and implied meaning of Eastern aesthetics, blending realism and romance like a painting of a court lady stepping out of ancient art, full of story and emotional depth.",
