        {
          "id": "krea2-48b442f283ad6e8028889c74",
          "alias": "单女露胸红连衣裙城市俏皮站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless on a modern urban plaza, her red and white check dress unbuttoned and slipped down to her waist, exposing her bare chest. The dress features a square neck, puff sleeves, gathered waist, and an A-line skirt with ruffled hem, now hanging open. Her black hair is tied in a thick braid, which she lifts with her right hand, forming a playful V sign. Her left hand holds a beige woven straw bag with visible texture, a black phone or wallet peeking out. She smirks warmly, making direct eye contact, her pose relaxed and inviting. In the foreground, light gray square tiles reflect soft light. The midground shows her centered, slightly tilted. Background left: a modern glass and metal building reflecting the sky. Background right: dense layered green trees. Distant skyscrapers loom through haze. A few blurred pedestrians walk behind her. Composition is central, eye-level, with soft focus on her face and exposed skin. Lighting from above and front is soft and even, no harsh shadows. Warm white tones contrast with red checks and green foliage. The image has a slight film grain, moderate saturation, and a vintage filter effect, capturing an intimate, candid street portrait.",
