          "prompt": "A young woman sits by a high-rise window, wearing a loose blue denim shirt that is unbuttoned to reveal her cleavage and bare chest, a small gold bear pin on the left pocket, sleeves casually rolled down. She is topless, the shirt hanging open, her high-waisted white wide-leg pants are unbuttoned and slightly pushed down, showing the top of her black lace thong. Her dark hair is pulled back in a low bun, with loose strands framing her face. She holds a black phone with a leopard-print case in both hands, rings on her fingers—a wide silver band, several thin diamond rings, and a simple metal band on her right ring finger. She looks down at the screen, lips parted, focused. The medium shot captures her torso and phone, body slightly angled toward the camera, head turned forward. Behind her, a dusk city skyline with deep blue-gray sky, thin clouds, warm yellow lights in distant buildings, one with a golden roof structure, another with a red neon sign. Reflections of her bare skin and the room are visible on the glass. Soft natural light from outside mixed with city lights creates a cool-blue tone with warm yellow accents, smooth skin shading, intimate and contemplative mood. Realistic photographic style, detailed, balanced composition, evoking solitude and urban night reflection.",
