          "alias": "单女半褪浴袍庭院媚态坐演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully in an ancient courtyard, her hair styled in a high double-loop bun adorned with silver hairpins and white feathers, a few loose strands framing her face. She wears a pale blue Hanfu top, the fabric slipping seductively off one shoulder, revealing a bare collarbone and the curve of her breast, a single strand of pearls resting against her exposed skin. Her hand holds a small bronze tea scoop, lips parted as she sips the tea, a soft, satisfied smile playing on her lips. The other hand rests on a dark blue velvet pouch with gold clasp. Before her, a set of celadon tea utensils sits on a wooden table, including a white porcelain bowl filled with tea leaves and small dishes with dried flowers. Soft warm light streams through a window, casting shadows across her face and the sheer fabric of her robe, highlighting the contours of her body. The scene is a mid-close-up, the composition focused on her, with blurred traditional wooden windows and greenery in the background. The overall palette is soft blue, cream white, and emerald green, with warm sunlight, creating a dreamlike, sensual classical atmosphere. The image has a cinematic quality, with detailed textures and rich tones, evoking the elegance of a Song dynasty courtesan painting, yet with an intimate, adult sensuality.",
