          "id": "krea2-1e6c8af1979afcadbe3208f0",
          "alias": "单女白束身衣戏谑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman poses in a white feather-texture bustier dress, the top made of fluffy layered feathers creating a soft sculpted effect, cinched at the waist with a wide white leather belt featuring metal buckle and rivet details for a touch of industrial edge. The dress is cut low, barely containing her breasts, with the feather texture teasing at her cleavage. She has short, layered dark brown hair with lighter highlights, wavy ends, and straight bangs covering her forehead. Her eyes are heavily lidded with silver-gray smoky shadow, long curled lashes, and a clear, direct gaze into the lens; her lips part slightly in a subtle, warm smile. She wears a delicate diamond necklace and small tassel earrings that catch the light. She stands slightly sideways, body tilted, arms relaxed at her sides, a thin chain bracelet on her wrist. The background is a deep blue crocodile-skin textured wall with glossy scale-like highlights, creating rhythmic shadows. Medium shot, she occupies the center-right of the frame, her head at the upper third, guiding the eye from her face down to the dress and texture. Lighting comes from the front-left, soft and even, carving her features and casting bright spots on the wall, giving a cool blue vs. pure white contrast. The mood is quiet and elegant, like a candid behind-the-scenes moment at a high-end fashion event. Shot with a large-aperture prime lens, shallow depth of field, sharp focus on her while the background blurs softly, colors saturated enough to feel real, with a natural, almost phone-captured authenticity yet high aesthetic quality.",
