          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙困倦坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits elegantly in a side profile against a rich red backdrop, her jet-black silky hair cascading naturally over her shoulders and back, strands catching soft light to reveal delicate highlights, a few strands brushing her cheek and collarbone, adding to her languid sensuality. Her porcelain skin is flawless, her facial features sharply defined with elongated natural brows, subtle shimmer eyeshadow, long curled lashes, and eyes gazing softly upward, lips slightly parted with a natural full color, exuding a quiet yet dreamy allure. She wears a sheer black lace slip dress with intricate floral patterns, the transparent mesh clinging to her curves, revealing the outline of her breasts and taut waist, with delicate ruffled hems at the waist and hem, thin straps, and an open back that showcases her graceful shoulder blades and spine. Silver geometric drop earrings catch the light, a simple metal bracelet adorns her left wrist, her long fingers neatly manicured with pale pink polish. She sits with legs crossed, one arm resting at her side, the other hand lightly on her knee. The composition is a medium close-up, her body forming a diagonal from lower left to upper right, emphasizing elongation and dynamic elegance. The background is a deep red curtain with high saturation but soft edges, a white light flare on the right creating dramatic contrast. Lighting comes from slightly left front, softly illuminating her face, neck, and arms, with gentle shadows enhancing volume and depth. The color palette is red, black, and white, bold yet harmonious. The image has fine grain and realistic light, resembling a high-fashion editorial shot with a large-aperture lens, capturing both polished artistry and a spontaneous, intimate feel. The focal points are her profile, neckline, and the intricate lace texture, guiding the eye along her body’s sensual curves, evoking a mood of serene elegance, refined sexiness, and subtle mystery.",
