          "alias": "单女蓝西装戏谑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a light gray brick wall, her long, jet-black hair falling in soft waves over her shoulders and curling delicately across her chest. Her fair skin glows, her refined features are accentuated by defined eyebrows, subtle earth-toned eyeshadow, and bold red lipstick. She wears a brilliant blue tailored blazer with gold buttons and wide lapels, left open to expose her bare chest—nipples partially hidden by the crossed arms she holds firmly in front of her. A unique golden insect-shaped brooch adorns her left shoulder, large gold hoop earrings dangle from her ears, and a gold watch encircles her wrist. Her arms are crossed just below her breasts, creating a teasing shadow and emphasizing the curve of her torso. The background is a simple, textured gray brick wall. Lighting comes from slightly above front, soft and even, casting gentle shadows under her chin, neck, and arms. High saturation makes the blue and skin tones pop. The image has a magazine-cover quality with realistic detail—every strand of hair, every fold of fabric, every gleam of metal is sharp. Shot with a medium-format camera, 50–80mm lens at f/2.8, shallow depth of field blurring the wall slightly. The mood is confident, elegant, and sensually mysterious.",
