        {
          "id": "krea2-5d8568e118b793c04b5be0e5",
          "alias": "单女半褪粉连衣裙花园闭眼坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully on the back seat of a white golf cart, her sheer pink lace dress unbuttoned and slipping off one shoulder, revealing her full, bare breasts with erect nipples. Her right hand gently rests on her cheek, left hand holding a cream mini handbag, eyes closed, lips parted in a soft, satisfied smile. Her dark hair is loosely tied, a few strands falling across her cheek, delicate earrings catching the sun. The golf cart has cream leather seats, a transparent roof, black armrests, and silver vintage-style hubcaps, showing slight wear. Behind her, a European-style building with pale yellow walls, dark brown tiled roof, arched windows, ornate window frames, and intricate relief carvings. Trimmed greenery and blooming pink rose bushes create a romantic garden. Sky is clear blue, sunlight from upper right casts soft shadows. Color palette: pink, cream, pale yellow, with green and blue accents. Medium shot, figure slightly left of center, cart fills most of foreground, building and garden in midground. Composition lines from the cart and her pose lead the eye. Lighting is warm, natural, with subtle film grain and crisp detail. A sensual, luxurious, everyday-life moment, like a private snapshot at a high-end resort.",
