        {
          "id": "krea2-325c95ee8a7a3cdbcd56dc2e",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫办公室微笑坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of an office desk, her soft brown hair falling naturally in warm, glossy strands under gentle indoor light, a few locks brushing her shoulder and cheek, adding a lazy, tender vibe. She wears thin-framed glasses, lenses catching faint reflections, eyes clear and focused with a hint of a smile, looking slightly down at the camera with a mix of professional poise and approachable allure. She is dressed in a white short-sleeved blouse with a wide bow at the collar, the bow hanging loosely in smooth lines, sleeves neatly rolled to the elbows. Over it, a dark gray pinstriped waistcoat with three buttons, the top one undone, revealing a peek of the blouse; the vest fits snugly, emphasizing her slim waist. A black high-waisted miniskirt ends mid-thigh, showcasing long, shapely legs clad in sheer black stockings that subtly reveal natural skin tone, smooth and elegant. Black pointed-toe high heels with a moderate heel, shiny leather, catch the light. Her left hand rests on the desk, fingers long and slender, a simple metal bracelet on her wrist; her right hand casually touches the desk edge, body leaning slightly forward. One leg is bent, the other extended with the toe touching the floor, legs crossed in a graceful S-curve, exuding a relaxed yet confident, sensual posture. The desk is white, clean, holding a silver laptop (screen off), a stack of documents, a pen, and an old rotary phone. Background: a modern office with light gray walls, white shelving filled with black binders and books, a gray fabric office chair on casters visible on the right. Soft overhead lighting casts a warm glow, with shadows from the left side enhancing the volume on her face, arms, and legs. The floor is light gray tile with subtle reflections. Composition: mid-shot, camera slightly low, subject left of center, head tilted slightly, making eye contact with the viewer. Foreground sharp, background mildly blurred but recognizable. Overall palette: grays, black, white with hints of brown and metal. The scene feels like a candid, real-office snap—natural, unposed, with a touch of everyday sensuality. The focus is on her expression and body language, especially the legs and heels, creating a cool, confident, professional yet seductive office woman vibe. Style: realistic photography, full-frame camera with a standard prime lens, amateur snapshot quality, rich details, natural lighting, no filters.",
