          "alias": "单女露胸黑短裙沙发微笑坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a light gray fabric sofa, her body slightly angled toward the camera. She holds a stack of colorful chocolate boxes in her right hand, while her left hand rests on her bare shoulder. Her long, wavy hair falls softly around her face, with neat bangs framing her features. She wears a sweet smile, eyes clear and bright, looking directly at the lens with a playful, inviting expression. She is topless, her breasts exposed, with her white fitted short-sleeve top undone and pushed aside. She wears a black-and-white plaid mini skirt, legs crossed, clad in black stockings that highlight her delicate ankles. The pose is elegant yet relaxed. The background is a modern minimalist interior with soft light blue walls, a geometric triangle art print on the wall. A deep blue upholstered armchair with a wooden frame sits behind, a thick cushioned seat. The floor has a blue-and-white geometric patterned rug. A dark blue throw pillow rests next to the sofa. The lighting is soft and even, casting cool blue-purple tones, creating a calm, cozy domestic atmosphere. The shot is a mid-shot, with the woman positioned on the right side of the frame, leaving empty space on the left for balance. The foreground shows the sofa edge and rug texture; the midground is the woman and the chocolate boxes; the background furniture and wall art are slightly blurred to emphasize the subject. The visual flow starts from her face, moves to the chocolates in her hand, then to background details. Light comes from the front left, soft diffused light defining her facial contours with natural shadow transitions. Overall color palette is blue and white, accented by warm red and pink chocolate packaging creating contrast. The image is finely detailed, with the warmth of everyday life and artistic aesthetic, like a high-quality family photo or a carefully arranged personal portrait, capturing a relaxed, joyful moment, conveying warmth, youth, and healing energy. The composition is layered and spacious, background elements simple yet not monotonous, highlighting the woman while keeping a sense of reality. Colors harmonize, lighting is delicate, presenting a quiet, life-filled visual experience—modern yet warm, artistic yet intimate, like a quiet afternoon with sunlight filtering through curtains, the girl on the sofa enjoying her own moment with beloved chocolates, a happy smile on her face, full of warm emotion and delicate details, evoking the beauty and simplicity of life.",
