          "alias": "单女半褪金浴袍忧伤过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman in exquisite ancient Chinese robes, her face pure and ethereal, eyes deep and sorrowful. Ink-black hair cascades over her shoulders, adorned with intricate metal hair ornaments studded with amber and crystal decorations, elegantly layered, with soft strands framing her cheeks. She wears a sheer translucent gold gauze outer robe over a fitted gold dress embroidered with floral motifs, the fabric light and luminous. Her chest and sleeves are covered in fine shimmering bead chains and tassels that glisten with movement. The neckline and shoulders are revealing, showing the delicate craftsmanship and opulent style. Her skin is jade-white, with natural delicate makeup: defined eye liner accentuating deep eyes, soft rose lips. On her cheeks, faint blood streaks and scars add a touch of tragic narrative. Close-up portrait composition focusing on her face and upper body, the background blurred into a gradient of deep blue to black, creating a quiet, mysterious atmosphere. Soft sidelight creates chiaroscuro, highlighting her silhouette and the intricate fabric details, with subtle reflections on skin and cloth. Dim light halos and bokeh enhance depth and artistic tension. The scene feels warm yet somber, merging classical aesthetics with modern photography, evoking a cinematic moment of historical drama. The texture is hyper-realistic, with smooth color transitions and rich detail, cinematic and artful. In this version, her outer robe slips slightly off one shoulder, baring a smooth pale shoulder and the upper curve of her breast, adding a sensual, vulnerable elegance while retaining the tragic beauty.",
