          "id": "krea2-fc198472c1429c2d82f5a13f",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜舞台媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long raven black hair with blunt bangs framing her pale, flawless face. Her delicate features are focused, eyes locked on the lens with a soft, seductive gaze, lips slightly parted as if mid-song. She grips a black microphone close to her mouth with her right hand, while her left hand lifts a glowing bright blue spherical object, its surface covered in handwritten black text and patterns. She wears a tight gray-and-white camo-print cropped top, revealing a generous glimpse of cleavage, with sparkling silver trim at the shoulders and neckline. A short white leather miniskirt hugs her hips, fringed at the hem, with metallic chains cinching her waist, layered with studs and patchwork detailing. Her long legs are sheathed in sheer black stockings, and a silver bracelet studded with tiny diamonds glints on her wrist, complemented by simple round earrings. Her pose is elegant yet provocative, body slightly turned, exuding confidence and allure. The foreground captures her sharp half-body close-up, with a row of blue LED lights along the stage edge creating a soft, even horizontal glow. The background fades into deep black velvet, heightening contrast. Centered composition draws the eye from her face to the blue orb, then down to her microphone and revealing outfit, creating a smooth visual path. A front-top spotlight illuminates her face, arms, and upper body, making her the brightest element, while deep shadows sculpt her curves. The cool blue lighting and the glowing sphere echo each other, building a modern, futuristic atmosphere—both concert energy and dreamy stillness, as if freezing a perfect, intimate moment. The image is sharp, with balanced saturation, cinematic lighting, and a raw, seductive quality that feels like a high-end portrait captured live on stage.",
