          "alias": "单女毛衣厨房微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a kitchen, her long black hair with straight bangs falling neatly over her forehead, silky strands flowing over her shoulders, a delicate braid resting on her chest with slightly curled ends, giving a soft and layered look. She wears a sweet smile, clear bright eyes with deep pupils, natural soft eye makeup, warm rose lips, fair smooth skin with a faint blush of health and vitality. She is wearing a fluffy knit cardigan in light gray with vivid red strawberry patterns and yellow line decorations, the knit texture visible and fuzzy, white buttons at the collar, wide cuffs with natural folds. The cardigan is hanging open, revealing her bare chest—full, perky breasts with pink nipples exposed, skin glowing. She pairs it with a high-waisted milk-white pleated skirt made of soft cotton or chiffon, the hem light and fluttering, giving a girly and cozy vibe. Her right hand holds a pair of wooden chopsticks in natural light brown, smooth and round, pointing diagonally toward the upper left of the frame. Her left hand hangs naturally at her side. She wears small silver stud earrings, simple but sparkling. The background is a modern kitchen: an open shelving unit with dark brown wood shelves and black metal frames, the top shelf holding stainless steel pots and a black cast-iron pan, the middle shelf with clear glass jars and ceramic spice containers with labels, a glass pitcher beside them. To the right are white cabinets and light beige walls with subtle texture. On the counter are stacked transparent plastic containers with smooth reflective edges, and a red-handled kitchen tool partly visible. The light is bright and soft, a mix of natural indoor light and warm artificial light from the front-left, highlighting her face and outfit details, with gentle shadows and moderate saturation for a realistic life-like feel. Composition is a close-up portrait, the woman centered slightly right, head tilted a little, body slightly turned, creating an intimate and natural perspective. The chopsticks in the foreground create a strong diagonal leading line pointing toward her face. Midground shows her and part of the kitchen, background shelves and walls slightly blurred to emphasize her. The atmosphere is warm, cozy, everyday life with a candid snapshot quality, as if taken with a regular camera or phone, blending realism and artistic beauty. Warm tones, smooth light transitions, rich details, conveying a relaxed, friendly, and subtly erotic mood.",
