          "alias": "单女透视衬衫镜前媚态站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman takes a sensual selfie in front of an indoor mirror. She has long, smooth black hair braided elaborately, resting over her right shoulder, with soft waves and loose strands brushing her cheek and collarbone. Her skin is fair and flawless with a healthy rosy glow. Her facial features are delicate and defined: large, bright eyes with pink and light brown eyeshadow, sharp eyeliner, thick lashes, gaze focused on her phone screen. Her lips are glossy pink, slightly parted, conveying curiosity and soft desire. She wears a light green, sheer, semi-transparent blouse with natural folds and gradient texture, deeply plunging V-neckline exposing her neck, collarbone, and the upper curve of her bare breasts (no bra underneath), the fabric clinging to her skin. In her right hand, she holds a white smartphone with a pastel case decorated with pink hearts, stars, and cartoon motifs; the phone has a visible camera module and a multicolored bead phone strap ending in a pink fluffy ball. Her left hand gently cradles a lifelike butterfly with black, yellow, blue-green patterned wings and translucent edges, as if ready to flutter away. Her fingers are slender with neatly trimmed nails painted pale pink. The background is a slightly cluttered, lived-in indoor space: a golden clothing rack with hanging clothes on the left, a white display stand with brochures and QR code cards on the right, \"ee3\" signage on the wall, and a visible air vent. Soft, even lighting from overhead creates a natural, everyday feel. The composition is a close-up portrait with a slight tilt, mimicking a real handheld shot, guiding the eye from the phone screen to her face and then to the butterfly. The overall palette is fresh: greens, pinks, whites with accents of yellow and blue, evoking a youthful, sweet, dreamy yet candid NSFW moment, with subtle grain and realistic color saturation.",
