          "alias": "单女绿短裙镜前温柔坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in traditional Hanfu sits elegantly in a classical room, her white wide-sleeve top and light green skirt now discarded, leaving her bare-chested with soft, pale skin glistening in warm light. Her long black hair is tied with a red ribbon, bangs framing her delicate face. She holds an antique hexagonal bronze mirror with gold engravings and white tassels, her gaze drifting upward to the right. Her body leans back against dark wooden furniture, one hand resting on her knee. In the foreground, a red brocade stool with green trim and carved legs. On the desk, a green lacquer tray with jewelry, a metal stand with bells, and a blue-and-white porcelain vase with yellow flowers. Background shows wooden screens, window grilles, potted plants. Soft golden light streams from the right window, illuminating her bare side and torso, creating a serene, intimate atmosphere. The composition is balanced, warm tones evoke a nostalgic, poetic Eastern ambiance.",
