        {
          "id": "krea2-d539cf5f278b26e81a206164",
          "alias": "单女露胸歌手白背心舞台忧伤跪侧头",
          "prompt": "A young female singer performs on stage, her flowing brown hair with natural gradient highlights glowing warm orange-red under stage lights, bangs neatly covering her forehead, a few strands gently caressing her cheeks. She tilts her head slightly, eyes focused and melancholic, lips parted as if in passionate song. Her face is delicately sculpted with fair, smooth skin, natural yet refined makeup—defined eyeliner, thick curled lashes, a straight nose, and full lips. She wears a black headset microphone angled toward her mouth. Her outfit is a futuristic white tight stage costume: sleeveless top with black leather accents on shoulders and chest, metal buckle details, a cutout at the waist exposing her bare midriff, a wide white belt with a silver buckle. The short skirt has a high slit and black stud trim. She wears tall white leather boots that reflect soft light. She kneels on one knee, body leaning forward gracefully with power, left hand on knee, right hand hanging naturally, arm lines smooth. The background is deep black stage space, with a sharp blue beam of light from the upper right creating strong contrast, and on the left, faint hints of other dancers with leopard print. Composition centers on her in a medium close-up, emphasizing facial expression and outfit details, with negative space on the left evoking loneliness and focus. Lighting is a cold blue spotlight from the right and a warm fill from the left rear, creating cool-warm contrast; shadows transition smoothly, highlights on forehead, nose, chin, hair edges rim-lit with soft glow. The atmosphere is modern and artistic, blending stage performance energy with quiet emotional tension, as if capturing an inner monologue. The image has fine texture, moderate color saturation, professional studio lighting while retaining live performance authenticity. Shot with an 85mm portrait lens, shallow depth of field blurs the background, slight vignetting enhances focus. The visual style combines fashion, technology, and emotional expression. For the NSFW version, the singer's top and skirt are removed, leaving her completely topless and nude from the waist down, her bare skin gleaming under the stage lights, the microphone now resting near her lips as her body is fully exposed in the kneeling pose, the blue beam casting dramatic shadows across her breasts and thighs, the leather accoutrements and boots contrasting with her nakedness, creating a powerful, erotic tableau.",
