          "prompt": "A young woman lies on her side on a bed with floral-patterned sheets, wearing only a sheer red long-sleeve top unbuttoned to reveal her bare breasts, deep blue shorts, and white lace thigh-high stockings. Her legs are bent and raised, toes pointed, in a lazy, inviting pose. Her black shoulder-length hair with air bangs frames her face as she gazes calmly at the camera, right hand resting on her cheek, left hand placed casually at her side. Warm yellow walls behind her are covered with vintage photos and hand-drawn cards. A bare bulb lamp hangs overhead, casting soft warm light. On the headboard rest a brown teddy bear and white plush toys. A cream-colored soft blanket lies at the bedside. Mid-shot composition, diagonal body lines guide the eye from feet to face. Foreground includes bedding and plush toys, middle ground is the woman and bed, background is the wall decor and lighting. Soft shadows and highlights accentuate her facial features and the texture of her clothes. The scene feels intimate, serene, and domestic, like a private diary photo capturing a quiet afternoon. Warm cinematic tones, high detail, natural light transitions, emotionally evocative yet subtly melancholic.",
