        {
          "id": "krea2-83bf48f1256280010d564bb0",
          "alias": "单女露胸绿连衣裙室内困倦站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a festive indoor setting, wearing a deep green short-sleeved dress that is unbuttoned and slipped off her shoulders, revealing her bare breasts; the dress features delicate lace ruffles at the bodice and a red silk ribbon bow tied at her neck, adding a touch of holiday color. Her long, wavy dark brown hair with subtle golden highlights cascades over her shoulders, her bangs neatly framing her forehead. Her eyes are clear and bright, gazing directly at the camera with a gentle yet slightly playful expression. She wears refined makeup with soft rose-red lips and long pearl tassel earrings. In her right hand she holds a red Miu Miu handbag with distinctive diamond-quilted embossing and visible metal logo; her left hand lightly touches the ornaments on a Christmas tree beside her. The foreground shows a partially blurred Christmas tree adorned with gold and silver baubles, snowflake decorations, and warm yellow twinkling lights, creating a dreamy festive atmosphere. She is positioned slightly right of center in a classic rule-of-thirds composition, dominating the visual focus. In the background, a tall Christmas tree is softly lit, producing beautiful bokeh; beyond, large glass windows and building outlines are visible, letting in bright natural light from the left that casts soft chiaroscuro highlights and shadows on her body, emphasizing her silhouette and facial contours. The side-backlighting creates a luminous glow, while specular highlights from the tree lights form circular lens flares, enhancing the dreamlike quality. The overall color palette is green and red with gold and white accents, warm and festive. The scene is captured in a professional fashion portrait style with a wide aperture for shallow depth of field, slight film grain, and natural color saturation, evoking a warm, romantic, elegant yet lively holiday mood—a perfect winter moment full of life and artistic beauty.",
