        {
          "id": "krea2-59e43114026fcf8d98bf66bc",
          "alias": "单女黑丝袜街道媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long jet-black hair and seductive makeup sits on an outdoor wooden platform, her legs crossed elegantly in sheer black stockings and pointed stiletto heels with metallic ankle straps. She wears a long beige-and-black geometric trench coat, completely open to reveal her bare chest, nipples exposed, and dark inner clothing discarded. She smiles invitingly at the camera, holding a paper coffee cup with a black lid in her right hand, while her left hand rests on the back of a modern metal-framed chair with vertical woven slats. Beside her is a small black cone-base table with an open rectangular dessert box showcasing colorful pastries and fruit. In the background stand Beijing’s iconic Bell and Drum Towers—red walls, green tiles, upturned eaves, golden ornaments, and arched windows. Pedestrians and vehicles move in the distance; traffic lights and utility poles frame the street. The sky is clear blue, sunlight streams from the upper right, casting sharp shadows across her bare skin and the wooden floorboards, which show natural grain and wear. The composition follows the rule of thirds—subject on the right, environment on the left—her gaze and extended legs leading the viewer’s eye. The atmosphere blends modern urban leisure with historic gravitas, evoking a candid moment captured with a phone—slight film grain, warm tones, and a lived-in authenticity that freezes a fleeting, sensual instant.",
