        {
          "id": "krea2-927d82406de7677bbf85c8a5",
          "alias": "单女人鱼黑连衣裙海滩闭眼站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a rocky beach at sunset, wearing a revealing black mermaid-cut dress covered in intricate sequins and crystal embroidery forming floral vines, with black feather accents on her chest adding mystery and elegance. Her long, slightly wavy hair flows in the sea breeze, a silver-white three-dimensional flower hairpiece studded with tiny sparkling rhinestones pinned in her hair, and a black mesh hat with pearl-like ornaments along the brim. She wears black polka-dot mesh long gloves from wrist to elbow, the fine holes revealing glimpses of her skin. She stands sideways, head tilted back, eyes closed, expression peaceful and lost in the moment, her right arm raised high with fingers naturally curled, reaching for the wind or freedom. The composition places her on the left third of the frame, creating a focal point. Background: open coastline with calm sea meeting a hazy blue-white sky, a clear horizon, distant palm trees swaying, and faint city skyline in warm gray tones contrasting with the cool sky. Foreground: brown rocks of various sizes, some wet and reflective, scattered twigs and gravel, a rugged but textured ground. Natural daylight from upper right, soft and bright, illuminating her face, hands, and dress details, with subtle shadows on her left side enhancing depth. Golden light reflects off the sea and sky, creating a warm, serene dusk atmosphere. Dominant colors: black, white, gray, with silver sequins and red lipstick as accents. The diagonal line of her raised arm draws the eye upward to her closed eyelids and extended pose, while the horizon provides stability. Overall vibe: elegant, romantic, with a touch of loneliness, like a fleeting moment captured with a slightly shaky vintage film camera – soft grain, warm color saturation, realistic light and environmental details, evoking nostalgic, poetic realism.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
