        {
          "id": "krea2-b5e173686471f8c197bba174",
          "alias": "单女绿浴袍忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a desolate, barren yellow-brown wilderness, her black hair swept up into an elaborate bun adorned with silver hairpins and dangling tassel earrings, a vermillion mark on her forehead. Her eyes are deep and longing, lips slightly red, with a melancholic, thoughtful expression. She turns slightly to glance back over her shoulder, her posture elegant and poised. Her light green silk robe slips open, revealing the smooth curve of her bare shoulders and the full swell of her breasts, the fabric pooling at her elbows; the luxurious white fur trim of the collar brushes against her exposed skin. Her arm hangs naturally at her side, fingers loosely gripping the handle of a folded fan or sword. The wide, flowing sleeves catch the gentle breeze, billowing softly. The foreground is a sharp half-body shot, with her figure dominating the composition. Behind her, dry grass and scattered stones stretch across the dusty yellow-brown ground, while distant blurred shapes create depth. The overall warm tones are lit by soft, golden late-afternoon sunlight that slants across her face and chest, casting delicate highlights and deep shadows that trace her form and the contours of her exposed décolletage. The atmosphere is quiet, slightly desolate, as if she stands in an ancient, forgotten battlefield or barren expanse. The scene exudes a poetic, cinematic quality, blending classical beauty with modern sensuality, capturing both her fragile nobility and the haunting solitude of the landscape.",
