          "prompt": "A stunning East Asian woman in elaborate red hanfu, her top open and slipping off her shoulders, revealing her bare breasts and erect nipples. She wears an intricate red and gold headpiece, black hair piled high with dangling red beads and gold pins, a few strands falling by her face. Her makeup is elegant, deep smoky eyes, red lips slightly parted, expression melancholic and sensual. She holds a small wooden carving in her right hand. The robe is vivid crimson with subtle damask patterns, gold and blue phoenix and dragon embroidery at the cuffs and hem. A wide red brocade sash tied in a bow at her waist, hanging with jade ornaments—circles, fans, and tassels. The disheveled fabric exposes her cleavage and bare chest. Foreground has faint pink lotus decorations. Background: dim classical interior, wooden beams and walls, colorful beaded strings and copper bells hanging above. Warm yellow light from left softly illuminates her face and exposed skin, creating dramatic chiaroscuro. Medium shot, subject center-right, making subtle eye contact with the viewer. Background blurred. Dominant warm red tones with deep brown and gold accents. Slightly grainy film texture and natural depth of field. The mood is both opulent and sorrowful, a cinematic classical aesthetic with sensual vulnerability.",
