          "id": "krea2-4b802681611e4a8f75257484",
          "alias": "单女全裸白衬衫公寓媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a light gray fabric sofa, her long, soft brown hair falling naturally with gentle waves and slightly curled ends, a neat fringe resting on her forehead. The warm brown locks catch soft light, shimmering with fine texture and layers. She wears a loose white long-sleeved cotton shirt dress, unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest and perky nipples, the soft fabric falling open to expose her smooth neck, collarbones, and the gentle curve of her breasts. The wide sleeves drape naturally, the hem of the dress just above mid-thigh, now slightly hiked up to show her inner thighs. Her long, toned legs are bare and smooth, skin glowing pale and flawless—she wears only sheer nude stockings that cling to her skin, seamless and glossy, one foot flat on the floor, the other lifted slightly, toe pointed, revealing the delicate arch of her ankle and the natural spread of her toes. She smiles warmly, lips red and full, eyes clear and inviting, gaze locked on the viewer with a soft, sultry confidence. Her right hand rests lightly on the sofa arm, fingers slender and nails neat; her left hand lies casually on her lap, fingers grazing the hem of her dress. The background is a cozy interior: white walls, a wooden-framed painting with blurred pastel tones, a white shelf holding potted plants with glossy green leaves and a trailing pothos with yellow-edged tips, alongside stacked books in black, white, and beige. Dark floorboards are partially covered by a gray-and-white geometric rug with irregular lines and triangles. The sofa cushions are light beige, one with three parallel black lines. The composition is a medium shot, body turned slightly toward the camera, head tilted gently, natural leading lines. Soft natural light from the left front fills her face and body with even, diffused illumination, creating gentle shadows and a warm, comfortable atmosphere. The background is softly blurred, keeping focus on her while preserving the room's details. The palette is white, beige, light gray, with touches of green and black. The scene feels like a candid, high-resolution photograph—sharp, detailed, textured—yet natural and lifelike, capturing a quiet, intimate moment of everyday elegance and sensual warmth.",
