          "alias": "单女半褪浴袍雪地媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands atop a snow-capped mountain peak, her traditional hanfu robe slipping off one shoulder to expose her bare breast and the curve of her waist. She wears a pale blue open-front top with delicate geometric patterns along the edges, a wide orange-red brocade sash cinching her waist, its tassels dangling seductively. Her long, dark hair is half-up in a bun, loose strands blowing in the breeze. She tilts her head back, eyes closed, lips slightly parted, hands resting lightly on her chest, one finger tracing the edge of the fabric. The low-angle shot emphasizes her height and ethereal beauty. Before her, low shrubs sway gently. Behind, majestic snow-covered peaks rise through mist, and a vibrant rainbow arcs across the sky, its light casting a soft, dreamy glow over her skin. The scene merges natural grandeur with sensual elegance—her exposed skin contrasts with the cold mountain air, the rainbow’s warmth illuminates her face and chest. The atmosphere is poetic and intimate, a perfect fusion of ancient Eastern aesthetics and raw sensuality.",
