        {
          "id": "krea2-57f527024fdc126bdbbfd692",
          "alias": "单女黑束身衣门媚态站立手持物",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a dark wood sliding door in a traditional Japanese building, wearing a sheer black lace corset and a multi-layered ruffled skirt. Her slender arms rest naturally on the door frame—left hand gripping the edge, right hand hanging at her side—her pose elegant yet subtly seductive. Her short black hair is softly curled, makeup is meticulous, eyes lock directly into the lens, lips are full and glossy, and delicate silver tassel earrings dangle from her ears. The outfit blends modern fashion with classical beauty. The foreground shows the deep brown wooden door frame and a translucent paper shoji screen with grid patterns, the wood lightly worn from age. The middle ground is dominated by the woman, positioned slightly right of center, her body turned slightly, revealing the clear curves of her bust and waist. The black lace corset tightly shapes her torso, metal zipper details visible, and the cascading layers of black silk skirt fall from her waist, flowing gently as if stirred by a breeze, catching the light. The background is an interior space with dark wood flooring contrasting pale tatami mats; in the distance, a low round wooden table holds a few books or scrolls, with a white cushion beside it. Soft warm yellow light emanates from inside, creating a cozy, serene atmosphere. The composition combines central symmetry with a framing effect—the sliding door acts as a natural visual frame directing attention to the subject. The vertical lines of the door frame contrast with her relaxed posture, guiding the eye toward her face and torso. Natural light slants in from outside, creating soft chiaroscuro across her skin; her face and shoulders are evenly illuminated, shadows are delicate, and the edge of the door frame has a subtle backlight effect that enhances depth. The overall palette is black, brown, and gray with touches of warm amber light, evoking a quiet, introspective yet sensuous mood. The scene feels highly artistic and narrative, capturing an intimate moment. The style blends modern fashion photography with Eastern aesthetics, rich in detail and texture, resembling a high-quality professional photograph while retaining a sense of candid everyday reality.",
