        {
          "id": "krea2-4af1ef20ad7587b2f671611d",
          "alias": "单女椅上微笑倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a flowing, low-cut pale beige Hanfu, the fabric finely textured and naturally draped, her wide sleeves billowing elegantly. The neckline is pulled open to reveal a hint of cleavage and the edge of a white inner garment, exuding a gentle, classic Oriental charm. Her hair is styled in an intricate ancient updo, secured with pale blue hairpins, a few silky strands falling loose by her ears, silver tassel earrings dangling with a soft shimmer. Her face is delicate, skin porcelain-white, brows softly arched, bright eyes clear and expressive, lips a natural pink with a subtle, playful smile. She gazes directly at the viewer, holding a yellow cartoon bear-shaped metal spoon in her left hand, its handle cute and round with red lettering, and in her right hand, a small, golden, crumbly pastry, its surface crisp and detailed. She leans slightly forward in a natural, relaxed pose, centered left in the frame. The indoor background shows a light gray wall, smooth texture, with a framed floral oil painting in yellow and white tones, vivid and full. To the left, a light blue woven handbag; to the right, a wooden cabinet and a gray-green chair back, modern lines contrasting with the ancient elements. On the dark brown wooden tabletop, slightly reflective, sits a pink ceramic bowl with leftover crumbs and a pink cloth bag. The lighting is soft and even, from above front, casting gentle shadows and a warm, cozy atmosphere. Warm yellow, beige, and light gray dominate, accented with yellow, pink, and pale blue. Close-up shot focusing on her face and hands, background slightly blurred, enhancing realism and intimacy. The style blends classical elegance with modern everyday whimsy—a serene afternoon moment where she enjoys a simple treat, her expression tranquil and content, the scene full of warmth, tranquility, and a hint of playful sensuality.",
