          "prompt": "A young woman sits nude in a traditional Chinese wooden pavilion, her black hair cascading over bare shoulders, skin luminous in soft diffused light. She holds a white ceramic teacup gracefully, a faint smile on her lips, eyes meeting the camera with serene confidence. Her legs are crossed, one hand resting on a bamboo table beside a potted green plant and woven basket. The damp wooden floor reflects subtle water stains, suggesting a recent rain. Natural light filters through red-brown railings and translucent gauze curtains, casting gentle shadows. Mid-shot composition, woman offset left, slight body turn. Background blurred with distant white columns and lush foliage. Color palette of gray, brown, green—harmonious, poetic, oriental aesthetic. Fine detail, subtle film grain, shallow depth of field. An atmospheric, sensual portrait blending modern zen and erotic elegance.",
