          "alias": "单女黑T恤镜前媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a full black fur ensemble, wearing an oversized black fuzzy hat with a fluffy collar that half obscures her face. She stands slightly sideways, her right hand gently touching the brim of the hat, a shiny ring on her finger. Her gaze locks directly into the lens, flawless makeup with red lips parted, long hair flowing naturally. Her shoulder reveals a low-cut black lace camisole exposing her cleavage, and she wears a thick black faux fur coat left open, with dense fluffy cuffs and hem. Below, black high-waisted shorts paired with black fishnet stockings, highlighting her elegant long legs. The background is a vintage interior with dark wood furniture accented with gold trim, a large ornate framed mirror on the wall reflecting blurred room details. Soft light from the left creates strong chiaroscuro, warm and mysterious. The overall palette is black dominated with gold accents. Centered composition, the figure placed slightly right, dominating the frame. Foreground emphasizes the subject, midground shows furniture and mirror detail, background blurred. Visual focus is on her face and confident, alluring pose. Rich lighting layers, smooth shadows. A luxurious, cool, yet intensely sexy fashion editorial feel, as if shot with a professional camera in low light using a wide aperture lens to capture fine fur texture, skin glow, and the lace of her top—cinematic quality with a touch of amateur photography’s natural rawness. Her expression is self-assured and relaxed, her posture elegant without being forced. The entire scene brims with dramatic tension and artistic atmosphere, as if frozen in a private, glamorous, and explicitly sensual moment.",
