          "prompt": "A silver-haired female ninja warrior stands against a deep, dark black background, her long moon-white hair flowing in a gentle breeze with a vivid red bow clipped atop her head. She wears only black leather belts and a metal buckle cinching her waist, gold armor plates on her shoulders and wrists, and a thin strip of red cloth trailing from her hip—her chest fully bare, with firm, round breasts exposed, nipples erect. In her right hand she holds an open gold folding fan with intricate engraved patterns; her left hand grips two white-sheathed katana crossed at her side, red cord wrapping the hilts. She wears high-heeled sandals with bronze-colored straps and thin stiletto heels. Her posture is elegant and confident, body slightly tilted, chin lifted, eyes gazing forward with a cool, determined expression, lips pressed in calm composure. The composition is a full-body front view, centered against a pure black or extremely dark gradient background for strong contrast. Lighting comes from the upper left, creating soft rim light that outlines her silhouette and casts delicate shadows across her face, arms, and folds of her minimal clothing. Highlights gleam on her hair, the fan's edge, and the metal armor, while shadows blend seamlessly into the background. The overall atmosphere is mysterious and charged, blending Eastern aesthetic with modern digital artistry. Skin is smooth and detailed, every texture clear, colors saturated yet balanced, evoking a high-quality rendered digital illustration with a fusion of realism and fantasy, suitable for character design or game art.",
