        {
          "id": "krea2-79c043dab11876c74c101acd",
          "alias": "单女绿浴袍窗边忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in exquisite Hanfu stands in an antique interior, her delicate face carrying a melancholic, pensive expression as she gazes slightly to the side, lost in distant thought. Her black hair is swept up in an elaborate high bun adorned with gold ornaments and pearl strands, with a few loose strands falling naturally to soften her features. She wears a sheer, translucent emerald green robe over a cream-colored embroidered bustier, the fabric clinging to her form and revealing the contours of her body, with intricate golden patterns tracing the cloth. A bright orange silk sash cinches her waist, creating a vivid contrast. Her hands are crossed gracefully before her, the pose both elegant and inviting. The camera is focused on a medium close-up of her upper body, emphasizing the expression and the details of her attire, with the translucent robe hinting at the bare skin beneath. In the background, another woman in pale blue period clothing stands blurred and indistinct, adding depth and narrative. The setting is a traditional Chinese wooden interior with exposed beams and lattice windows, where soft, natural light streams from the side, casting dramatic shadows and highlighting the woman’s profile and the sheer fabric of her robe, creating a luminous, intimate glow. The scene is bathed in warm greens, cream, and brown tones, with subtle highlights on her hair, shoulders, and sleeves, enhancing the texture of her clothing and skin. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with the subject offset to the left, her gaze leading the eye to the right, building a quiet tension. The light source from the left window casts the background wooden structures into deep silhouettes, adding depth. The overall mood is serene yet charged with unspoken emotion, suggesting a moment of vulnerability and desire, as if captured from a period drama with cinematic quality. The visual style is crisp, with subtle film grain and natural dynamic range, evoking a realistic, sensual aesthetic that embodies the restrained beauty of Eastern sensuality.",
