          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an indoor setting, her soft light brown hair cascading in natural waves past her shoulders, warm and silky. Her delicate features are calm, her gaze directly at the viewer with a gentle, inviting expression, lips slightly parted. She wears a gray knit long-sleeve dress with a unique square neckline and tie detail; the dress is deliberately unbuttoned down the front, revealing her bare breasts, the fabric slipping off one shoulder to expose a nipple. The cutout at the chest is now fully open, showcasing her cleavage and areola. The skirt ends above mid-thigh, hugging her hips. She wears sheer black stockings that gloss her long, straight legs, and black patent leather stiletto heels with a metal buckle at the back. Her pose is natural and relaxed: one hand rests on a pink vanity table with ornate carved handles, the other hangs loosely at her side. On the vanity, a white ruffled lampshade lamp emits warm light, a framed black-and-white photo, and a small vase with fresh pink and white roses. Behind her, a light beige wall is decorated with a string of colorful pennant flags (plaid, stripes, polka dots) creating a festive, intimate backdrop. To the right, a floor lamp with a dark gray metal stem and a cream round shade casts a soft glow. The wood floor reflects the warm light. The lighting is warm and even, with no harsh shadows, accentuating her skin and the curves of her body. Her expression is serene yet seductive, eyes locked on the viewer. The shot is a low-angle waist-level view, focusing on her face and exposed breasts, with the background slightly blurred for depth. Overall, the image feels like a high-quality intimate portrait, warm, soft, and sensually artistic.",
