          "prompt": "A young woman in an opulent Hanfu sits centered, her black hair piled high in an elegant classical bun adorned with intricate silver hairpins, pink gemstones, and a pearl-encrusted tiara, tassels cascading to her shoulders and swaying gently in a soft breeze, loose strands framing her delicate face. Her features are refined—long arched brows, subtle pink-purple eyeshadow, clear pensive eyes, and natural rose lips with a faint, warm smile. She wears a lavish white cross-collar robe, but the outer layer has slipped open, baring her smooth, full breasts, the nipples visible against the translucent inner fabric. A sheer pink inner dress hugs her torso, edged with fine embroidery and revealing the curve of her chest. A silver carved jade belt set with pink gems and pearls cinches her waist, and multiple layered beaded necklaces drape over her bare skin, each cluster of gems and tassels resting between her breasts. Long earrings dangle from her ears, matching the headpiece. Her hands rest gently on her thighs, posture elegant yet deliberately seductive. The background is a soft-focus blue curtain with faint silhouettes of other figures in blur, creating a theatrical or ceremonial atmosphere. The composition is a medium close-up, shallow depth of field, side lighting mimicking dusk—warm and even, making her skin glow pale and luminous, highlighting the texture of the silk and the curves of her exposed body. The overall palette is white, pink, silver, and blue, with cool-warm contrast, evoking a serene yet sensual antique dream—part historical portrait, part erotic tableau, rich in detail and naturalistic lighting.",
