          "prompt": "A young woman stands elegantly in a classical European interior, wearing a sheer white lace halter dress that leaves her breasts fully exposed, the delicate fabric pooling around her hips with intricate cut-out patterns and scalloped edges, the A-line skirt ending at her upper thighs. Her long black hair falls over one bare shoulder, glossy and smooth. Her makeup is refined, with defined eyeliner and soft nude-pink lips. She wears a striking sapphire-and-diamond necklace, matching drop earrings, a prominent ring, and a minimalist white watch. Her hands are clasped just below her exposed chest, her pose poised and dignified, her gaze calm and absorbed, with a hint of introspection. Behind her, a pure white wall with ornate Baroque moldings and symmetrical geometric reliefs creates a luxurious backdrop. The polished pale floor reflects soft light, casting subtle shadows. The scene is predominantly white with cool-toned metallic and gem accents. Composition is a medium portrait, the subject slightly off-center, her body turned slightly toward the left, head tilted, forming an elegant S-curve. Soft diffused light comes from the front left, illuminating her skin and the dress texture evenly, enhancing the tactile detail. The atmosphere is serene, sophisticated, and slightly surreal, like a high-fashion editorial shot with a touch of everyday intimacy—a timeless, sensual portrait.",
