          "prompt": "A young woman with flowing pink hair stands at the center of an indoor exhibition space, wearing a sheer white sleeveless dress with a deep plunging neckline that reveals her bare breasts and erect nipples, the fabric clinging to her curves under warm amber lights. Her posture is poised, slightly turned, her gaze directed left with a contemplative, distant expression. One hand lightly holds a silver clutch adorned with sparkling crystals, while a delicate metal bracelet graces her wrist and geometric drop earrings dangle from her ears. Her makeup is refined, lips a natural nude pink, skin fair and luminous. Behind her, a large ivory curtain with heavy vertical folds creates a warm, intimate atmosphere. On the left, a black luxury handbag with gold chains rests on a white pedestal; on the right, a vibrant orange feathered hat with black-and-white patterned fabric accents sits beside a tall bouquet of pink, yellow, white, and green flowers. Soft lighting from recessed ceiling spots and hidden base lights casts gentle gradients and subtle shadows, highlighting the glossy texture of her hair and sheer dress. The center-left composition balances the two display pedestals, with shallow depth of field focusing on her body and the clutch in the foreground. The warm ivory, beige, and pink tones evoke a quiet, luxurious art-exhibit ambiance, as if captured during a high-end brand event. Slight film grain and faint noise at the edges mimic amateur photography, adding a lifelike, candid feel. Her gaze guides the eye toward the left display, then to the flowers and curtain, creating a flowing visual line. The scene is serene, elegant, and implicitly sensual, blending fashion with intimate, real-life atmosphere.",
