          "alias": "单女全裸椅上微笑坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits nude on a weathered wooden bench outdoors, her deep brown wavy hair pinned with delicate silver clips, soft natural light warming the strands as a few fall gently against her cheeks. She wears a bright, genuine smile, teeth visible, eyes joyful and focused, tenderly holding a silver digital camera in both hands, lens aimed forward, colored tags and buttons clearly visible. Her bare shoulders and chest are exposed, skin glowing in the warm, diffuse light. A single pearl earring dangles from her left ear; a black leather bracelet and gold watch adorn her wrist. The bench is dark, aged wood. Behind her, traditional Chinese gray brick walls and green tiled roofs interlace, weathered with time, clothes hung to dry in the distance, creating a quiet, lived-in atmosphere. The composition is a close-up, the woman slightly off-center right, her face and the hand-held camera the focal point, the camera tilted for a subtle dynamic feel, guiding the eye from her expression to the camera and then to the architectural details. Light falls from an upper angle, soft and even, like late afternoon or overcast sky, casting warm tones on her skin and hair, creating natural highlights and shadows that enhance depth and texture. The overall mood is intimate, nostalgic, and warmly sensual—a candid, everyday moment captured as if by an old digital camera, with a documentary, nostalgic feel. The color palette features cream, pale yellow, gray-brown, with accents of silver metal and black leather, the image rich in detail, blending youthful vitality with artistic elegance.",
