          "prompt": "A young woman strides confidently down a wet city street, her deep olive-green fleece jacket hanging open to reveal bare skin beneath—no shirt, just the smooth curve of her breasts partially visible as the jacket shifts. She wears a micro black leather skirt that barely covers her ass, sheer black stockings, and thigh-high patent leather boots with crisscross straps and silver buckles that cinch tight around her legs. Her grey-purple hair is loosely pinned up with stray strands falling over her forehead, large black sunglasses hiding half her face as she smirks with cold desire. A classic black Chanel bag with gold chain strap swings at her hip. The low-angle shot captures her from behind, legs spread slightly with each step, the wet pavement reflecting her silhouette. In the background, modern glass buildings, a Chanel storefront, and leafless trees frame her. The mood is urban, lustful, and powerful—a predator on the hunt.",
