        {
          "id": "krea2-dde09b3c985f5e5f92b2e012",
          "alias": "单女全裸粉连帽衫微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands elegantly in a side profile, slightly right of center, her long black hair pulled into a high ponytail with soft strands framing her face. Her skin is fair and glowing with a delicate, natural makeup—rosy cheeks and soft lips—her eyes clear and bright, a slight smile as she gazes left. She wears a pink zipped athletic hoodie, open to reveal her bare chest and smooth skin, with a white lace camisole barely visible at the collarbone. The sleeves are wide and fluffy, giving a relaxed silhouette. In her hands, she cradles a bouquet of vibrant flowers—pink peonies, yellow roses, purple forget-me-nots, blue delphiniums, and green leaves—tied with a lavender ribbon. On the ground in front: a small pink portable fan with a cartoon bunny on top, a retro brown film camera with silver trim and a red logo, and a clear glass with \"BUBBLE\" printed in color. The background is a dreamy blur of blue-green tones, abstract sky and grass, with distant green hills dotted with purple and white flowers. Medium shot, composition draws the eye from her face along her gaze to the left, then loops back through the bouquet and props. Soft overhead-front lighting, no harsh shadows. Tonal palette of pink, green, blue with pops of floral color. Textures are rich, like a commercial ad shot but with an intimate, candid feel—a sunny afternoon captured on old film. Sensual, with implied full nudity beneath the open hoodie.",
