          "alias": "单女露胸短裤城市媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman leans sideways against a metal-textured wall with vertical stripes, her long black hair cascading naturally, some strands tucked behind her ear to reveal her refined profile and elegant neck. She wears thin-rimmed glasses, lenses catching warm light, her gaze focused and slightly contemplative off-frame, lips pressed in a composed, confident expression. She is completely topless, her bare breasts fully exposed with nipples subtly erect against the cool air, her smooth, sun-kissed skin contrasting with the sleek wall. A white short-sleeved top lies discarded on the floor, its hem showing black FENDI double-F logo fabric, now irrelevant. She wears matching high-waist shorts that hug her hips and elongate her legs, emphasizing her slender waist and healthy skin tone. Her left arm casually drapes a light gray jacket over it, the material soft and draped, zipper details visible. The overall style is both fashionable and effortless. The interior background shows a modern space with fine vertical groove textures on the wall, reflecting warm ambient light. Above, simple recessed lighting strips emit soft golden light, creating a cozy, intimate atmosphere. In the distance, blurred furniture outlines and wooden elements add depth. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, the subject positioned slightly right, her body slightly angled into a natural S-curve, visual focus on her pose and bare upper body. Foreground emphasizes her figure and clothing coordination, midground uses wall texture and light-shadow to enrich the structure, background remains softly blurred to avoid distraction while preserving environmental cues for realism. Light comes from the upper left, creating soft chiaroscuro, her face evenly lit with delicate shadows, accentuating skin texture and three-dimensional contours. The overall color palette is off-white, gray, and black, with warm lighting tones, balancing premium feel and everyday vibe. The image has a strong sense of fashion and life, as if captured spontaneously with a professional camera in an urban café or boutique hotel lobby. Subtle film grain and natural color saturation simulate high-end photography gear shooting in low light, resulting in a genuine texture. The overall atmosphere is serene and elegant, blending model-like refined beauty with authentic, approachable sensuality.",
