          "id": "krea2-fbeafb073dbe23cc68636513",
          "alias": "单女蓝T恤户外媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a pale green wooden storage crate outdoors. Her long, jet-black hair cascades over her shoulders in soft waves, catching the sunlight with a subtle sheen. She wears a blue-to-green gradient spaghetti-strap tank top, the thin straps slipped down her shoulders, revealing a hint of cleavage and the smooth curve of her collarbone. Over it, she layers an open black-and-white striped knit cardigan, sleeves rolled to the elbow. Her bottom is a high-waisted cream pleated mini skirt, the hem slightly lifted to expose the soft inner thigh. A black leather belt cinches her waist. On her feet, brown lace-up combat boots with visible light socks. She sits with legs crossed, one foot planted on the ground, the other resting on the edge of the crate. Her hands are relaxed—one fingers lightly grazing her neck, the other resting on the crate. Her gaze is focused directly at the camera, eyes deep and inviting, lips parted in a lazy, contemplative expression that carries a sensual undertone. Atop the crate sits a pink vintage record player, lid open with a red vinyl beside it. In the background, lush green bushes create a natural bokeh under golden afternoon light. Dappled shadows fall across her body and the grass, highlighting the texture of her skin and the subtle wetness of her lips. The composition is centered but slightly offset, leading the eye from the record player up her legs to her face. The color palette is dominantly green, accented by blue, pink, and brown, giving a fresh, summery eroticism. The light comes from the upper right, casting a sharp side-light that accentuates the contours of her form, with soft shadows on the left. Every detail—the grain of the wood, the sheen of her skin, the tiny folds of her skirt—is rendered with cinematic clarity, like a still from an indie film that teases a sultry afternoon.",
