          "prompt": "A young woman lies sideways on a plush, soft brown fur, her intricate classical Hanfu loosened—the outer pink robe slipped open to reveal her bare breasts and smooth, pale skin. Her long black hair is styled in an elaborate updo adorned with golden hairpins, pearl-encrusted flower ornaments, a crescent-shaped white hairpin, pink blossoms, and blue tassels; a partial gold crown hints at noble status. Her face is delicate, with willow-leaf brows, clear amber eyes gazing upward to the right, long curled lashes, a straight nose, and naturally pink lips curved in a faint, knowing smile. She rests her right cheek on her hand, arm bent, elbow supported on the fur, exuding relaxed, sensual grace. The inner blue embroidered cross-collar robe peeks out where the garment falls open, its edges trimmed with pearls and gold threading. Fine three-dimensional embroidered flowers adorn shoulders and sleeves, petals layered in soft hues with gold outlines. Silk fabric shimmers softly. The background is a vast expanse of fluffy fur, its texture richly detailed. Warm, soft light spills from the upper left, rim-lighting her face, hair, and the edges of her clothing, casting gentle shadows that add depth. Close-up composition—figure dominates the frame, head slightly rightward, her gaze directing attention off-frame. Color palette: pink, blue, gold, warm brown. A serene, softly melancholic yet sensual atmosphere. High-resolution cinematic quality, focus on her face and exposed skin, background gently blurred. Elegant, artful, like a classical beauty portrait infused with quiet eroticism.",
