          "alias": "单女背心广场冷淡侧头",
          "prompt": "A female character in elaborate fantasy battle attire poses in a half-crouch, her shoulder-length hair fading from deep green to pale blue, metallic sheen under cool light, a few strands falling across her forehead. She wears a pair of ornate golden horn-like headpieces studded with turquoise gems, pointed elven ears adorned with matching gold-and-gem earrings. Her dramatic makeup features heavy geometric eyeliner, deep blue-green eyeshadow, and soft coral-pink lips; her face is sculpted with high cheekbones and pale, flawless skin. Her gaze is intense and sharp, staring directly at the viewer with a confident, slightly challenging smirk. She wears a tight, deep teal sleeveless top with a plunging neckline that exposes her collarbone and the full curve of her breasts, with intricate golden pauldrons engraved with runes on her shoulders. Black elbow-length gloves with gold trim and claw-like spikes cover her arms; her left hand is raised near her chest, while her right hand hangs down, holding a complex mechanical device of gold and black with glowing turquoise components. Multiple layers of bandages and metal rings wrap her wrists. A wide cream-colored belt with gold trim and turquoise gems cinches her waist. She wears high-waisted shorts with geometric cutouts at the hem, paired with smooth, pure white thigh-high stockings that highlight her leg lines. Her right knee is bent, left leg straight; black ankle straps and decorative golden high-heeled sandals with intricate bindings and turquoise gems complete her feet. The overall look blends futuristic technology with classical fantasy. Her posture exudes power and elegance, body slightly forward with weight on her right leg, left leg pulled back, creating strong visual tension. The foreground shows a rough gray concrete or stone floor with subtle textures and reflections. Light slants from the right, casting a sharp shadow of her silhouette. The midground is dominated by the figure, filling most of the frame. The background is a blurred indoor environment with dark gray walls and ceiling, modern geometric lines, faint square structures and pipes, depth of field keeping focus on her. A low-angle upward shot enhances her commanding presence. She is offset left-center, forming an S-curve, head slightly tilted, making direct eye contact. Visual lines flow from arms and legs through clothing details to her face. Lighting is cool-toned, with a strong key light from the right creating dramatic chiaroscuro, highlighting her front while casting her back and sides into shadow, producing rim light that accentuates her contours and fabric layers. Highlights gleam on her hair, jewelry, and skin, enhancing texture. A blurred green light patch in the background adds a surreal sci-fi touch. The overall atmosphere blends futuristic warfare with oriental fantasy, as if in a high-end photo studio shot with a large-aperture lens, achieving cinematic visual quality.",
