          "prompt": "A young woman in a unbuttoned black suit jacket and white collar shirt, her chest exposed, wearing a black beret and black-rimmed glasses, long hair falling naturally, standing in front of \"Venchi\" chocolate shop, her right hand pressing against the glass window, gazing intently at the giant pink ice cream sculpture inside, her left hand holding a classic black quilted chain bag, black thick-soled loafers with white knee-high socks, her right leg elegantly lifted, knee bent, toes pointing down, a playful yet refined pose. Beside her is a huge pink ice cream model on a metal spiral stand, exaggerated and artistic, with delicate creamy textures in soft pink tones, contrasting with the cold architectural background. Gray stone wall and transparent glass door, \"Venchi\" logo on the wall, sunlight slanting from the right casting clear shadows on wall and floor, bright warm light creating a realistic street snapshot feel. Medium shot composition with the woman on the right, leaving space on the left for the ice cream sculpture and shop entrance. Visual flow from left to right guided by her pose, gaze, and the ice cream. Foreground: stone steps and her legs. Midground: her body and the ice cream sculpture. Background: shop front and wall. Color palette mostly black, white, gray with pink and gold accents. Strong contrast, natural light transitions. Atmosphere of urban fashion with a light, joyful life vibe, as if capturing an unguarded moment, with strong narrative and artistic appeal, like a high-resolution camera shot on a sunny afternoon — realistic, detailed, textured, blending professional photography with casual snap aesthetics.",
