        {
          "id": "krea2-2ab6de8e8730e1b0f421b510",
          "alias": "单女露胸连衣裙舞台沉思站立躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless, her pale pink Hanfu slipped off her shoulders, the soft, delicate fabric pooling at her elbows, revealing the creamy skin of her bare chest. The inner lining of the dress—a pale beige with subtle interlocking scroll and vine patterns—peeks from the collar and cuffs, with tiny green leaves and purple flower embroidery at the edges. She presses her hands together under her chin, fingers long and slightly curved, palms touching, her pose elegant and contemplative. Her black hair is swept up in a high bun, a few stray strands falling naturally over her forehead; two simple white jade hairpins gleam with a smooth, polished sheen. Her face is refined and three-dimensional—willow-thin brows, deep, bright light-brown eyes staring calmly and intently at the viewer, lips slightly pressed, pale pink. Her skin is fair and smooth, with soft shadows sculpting her cheeks. The background is a blurred blue backdrop, cool-toned, fading from deep blue at top to lighter blue below, with faint fabric texture and reflections. In the midground, a vague dark wooden structure (prop or stage support) adds contrast. Composition: medium close-up, subject slightly left of center, head tilted, direct eye contact, intimate and serene mood. Light comes from front-right, soft diffused like natural daylight, even on her face, with gentle highlights on hair edges and folds of the fallen dress. Tones: soft pink, pale beige, light blue, with small accents of green and purple. Cinematic quality, as if captured with an 85mm f/1.8 lens on a Canon R5 or Sony A7R IV, shallow depth of field, sharp yet natural, with fine detail and minimal noise.",
