          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the center of a vintage-style indoor restaurant, her delicate white lace corset unlaced and hanging open, exposing her bare breasts, the crossed straps framing her nipples. She wears loose beige suede lounge pants and chunky sneakers, with a fluffy light gray fur coat draped over her shoulders. Her black hair is high in a tight bun, a few strands falling across her cheek, her eyes locked on the camera with a cold, detached gaze. A thin chain necklace rests at her collar, a small tattoo visible on her collarbone. She softly grips the coat sleeves, her pose natural yet taut, her full body from ankle to crown clearly visible. The room is richly detailed: dark brown wooden floor with natural grain and age, reflecting warm light; tables on either side in white cloth and blue skirts, with brown leather seats and wicker chairs, accented by greenery and floral bouquets. Behind her, a dark brown louvered wall is adorned with hanging plants and festive string lights. The sloped ceiling is supported by rough-hewn wooden beams, a classic brass chandelier at center casting golden yellow glow, while wall sconces and a skylight pour in cool natural daylight, creating dramatic contrast. The composition is symmetrical, drawing the eye to her centered figure, with perspective lines deepening the space. Warm yellow artificial light mingles with cool natural light, evoking an intimate yet opulent mood. The image feels raw and candid, like an amateur snapshot, yet holds the polished aesthetic of an art film. Colors are beige, tan, gold, with subtle green and blue accents. The overall atmosphere is elegant and decadent, fiercely fashionable and storytelling.",
