        {
          "id": "krea2-30949c35d5684159ad234c2b",
          "alias": "单女透视连衣裙城市媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A woman in a deep plunging black V-neck form-fitting long-sleeve dress sits gracefully on a heavy stone tabletop, her legs crossed, right foot slightly raised, wearing glossy black pointed-toe stiletto heels and sheer stockings that emphasize her long, sensual legs. Her hair falls naturally, a soft smile on her face, eyes tenderly gazing at the camera, a delicate necklace around her neck. Her pose is composed and confident, exuding urban feminine allure and intelligence. The foreground is a clear close-up of her seated posture; the stone surface is rough with natural texture, supported by a sturdy metal frame, creating an industrial-meets-nature contrast. In the midground, a potted sapling with slender branches dotted with white blossoms and fresh green leaves grows in a blue-green geometric circular planter, beside a blue ceramic pot holding another plant. On the left background, a fine metal-wire mesh display enclosure holds several ancient carved wooden Buddha statues in various poses—seated, standing—with rich detail, evoking Eastern Zen and religious culture. On the right, a unique fish-scale woven pendant lamp glows warm yellow, casting soft light, alongside everyday objects like a handbag and tea set. The floor is paved with beige stone slabs and dark wooden strips in a mosaic pattern, adding visual depth. The entire scene blends modern design, traditional elements, and natural motifs. Composition is centrally symmetrical with the woman positioned slightly lower center, drawing the eye to her, while ornaments on both sides create visual balance. The lighting is warm and textured, coming from above and the sides, producing soft chiaroscuro and subtle shadows that contour her figure and objects. The wire mesh casts dappled light, enhancing spatial depth. Overall color palette is black, gray, and brown, accented by green plants and warm yellow light, creating a serene, elegant yet stylish atmosphere—as if captured in a high-end café or art space fusing Eastern aesthetics with modern design. The image has a strong cinematic and editorial magazine feel, rich in detail and layers, like a real moment captured by professional photography, yet retaining everyday intimacy and spontaneity.",
