        {
          "id": "krea2-bca32944fa726b0b2b13743b",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙城市媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a rattan sofa on an outdoor terrace, wearing a creamy-white satin long-sleeve dress with a plunging neckline, its silk ribbons loosened and falling open to reveal the smooth curves of her breasts. The short hem barely covers the tops of her thighs, legs crossed elegantly. Her black hair cascades naturally, makeup refined, her gaze calm and seductive directly into the lens. Small pearl earrings adorn her ears. One hand rests lightly on her thigh, the other on the sofa's arm. Behind her, a wide cream-colored umbrella on a metal stand, lush potted plants, a matching rattan lounger, and a black quilted handbag. To the right, a glass railing overlooks dense green mountains under a gray-blue overcast sky. Soft diffused light, no harsh shadows. A dark gray woven rattan coffee table in the foreground holds a clear glass and a black phone with a double-C logo. The composition is centered, the woman positioned slightly above center, with layered depth from furniture to plants to distant hills. Color palette: cream, gray-brown, dark green. The scene exudes a serene, cool luxury, combining high-end urban lifestyle with a hint of solitary contemplation. Every detail—fabric luster, rattan texture, glass transparency—is rendered with photorealistic precision. The atmosphere is both intimate and aloof, with a sensual, mature elegance.",
