          "alias": "单女棕毛衣椅上忧伤坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a leather piano stool before a deep reddish-brown upright piano, wearing a form-fitting brown knit dress with a daring one-shoulder cutout and irregular angular shapes exposing her bare shoulder and upper chest—the entire dress is sheer and translucent, revealing her nipples through the fabric. Her legs are crossed, clad in thick cream-colored ankle boots. Her hair is tousled, strands falling across her face, a single gold earring catching the light. She gazes off to the left with a contemplative, slightly melancholic expression, her lips parted slightly. Her hands rest gracefully in her lap, fingernails polished dark, a simple ring on her ring finger. The piano's glossy dark wood reflects soft light, keys crisp. Behind, a pale beige wall with wooden wainscoting; the floor is dark geometric parquet. Natural light from the left illuminates her side and body, casting subtle shadows on the piano and floor. The composition is centered, with a slight downward angle emphasizing the full figure and the sensual exposure of her skin. The mood is quiet, warm, nostalgic, with an intimate, cinematic quality—a moment frozen in time as she sits alone, lost in her own world, the piano awaiting her touch.",
