          "prompt": "A young woman stands deep in a shadowy forest, her body wrapped in a sheer, flowing Hanfu of pale lavender and misty teal, the fabric clinging to her curves and leaving her breasts exposed through the translucent silk. The robe falls open at the chest, revealing her nipples and the soft swell of her breasts, while a woven vermillion sash cinches her narrow waist. Her black hair is swept up in a loose bun, pinned with tiny white ornaments, a few strands curling across her forehead. In her right hand, she grips an antique sword with a dark green scabbard engraved with dragon motifs, the metal fittings glinting coldly. Her gaze is calm yet fierce, locking onto the viewer. The background is a blurred tapestry of deep green and charcoal, creating a sense of depth and isolation. A second sword lies in the foreground, hinting at a confrontation or ally. Soft side lighting casts gentle shadows across her skin and the folds of her robe, the scene bathed in a cool, early twilight aura, yet warmed by the subtle glow of her exposed flesh. The composition is symmetric, her figure centred, with the sword's diagonal line drawing the eye upward to her face and bare chest. The overall mood is still and story-laden, a mythical martial moment captured in high-definition, with a slight film grain and natural depth of field, evoking an artistic, sensual Eastern fantasy.",
