          "alias": "单女露胸广场忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "An elegant East Asian woman stands in a side profile, her black hair swept up into a high bun with loose strands falling around her ears, adorned with simple yet refined hairpins. Her delicate face features sharp brows and expressive eyes that gaze melancholically toward the right, lips slightly parted. She wears a cream-colored cross-collared ruqun, the front deliberately pulled open to expose her bare breasts—nipples visible—with a wide red silk sash tied in a bow just beneath her bust, the ends trailing down. Over this, a crimson velvet cloak embroidered with gold floral patterns drapes off one shoulder, revealing the smooth curve of her shoulder and collarbone, the thick white fox-fur collar framing her neck and upper chest. Her hands rest lightly over her lower abdomen, fingers long and nails neatly shaped. The scene is a half-body close-up set in a dim historical Chinese interior—dark wooden lattice windows, warm square lanterns casting soft yellow light, and a blurred backdrop of palace corridors. Muted shadows play across her face and body, emphasizing the lush texture of the silk, fur, and skin. The composition centers her slightly left, her tilted posture and gaze directing the viewer's eye rightward, creating depth and narrative. The light, warm and slightly mysterious, highlights the contrast between the blood-red cloak, white fur, and exposed pale skin. The overall mood is one of quiet longing and sensual elegance, captured with the sharp focus and cinematic quality of a professional photograph.",
