        {
          "id": "krea2-1d6f312b8dcdf130b2b657a2",
          "alias": "单女半褪金连衣裙山野忧伤站立出神",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an exquisite yellow traditional Hanfu stands as the focal point, her long black hair styled into a high bun adorned with golden floral leaf hairpins, soft strands falling beside her ears where slender gold tassel earrings dangle and sway with subtle movements, adding a touch of lively elegance. Her makeup is refined and classical: thin willow-leaf eyebrows, deep eyes outlined with eyeliner, full and luscious red lips, and a small red flower mark on her forehead. Her face is delicate and ethereal, exuding a gentle yet stubborn, serene temperament. She stands slightly turned, gazing to the left with a melancholic expression, as if lost in thought. The yellow Hanfu is made of light, flowing fabric, with a pale yellow base embroidered with light floral patterns. The sleeves are wide, revealing white inner cuffs at the edges. A silver-gray silk ribbon ties at the collar and waist, showcasing meticulous elegance. The foreground clearly presents the woman's upper body from head to waist, with detailed textures, folds, and highlights on the clothing. Soft light falls on her face and fabric, creating natural chiaroscuro. The background is a blurred rocky or earthen slope in warm brown tones, rough and mottled, resembling a sunlit mountain wall or ancient roadside rockface. The background is softly blurred to emphasize the subject. The composition is a medium close-up with the figure placed slightly right of center, creating a focal point. On the left edge, a person in blue Hanfu is barely visible with only shoulder and arm showing; on the right, another in light-colored clothing appears, both blurred and marginal, suggesting a group scene, but the focus is entirely on the central woman. The visual line starts from her face and extends along her gaze out of frame. Her yellow dress contrasts vividly with the warm background, shining brightly. The lighting is warm and soft, with sunlight coming from an angle above, casting delicate highlights and shadows on her face, hair, and clothes, evoking the calm of early morning or dusk. The overall palette is warm, dominated by yellow, brown, and ochre, contrasting with the bright yellow of her dress and the gold of her accessories, creating a harmonious, layered color scheme. The image quality resembles a professional film still yet retains the authenticity of casual amateur photography. The focal length is moderate, depth of field shallow, background blur natural, and details well-preserved. The atmosphere is quiet, classical, and poetic, as if freezing a moment of time-traveling beauty, full of Eastern aesthetic and narrative depth. The Hanfu's collar is slightly loosened, revealing the smooth curve of her shoulder and the upper swell of her breasts, with the fabric draping suggestively off one shoulder, adding a sensual allure to the otherwise elegant attire.",
