          "alias": "单女舞者黑挂脖舞台冷淡站立展示",
          "prompt": "A young female dancer performs a high-energy routine on a futuristic stage, wearing a black fringe halter top that barely covers her breasts, the dense fringe swaying with every move, exposing glimpses of her smooth midriff and sides. She pairs it with high-waist denim shorts that hug her hips and curve, black thigh-high boots with chunky heels, and a studded leather belt with metal buckle and rivets, emphasizing her punk-rock sex appeal. Her long black hair flows naturally, lifting with her movements. Her makeup is sharp, eyes focused and intense, lips parted slightly, a small microphone clipped near her mouth capturing every sound. Her arms are raised high overhead, index fingers pointed to the sky in a signature gesture, radiating power and confidence. The background is a modern pink-purple stage with horizontal striped panels creating strong visual depth. A deep red column stands on the left, while the right edge shows another dancer in tight black clothing, arm raised in call and response. A potted green cactus sits at the lower left, adding a touch of organic life to the cool tones. Above, vintage lantern-style lights cast warm yellow glows contrasting with the cooler stage lights, enhancing shadow and dimension. The shot is mid-angle, the dancer centered, her body the focal point, with lines guiding the eye inward. Lighting is soft and even from the stage system, with localized highlights creating subtle shadows that accentuate her curves and muscle definition. The overall atmosphere blends youthful vitality, urban fashion, and theatrical drama with strong K-pop performance flair, as if captured during a professional TV show recording. High-definition camera work picks up every detail of skin texture, fabric, and environment—crisp clarity, balanced color saturation, authentic yet commercial. The sexy halter top reveals her cleavage and the curve of her breasts as she moves; the tight shorts ride up slightly, showcasing her thighs; her confident stance and parted lips invite the viewer into the moment.",
