        {
          "id": "krea2-53bb40ae925bdefb6f4df7a8",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装沙发忧伤坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a brown woven-texture fabric sofa, her smooth golden blonde hair cascading naturally, catching soft, warm highlights at the tips that gently curl against her shoulders. Her skin is fair and luminous, with delicate facial contours—fine arching brows, subtle eye makeup enhancing deep, introspective eyes that gaze slightly right, holding a melancholic stillness. Her lips are painted pale pink, slightly parted, the corners drooping just a hint to create a languid, detached allure. She wears a loose, dark blue blazer of thick, soft material with natural draping and light wrinkles; underneath, a cream-colored collared shirt unbuttoned enough to reveal her collarbones and the faint shadow of her décolletage, the shirt fabric pulling slightly to hint at the curves beneath. Her left hand rests gently near her chest, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed, while her right hand lies casually on the sofa arm, a delicate gold chain bracelet catching faint metallic glints. Her body angles slightly to one side, shoulders relaxed, pose effortlessly elegant against a plain light-gray wall. Medium-shot portrait framing from head to shoulder, her head tilted a little, directing the viewer's gaze rightward. The foreground shows the sofa's woven texture in crisp detail; the background is clean, empty, emphasizing her. Lighting from upper left, soft and even like natural window light or a softbox, with subtle highlights on nose, forehead, and cheekbones, smooth shadow transitions, and gentle chiaroscuro on the clothing folds. The atmosphere is quiet and intimate, capturing a fleeting, candid moment. Color palette of blue, cream, and brown with a muted, low-saturation yet rich look, as if shot on film with a professional camera, shallow depth of field blurring the background, fine grain and smooth tonal transitions, evoking a personal photo from a private album—an authentic afternoon reverie.",
