          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully on steps covered in vivid red carpet, wearing a form-fitting black strapless mini dress with delicate silver pinstripe texture. The exaggerated ruffled shoulder detail creates a voluminous, layered look. The dress clings to her curves, highlighting her waist and hips. Her natural long black hair falls softly, gleaming faintly in the light. She has flawless makeup—smoky eyes, deep eyeliner, full lips—and an aloof, high-fashion expression. Her body is slightly turned, left hand resting on her knee, right hand on the step behind her, confident and poised. Her long, toned legs are bare and smooth, ending in black stiletto pumps with glossy patent leather. The dress cuts low across her cleavage, revealing the upper swell of her breasts and a hint of nipple under the taut fabric. Her skin glows under the dramatic overhead lighting. The background is a dark gray wall with professional stage lighting rigs, some labeled “50” and “61”. A bright beam of light cuts diagonally across the scene, casting sharp shadows on the red carpet. The foreground is layered red steps with deep saturation and plush texture. The low-angle shot emphasizes her long legs and commanding presence. The lighting creates a strong chiaroscuro effect, with the background fixtures slightly out of focus, adding depth. The mood is intimate yet cinematic, blending fashion, theater, and a private studio shoot. Color palette dominated by red and black, accented by metallic gray and white highlights. The scene feels like a high-end fashion editorial or film still, capturing her most natural yet seductive moment, with sharp focus on her face and body contours, background soft.",
