        {
          "id": "krea2-198b8bbb0715385721a7b8c1",
          "alias": "单女半褪红浴袍雪地忧伤站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A stunning East Asian woman in an exquisite red traditional Hanfu, her long black hair intricately piled high with jeweled hairpins adorned with rubies and gold, a few loose strands framing her delicate face. Her expression is melancholy yet sensual, with deep, smoky eyes lined with kohl, full crimson lips parted slightly, a blush on her porcelain skin. She wears a heavy dark red brocade robe with subtle floral patterns, the collar and cuffs embellished with blue-and-white embroidered trim. The robe is loosely draped, slipping off one shoulder to reveal the smooth curve of her neck and collarbone, the white inner robe barely visible beneath. A wide red sash cinches her waist, tied in an elegant bow, accentuating her slender figure. She stands in a slight three-quarter turn, head tilted, gaze lost in the distance, lips slightly wet. Soft, diffused light from above highlights her facial features and the rich texture of the fabric. The background is a blurred abstract of cool blue and gray tones, evoking misty mountains or snowy landscapes, creating a dreamy atmosphere. The warm red of her attire contrasts starkly with the cool backdrop, drawing focus to her facial expression and the sensuous details of her clothing. The overall effect is a high-end cinematic still, blending classical Chinese elegance with modern erotic undertones, as if captured in a pivotal moment of a forbidden romance.",
