          "alias": "单女束缚浴袍桌边媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sheer pale pink Hanfu sits gracefully at an antique wooden table. Her hair is styled in a high bun adorned with colorful butterflies and red-blue floral ornaments, with two vermillion dots on her forehead. She has delicate features, calm and deep eyes, slightly tilting her head as she gazes forward, her expression gentle yet contemplative. Her sheer outer robe reveals the intricate blue-and-red floral brocade beneath, and her wrists are tied with purple ribbons. Her hands are folded on the table, while the transparent fabric clings to her figure, highlighting the outline of her bare shoulders and the soft curve of her breasts beneath the inner garment. A red silk sash and gray-green embroidered knot cinch her waist. On the table, a celadon plate holds pink-white tangyuan and bright red cherries. The background features dark wooden window frames and blue curtains. Warm sunlight streams in diagonally, casting soft chiaroscuro across her face and clothing, creating a serene, classical ambiance. Medium shot, the subject is slightly left of center, with the foreground food and background window grille forming depth, guiding focus to her serene yet subtly sensual expression. The scene exudes rich Eastern aesthetic, like a moment from a costume drama, detailed, harmonious, poetic, and warm, with the sheer fabric hinting at nudity beneath, adding an adult, NSFW layer to the otherwise modest pose.",
