          "prompt": "A noblewoman sits in a serene courtyard, her elaborate hanfu robe undone and slipped off her shoulders, baring her full breasts and pale skin. Her high, ornate hair bun is adorned with pearls and golden threads, a flower crown atop; a delicate floral mark painted on her forehead. She wears only a sheer, translucent inner robe that leaves her torso exposed, her nipples faintly visible through the gauze. Her gaze is lowered, focused intently on the Go board before her, lips a soft rose, skin luminous like jade. Her hands rest on either side of the board—slim fingers with lightly tinted nails. The dark wooden Go board is scattered with black and white stones; beside it, two intricately woven bamboo stone containers sit with lids half-open. The background reveals classical Chinese garden elements: mossy stone railings, towering pines, lush foliage, and a corner of black-tiled yellow walls. Soft, golden afternoon light filters through, casting dappled shadows across her bare chest and the board. Composition is centered slightly right, with the woman's body and exposed skin as the focal point, the Go board and containers in the foreground, and the layered garden scenery receding. Warm tones of beige, dark green, and brown dominate, with hints of gold. The image has a realistic, photograph-like quality with subtle film grain and natural halation, evoking a classical poetic yet sensual atmosphere.",
