        {
          "id": "krea2-aabb807509d4ced22dac793f",
          "alias": "单女黑短裤城市媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired woman sits on an indoor staircase, wearing a black strappy crop top and high-cut shorts that ride up her thighs, paired with chunky black Martin boots. Her silver-gray hair is slightly wavy, falling naturally over her bare shoulders, catching soft light. She toys with a strand of hair with her right hand, her left resting on her knee, fingers long with pale nail polish and a simple ring. A layered metal chain necklace sits against her collarbone. She stares directly at the camera, lips parted, expression cool and confident, body leaning forward slightly. Her legs are crossed, left over right, boots casting sharp shadows on the floor. The background is a gray marble wall with tiny textured grains, a white switch plate, and a red metal handrail contrasting starkly. The dark stone steps are smooth and reflect faint light. The gray marble floor has irregular speckles. Mid-shot composition, with her centered, head tilted, making intense eye contact. Side lighting creates subtle highlights and shadows on her face, arms, and legs, emphasizing her curves and the sleek outfit. The atmosphere is urban and cool, with a raw, amateur-photography realism, capturing a moment of casual yet deliberate sensuality. The scene feels like an accidental street-style capture, but every detail—from her sultry pose to the modern backdrop—projects confidence, independence, and a bold personal style.",
