        {
          "id": "krea2-246e793f407a1481e0460bbe",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙舞台媚态坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a vanity mirror, wearing a romantic pink feather tulle dress with off-shoulder ruffled straps, layers of sheer fabric cascading in soft, airy folds, the skirt billowing like clouds around her. She has blunt bangs and long, jet-black hair, fair flawless skin, delicate refined features, and bright clear eyes. She tilts her head slightly toward the mirror, her right hand gently cupping her cheek, lips pursed in a playful, kissy expression that exudes sultry innocence. Silver earrings catch the light, shimmering. In the foreground, a dressing table is strewn with cosmetics—lipsticks, powder compacts, eyeshadow palettes, brushes, mascara—some neatly arranged, some scattered, transparent packaging and metal containers reflecting tiny glints, creating rich detail. Midground: her reflection in the mirror. Background: a dim backstage area with staff moving—one in a dark jacket adjusting props or costumes, another holding a camera, distant garment racks with gowns and suitcases, suggesting pre-show preparation. Linear LED light strips on the ceiling cast cool white beams contrasting with warm amber ambient light, slanting down to create soft shadows on her face and skirt, and subtle glares and halos on the mirror’s surface and glass. The composition blends close-up with mirror reflection, the subject slightly right of center, using the mirrored double image to enhance depth. Visual lines flow from her eyes and gesture to the cosmetic foreground, then through the reflection to the backstage scene, weaving a complete narrative. The mood fuses theatrical stage lighting with authentic backstage rawness—both professionally polished and casually intimate. The palette is predominantly pink, accented with black, gray, and metallic touches, creating a dreamy yet real aesthetic, as if capturing a star’s most private, tender moment before going on stage. The image is crisp and lifelike, like a high-res camera shot in low light, with subtle grain and film-like texture, stylish yet warm.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
