        {
          "id": "krea2-d98cf4a92b74edaef8a5d1e4",
          "alias": "单女半褪白外套城市戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands by the window of a modern café, her fluffy off-white coat deliberately slipping off one shoulder to reveal a lace-trimmed bralette beneath, the soft fabric teasing the curve of her breast. She holds a black smartphone in one hand, angling it to capture a sensual selfie, her lips parted in a knowing, gentle smile, eyes half-lidded and luminous. In her other arm, she cradles a bouquet of purple calla lily and pale pink roses wrapped in creamy paper, a silver ribbon trailing. Beside her on the wooden table, a glass of colorful drink and white ceramic teacups catch the warm window light. Natural sunshine from the right streams across her bare shoulder and the floor, casting soft shadows. Behind her, warm hanging lamps glow, and the blurred cityscape adds a romantic backdrop. Orange Hermès and brown paper shopping bags rest at the lower right. The composition focuses tightly on her face and the flowers, with a shallow depth of field, her skin luminous and creamy, the whole scene radiating a quiet, elegant sensuality — an accidental moment of intimate beauty.",
