        {
          "id": "krea2-12edb4219ddcd9636d4988cf",
          "alias": "单女灰外套船上媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a dark bench inside a ferry cabin, her body angled toward a large window. She wears a segmented gray-and-brown jacket over a shiny gold mini skirt that clings to her crossed thighs, her long legs sheathed in elaborate high heels studded with crystals and metal—one foot dangled provocatively. Her right hand holds an open newspaper, the masthead “CHINA DAILY” clearly visible; she gazes down at it with intense, contemplative focus, her slightly parted lips hinting at deep thought. Her deep brown, wavy hair falls over her shoulders, and large gold hoop earrings catch the light. A yellow coffee cup with a white lid rests beside her left hand. Through the broad window, the gray-blue river glitters with ripple, while distant ships and shoreline buildings blur into silhouettes. Warm natural light spills across the wooden floor, casting long diagonal shadows and creating a rich chiaroscuro effect. The composition is medium-shot, with the woman occupying two-thirds of the right frame, leaving the left side open to the expansive window and river view, evoking a sense of spacious solitude. The camera angle is slightly downward, emphasizing the curve of her legs and the delicate detail of her shoes. Color palette is warm brown, gold, and cool gray-blue, with stark temperature contrast. Visual flow begins at the foreground heels and coffee cup, travels up her body to the newspaper, then follows her gaze out the window—a seamless narrative line. The mood is quiet and cinematic, capturing a fleeting, intimate moment of a city traveler lost in thought during an afternoon voyage. The style is hyper-realistic, with visible skin texture, fabric folds, ink gloss on newsprint, and glass reflections, blending everyday authenticity with artistic composition—like a street photograph shot on professional camera, rich in detail and layered storytelling, suffused with poetic sensuality.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
