        {
          "id": "krea2-79913c949b0a07acadb5eeb6",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣沙发微笑坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a sofa by a sunlit window indoors, wearing a soft, fluffy white high-neck sweater dress with sheer translucent sleeves that reveal her bare arms. She crosses her legs—left over right—clad in sleek black over-the-knee boots that hug her thighs tightly, contrasting sharply with the white knit. Her hands gently caress the collar of the sweater, one wrist adorned with a gold bangle, the other with a black-strap watch. She leans slightly sideways, head tilted, gazing softly at the camera with a subtle, inviting smile, her eyes clear and bright. Her hair is wavy, brown-toned, cascading over her shoulders, loose strands framing her face for a lazy, sensual feel. She sits on a beige fabric couch with a cream cushion and a patterned throw pillow. White curtains filter in natural light from the left, casting soft shadows across the fabric, highlighting the knit's texture and curves. The background is blurred, creating an intimate, warm atmosphere. Mid-shot focuses on her body and seated pose, with foreground details of her legs, boots, and a glimpse of the sofa. Composition centers her slightly left, drawing attention to her face and upper body, the overall palette white, cream, and black with warm yellow tones, evoking a cozy, private, everyday sensuality—natural lighting, realistic detail, clean focus, and subtle blur, capturing a quiet, alluring visual experience.",
