        {
          "id": "krea2-45e1019d0f05f35ad84337e7",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman in an exquisite white lace wedding dress, her short silver-white hair softly framing her face, catching a pale pearl-like sheen under soft light. Her eyes are slightly lowered, expression serene yet melancholic, as if lost in her own world. Her makeup is refined, lips pale, skin porcelain-white, giving an ethereal, otherworldly beauty. She wears a delicate white lace gown with a transparent lace corset top, intricate floral patterns, thin straps that accentuate her shoulders and collarbones, and three-dimensional lace embroidery on her bust and waist. The skirt is made of multiple layers of light tulle, flowing and airy, with a high slit on one side revealing a long, sculpted leg, the fabric naturally spreading into smooth curves. She sports long lace gloves extending from wrist to elbow, covered with fine lace motifs matching the dress. Her right hand holds a bouquet of white roses and baby's breath, wrapped in white satin with a graceful bow, held gently in front of her, posture elegant and tender. She stands under an ornate white wrought-iron archway, its intricate curves and openwork designs adorned with hanging strands of crystal-clear white flowers like dew drops. In the background, large white floral installations, possibly fabric or paper sculptures, create a dreamy garden atmosphere. The entire scene is dominated by white, with soft, cool-toned lighting that casts delicate shadows from the left, highlighting the contours of her body and the texture of her clothes, adding depth. Mid-shot composition, the figure positioned slightly right, her body in an S-curve, head tilted slightly, eyes down, creating natural visual flow. Foreground shows partial close-up of the wrought-iron railings with smooth lines, enhancing layering. Background softly blurred to emphasize the subject. The overall mood is serene, romantic, with a hint of mystery, as if she exists in her own white dream. The image has a strong artistic, cinematic quality, like a high-end studio shot with a professional camera and wide aperture, capturing every flow of light and subtle texture. It presents a visually beautiful, storytelling experience with a sensual, NSFW edge.",
