        {
          "id": "krea2-1adf028d1c7ca909b732a4f7",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a classical European interior, her sleek black hair with bangs adorned by two golden rose ornaments and a thin gold headband, falling naturally to her shoulders. Her soft facial features hold a deep, melancholic gaze with reddish-brown eyes, pale skin, and subtle lip color, exuding an aristocratic, cold allure. She wears a complex black off-shoulder dress with wide black leather straps crossing at the shoulders, creating a unique open structure, and a black leather choker-style accent at the chest. A small gold brooch adds detail. Black short leather gloves cover her hands; her right hand grips an ornate golden scepter with a circular top and spiral shaft, while her left hand gently supports its lower part, her stance poised and powerful. She is centered slightly left, body turned slightly, face directly to camera, looking straight ahead with intense visual impact. Full body from head to ankle. Background: warm cream walls with vintage relief patterns and molding, a large crystal chandelier on the right emitting soft warm yellow light, casting dazzling refracted highlights and a hazy glow, enhancing depth and luxury. Another similar chandelier faintly visible in the distance. Composition uses rule of thirds, subject dominant, background slightly blurred. Eye-level angle with slight upward tilt, making her look taller and commanding. Lighting from the right chandelier and possible fill lights, soft and even, creating subtle highlights on face, arms, and dress, with natural shadow gradients for volume. Palette: black, gold, cream. A dramatic, narrative atmosphere, like a frozen ritual of an ancient family, with modern photography quality. Rich detail: silky fabric, smooth leather, metallic scepter, transparent crystal. Gothic and Rococo blend, quiet and mysterious, like a role-play scene and a classical aristocratic portrait. Visual flow guided by her eyes and scepter toward the light source in the background, emphasizing symbolism. Calm and solemn with subtle loneliness and fate, hinting at a tale of power, beauty, and sacrifice. Artistic and epic, inviting immersion.",
