        {
          "id": "krea2-f37e59afcebe7038563e0a85",
          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙霓虹夜景媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the rear seat of a luxury SUV, wearing a richly textured olive-green tweed dress with shimmering gold thread, the fabric catching warm metallic highlights in the dim cabin light. The dress features an asymmetrical cape-like shoulder structure adorned with antique bronze buttons, adding a retro, refined edge. Her legs are crossed high, clad in sheer black stockings that tighten over her smooth thighs, with a sliver of bare skin visible at the ankles. Her hands rest elegantly on her knees, fingers long, nails polished in pale pink French tips. Her deep brown hair falls in soft curls over her shoulders, topped with an ornate black headpiece studded with tiny silver rhinestones and pearls arranged in star patterns, flashing under the light. Her makeup is flawless: smoky pink-purple eyeshadow, sharp eyeliner, voluminous lashes, and natural rose-pink lips. Her gaze meets the lens with a cool, confident detachment, a hint of aloof sensuality in her expression. The interior features glossy black leather seats with fine stitching, silver door handles and control panels, while the windows reflect blurred neon city lights in green, blue, and red. The ceiling has an embedded LED strip emitting soft cool white light. Shot in a mid-angle composition, she sits slightly left of center, body angled, head facing forward, with the camera just below eye level to accentuate her dominance. Lighting comes from the ceiling LEDs and faint urban nightglow through the windows, casting soft shadows across her face and dress, highlighting every texture. The mood is intimate, upscale, and charged with subdued erotic tension—a poised socialite caught in a quiet moment before a night out. The image style blends realism and artistry, as if shot with a high-res full-frame camera and fast lens, capturing the richness of materials and the luxurious yet suggestive atmosphere.",
