        {
          "id": "krea2-3c53d5b46793f5c6b7fb611f",
          "alias": "单女全裸空姐米短裙摄影棚微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young female flight attendant in a cream double-breasted skirt suit sits perched on a black high stool, her dark brown hair pulled back in a tight low bun. Her face is delicate, eyes locked on the lens with a soft, knowing gaze, a subtle smile playing at her lips that blends professional composure with a hint of inviting warmth. Her left hand rests lightly on her right knee, long fingers adorned with a simple silver ring and a black smartwatch on her wrist. Her legs are crossed, sheathed in pale nude stockings that cling to her long, shapely thighs, leading down to nude pointed-toe stilettos that catch the light. The fitted cream jacket is unbuttoned just enough, revealing a crisp white collared blouse with the top button deliberately left open, exposing a hint of cleavage. A vibrant orange silk scarf is tied in an intricate bow at her neck, drawing the eye to the swell of her chest. The background is a smooth light gray wall, textured, with a deep gray carpet underfoot. The camera angle is slightly low, emphasizing her poised, confident frame. Lighting comes from the front-left, soft and even, casting a gentle glow across the subtle curves of her body, highlighting the natural fabric sheen and the faint texture of her skin. The overall tone is a neutral beige and gray palette punctuated by the bright orange, creating a clean, modern studio feel with a hint of casual realism—slight grain, natural skin pores, and the soft reflection of the stockings. The pose exudes a controlled sensuality, as if captured in a quiet moment between duties, her professional demeanor just barely veiling a more alluring edge.",
