        {
          "id": "krea2-1650b51fe624e95394b1df0d",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服户外媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman glides through a moonlit outdoor scene, her sleek black satin off-shoulder gown hugging her curves, a daring high slit exposing a long, toned thigh with every step. Her soft red-brown hair cascades over bare shoulders, wisps brushing her cheek as a breeze stirs, adding a lazy, seductive charm. Her makeup is intense—smoky eyes with sharp liner, full, glossy lips parted slightly, gaze lowered in a quiet, contemplative allure. One hand idly toys with a strand of hair, the other grips a glossy black clutch that catches faint light. The gown's sheer fabric over the slit hints at the skin beneath, and a wide black satin bow at the waist adds a vintage, romantic touch. Her shoes are black patent leather platform heels, thick and commanding, accentuating the length of her legs. She stands against a pale gray brick wall, texture visible, with a tall dark green plant to the right providing contrast; deep shadows on the left add depth. Faint blurred figures in dark coats suggest a red-carpet or fashion event. The composition is a medium shot, slightly off-center right, her body tilted for dynamic energy, camera angle just below eye level to emphasize her legs and heels. Warm yellow light from above left caresses her face and figure, casting soft shadows on the ground, while the dim surroundings keep her as the sole focus. The mood is luxurious, mysterious, and intensely sensual—a captured moment of private elegance turned explicit invitation.",
