          "id": "krea2-8d6eb43ed7a2f0ea7306aba6",
          "alias": "单女透视金高领衫桌边媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors, her brown curly hair partly pinned up with a black hair ornament, the rest falling loose. Her makeup is refined, eyes locked on the viewer, lips slightly pouted in a playful yet lazy expression. She wears a bright yellow turtleneck sweater, fluffy and soft, with fine ribbing at the cuffs and hem, gold embroidery and bead detailing on the shoulders and sleeves adding a touch of luxury. Below, she sports black sequin shorts that shimmer under the light, contrasting with sheer black stockings, her feet in black patent leather loafers adorned with metal studs—a retro yet stylish look. She holds a small black suede handbag with silver metal clasps and a zipper. Positioned slightly right of center, her body leans gently, her left hand resting on a gray metallic liquor cabinet beside her; the cabinet's smooth surface, black trim, and leather handle reveal open bottles and glasses inside. To the left stands a black floor lamp with a white bell-shaped shade casting soft light, next to a dark blue metal side table stacked with books. The background wall is light beige with subtle vertical texture, a gold-framed abstract painting hanging above. The floor features a geometric rug in cream and gray-brown tones. Light streams from the left front, creating soft shadows and a warm, layered atmosphere. Mid-shot composition places the woman as the focal point, her pose subtly curvaceous and inviting, the sequined shorts hugging her hips, the sheer stockings gleaming, her pouty lips and direct gaze carrying a deliberate, seductive edge.",
