        {
          "id": "krea2-ccd0a5612b6c687d56e6976a",
          "alias": "单女黑外套雪地媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a gray stone bench dusted with snow, wearing a thick, black high-neck long coat that is slightly unbuttoned at the top, revealing a hint of pale cleavage and the curve of her collarbone. The coat is tailored, its skirt falling to mid-calf with subtle wrinkled detailing at the cuffs and hem. Her gloved hands rest on her thighs, fingers spread slightly, drawing attention to the sleek black gloves and the shape of her legs. She wears simple black pointed flats, one foot crossed over the other, the hem of the coat hiked up just enough to show a sliver of bare calf above the boot line. Her head is tilted back, eyes half-lidded, gazing upward with a mix of quiet longing and sultry invitation. Dark hair falls loosely over her shoulders, a few strands caught by the wind. Small pearl earrings gleam softly. Beside her on the ground rests a worn brown leather suitcase with scratches and metal clasps, its battered corners telling stories of travel. The background is a blurred winter city street: a fountain sprays mist that freezes into tiny ice crystals, mingling with falling snow, creating a hazy white glow. Behind it, indistinct building outlines and bare trees loom. A black vintage streetlamp stands to the right, its thick post textured with snow. The ground is square cobblestones, partly covered in white. The palette is gray, black, and brown, cold and still. The composition follows the rule of thirds: she sits left-center, body slightly angled, her gaze leading the eye toward the upper right. The foreground is sharp with her figure and the suitcase; the midground holds the stone railing and fountain; the background fades softly. Light is diffuse, overcast, with subtle chiaroscuro on her face and coat, accentuating her curves and the damp gleam on her lips. Snowflakes drift in varied sizes, some crisp, others blurred from motion. The mood is cinematic, charged with anticipation, loneliness, and unspoken desire. The image has a film-grain texture, low saturation, moderate contrast, and a slightly faded vintage filter, as if captured by an amateur camera on a quiet, erotic winter afternoon.",
