        {
          "id": "krea2-47caebf44666d9008038b443",
          "alias": "单女半褪绿毛衣忧伤站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in front of a soft beige backdrop, her long, jet-black hair cascading over her shoulders with natural waves catching the gentle light. Her skin is fair and luminous, with a refined bone structure—sharp cheekbones, a straight nose, and deep, slightly melancholic eyes that hold a hint of longing. Her lips are parted, the lower one caught between her teeth, as if suppressing a quiet plea. She wears a thin, green knit sweater, the fabric clinging to the curves of her torso, with the top two buttons undone to reveal the delicate line of her collarbone and the edge of a white lace-trimmed camisole beneath. The straps are slight, slipping off one shoulder. Her arms are crossed loosely in front of her chest, fingers intertwined, the motion pressing her breasts together and emphasizing their shape. A sleek black smartband wraps around her wrist, its metal accents catching the light. Her body turns slightly to the left, head tilted, gaze drifting just off-camera—a mixture of vulnerability and invitation. The lighting is warm and even, coming from above and in front, casting soft shadows on her skin and the fabric. The background is uncluttered, drawing all focus to her figure. The image has a casual, almost phone-captured feel, with subtle grain and slight color softness that enhances the intimacy. The overall mood is quiet, tense with unspoken desire, the greens and beige creating a calm yet charged atmosphere.",
