        {
          "id": "krea2-55eb123f362ea401cd61b5af",
          "alias": "单女棕背心窗边媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways, her body curving slightly as she glances back over her shoulder at the camera with a soft, inviting gaze. She wears a light blue short-sleeved crop top that cinches above her waist, leaving her slender midriff and the subtle curve of her hips exposed. Over it, a fluffy brown hooded vest hangs open, the hood draping loosely over one shoulder, adding a lazy, warm texture. A blue-and-white striped pleated mini skirt flares around her thighs, its layers lifting just enough to hint at the pale skin beneath, while cream-colored thigh-high socks hug her legs, ending mid-thigh. Her dark hair is swept into a low bun, with a few stray strands falling across her forehead. Her expression is gentle but knowing, lips slightly parted, eyes clear and direct. In her right hand, she holds a light blue smartphone with the iQOO logo visible; the camera module catches the light. She stands slightly right of center, her body tilted, making eye contact with the viewer. The medium shot frames her from head to knee. Behind her, a lived-in room: pale blue and white walls, a large window with sunlight streaming through blinds, casting striped shadows across the floor and wall. To the right, a red electric guitar gleams on a stand, with blurred music gear nearby. A wooden chair and abstract art hang in the soft-focused background. The light is warm morning or afternoon sun from the upper left, softly sculpting her face and body, highlighting the smooth skin of her waist and the delicate fabric of her skirt. The photo has a high-end commercial look with subtle film grain, natural color tones, and a shallow depth of field. The overall mood is intimate, sensual, and effortlessly chic, blending everyday beauty with a hint of tech-lifestyle allure.",
