        {
          "id": "krea2-fe0264c63d3746d1e8870f6d",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙沙发媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in an ornate classical armchair, wearing a sleeveless black dress over a white blouse with the neckline slightly unbuttoned, revealing a pearl necklace resting against her collarbone. Her short hair is neatly swept to one side, makeup natural and refined. She gazes at the camera with a lazy, half-lidded expression, her right hand lightly propping her chin in an elegant, relaxed pose. Her legs are crossed and extended, clad in white over-the-knee stockings and shiny black chunky heel pumps, ankles slightly bent to emphasize the long line of her thighs. The overall style blends vintage and modern, exuding a seductive fashion sense. She sits slightly left of center, body angled to create dynamic balance. The foreground focuses on her full seated figure—facial expression, dress details, hand gesture, and leg posture. In the midground, the armchair is upholstered in gray-blue fabric with gold floral patterns, carved wooden edges, and metal trim. To the right, a matching small table with a dark glass top and carved wooden legs holds a white ceramic vase with a bouquet of pink roses and green leaves. The background wall is off-white, decorated with vertical fluted pillars edged in gold metal strips. Above hangs an ornate crystal chandelier wall sconce in bronze metal, with multiple candle-like bulbs emitting warm yellow light that refracts through crystals, casting soft halos. On the right wall, an abstract painting in a gold frame features pale tones with subtle geometric patterns. The floor is dark brown parquet with visible wood grain and moderate reflection. The whole scene exudes European palace style—elegant and luxurious. Composition follows the rule of thirds: subject on the left third, her gaze leading to the vase and background light. Lighting is warm and soft, mainly from the sconce, creating a dusk interior effect with gentle chiaroscuro on her face, fabric folds, and furniture surfaces. Shadows are deep but not harsh. Color palette: warm yellow, cream, gold, with black and white accents for contrast. The atmosphere is quiet, noble, and subtly intimate. Image quality is film-like, with high detail, slight lens distortion and grain for realism, captured as if by a high-end mirrorless or film camera, blending high-class elegance with a candid, everyday moment.",
