        {
          "id": "krea2-ceaa8333bcfbdb73c8c7de1d",
          "alias": "单女半褪灰毛衣床媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on a sleek modern bed, her soft grey knit dress clinging to her curves, the matching cardigan slipping off one shoulder to reveal bare skin and a delicate chain necklace. Her brown wavy hair tumbles over the pillow, catching warm light, while transparent-frame glasses perch on her nose, a hint of reflection hiding a knowing gaze. She parts her lips slightly, one hand resting on a crumpled fashion magazine, her pink-polished fingers tracing the pages as if lost in thought—or invitation. The magazine is open to \"Bonjour, Qi\" and \"Brand Vision\" with glossy product shots; its edges curl, adding a tactile, intimate feel. Beside her, a silver metallic handbag gleams, its cool sheen contrasting with the soft white bedding and plush pillows. On the bedside table, a retro telephone and a milk-glass globe lamp cast a low, sultry light. The room is pale grey and white, minimalist yet warm. She leans back slightly, the knit dress riding up her thigh, exposing the curve of her hip. Her gaze meets the camera with a quiet, knowing intensity—caught in a moment of private indulgence. The framing is tight, 50mm f/2.8, with shallow depth of field, soft natural and artificial light sculpting her face and body. Full-frame grain lends a filmic, sensuous realism.",
