        {
          "id": "krea2-6243bd8f51e14c08b1cfedfc",
          "alias": "单女兔女郎黑连体衣舞台戏谑站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sleek black satin bunny girl bodysuit stands center stage, a pair of tall black velvet bunny ears atop her head, her long black hair cascading over her shoulders and chest, glossy strands catching the light, a few wisps brushing her cheek, adding a teasing touch. Her makeup is flawless—smoky eyes with sharp liner, full red lips curved in a confident, seductive smile. She raises her right hand, index and middle fingers extended in a \"call me\" gesture, a white French cuff shining at her wrist; her left hand rests on her hip, body slightly tilted to emphasize her elegant curves and long, bare legs. She wears black high heels, fine ankle lines exposed. The foreground centers on her, sharp and clear. The midground is a dark reflective stage floor, mirroring her silhouette and scattered light spots, enhancing depth and realism. The background features a massive red LED screen with faint blue text reading \"THE 3RD MINI ALBUM\" and blurred shapes, a slight grain and noise giving a live-event feel. A black stage spotlight on the right points toward her, emitting a weak white glow. The composition is symmetrical, her gaze direct, visual flow from her face along her gesture down her body to her legs and heels. Lighting comes from front and above, bright and even, casting soft shadows on her side and the floor, enhancing volume. The warm red background light contrasts with her black outfit, creating a hot, dynamic, slightly mysterious atmosphere. High color saturation in black, red, white, with skin and metallic sheen—a classic entertainment scene. The image feels like a perfectly captured moment of a carefully staged performance, detailed and natural, as if taken with a high-end camera under stage lights, full of narrative and visual appeal.",
