        {
          "id": "krea2-13afa9060b1b778c9350aef7",
          "alias": "单女粉毛衣摄影棚媚态倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a half-body portrait, with fair, delicate skin and finely sculpted features. Her deep brown hair is tied into a high ponytail secured with a pink ruffled scrunchie, strands falling naturally with a few loose hairs at the roots for realism. She wears a soft light pink long-sleeve knit top over a matching camisole, the fabric clinging to her curves, accentuating her breasts and waist, creating a cozy yet sensual homey feel. Her right hand gently holds a pink tube cosmetic product, her long, slender fingers with neatly trimmed nails resting in a relaxed pose. Her gaze soft and inviting, looking slightly left of frame, eyes clear and bright with a hint of thoughtful allure, head slightly tilted, revealing an elegant profile. Medium close-up composition, the figure occupying the right-center of the frame, leaning slightly forward, creating an intimate and focused atmosphere. The foreground blurs the edge of a gray object, possibly a desk or camera equipment, adding realistic everyday context. Background is a clean soft pink-to-gray gradient wall, no clutter, making the subject stand out. Lighting is soft and even from front-left, casting natural shadows, highlighting the translucent quality of her skin and the three-dimensionality of her features. Overall color palette is pastel pink with warm beige tones, giving a sweet, warm, slightly artistic vibe. Shot with a wide aperture for bokeh, moderate background blur preserving depth of field, focus on her face and hand. Color saturation is balanced, natural and true. Image texture is rich and detailed, resembling a high-quality studio photograph with slight film grain and soft depth-of-field effect, blending commercial beauty with everyday life. The atmosphere is calm, healing, gently erotic, conveying a tender moment of daily sweetness, simple yet layered composition, harmonious light and color, exuding a relaxed, girlish, intimate slice of life.",
