        {
          "id": "krea2-97250b5db708793f51853537",
          "alias": "单女黑和服微笑站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an elegant black kimono adorned with purple-pink peonies, her gentle smile warm and inviting, eyes clear and luminous fixed on the viewer. Her light brown hair is swept into a graceful updo accented with small white blossoms, soft bangs framing her face. Flawless makeup with vivid red lips contrasting her pale skin. She wears a plush white fur stole over her shoulders, one hand lightly touching the fur, the other lifting the kimono sleeve. Her body is slightly turned, the kimono slipping just enough to hint at the curve of her neck and collarbone. Behind her, traditional shoji doors cast a soft warm backlight, the wooden frames glowing. Mid-shot composition, she stands slightly left of center, the light spilling through the paper screens creating a gentle rim light that caresses her silhouette. The fur catches delicate highlights; the overall palette blends deep purple, pink, white, and warm wood tones. A quiet, intimate atmosphere, as if captured by an amateur camera with subtle film grain and natural color shifts, evoking a sensual, timeless moment of classical beauty and quiet desire.",
