        {
          "id": "krea2-97e885f5c56f9000eea5cb6b",
          "alias": "单女蓝内衣健身房媚态站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before the gym mirror, her toned body wrapped in a light blue sports bra and matching high-waist leggings that cling to every curve. Her black hair cascades in soft waves, catching the light as she poses side-on, phone in hand for a selfie. One hand rests on the metal frame of a Pilates machine, body tilted forward, ass pushed back slightly, creating a sleek silhouette. Her lips part, eyes half-lidded with a hint of lust as she studies her reflection. The mirror captures her full figure, sweat-sheened skin, and the subtle outline of abs and thighs. Soft natural light filters through white vertical blinds, mixing with cool LED strips overhead. The gym floor is wooden, scattered with Pilates reformers, one draped with a black jacket. The warm, intimate atmosphere feels like a stolen moment of self-admiration, the camera lens slightly distorting the edges, adding a raw, real-life sensuality. The composition centers her off-left, her gaze and phone leading the eye through the mirror to the equipment and window, creating a loop of visual desire. The muted blues, creams, and wood tones keep it clean yet charged with unspoken tension, capturing the everyday beauty of a fit, confident woman.",
