          "id": "krea2-3f62aa648199c8f173d24115",
          "alias": "单女全裸米西装办公室媚态跪脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a beige power suit kneels beside vintage luggage, her bright blue silk blouse unbuttoned to reveal a hint of cleavage and the delicate curve of her collarbone. She half-crouches, one hand gripping the red leather handle of a retro trunk, the other resting casually on a white case, her posture poised yet inviting. Her short brown hair is swept back, a blue clip catching the light, and her gaze locks directly onto the lens with a knowing, seductive confidence. Full lips, flawless skin, and a polished office-glam look accentuated by pale nude stockings and white stiletto heels. The scene is set in an airport lobby—low-angle shot emphasizes her height and dominant presence. Left front: a deep red leather trunk; center: white case with metal corners; right: weathered brown suitcase. Background: light gray and wood-paneled wall, black flight board listing cities. Lighting from left front, soft and even, shadows gentle. Colors: beige, blue, red, brown—vivid and harmonious. Her suit jacket drapes open, silk blouse catching the light, hinting at the shape beneath. Everything exudes a polished commercial photography feel, but with a raw, sensual energy that makes her the undeniable focal point—a modern professional woman whose poised exterior barely conceals her carnal allure.",
