        {
          "id": "krea2-c16dda3888765457be4c367e",
          "alias": "单女透视灰外套城市媚态站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands by stone steps at night, wearing a fluffy light gray fur coat that's slightly open to reveal a black lace-trimmed tight crop top and a dark ruffled mini skirt, her black sheer stockings and tall black leather boots accentuating long legs, a red chain bag slung across her body. Her hair is in a sleek bun, gold earrings catching the warm yellow side light; she smirks directly at the camera, one hand resting on a black metal spike railing, the other hand lifting to spread her fingers as if feeling the cool air, her expression confident and inviting. The coat's edge brushes against her thigh, skirt riding up to expose a hint of garter belt. Background: a building with diamond-pattern tiles bathed in amber glow, red-brown brick paving in herringbone pattern, cinematic depth of field with blurred architectural details. Composition follows rule of thirds, railing lines guiding the eye toward her relaxed yet sensual stance. Lighting is warm, side-lit, creating deep shadows on one side of her body, highlighting the curve of her hip and the sheen of her stockings. Overall mood: intimate, nostalgic, with a film grain and low saturation, capturing a private moment of urban nightlife where her parted lips and raised hand invite the viewer into the frame. The scene feels both elegant and deliberately provocative, the red bag drawing focus as she tilts her chin up, eyes half-lidded, exuding a quiet, self-assured sexuality.",
