        {
          "id": "krea2-50bc6926402e37c140eccf96",
          "alias": "单女透视黑毛衣霓虹夜景忧伤坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the back seat of a luxury sedan, her glossy black hair cascading over her shoulders, catching the soft interior light. Her delicate features are sharply defined, porcelain skin flawless, eyes deep and melancholy as she stares directly at the camera, lips slightly parted in a sensual pout. She rests her chin on one hand, long fingers perfectly manicured, the other hand idly stroking her thigh. She wears a tight black ribbed knit top emblazoned with white \"PRADA MILANO\" lettering, fabric hugging her curves, paired with ripped light-blue denim shorts that show off smooth skin and a hint of hip. Black sheer stockings cling to her long legs, one crossed over the other, muscle tone visible. On her feet are chunky black leather boots with metal buckles, glossy and heavy. The car’s cream leather interior is plush, with stitched seats and a futuristic dashboard glowing with ambient lights. Through the window, blurred city nightlife—neon signs, car streaks—creates a dreamy backdrop. The close-up composition has her slightly angled, head tilted, making intimate eye contact. Soft top lighting mixes with street glow, casting dramatic shadows across her body, highlighting the curves of her breasts and hips. The mood is quiet, private, charged with a subtle loneliness and sexual tension. She exudes a modern urban woman’s confident, independent, yet vulnerable allure—a stolen moment of nighttime introspection, captured with high-end photographic realism.",
