        {
          "id": "krea2-6b9bc665c16699bb55cabd68",
          "alias": "单女银连衣裙街道忧伤站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman stands elegantly sideways in the center frame, her long, wavy light golden hair cascading with scattered tiny light spots and rainbow halo effects, a massive black rose adorning her updo—its matte petals layered and velvety, contrasting sharply with her pale skin. She wears a silver-gray sequin dress covered in dense shimmering particles arranged like newspaper collage art, faintly revealing the English phrase \"MY UFO NIGHTMARE\" along with blurred silhouettes and graffiti-style lines—a post-modern street art vibe. The thin straps expose her smooth shoulders; she lowers her head slightly, eyes downcast, lips parted in a melancholic, contemplative expression. Her right hand gently holds a large, delicate black rose with a thin stem and deep black leaves, echoing the flower in her hair. Composition is center-right, with the figure dominating the frame. On the left, a black-and-white minimalist Polaroid photo shows the same woman in a different outfit—black clothing, relaxed pose—with \"970211\" printed below. On the right, another Polaroid captures her sitting on a couch surrounded by plush toys, with \"XOXO\" handwritten at the edge. Above, artistic text reads \"HAPPY B-DAY ROSÉ\" with \"ROSÉ\" in bold capitals, while \"ROSE\" appears in a hand-lettered style with star decorations and a black four-point star symbol. The entire image has a clean white background, creating a pure, high-end visual feel. Large black letters \"F\" and \"S\" partially overlap the figure, integrated into the background to form a strong graphic composition, enhancing design and brand identity. Lighting is exquisite: a soft, even main source from the left front illuminates her face, arms, and skirt, producing subtle highlights and shadows that give a three-dimensional effect, while her hair and sequins sparkle like stars, adding a dreamy atmosphere. Rainbow light spots and lens flares of various sizes—round and streak-shaped—are scattered around the figure and background, mimicking real camera optical effects to boost realism and artistry. The composition uses diagonal leading and spatial layering: foreground with the figure and held rose, midground with Polaroids and text, background with large white areas and abstract letter structures. Visual flow begins from the top-left text, naturally leads to the main subject, then moves down to the photos and bottom info. The overall tone blends fashion, art, and personal emotion. Color palette is mostly black, white, and gray, accented with gold, silver, and rainbow light effects, creating a stark cool-warm contrast that evokes both calmness and romance. The image texture is fine and detailed, with professional photography and post-production quality, yet retains a casual, everyday amateur feel—as if capturing a moment of inspiration in a private space, authentic and moving. The dress's low neckline and thin straps hint at bare skin, and her slightly parted lips and downcast eyes suggest a sensual vulnerability, making the scene subtly NSFW.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
