        {
          "id": "krea2-da98359ce5f48a907327c591",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉连衣裙床害羞坐张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a bed with white sheets, wearing a light pink sleeveless dress with brown spots—the top pulled open to expose her bare breasts, waist cinched with pleats, A-line skirt bunched high on her thighs. Her long wavy dark hair spills over her shoulders, skin flushed and dewy. She plays a silver flute, hands gripping the body, fingers pressing keys sensually, eyes half-lidded and intense, lips slightly parted and wet near the mouthpiece. Her right leg is bent, left leg stretched out, clad in black knee-high socks and grey sneakers with white logo, one sneaker dangling off her toes. The relaxed pose becomes provocative as the skirt rides up, revealing the tops of her thighs and the edge of her underwear. Foreground: extreme close-up of her face, chest, and flute glistening with saliva. Midground: rumpled bed sheets and her spread legs. Background: dark blue wall with soft light spots, a cylindrical object (possibly a speaker) on the right. Lighting from above-left casts dramatic shadows, highlighting the shine on her skin, the metal of the flute, and the dampness of her lips. Centered composition, the flute points up toward her mouth, guiding the viewer's gaze to her expression of musical ecstasy. Atmosphere: erotic, intimate, still yet charged. Color palette: cool blue shadows and warm pink highlights, high-contrast, magazine-photo quality with slight grain and shallow depth of field, merging modern fashion with classical music and raw sensuality.",
