        {
          "id": "krea2-7810b9cbbf47f4090406a421",
          "alias": "单女蓝背心城市媚态站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A woman in a tight deep-blue sleeveless top and matching high-waisted athletic shorts stands on a wooden deck, her back to the camera. Black compression stockings and light-blue platform sneakers complete the outfit. White baseball cap and black mask cover her head and face; shoulder-length dark brown hair falls naturally. She slightly turns her body, right hand hanging loosely, left hand resting on her hip — a relaxed, sensual pose. The tight fabric clings to her curves, emphasizing her athletic yet feminine form. In the midground, a modern TRX GYM building with black metal frames and large glass panels reflects the sky. Yellow \"TRX GYM\" letters and stripes adorn the roof. Green artificial turf and gray wicker sofas with beige cushions create a leisure area. The background shows a vast sky with layered gray-to-deep-blue clouds, suggesting early evening or dawn. Soft, cool scattered light from above casts subtle shadows on her back, hair, and clothes, highlighting her physique. Warm yellow light from inside the building contrasts with the cool exterior. Low-angle shot elongates her legs, emphasizing her proportions. Wooden deck planks show fine texture and slight reflections, hinting at recent rain. The scene merges urban fitness culture with natural surroundings, capturing a candid yet magazine-quality moment. Dominant colors: blue, black, yellow, brown. The visual line from her body to the gym sign and then to the distant skyline creates a flowing, balanced composition. The overall mood is sensual, confident, and health-oriented.",
