          "prompt": "A woman in a pale lavender satin strapless gown sits elegantly on an antique carved reddish-brown leather sofa, her long black curly hair cascading over bare shoulders, a delicate black net veil partially obscuring her face, adding mystery and vintage allure. She turns slightly, looking back with deep, sensual eyes, lips slightly parted, as if lost in a distant memory. Her right hand, clad in a dark long glove, rests lightly on the sofa arm, fine metal chains glinting at the wrist. The dress's low neckline reveals the swell of her breasts and the smooth curve of her collarbone, her body forming a natural S-curve that accentuates her slender waist and hips. The voluminous pink satin skirt pools on the floor, rich folds catching the light. In the midground, the ornately carved Baroque high-back sofa features tufted diamond-button leather and heart-shaped motifs. The deep red wallpaper behind is patterned with subtle geometric designs, evoking a royal vintage boudoir. Soft warm light from the left front creates dramatic chiaroscuro on her skin, the glossy satin, and the polished leather, highlighting every sensual curve. Slight film grain and soft bokeh add an intimate, realistic texture, as if captured by an old camera in a private antique room. The scene blends luxury, elegance, mystery, and raw sensuality—a cinematic, narrative-driven portrait with a touch of vintage eroticism.",
