        {
          "id": "krea2-6af581b841b7eadfd1e4243c",
          "alias": "单女半褪白围巾楼梯媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman stands by a vintage wooden staircase railing, draped in an elegant white fur shawl that slips slightly off one shoulder, revealing the curve of her collarbone and a hint of bare skin. Her long black hair cascades smoothly over her shoulders, adorned with delicate pearl hair clips. She wears small pearl stud earrings and a multi-layer pearl necklace that rests against her décolletage. Her gaze is lowered, lips slightly parted, with a soft, contemplative expression. Her right hand holds a cream silk handbag with gold metal clasp and pearl tassels, while her left hand rests lightly on the dark carved wooden railing. The background features warm interior lighting, deep brown wood paneling with gold trim and浮雕 details. Soft warm yellow light falls from above, creating rich shadows and highlights on her face and the fur shawl. Mid-shot composition, body slightly turned, shallow depth of field blurs the background. The lighting comes from upper right, casting subtle, sensual shadows across her figure. Overall warm tones of brown, cream, pearl, and black, evoking a timeless, luxurious yet erotic film still. The fur shawl clings to her frame, hinting at the silhouette beneath, and the pose exudes a quiet, seductive sensuality.",
