        {
          "id": "krea2-99b306d9710d9d2c3a8975ef",
          "alias": "单女蓝衬衫酒店媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the edge of a hotel bed, wearing a light blue long-sleeve shirt with the collar wide open, revealing a deep V-neckline and a white lace bralette beneath. Her white high-waist short skirt rides up slightly, showcasing long, toned thighs, and she wears beige pointed-toe heels with delicate lace detailing. Her black hair falls naturally, strands brushing her cheek, her gaze locked directly on the lens with lips parted in a sultry, confident expression. Her hands rest casually on the bed and her thighs, body leaning forward, a mix of relaxed composure and sexual tension. The modern minimalist hotel room features light brown wood paneling, a neatly made bed with crisp white sheets and pillows, a deep purple upholstered headboard, a red accent chair, and a geometric red-gray carpet. Warm yellow light streams from the upper left, casting soft shadows across her face, arms, and legs, accentuating skin texture and clothing details. Medium shot, subject slightly off-center left, body angled diagonally, focus on her face and upper chest, background softly blurred. The palette is dominated by blue and white with warm yellow and red accents—a cool-warm contrast that feels both intimate and stylish, as if a candid yet perfectly framed moment captured by a professional camera, rich in detail, realism, and erotic, artistic tension.",
