        {
          "id": "krea2-8bb61908e1c2a37fb0a092a2",
          "alias": "单女米浴袍酒店媚态坐喝",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a soft cream bathrobe, loosely tied and slipping open to reveal the curve of her breasts and a hint of bare skin, sits at a round table in a luxurious hotel room, elegantly sipping from a fine bone china teacup. Her dark hair is pinned in a low bun, small pearl earrings and a thin red string bracelet adorn her, expression serene and relaxed. She holds half a buttered croissant in one hand, body turned slightly toward the window, exuding a lazy morning sensuality. The table is covered in a crisp white cloth, laden with a lavish French breakfast: a basket of golden, flaky croissants, pain au chocolat, and baguette slices; a bowl of fresh strawberries and blueberries; a glass of orange juice glowing in the warm light; silver cutlery neatly arranged, catching gentle reflections. In the midground, floor-to-ceiling windows frame a hazy but unmistakable view of the Eiffel Tower in the distance, the Parisian skyline soft in the morning haze. Heavy gold velvet curtains with tassels are half-drawn, sheer white curtains letting in diffused sunlight, creating layered light and shadow. On the left wall, a vintage botanical print in a wooden frame, beside it a classic table lamp with a cream fabric shade emitting a warm yellow glow. The room's palette is cream, gold, and light brown, with cream walls, delicate plaster moldings, a carved ceiling border, and a patterned carpet. The composition centers the woman slightly right, using the window as a natural frame, drawing the eye from the breakfast details in the foreground, to her relaxed, subtly exposed form, to the distant Eiffel Tower. Lighting is from the right, natural sunlight filtered through curtains, creating soft chiaroscuro. Overall mood is warm, tranquil, luxurious, and intimate, blending art-photography quality with a daguerreotype-like grain and realistic exposure, evoking a nostalgic yet modern aesthetic with a sensual, lingering gaze.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
