        {
          "id": "krea2-ce44d602f9c78088470e3203",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙镜前戏谑自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman takes a risqué mirror selfie indoors, wearing a revealing black-and-white plaid off-shoulder dress with ruffled short sleeves and a high-waist pleated mini skirt that barely covers her thighs. Her long black hair cascades naturally, strands teasingly draped over her bare shoulder. She holds a white smartphone in her right hand, the camera angled low to capture her body, while her left hand rests on her hip, gold bracelet and rings catching the light. A small black leather crossbody bag with metal buckle accents hangs at her side. She wears black ankle boots with metal buckle detailing, the short heels adding a subtle lift. Her posture is relaxed yet seductive, body slightly turned toward the mirror, head tilted down as she gazes at the screen through half-lidded eyes with a sultry pout. The background is a soft beige wall with smooth texture, warm diffused lighting from the front-left casts a soft shadow behind her, accenting her curves. The wood floor reflects a gentle sheen. The frame includes the edge of a dark door or mirror frame on the left. The composition is a mid-shot full body, focusing on her figure, with subtle film grain and realistic smartphone camera artifacts, giving it a raw, intimate, everyday voyeuristic feel.",
