          "alias": "单女金连衣裙窗边媚态坐张开双腿",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits indoors in a figure-hugging bright yellow tube dress, the fabric slick and taut against her curves with natural creases, a simple thin strap accentuating her collarbones and bare shoulders. Her long black hair falls in soft waves, catching warm light. She wears matching yellow circular earrings that dangle playfully. She leans slightly to one side, her head resting on her hand, eyes locked on the camera with a confident, sultry gaze, lips parted in a faint, knowing smile. One hand rests on her thigh, fingers long and polished, a gold bracelet glinting at her wrist. Her legs are spread, body leaning forward, the dress riding up to reveal smooth, bare thighs. White minimal heels peek from under the hem. The front plane of the image captures her face and décolletage, skin radiant and dewy, makeup sharp—lined eyes, full lips. Midground shows her torso and parted thighs. Background is a soft-focus interior with a wooden cabinet to the left and a dark doorframe to the right, warm light streaming from a window, creating a halation around her silhouette. The composition is centered slightly left, the yellow dress glowing against the dim surroundings, enhancing her form. The scene feels intimate, luxurious yet casual, as if captured with a wide-aperture lens, emphasizing texture on skin and fabric, the tension between modesty and exposure.",
