        {
          "id": "krea2-294ad2abdd836636eadeb296",
          "alias": "单女短裤泳池媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges on a woven rattan pool chair, her black long-sleeve high-neck cropped top unzipped to reveal her toned midriff and a sheer hint of skin. She wears high-waist printed shorts with abstract geometric patterns in cream, tan, and black, paired with black flat sandals featuring orange and black geometric accents. Her dark hair is pulled back in a high ponytail with blunt bangs, her makeup natural with soft lips. She gazes directly at the camera with a subtle, seductive smile, her right hand lifting to brush her hair, her left resting casually at her side. Her legs are crossed, emphasizing their long, lean lines. The scene is a poolside with a matching geometric cushion and rattan furniture in the foreground, a calm pool with shimmering water in the midground, and a white wall with blue-green tiles in the background. Gray marble flooring is wet and reflective. Low-angle side shot, subject slightly left, asymmetrical but balanced composition. Overcast diffuse light creates soft shadows, highlighting her smooth skin and the natural folds of her clothing. The overall palette is cool grays, black, and white, with warm pops from the shorts and sandals, evoking a sophisticated, sensual urban resort aesthetic. The image is sharp, detailed, and realistic, as if captured with a professional camera, blending casual spontaneity with deliberate erotic tension.",
