        {
          "id": "krea2-768ee11b2d631ed86c895b88",
          "alias": "单女空姐白衬衫机场媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A female flight attendant in a tight white short-sleeve blouse with the top buttons undone, revealing deep cleavage, and a form-fitting black pencil skirt that hugs her curves, stands confidently in the center of a modern airport hall. Her dark hair is slicked back into a neat bun, exposing her delicate features and a sultry, knowing smile. Her bright eyes lock onto the camera with a blend of professional poise and seductive invitation. One hand rests lightly on the handle of a black rolling suitcase, the other hangs loosely at her side, fingers barely curled, a pink watch catching the light on her wrist. A black leather handbag is slung diagonally across her body. She steps forward with her left foot, her hips canted slightly, creating an elegant, sexually charged dynamic. A plush rabbit keychain dangles from the suitcase, adding a playful, innocent contrast. Behind her, the vast airport lobby glows with sleek linear lights, the gray polished stone floor reflecting the scene. Distant travelers shuffle past, their forms blurred. A \"PREMIUM\" sign glows on an overhead display. The camera captures her from a medium distance, off-center to the right, with the suitcase and floor texture filling the left frame. Soft, diffuse overhead light sculpts the curves of her body, casting subtle shadows that emphasize her waist and bust. The atmosphere is a fusion of corporate polish and raw sensuality, the cold tones of white and black punctuated by the warm pink of her watch and keychain. Every detail—from the slight wrinkle of her blouse to the slick shine of the floor—whispers a narrative of a woman in command, both of the terminal and of the desire she awakens.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
