        {
          "id": "krea2-dc264f50138a17209b0ce10e",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣摄影棚媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A female photographer in a tight gray high-neck sleeveless knit top stands in soft indoor light, her dark brown hair naturally wavy, a small black clip and pearl earrings accenting her look. She is slightly turned, her gaze focused and contemplative to the left, lips parted, conveying a blend of professional calm and hidden desire. Her hands grip a black Canon DSLR with a telephoto lens, but her body language is sensual—the tight top clings to her curves, her deep red nail polish visible as her finger rests near the shutter. A silver bracelet wraps her wrist. The mid-shot composition centers her slightly right, body tilted, head turned, creating dynamic tension. The background is blurred: left side has slatted light from blinds, warm golden tones; right side is cool blue ambient light, creating a dramatic warm-cool contrast. Vague clothing racks and furniture soften into bokeh. Foreground details are sharp: the texture of the knit top, her skin's subtle sheen, the camera's metallic finish. Light sculpts her shoulders and arms, enhancing her form. The shallow depth of field locks focus on her and the camera, but the overall vibe is intimate and charged—a quiet moment between shoots that hints at vulnerability and arousal. Color palette: gray-blue, warm gold, black, white, with red nail polish accents. Cinematic film-grain quality, as if shot with a full-frame camera and fast lens. The setting feels like a private studio, the lighting intentional, evoking a blend of warmth and detachment—professional yet sexually confident.",
