        {
          "id": "krea2-c039a93015737a4bd0ad56b0",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣摄影棚忧伤坐持相机",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the corner of a dark gray fabric sofa, her body leaning back slightly, head resting on a thick cushion. She wears a red knitted cardigan open over a white dress, the hem riding up to reveal her slender ankles and bare skin. Her feet are bare on a tan-striped rug. Her right hand gently holds a classic ceramic lamp with a blue-gray base, gold metal fittings, and a warm ivory pleated shade that casts soft, glowing light across her face and cleavage. Her long hair falls naturally, topped with a red bow. Her eyes are downcast toward the camera, lips parted, expression melancholy and vulnerable. Her left hand rests on her thigh, posture relaxed yet with a hint of restraint. Behind her, a dark wall and part of the sofa. On the floor to her right lie a pair of white high heels. The composition is mid-shot, subject slightly right, lamp prominent in the foreground as the main focal point. Lighting is warm yellow from the lamp, creating a cozy yet lonely atmosphere, with soft shadows draping left across the floor and sofa. The palette is warm yellow, gray-blue, and red—contrasting yet harmonious. The scene feels cinematic and story-driven, like a quiet, intimate solo moment late at night. Shot in a professional studio environment with a wide-aperture prime lens, shallow depth of field, natural blur, sharp details, and rich texture, blending artistic beauty with realism. Suggest sensual embrace of the loneliness, hinting at bare skin and subtle exposure under the open cardigan.",
