        {
          "id": "krea2-26249f6c39fa56bae36dfd39",
          "alias": "单女空姐蓝衬衫纯色背景媚态坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A female flight attendant in a light blue silk blouse and cream high-waist pencil skirt sits gracefully on a simple white cube. Her deep brown hair is pinned up with a white bow, professional yet sensual. She sits slightly turned, left leg crossed over right, right hand resting on the cube's edge, left hand near her thigh—fingers long with a simple ring. Black pointed high heels accentuate her long legs. Her expression is warm, eyes clear, looking directly at the camera with a flirtatious hint. The top buttons of her blouse are undone, revealing a hint of cleavage. The sheer silk clings to her curves, the pencil skirt hugs her hips and thighs. Her hand lightly traces her own leg. Minimalist light gray gradient background, no distractions. Soft frontal lighting highlights her face, the silky sheen of the blouse, and the subtle shadow between her thighs. The pose is poised yet inviting, combining professional elegance with a subtle, alluring undertone.",
