          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a pink carousel horse, wearing a tight black cropped top that reveals her midriff and low-rise green drawstring shorts that cling to her hips, the side logo barely visible. She wears a grey knitted cat-ear beanie with a white Fila logo, her long wavy dark brown hair cascading over her shoulders. Her head is tilted down, eyes half-lidded as she gently strokes the cat ears of the hat with her fingertips, a soft, sensual smirk playing on her lips. The background is a blurred metallic wall with cool reflections; above, the golden columns and pink canopy of the carousel show geometric yellow and orange patterns. Soft side lighting highlights the curves of her body, the folds of her shorts, and the glossy texture of her beanie. The composition places her slightly left of center, body leaning forward naturally, the pink carousel forming a strong foreground leading to her. The color palette is pink, grey, green with gold accents, creating a nostalgic yet sexy amusement-park vibe. The image feels like a candid, intimate moment, with subtle film grain and natural shadows, emphasizing her youthful allure and quiet confidence.",
