          "alias": "单女银旗袍城市媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A stunning woman in a silver sequin cheongsam stands at the corner of a beige stone wall. Her black hair is swept into an elegant vintage updo, makeup bold with heavy eyeliner and full, glossy lips. Her cold, modern face stares directly at the camera with a confident, slightly aloof expression. The high-collar sleeveless cheongsam hugs her curves tightly, the dense diamond-shaped sequins shimmering like metallic scales under the light, outlining every contour of her body—her breasts, waist, and hips clearly defined. A thick dark woven necklace adds a touch of luxury and depth. She holds a small black beaded purse in her left hand, right hand hanging naturally, wearing a wide silver bracelet and multiple rings. The background is a simple horizontal stone wall with two classical black iron sconces on either side, their six-sided lamps casting warm yellow light from above, illuminating her face and the wall, creating dramatic chiaroscuro. Medium shot, figure slightly turned to the right, head facing the camera, forming a stable focal point. The warm light spills over her shoulders, catching the sequins and making them sparkle like scattered stars. The overall palette is silver-gray, beige, and black, accented by warm yellow, creating a cold, glamorous urban night vibe. The tight cheongsam emphasizes her sensual figure, the fabric taut across her chest and hips, hinting at the body beneath. Her confident gaze and poised stance radiate an inviting yet untouchable allure, blending traditional elegance with modern erotic sophistication.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
