        {
          "id": "krea2-8e8139f7e481852b796c7851",
          "alias": "单女银礼服摄影棚媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman stands with her back to the camera, turning to glance over her shoulder. Her long golden silk hair cascades down, adorned with delicate floral ornaments and gold chain details, the ends slightly curled, catching warm light. Her makeup is heavy and layered—arched brows, sultry eyes with metallic shadow and winged liner, thick lashes, and full crimson lips curved in a teasing half-smile. She wears a silver-white silk off-shoulder gown, the fabric smooth and luminous, with thin black spaghetti straps that contrast against the pale dress. One strap slips slightly, hinting at bare shoulder and collarbone. The gown drapes in flowing folds, clinging to her waist and hips. Her right arm hangs naturally, holding a handful of dried wheat stems; the left is hidden. Her body tilts in a graceful S-curve, pose elegant and relaxed. Behind her, a vivid red fabric backdrop printed with large floral patterns in deep crimson and blue, edges soft, creating a vintage opulent feel. To the left, pink feather decorations appear, fluffy and layered, complementing the dress. Close-up composition: figure fills frame, head on the right, body curving, gaze directed toward camera, inviting and sensual. Light from front-left creates bright highlights on face, shoulders, and hair, with soft shadows on the right side and gown. Overall atmosphere: luxurious, dreamlike, with a touch of retro art. Saturated colors—red, white, gold, with black and blue accents—high contrast, strong visual impact. Rich detail, realistic texture, as if a high-end studio portrait, blending artistic beauty with commercial appeal. Her wet lips part slightly, a glistening sheen on bare skin, adding an intimate, NSFW edge.",
