        {
          "id": "krea2-14868eb65102ab3db1700b69",
          "alias": "单女精灵绿外套高塔媚态蹲摆拍",
          "prompt": "Nightfall over Tokyo Tower: the steel giant glows like burning metal, its grid-like framework etched in warm orange light, signal lamps piercing the thin mist. The sky bleeds deep crimson and violet-gray, an apocalyptic cyberpunk aura. In the foreground, a woman crouches low on the wet asphalt—black blunt-cut bob, sharp elf ears, cold green eyes catching the glow. She wears a light green jacket with white fur trim over a tight red-and-black bodysuit that clings to every curve, leather straps and metal buckles at shoulder and waist. Arm guards with red accents, high gray-white combat boots with red ankle details, her right knee bared by torn black stockings revealing smooth thigh. In her right hand, a long-shafted weapon with a curved green barrel ending in an arrowhead. Her pose is dynamic: body leaning forward, hands pressed to the ground, left leg extended, right leg bent back, muscles taut, the tight fabric of her bodysuit stretched across her ass and thighs. Low-angle shot amplifies the contrast between her small but fierce form and the looming tower. Moonlight spills cool white from above, clashing with the tower’s orange warmth, casting sharp side-light across her face and body, shadows pooling on the wet street and her bare knee. Behind her, a traditional Japanese roof silhouette curves against the neon sky. The white zebra crossing leads the eye from her boots up to the tower’s apex. The image feels like a handheld photograph—slight motion blur, floating dust particles in the beam of light—adding raw realism. She is central-left, the tower dominates right, creating an asymmetrical yet balanced composition. The mood fuses cyberpunk tension, traditional mystery, and erotic edge: the torn stocking, the snug bodysuit, the assertive crouch, the weapon ready.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
