        {
          "id": "krea2-202598abfea0dc1c15a1f709",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫办公室媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A voluptuous flight attendant in a tight white long-sleeve blouse, unbuttoned to reveal a lacy black bra and deep cleavage, paired with a beige high-waist pencil skirt that hugs her curves and accentuates her hips. Her black hair is pulled back in a sleek low ponytail, a warm, sultry smile on her glossed lips, eyes half-lidded with confident allure. She leans casually against the white emergency slide housing, one hand resting on it, the other playfully flashing a peace sign. A bright orange silk scarf is knotted at her neck, a lanyard with her ID badge dangling between her breasts, a small yellow purse clutched in her hand. The aircraft door interior shows a light gray metal wall with an \"OPEN\" sign and red arrow, \"AUTOMATIC INFLATABLE SLIDE\" text below, dark gray anti-slip flooring. Silver metal frames and connectors at the door edge. Soft indoor lighting casts gentle shadows across her body, highlighting the sheen of her stockings and the smooth skin of her thighs. The pose is relaxed yet provocative, conveying a professional but teasing atmosphere. High-detail photorealistic style, warm beige, white, and orange palette with gray and black accents. Focus on her upper body and face, shallow depth of field, cinematic composition, sensual workplace snapshot.",
