        {
          "id": "krea2-07e48f69b45d0fe3dd12caab",
          "alias": "单女黑连体衣舞台冷淡站立叉腰",
          "prompt": "A woman in a lavish military-style stage costume stands at the center of a vast indoor venue, wearing an ornate black officer's cap encrusted with shimmering crystals and metal filigree, its brim tilted forward to add mystery and authority. Her long hair falls naturally, strands kissed gold by stage lights, contrasting against the dark palette and highlighting her face. Her eyes are deep and commanding, locking onto the camera, lips parted slightly. Makeup is immaculate—heavy eyeliner, long lashes, flawless pale skin with a high-end mirrored finish. She wears a black bodycon jumpsuit entirely covered in tiny silver sequins that sparkle like a night sky. The shoulders are exaggerated with structured epaulettes, edged with silver piping and round buttons. Across her chest and waist are multiple rows of silver rhinestone-studded straps, resembling military decoration belts, with a massive gem brooch at the center radiating brilliant light. Long sleeves end in black-and-white striped cuffs, adding visual depth. Hands on hips, fingers long with black nail polish and glittering tips, a minimalist metal bracelet on her wrist. Legs sheathed in high-gloss black stockings that reflect a soft metallic sheen, legs together, posture tall and confident, exuding power. The background is a modern indoor performance venue: a complex steel ceiling grid suspending multiple professional stage lights emitting cold white beams, creating dramatic chiaroscuro. In the distance, blurred audience seats and an LED screen displaying blue geometric lines and dynamic patterns, evoking a futuristic tech atmosphere. The stage floor is reflective, casting mirrored images of the figure and lights, enhancing depth. The composition is a mid-shot close-up, the figure dominating the frame, slightly turned with an S-curve silhouette. A low-angle shot accentuates her height and presence, visual focus on her face and upper body, especially eyes and costume details. Light comes from above and front spotlights, creating clear light-and-shadow divisions; her face is evenly lit with soft shadows, sequins on the outfit producing dense highlights under the strong light, creating a dazzling effect. The overall mood blends futuristic tech, luxury fashion, and stage performance tension—visually striking yet artistically refined, as if capturing the most captivating moment of a top-tier concert. The color palette is primarily black, silver, and blue, cool-toned, conveying a cool, noble aura, balanced by localized warm light and highlights, adding layers and warmth.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
