        {
          "id": "krea2-e92734311f11678e2373a332",
          "alias": "单女黑挂脖街道媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before an industrial corrugated metal wall, her jet-black short bob with blunt bangs framing her bright, focused eyes as she pouts her lips in a playful, kiss-ready expression. She wears a tight black sequin halter top that shimmers with fine silver sparkles under the light, hugging her slender waist, paired with high-waisted black jeans and a wide studded belt with metal charms adding a punk edge. Her right hand is clad in a long black leather glove, smooth and glossy, fingers elegantly curved in a suggestive gesture, while her left ear sports a geometric metallic earring catching the light. Her body is slightly turned, head facing the camera in a mid-shot composition, with the foreground showing a stabilizer rig labeled \"MANULUX\" and cables, enhancing the behind-the-scenes vibe. The backdrop features vertical corrugated metal panels, a thick pipe column with a yellow valve on the right contrasting the dark tones. Soft left-front lighting sculpts her curves and face, casting subtle reflections on the metal, creating a noir atmosphere. The palette is black and gray with silver sequins and yellow accents, blending modern fashion with street grit. She exudes a cool, confident, and alluring femininity, the composition tight and dynamic, drawing attention to her seductive expression and gloved hand gesture.",
