          "alias": "单女白连体衣媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman with sleek, jet-black hair falling naturally over her shoulders stands before a soft gray gradient background. Her porcelain skin gleams under the light, her delicate brows framing deep, captivating eyes that gaze directly into the lens with a sultry, focused intensity. She wears a pure white strapless bodysuit, its surface densely covered in shimmering pearls and rhinestones, with a heart-shaped neckline that boldly accentuates her full, inviting cleavage. The bodysuit clings tightly to her slender waist and curves, the hem cutting high across her thighs, exposing long, smooth legs. Black velvet gloves extend from her fingers to her forearms, one hand resting on her hip, the other hanging loosely by her side. Around her neck, a three-strand pearl necklace cascades in layered elegance; matching pearl studs adorn her ears. Her pose is confident and alluring, with her body slightly turned and head facing forward, the composition centered yet off-kilter. The lighting comes from the left front, casting warm highlights across her face and upper body while soft shadows deepen the contours of her form, with her silhouette faintly reflecting on the wall behind. The overall atmosphere is erotic elegance—a fusion of high-fashion glamour and sensual tease, with stark contrasts of white, black, and gray enhancing the detailed, lifelike texture of her skin and attire.",
