          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a pale beige textured wall, her long deep brown hair falling naturally with part of it tied into playful twin tails by black bow hair accessories, soft waves catching the light. She turns her body slightly, one hand on her hip, the other resting casually, her pose relaxed and confident. Her gaze meets the camera with warm, gentle eyes, a subtle smile on her lips, the full red of her mouth contrasting against her fair skin. She wears a short white satin top with a square neckline and puffed sleeves, a row of tiny buttons down the front, a drawstring cinching at her waist creating soft gathers and a defined waistline, a ruffled hem revealing a sliver of toned midriff. Her high-waisted blue jeans are fitted, showing off the curve of her hips and thighs, the fabric lightly washed and worn, with natural creases and highlights. The lighting is soft and warm from the front right, casting gentle shadows across her face, accentuating her cheekbones and jawline. The satin top gleams subtly on her shoulders, chest, and arms, while the denim shows a play of light and shadow. The clean tones of white, beige, and blue create a fresh, slightly retro mood. The image has a slight vignette, focusing attention on her. The overall vibe is intimate and sensual, as if capturing a quiet moment of self-assured allure, with a hint of film grain and natural color saturation. She stands confidently, her expression inviting, the simplicity of the pose enhanced by the tactile details of fabric and skin.",
