          "alias": "单女绿连衣裙媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A sexy young woman stands before the OPPO Reno15 Series brand backdrop, her body clad in a tight, low-cut light green ruffled strap dress with a fitted corset-like bodice, vertical seams, metal button details, thin straps, and a black label just above her cleavage. The dress's layers of ruffles cascade from her waist, the fabric clinging to her hips and thighs, emphasizing her curves. Her deep brown hair is swept up into a sleek, high bun with a few strands falling seductively across her forehead. Her makeup is dewy, with soft smoky eyes, glossy pink lips slightly parted, and a sultry, direct gaze into the lens. A thin silver chain with a small pendant rests against her collarbone, and a simple silver bracelet adorns her wrist. Her left hand, bearing a ring on the ring finger, rests casually on her hip, while her right hand grazes the hem of her dress, lifting it just enough to reveal a flash of inner thigh. The lighting is soft and even, highlighting the sheen of her skin and the texture of the fabric, with shallow shadows adding depth. The composition is a mid-shot, slightly off-center, capturing her confident, inviting pose. The overall atmosphere is a high-fashion launch event with an intimate, tempting allure, captured in crisp, ultra-high-resolution detail.",
