        {
          "id": "krea2-0ff7b493419a5c48d972acc4",
          "alias": "单女湿身绿连衣裙浴缸媚态站立戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges seductively in a pristine white ceramic bathtub, wearing a sheer emerald-green sequined mermaid dress that clings to her wet curves, its silver-and-blue glitter refracting under cold blue light, the fabric partially translucent where it dips into the water, outlining her erect nipples. Her long legs are parted sensually—right knee bent outward, left leg extended—revealing the bare skin of her inner thighs and the dark hint of her crotch through the soaked dress. She wears matching high-heeled sandals with a delicate pearl anklet, her left hand resting loosely on the tub's edge, silver ring catching the light, fingers curling as if beckoning. Her head is tilted, dark wet hair plastered to her shoulder and chest, her red lips parted, gaze locked with the camera in a cool, inviting stare. The scene is shot from a high angle, capturing the curved bathtub, the mirror-smooth water rippling only around her submerged dress, and tiled white walls. A vintage silver showerhead and control valve hang on the right wall; a sheer white shower curtain with soft folds stands on the left. The floor is deep-blue geometric mosaic tiles. Dominant cool-blue lighting from above and front casts sharp, directional shadows, highlighting every contour of her body and the wet fabric. The reflection of her reclining figure shimmers on the glossy tub surface. The composition is precise, high-resolution, with shallow depth of field that blurs the background slightly, focusing all attention on her coldly erotic pose and the unspoken tension of the intimate moment. The atmosphere is both luxurious and voyeuristic, a frozen moment of high-fashion eroticism.",
