        {
          "id": "krea2-545da43d421dcfb7b8c99cc1",
          "alias": "单女白外套城市媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a modern wooden bench, wearing a loosely draped off-white cropped jacket over a matching slip dress, one shoulder bared as the jacket falls open, revealing the curve of her cleavage and the thin strap of her dress. Her long black hair cascades freely, makeup precise, gaze sharp and slightly aloof as she looks directly into the camera. Her legs are crossed, one yellow-and-white stiletto dangling from her toe, the other foot planted firmly, her skirt hiked high enough to expose a generous length of thigh. Her body leans forward slightly, hands resting on the bench beside her hips, posture relaxed but provocative. Behind her, a geometric lattice of diagonal wooden slats creates strong lines and depth, with blue glass wall beyond casting a cool, reflective light that contrasts with warm wood tones. Hanging air plants and trailing vines dangle from the lattice, some with tiny white blossoms, adding organic sensuality. The ceiling is light corrugated metal with soft, diffused circular lights, casting a warm golden glow across her skin, making shadows trace her collarbone and the indent of her waist. The cool blue glass behind her reflects subtle hints of her silhouette, creating a moody, intimate atmosphere that blends modern urban design with natural elements. The overall look is polished, high-end, as if captured by a professional with a full-frame camera and wide-aperture lens under ambient interior light, with smooth gradients and rich detail, emphasizing her confident, sensual presence.",
