        {
          "id": "krea2-b81d7ef7f3cdc6752e290dde",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙泳池媚态坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on dimly lit wooden stairs, her long black hair falling loosely. Her pale skin glows, delicate features sharp, eyes deep and lazy as she stares into the lens, lips slightly parted and glistening, wet and inviting. She wears a black lace slip dress with intricate floral embroidery, the sheer fabric clinging to her body and revealing the dark outlines of her nipples and the curve of her breasts. Over it, a fluffy black faux fur coat, soft and voluminous. A tight black miniskirt hugs her hips, black stockings stretch taut over her legs, and shiny black high-heel sandals with tiny crystal embellishments and metal ankle straps add a luxurious, erotic touch. She sits slightly sideways on the step, legs crossed and extended, thighs pressing together, creating a tense, sensual pose. Her right hand rests on her thigh, fingers splayed, left hand hanging languidly. Dangling chandelier earrings catch the warm light and sway as she shifts. The background is an old wooden staircase with worn, dark steps, white walls bearing stains and scratches, a few dark-framed paintings, and a simple wooden railing. A white sign on the right reads \"CLEANING IN PROGRESS\" with Chinese text and a warning symbol. The dim lighting comes mainly from a warm yellow wall lamp above right, casting soft chiaroscuro across her body, highlighting the sheer lace, the shine on her lips, and the curve of her hips. Shadows pool on the stairs and walls, deepening the space. Low-angle shot, she is center-left, body tilted, head slightly back, eyes locked on the lens with a heavy, inviting gaze. The mood is retro and intimate, with subtle film grain, like a candid snapshot in a bar or restaurant stairwell late at night, full of narrative and erotic tension. The palette is nearly monochrome with warm yellow highlights, giving a stylish, slightly decadent urban nightlife feel. Details are crisp—from the floral lace to the wood grain to the tiny crystals on her heels—evoking a realistic, unpolished amateur photography style.",
