          "id": "krea2-915dbe299c9c377ec2220215",
          "alias": "单女蓝西装废墟媚态跪注视",
          "prompt": "A female character in an elaborate magical costume kneels in an abandoned industrial scene. She has long deep-purple hair and bright blue eyes, with refined makeup and slightly parted red lips exuding a mysterious, elegant allure. A wide-brimmed hat is adorned with gold trim and red fabric, a black bow dangling playfully from beneath the brim. She wears a tight blue-and-purple combat suit with a low-cut bodice, accented by a blue cape-like shoulder piece decorated with gold star patterns and linework. A shimmering star-shaped pendant rests at her chest. Her arms are clad in purple gloves with gold trim and black leather ends. Brown stockings patterned with gold stars cover her legs, and her ankles are fitted with red-and-gold armored boots. The overall look blends fantasy and combat, sensual and commanding. She kneels with elegant tension, right hand lightly touching her hat brim, left hand resting naturally at her side, body slightly leaning forward, gaze fixed directly at the viewer—a seductive, knowing stare. In the foreground, a wooden fence and heavy iron chains stretch diagonally from the lower left toward the center, guiding the eye to her. The midground features scattered bricks, broken walls, and piled old furniture. The background reveals a mottled concrete wall with exposed brick, and to the right, an old Sony audio setup (CD player and amplifier) sits beside miscellaneous items and plastic bags—an abandoned space still hinting at past life. The composition blends close-up details with mid-far elements; she is positioned on the right, creating asymmetric balance. Soft natural light streams from the upper left, illuminating her face and costume with delicate chiaroscuro, casting shadows on the right wall and floor for added depth. The atmosphere merges fantasy with reality, opulence with decay—dramatic yet intimate, like a candid moment captured in a derelict warehouse or forgotten studio. The color palette revolves around purple, blue, and brown, accented with gold, evoking a warm, slightly melancholic mood. The image quality feels like a professional studio shoot merged with an amateur's raw, affectionate eye—rich in detail, layered, brimming with narrative intensity and artistic allure.",
