        {
          "id": "krea2-ec57c25938f0c0597a70742f",
          "alias": "单女棕毛衣舞台媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, her long, sleek black hair cascading over her shoulders, catching the soft glow of the lights as a few strands brush against her cheek, adding a touch of delicate sensuality. She wears a confident, sweet smile with bright, clear eyes, lips slightly parted in a hint of allure. Her arms are raised high overhead, the graceful lines of her arms and exposed underarms adding a healthy, vibrant energy. She is dressed in a form-fitting brown crochet-knit dress, strapless and tight, hugging every curve of her slender waist and toned body. The hem is an irregular ruffled design with openwork patterns that reveal flashes of bare skin, accented by delicate gold chains and white pearl pendants that draw the eye to her décolletage. The background is a soft blur of blue stage lights creating bokeh spots, with faint outlines of green plants in the distance, adding a dreamy, natural contrast. Shot in mid-range, she is slightly left of center, her gaze drifting to the right, inviting the viewer. Focus is on her face and upper body, emphasizing her expressive features and the intricate details of the dress. Soft, warm light from above and front casts gentle shadows, enhancing the rich brown tones against the cool blue-green backdrop, creating a vivid, artistic, and glamorous NSFW atmosphere.",
