        {
          "id": "krea2-056c968fc4618072e48afaaa",
          "alias": "单女银旗袍媚态倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in a silver-and-black sequined cheongsam leans sensuously against an ivory European stone wall, her black hair styled in an elegant vintage updo, sparkly earrings and necklace catching the light. Her makeup is artfully intense, eyes deep and confident, locking onto the viewer with a seductive, knowing gaze. Her right hand holds a black bead clutch, left hand hangs loosely, a silver bracelet glinting at her wrist. The dress is a striking fusion: left side silver diamond-pattern sequins, right side black velvet, with a high slit that reveals a long, bare leg, the fabric shifting to hint at the curve of her hip and the silk of her thigh. The slit opens further as she shifts, exposing the smooth skin up to the upper thigh, the edge of the cheongsam teasing the beginning of her panty line. The skirt flutters gently in the night breeze, creating a flowing, sensual dynamic. Background: classic European architecture, horizontal lines on the wall, a vintage sconce casting warm amber light that sculpts her silhouette, highlighting the shiny contours of the dress and the shadowed hollows of her collarbone and cleavage. The light falls softly across her face and décolletage, emphasizing the glossy finish of the fabric and the subtle sheen of her skin. Stone pavement underfoot, rough texture contrasting with the smooth wall. Medium shot, slight right of center, her body tilted, head angled, drawing the eye from her face down to the clutch, then to the leg at the open slit, the shadows deepening between her thighs. The atmosphere is high-fashion noir, cool silver-black palette with warm highlights, a blend of modern and vintage elegance, as if a stolen cinematic moment in a glamorous, nocturnal city. Every sequin and strand of hair is crisp, the overall effect both polished and provocatively intimate.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
