        {
          "id": "krea2-fc53206260a6e6c969c2a588",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫街道媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a brown leather armchair, her deep brown hair falling in natural, glossy waves. She wears flawless makeup with full red lips, her eyes locked on the camera with a cold, confident, and seductive gaze. Her skin is pale and smooth. She is dressed in a white shirt and black leather jacket, the collar unbuttoned just enough to reveal a hint of blue fabric beneath. A black mini skirt hugs her thighs, her legs crossed elegantly—right over left—drawing attention to her white high-top sneakers with tassels and pure white long socks, the \"miu miu\" logo visible on the side. In her right hand, she holds a black Miu Miu handbag with smooth leather, gold zipper and logo details, black strap. The outfit blends street-chic with high fashion. The scene is indoors with a light gray upholstered wall and white ceiling, warm overhead lighting casting soft shadows across her face, arms, and the bag, emphasizing curves and texture. The composition is a medium shot, subject slightly off-center left, her body and bag in the foreground. The image has a natural, amateur feel with slight noise and lens distortion, edges slightly blurred, yet rich in detail. The atmosphere is quiet, elegant, and sensual—her relaxed yet poised posture exudes independence, confidence, and a hint of invitation. Warm tones of black, white, brown, with accents of blue and gold create a modern urban vibe, perfect for fashion or lifestyle, but here heightened with an intimate, NSFW allure.",
