        {
          "id": "krea2-7b0003b0da2976b8487e911a",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙街道冷淡蹲过肩",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman squats low on the wet asphalt of a night city street, her black mini-skirt riding up to expose the sheer black stockings that cling to her thighs, thick-soled martin boots laced tight. Her long hair falls over her shoulders, straight bangs framing a cool, detached face as she stares directly into the lens, expression calm yet laced with rebellion. The outfit blends punk and futuristic edge: black clothes with silver reflective stripe accents, the fabric tight against her curves, the translucent stockings catching the neon glow. Diagonal metal rods or pipes cut from bottom-left to top-right, framing her and leading the eye to the dark center of her body. Puddles mirror blurred city lights and the faint glow of passing car tail-lights, creating a wet, cold, tech-noir atmosphere. The low-angle shot stretches her silhouette, making her dominate the frame. Her cheeks, hands, and boot buckles gleam with specular highlights from street lamps above. The color palette is cold—black, grey, blue—punctuated by warm amber and orange reflections from distant buildings. She is a lone figure, isolated, self-contained, exuding a raw, sexual tension—the slight spread of her knees, the taut line of her spine, the way the wet fabric clings to her skin. The scene feels like a stolen after-midnight snapshot: slight grain, dynamic blur, the throat of the city night around her, her eyes holding a story of desire and defiance.",
