        {
          "id": "krea2-7361f573a690d3824d62e9b5",
          "alias": "单女黑西装机场媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands outside Terminal 1 of Incheon Airport, wearing a sophisticated black-and-white checked tweed blazer (loose fit, black velvet lapels) over a low-cut gray V-neck knit top that reveals a hint of cleavage. Matching high-waist shorts hug her hips, cinched by a thin black belt that emphasizes her slender waist. Her dark brown hair falls naturally, glossy and soft. She has a flawless fair complexion with subtle makeup, pale pink lips, and a seductive, confident gaze directly at the lens. One hand rests lightly on her hip, the other holds a black leather handbag with gold zipper details. She wears black square-toe chunky heels with metal buckle accents and sheer black stockings that accentuate her long, shapely legs. Her posture is tall and composed, exuding an air of poised sensuality. Behind her, airport signage in gray-green displays Korean and English text: \"T1 항공사는\", \"Asiana Airlines\", \"Free Shuttle Bus\", \"Incheon Airport\". The composition is a mid-shot with slightly blurred background, natural daylight casting soft shadows, a crisp and bright atmosphere. The overall palette is black, white, gray with touches of gold and dark brown, creating a chic urban aesthetic. The texture is high-quality, as if captured by a premium camera, with realistic details and a natural, candid feel. The image balances everyday airport public space with a deliberate, alluring personal style, presenting a modern woman who is independent, charismatic, and subtly provocative.",
