        {
          "id": "krea2-e01e8d6de0f230ae4b73b10a",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣厂房媚态站立伸展",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the aisle of a large warehouse-style supermarket, wearing a cream-white high-neck fitted knit dress that clings to every curve of her body. Her long, slightly wavy hair falls naturally, catching the cool fluorescent light as she rests her right hand under her chin, her gaze locked on the camera with a sultry, thoughtful expression. Her left hand casually grips the shopping cart handle, her hip subtly tilted, arching her back and emphasizing her waist and breasts. The silver-gray metal cart has a red plastic seat and straps, with a visible brand logo on the handle, and a few items inside. The scene is shot from a low angle, making her appear taller and more dominant amidst the tall orange-red metal shelves stacked with wrapped boxes and black-and-yellow tools. The gray cement floor reflects the overhead industrial circular lights, casting sharp shadows and enhancing the depth. The composition centers her slightly right, with the cart anchoring the lower left, leading the eye to her exposed collarbone and the dress's tight outline. The lighting is even on her face, highlighting her skin's natural tone, while the neutral grays, orange-reds, and cream-white create a harmonious yet erotic contrast. The detail is crisp, like a high-end camera capture, with a slight film grain and shallow depth of field that blurs the background shelves, making her body the focal point. The atmosphere blends everyday reality with a charged, sensual tension, showing a modern woman's allure in a mundane setting.",
