        {
          "id": "krea2-e9e47d55c17870a3d56f1e99",
          "alias": "单女白连衣裙媚态侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sheer white spaghetti strap dress with delicate ball ornaments and lace trim, the translucent sleeves revealing her skin beneath. Her long black hair cascades over her shoulders, catching the cold white light from a massive conical source above. She tilts her head back, right index finger gently touching her chin, gaze lifted upward with a sultry, contemplative expression. Soft coral lips, pale lilac eye shadow, flushed cheeks. The dress clings to her curves, the thin straps framing her exposed shoulders and collarbone. Behind her, dense tropical foliage glistens in the dim light, creating deep shadows and a dreamy, mysterious atmosphere. The strong top light casts dramatic highlights on her skin and dress, emphasizing her silhouette and the subtle sheen of her thighs and décolletage. Cold blue-green tones dominate, with a cinematic, surreal quality. The shallow depth of field blurs the background, making her the focal point. Her pose is elegant yet seductive, with a hint of vulnerability. The scene feels like a high-fashion night portrait, intimate and charged with sensual tension.",
