        {
          "id": "krea2-c24e9576dda51b42e91d5502",
          "alias": "单女半褪毛衣椅上微笑坐回眸",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a classic brown leather piano bench, wearing an oversized burgundy chunky-knit sweater that slips off one shoulder, revealing her bare shoulder and collarbone. The sweater's sleeves hang loosely, exposing her slender arms. She wears white thigh-high stockings that bunch slightly at her ankles, creating a warm, lazy allure. Her dark brown wavy hair falls softly over her shoulders, topped with a bright red oversized bow that adds playful retro charm. She turns her head to glance back at the camera with clear, inviting eyes, lips parted in a gentle, knowing smile. One hand rests under her chin, the other holds a beige teddy bear wearing a light brown ribbon around its neck, its plush texture visible. She sits with legs crossed, right ankle resting over left, toes lightly touching the floor, exuding a casual yet sensual intimacy. The composition is a mid-shot from a low angle, slightly tilted upward, emphasizing her presence. Behind her, an old upright piano, deep reddish-brown with visible wood grain, bears the brand \"RAYNER\". Sheet music sits on the music stand, alongside beige boxes and a framed classical portrait. To the left, dark brown venetian blinds are tilted, letting soft light streak through, creating warm, striped shadows on the floor. The right wall is a warm yellow hue. The floor is covered in a patchy faux-fur rug in brown and gray, plush and soft. Warm golden light comes from the right rear, mimicking sunset, casting delicate highlights on her face, sweater, and the piano, with smooth light-to-shadow transitions. The overall tone is nostalgic, cozy, and sensual. The scene feels like a quiet afternoon captured with amateur photography—natural light, slight grain, subtle vignette at edges. Colors are warm yellows, burgundy, brown, with white stockings and red bow as accent. The image has a vintage artistic vibe, rich in detail and narrative, with a soft, intimate eroticism.",
