        {
          "id": "krea2-d048e75e35f38c55d12491e5",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙车厢媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a white bench in a subway car, wearing a striking red lace long dress with long sleeves, a deep V-neckline, and a high side slit that reveals her long bare leg. The delicate floral lace pattern leaves her skin tantalizingly visible underneath. She wears shiny red pointed-toe high heels with thin stiletto heels, matching the dress. Her dark brown hair is pulled into a low bun, adorned with a large red flower clip. She gazes down at a black smartphone in her hands, fingers gently touching the screen, her expression focused and serene. A thin silver necklace rests at her neck. The subway interior is clean: white plastic seats, white doors, a window with a blue poster showing pink flowers and foreign text, and a red-and-white sign on the left wall. Gray speckled anti-slip floor reflects faint light. Cold white fluorescent tubes illuminate the scene evenly. She sits slightly turned toward the camera, legs crossed and extended forward, forming a stable triangular composition. The background is subtly blurred to emphasize her. Soft overhead light creates subtle highlights on her hair, shoulders, hands, and heels, enhancing the realistic texture. The dominant red of her outfit contrasts sharply with the cool white environment, creating a striking visual impact in this everyday public space. The scene captures a private, sensual moment of urban life—a blend of ordinariness and deliberate glamour, stillness amid transit. The camera angle is slightly low, hand-held perspective, ultra-sharp detail from lace texture to skin sheen to leather gloss. The mood is modern yet cinematic, a freeze-frame of a woman’s elegant, poised presence in a fleeting public space, exuding quiet confidence and erotic allure.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
