          "prompt": "A young woman sits poised on a vintage red velvet armchair with carved wood and gold studs, her black high-neck ruffled dress unbuttoned low to reveal a hint of cleavage, sheer black stockings glistening under soft light, and pointed boots crossed seductively. She wears black gloves, one hand resting on her exposed thigh, the other on the armrest. Her dark hair is in a low ponytail with a black bow, a single strand falling over her shoulder; glossy black bead earrings catch the light. She stares directly at the camera with a cool, commanding gaze, lips slightly parted. The warm, diffused light from the right front highlights the curve of her body through the dress and the texture of the velvet chair, casting subtle shadows on the left. The background is a soft beige wall with fine grain, a light gray carpet beneath. Mid-shot composition, figure slightly forward, legs crossed naturally, creating a stable triangle. The color palette is black, red, and brown, exuding an elegant, vintage, and mysterious atmosphere, with a touch of subdued sensuality. The image is ultra-detailed, magazine-quality, no watermarks, focusing on the harmonious union of the subject and setting, conveying a quiet, powerful fashion aesthetic with an adult edge.",
