          "prompt": "A young female model in a futuristic silver-blue metallic dress, asymmetrical design with one-shoulder wrap and spiral layered fabric, the bodice cut daringly low to expose the full curves of her breasts, with sheer metallic panels barely covering her erect nipples. She stands with arms crossed beneath her chest, pushing her cleavage upward, her pose confident and sensual. Her long jet-black hair falls straight with blunt bangs, framing a face with perfectly applied makeup: smoky eyes, coral lips, a subtle, knowing smile. Silver accessories adorn her: a thin choker, long tassel earrings, a wide metal cuff on one elbow, and a gemmed bracelet. Behind her, a large champagne-gold vehicle, blurred with blue-violet gradient bokeh lights, suggests a high-end auto show or tech event. Soft overhead lighting catches the reflective dress and her damp, glowing skin, creating sharp highlights and deep shadows. The color palette shifts between icy blue-silver and warm gold, emphasizing the wet sheen on her dress and the slick texture of her exposed skin. The composition centers on her figure, her gaze locked directly to the camera, inviting and dominant, the scene rendered with a polished yet raw editorial realism.",
