        {
          "id": "krea2-f91193a3ee4004e5713068f6",
          "alias": "单女米衬衫广场微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on an outdoor wooden bench, wearing a cream-colored long-sleeve blouse with red and green floral patterns, puffed sleeves, and a delicate red bow at the collar, paired with a high-waist coral red bodycon mini skirt that hugs her curves tightly. She wears light beige square-toe low heels. Her brown hair is styled in a low ponytail with blunt bangs, makeup natural and fresh. Her eyes gaze softly up and to the right, lips curved in a serene yet subtly inviting smile. Her hands gently hold a white-covered book with a red \"V\" logo, her body turned slightly, legs crossed elegantly, showing off long, smooth thighs. The foreground is paved with irregular gray and beige stone slabs, slightly rough, dust in the cracks. Sunlight streams from the upper right, casting clear but soft shadows on the ground and her body, creating warm, tranquil afternoon lighting. The bench is simple dark brown wood, sleek and rounded edges. Background is a plain white wall, with a section of red brick wall on the right as a visual contrast. Composition follows the rule of thirds, subject placed left, her gaze leading to the upper right, adding depth. Color palette: warm whites, coral red, beige, with green floral and red brick accents. Natural soft diffused daylight, realistic shadows. Style resembles casual photography, with slight grain and real details: fabric folds, skin texture, shoe reflections. Visual lines created by her eyes, body orientation, and book form an implicit diagonal, enhancing flow. Mood is intimate, warm, nostalgic, and subtly sensual—capturing a leisurely urban moment with artistic realism, emphasizing the woman's everyday style and inner world.",
