          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a light gray plush carpet before a deep blue fabric sofa, wearing a sheer white chiffon blouse with cascading ruffles, puffed collar and cuffs, her black lace bra clearly visible underneath. She pairs it with black high-waist shorts, black thigh-high stockings, and black stiletto heels. Her glossy black hair falls naturally, as she turns slightly sideways, right hand brushing a silver double-G earring, left hand resting on her thigh, fingers long with manicured nails. Her gaze is direct, calm, with a hint of mystery. The background is a warm vertical wood slat wall with natural texture. Low-angle composition places her center-right, with the carpet and feet details in the foreground, sofa and her body in midground, wall and sofa back in background. Soft natural light from the left sculpts her face and fabric, highlighting her skin's texture and the blouse's transparency. The palette is predominantly black and white, accented by blue and wood tones, creating a high-fashion editorial feel with film grain and subtle saturation. Her pose is relaxed yet precise — the sheer blouse reveals her black lace bra and the outline of her nipples, the shorts ride high on her hips, and the stockings trace her long legs, all exuding a controlled sensuality. The scene feels like a quiet afternoon photoshoot, blending elegance with an intimate, provocative allure.",
