        {
          "id": "krea2-8e5d2bc5aef296a134cc4f69",
          "alias": "单女黑礼服室内媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a bright indoor commercial space, wearing an elegant black velvet gown with off-shoulder ruffled sleeves that cling to her curves and fall to her ankles, the fabric shimmering under soft light. Her shoulder-length brown hair frames a bob with blunt bangs, her makeup is precise—bold eyeliner and full lips—her gaze locked seductively into the lens. She holds a small teddy bear in a red sweater with her right hand, while her left hand rests casually at her side, a simple ring on her finger. White pointed heels complete her chic, festive look. Her body leans slightly against a red display platform, creating a relaxed yet poised balance. In the foreground, a glossy red curved stand holds a beige handbag with metal clasps and handles, decorated with pinecones, green Christmas branches, and red ornaments, evoking holiday spirit. The background is a red wall with gold lettering \"THE TOÉ\", with more Christmas trees and lights visible behind. A woman in dark clothing browses clothes in the distance. To the right hang knitted garments—red sweater, beige cardigan, white dress—creating rich layers. A red carpet stretches deep into the scene. The composition is mid-shot, subject center-right, with symmetrical display stands. Warm top lighting casts soft shadows, enhancing the velvet's texture and fabric folds. The atmosphere is warm, luxurious, and festive with high resolution, crisp details, saturated colors, subtle film grain, and natural depth-of-field, as if shot with a professional camera yet maintaining a candid, realistic feel. The overall style is fashion-forward, elegant, and subtly commercial, with strong red-black contrast balanced by white shoes and beige bag, creating a unified yet dynamic visual.",
