        {
          "id": "krea2-acefa715bdae82911a59bad2",
          "alias": "单女白礼服酒店媚态站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A woman in a white layered ruffled off-shoulder gown stands at the center of an ornate indoor spiral staircase, her face half-concealed by a black lace cutout mask. Her long hair is woven into a side braid that falls over her shoulder. She wears a black long glove on her right hand, delicately holding a small gold-embossed book, while her left hand hangs naturally, the hem of her dress lifting slightly with her movement, exuding an elegant yet mysterious poise. Her body is turned slightly, head glancing back at the camera with deep, seductive eyes, as if narrating a hidden secret. The overall style blends Gothic romance with classical ballet. The background features dark gray velvet steps and curved metal railings on both sides, crafted from black wrought iron adorned with gold scrolling patterns and decorative finials. The walls behind the railings are paneled in reddish-brown wood with a smooth, fine grain. Above, the building's ceiling structure and recessed downlights are visible, with soft light spilling from above, creating alternating light and shadow layers on the steps. Warm yellow lighting contrasts with the cool-toned steps, enhancing the spatial depth and dramatic atmosphere. The composition employs central symmetry, with the figure as the visual focus, the staircase lines extending backward to guide the eye, creating strong perspective. A low-angle shot makes the figure appear taller and more commanding. The foreground is sharp and prominent, the mid-ground shows continuous steps and railing details, and the background gradually blurs, highlighting the subject while retaining environmental context. The lighting is meticulous, coming from top and side sources, with soft, consistent shadows that produce a warm, slightly mysterious indoor ambiance. The overall palette is dominated by black and white, accented with gold and red, conveying a vintage, elegant, and ritualistic visual style. The image feels realistic, as if shot with a professional camera in a high-end hotel or theater lobby, possessing cinematic narrative quality and artistic flair while preserving the naturalness of everyday photography, capturing a moment of genuine movement and emotion like a carefully staged performance frozen in an ordinary reality.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
