        {
          "id": "krea2-f1f1abfbadb07d76a6d45376",
          "alias": "单女女仆黑女仆装室内害羞坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an intricate black-and-white maid outfit, wearing cat-ear headdress with pink lining and soft white fur, her long black hair styled in twin tails with blunt bangs partially covering her forehead, seated indoors. Her makeup is refined with soft eyeshadow, pale pink lips, and delicate pink blush on her cheeks. She gazes tenderly at the camera with a sweet, slightly shy smile. Her dress features white lace ruffled trim at the collar, cuffs, and chest, with black ribbon bows accenting her neck and bust. The overall look blends cute and elegant style. In the foreground, she occupies the left-center of a close-up shot, emphasizing her facial expression and costume details. The midground shows part of a dark woven seat and wooden structure, while the background reveals rough stone wall and blurred warm-toned fabric, creating a vintage, cozy atmosphere. Light falls from an upper angle, casting soft chiaroscuro across her face and clothing folds, enhancing three-dimensionality. The warm, layered lighting and tones of white, black, pink, and brown evoke an amateur, real-life snapshot taken with a casual camera in a private space. The image has fine grain and natural noise, adding realism and intimacy. The camera angle is slightly low, bringing the viewer closer, making the scene feel personal and inviting. The whole composition is quiet and private, filled with girlish sentiment and fantasy. The tight, balanced focus draws the eye to her face and gaze, immersing you in this tender, sweet atmosphere.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
