        {
          "id": "krea2-8cc687f083143f5fe96e553a",
          "alias": "单女白短裙摄影棚媚态站立亲吻",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman stands in a side profile, her long straight hair falling naturally with soft golden highlights and a subtle warm glow, bangs neatly covering her forehead. She wears a form-fitting white silk-like top with subtle sheen, wrapped straps across her back, cinched at the waist. Below, a high-slit white skirt, the slit rising from mid-thigh to hip, edged with thin black trim, revealing bare leg. The skirt drapes softly with folds and light shadows, a white ribbon tied at the back with an orange-red accent. Her body slightly twisted, head turned back toward the camera, one eye closed, the other half-open, lips pursed in a playful kiss, glossy coral pink lipstick, a slight smirk. Right hand hangs naturally, fingers long, nails tidy, a simple silver ring on the ring finger, hand relaxed, as if adjusting the skirt. Background: dark gray gradient wall, lighter at top, fading to black at bottom, creating strong contrast. Medium shot, subject centered slightly right, S-curve from head to waist to leg. Lighting from front-left, soft and even, illuminating face and torso, creating natural shadows that enhance skin texture and dimension. Atmosphere: fashion-forward yet intimate, like a studio art portrait with candid authenticity. Palette: white, black, gold, with orange-red accents. Clean, modern, sensual, elegant, and youthful.",
