        {
          "id": "krea2-844827a6a3d34580755b09ec",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙媚态拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young female model struts down the runway, wearing a tight wine-red strapless pleated mini dress with long sleeves hugging her arms to the wrists, the fabric clinging to every curve of her toned body. The dress features delicate ruched details around her waist and hips, with tiny sparkling silver rhinestones along the hem catching the light with each step. Her high-heeled sandals are black chunky block heels with simple buckle straps, emphasizing her long, bare legs. Her glossy dark hair falls in soft waves over her shoulders, swaying gently as she moves. A confident, sensual smile plays on her lips, her eyes half-lidded and magnetic, radiating raw allure. A thin silver chain rests at her collarbone. The background shows a blurred audience, some wearing masks, with a vibrant pink runway contrasting against the deep red dress. Medium shot, slight side angle, her right leg lunging forward, left leg supporting, hips subtly swayed in a provocative catwalk pose. Lighting from above and front creates soft highlights on her dewy skin and the dress's shiny fabric, with faint shadows accentuating her curves. The scene feels like a high-end fashion show frozen in a moment of seductive elegance, captured with a professional-grade camera (85mm lens, f/2.8, subtle film grain), delivering a hyper-realistic, artfully erotic aesthetic. The dominant tones are warm deep reds, black, and silver, with the pink runway adding contrast. Every detail—from the sheen of her bare thighs to the glint of her lip gloss—is sharp and intimate, inviting the viewer to focus on her confident, sexually charged presence.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
