        {
          "id": "krea2-4098a801a5eead38f24ea36a",
          "alias": "单女黑外套小巷忧伤站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with soft pink gradient hair stands in a narrow, lived-in city alley, strands swaying in a gentle breeze, black rabbit-ear headband perched playfully atop her head, yellow hair clips framing her face. Her bright green eyes are clear and intense, with a subtle melancholic fixation, lips slightly parted in a sensual pout, flawless pale skin and detailed makeup. She wears a tight white cropped top with black geometric print, unbuttoned black leather jacket revealing a black high-neck top and a black heart-shaped pendant necklace resting above her cleavage. Low-rise black denim shorts hug her hips, layered with multiple belts and metal buckles, fishnet stockings hugging her thighs with yellow-studded black garter straps and fur cuffs at the ankles. Her right hand lifts to touch her cheek, long fingers with pale blue nail polish, while her left hand holds a bright green cartoon plush toy with stitched details and exaggerated eyes. She stands slightly off-center, body angled, head facing the camera, gaze direct and confident, a subtle arch in her back accentuating her chest and waist. Behind her is a gritty East Asian alley with weathered brick walls, peeling posters, and graffiti. A concrete utility pole is plastered with colorful stickers reading \"JOWL\" and \"TOP HAZA.\" A traditional red lantern hangs in the distance, casting a warm glow against the cold gray pavement. The ground is damp, reflecting faint light, with a bicycle and clutter visible deeper in the alley. Soft natural light mixes with artificial sources, creating gentle chiaroscuro on her figure, emphasizing her curves and outfit details. The overall palette is cool grays, blacks, and whites, punctuated by pink hair, green eyes, yellow accents, and the red lantern—balancing street fashion seduction with urban realism. The image is sharp and cinematic, blending anime aesthetic with gritty NSFW allure.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
