        {
          "id": "krea2-605531afdc037259f3308c55",
          "alias": "单女西装街道沉思站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A woman in a sleek, stylish suit stands on an outdoor street, her long black hair cascading naturally over her shoulders, blowing gently in the breeze with dynamic arcs and a glossy sheen. Her deep eyes gaze forward, her makeup refined with a subtle rosy flush, full lips soft and inviting, her expression elegant and confident. Her body is turned slightly toward the camera, accentuating her slender silhouette; her right hand hangs naturally, while her left hand lightly touches the edge of her coat, creating an effortless graceful pose. She wears a white lace cutout cropped top that hugs her curves, the intricate lace patterns at her chest and waist detailed with delicate scalloped edges. Beneath, a cream high-neck base layer peeks through. Over this, a wine-red long trench coat with a smooth, slightly reflective fabric, a clean lapel design, button details, and fine stitching at the cuffs—left open to reveal the layers beneath. Her lower half is clad in a high-waisted white sequin pencil skirt, densely covered in fine silver sparkles that shimmer in the light, the hem falling below the knee with white lace trim on the side for a romantic touch. She wears pure white thigh-high boots, the shafts hugging her legs tightly, with stiletto heels and a mirror-like finish reflecting the surroundings, a black zipper detail at the back. The overall look is both sexy and poised. The background is a red brick wall, bricks neatly stacked, colors transitioning from deep red to light brown, the surface rough with age and fine cracks, adding realism. The ground is gray asphalt, unevenly textured with signs of wear, some areas lit by sunlight creating contrast. The composition is a mid-shot, the figure centered slightly left in a three-quarter standing pose, head and gaze facing the camera, eyes directly engaging the viewer, drawing attention to the face and clothing details. The framing balances well, using color contrast—the warm wine-red coat against cool whites, harmonizing with the warm brick wall. Light comes from an upper diagonal angle, simulating natural daylight, soft but directional, illuminating the front and right side of the figure, casting natural shadows on the left, enhancing the three-dimensional contours. Hair, skin, fabric folds, and sequins all catch subtle highlights, boosting realism. The brick wall in the background is bathed in warm light, retaining deep shadow for a dusk or early morning serene atmosphere. The overall palette is warm and sophisticated, blending modern urban streets with vintage romantic elements, evoking a stylish, elegant, artistic visual style, as if captured by a professional camera in natural light, with slight film grain and motion blur, mimicking authentic photographic texture over digital over-processing. The scene is calm and narrative-rich, suggesting a chance encounter or a meticulously styled fashion moment in the city. The image is detail-rich, from clothing texture to expression to environmental texture, conveying an independent, confident, elegant, and alluring feminine presence.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
