          "id": "krea2-119dc90b039447f234ee9964",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a flowing white wedding dress, her soft brown-tinted curls cascading naturally over her shoulders, a sheer white veil drifting from her head to cloak her back and shoulders in translucent layers. The dress features an asymmetrical off-shoulder neckline that exposes one collarbone and bare shoulder, with a corseted waist hugging her curves. The short, voluminous skirt is made of multiple lightweight tulle layers, trimmed with delicate lace, and she gently lifts the hem with her slender fingers, revealing a hint of her thigh. She poses slightly sideways, her body forming an elegant S-curve, her gaze soft and seductive toward the camera, lips full and glossy, eyes with subtle smoky shadow and long curled lashes. A long silver tassel earring sways with her movement. The indoor setting includes a white wall, glass doorframe, and a hint of red sofa in the background, with warm orange-hued light streaming through pale gray curtains, creating a soft, cinematic glow. The composition is a medium shot, focusing on her upper body and facial details, with the background blurred. The lighting comes from the front right, casting delicate shadows and highlighting the smooth skin, translucent veil, and intricate fabric textures. The overall tone is predominantly white with warm amber and small red accents, evoking an intimate, romantic, yet sensual atmosphere—like a high-end fashion portrait with a subtle erotic tension, capturing a moment of bridal vulnerability and allure.",
