        {
          "id": "krea2-790b436ed796cd4dc050eea5",
          "alias": "单女黑外套城市戏谑站立举手",
          "prompt": "A young blonde woman with a short, choppy bob stands against a pure black background. She wears a black sleeveless baseball-style jacket with white stripe trim on the collar and cuffs, printed with \"OMG\" in white artistic font. Underneath, a red leather corset cinches her torso, tied at the waist with a thin black cord. High-waisted black leather shorts feature a double-layer wide belt—outer black leather strap, inner red studded strap, with a silver metallic buckle. Her left hand rests casually on her hip, right hand raised to gently touch the top of her head, fingers long and well-groomed. A simple gold bangle adorns her wrist, and a thin chain cross necklace hangs between her collarbones. Her makeup is expertly applied: sharp eyeliner, thick curled lashes, and soft coral lipstick. She stares directly at the lens with a confident, slightly teasing expression, lips parted in a subtle smirk, a beige microphone head held between her lips, a thin cord trailing from her mouth. Her skin is pale and smooth, her physique fit and toned with visible abdominal muscles. Lighting comes from slightly above front, casting soft highlights on her face, chest, and arms, with natural shadow transitions. The background is completely dark, isolating the subject. Center composition, eye-level with a slight upward tilt, emphasizing her commanding presence and pose. High contrast between light and shadow creates a dramatic, theatrical effect. The atmosphere exudes fashion, raw sensuality, and power—like a captured moment from a live show or fashion shoot. The overall vibe is modern urban nightlife cool. Photorealistic, richly detailed, with balanced saturation. The red-and-black color scheme is vibrant and punchy. Clean, distraction-free composition focuses entirely on her, delivering strong visual attraction and personal attitude, as if shot with pro gear under stage lights. High artistic and commercial appeal.",
