          "alias": "单女透视红连衣裙摄影棚媚态坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a blue chair, wearing a sheer red slip dress and a cream fringed shawl, her body angled to the side as she takes a sensual selfie. With her right hand raised, she holds a vintage silver digital camera, the lens aimed at her own body, while her left hand presses the dress against her thigh, hiking the hem up to reveal bare skin. Her lips are parted, eyes half-lidded and confident, dark brown hair tied in a high ponytail that exposes her long neck. Gold chunky chain necklace, earrings, and bracelet gleam against her skin; black nail polish contrasts with the dress. The black backdrop gives a studio feel, but a colorful plaid blanket and a blue bag with cartoon prints sit to the left, adding a lived-in touch. In the lower right corner, a drink with a straw hints at relaxation. Soft front lighting catches the sheer fabric, emphasizing the curve of her breasts, the shadow between her thighs, and the glossy finish of her lips. The composition is a medium shot, her body slightly off-center, balancing the luxurious and the casual. The sheer dress clings to her nipples, visible through the red mesh, and her confident pose suggests she knows exactly what she's doing—a candid, erotic moment caught by the camera in her own hand.",
