          "prompt": "A sharply dressed woman in a tailored grey blazer stands in the neon-lit urban night, her short hair perfectly styled, makeup precise. She turns slightly, arms crossed, one hand holding a smartphone, the other gripping a glossy black handbag with metallic branding. Her blazer is unbuttoned, revealing a sheer white blouse that clings to her curves. She wears tight black shorts and high-shine silver-gray stockings with vertical ribbing, the light catching every contour of her long legs. Black stiletto heels lift her stance, emphasizing her confident, commanding posture. Her gaze is cool, focused, lips slightly parted, exuding quiet dominance. The scene is framed with her slightly off-center, background blurred with blue-violet glass towers and soft neon glow creating a rim light on her silhouette. The stockings' sheen and the subtle tension in her body suggest a sensual, powerful presence. The overall mood is cinematic, high-fashion, and explicitly adult, capturing a moment of urban seduction and poised allure.",
