        {
          "id": "krea2-1b3aa433c09bd18a7d200ea8",
          "alias": "单女黑外套摄影棚媚态坐躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a table draped in pale gray silk, her glossy black hair falling naturally over bare shoulders. Her fair, flawless skin and delicately sculpted features are illuminated by soft left-side light, her deep eyes locking onto the lens with a sultry, knowing gaze. Her lips part slightly as she slowly brings a deep purple grape to her mouth, fingers pinching the fruit with deliberate sensuality. She wears a black-and-white houndstooth tweed jacket over a white blouse with dark print, the cuffs peeking out, adding refined layering. Her left hand rests on the table as she leans forward, body language poised yet inviting, exuding quiet erotic tension. In the foreground, a polished silver vase etched with ornate patterns catches soft gleams of light, beside a small silver bowl heaped with plump, glossy grapes—a few scattered casually on the silk cloth. A dry twig with white berries rises from the vase, lending a wild, natural contrast. To the right sits a pink diamond-stitched Dior handbag with white leather handles and gold hardware, its classic quilting gleaming. The background is a deep blue velvet-textured wall with faint translucent \"GRAZI\" lettering, evoking a high-fashion editorial spread. The composition is a medium close-up, subject slightly off-center left, with the grapes, vase, and bag creating layered depth. The lighting casts soft chiaroscuro over her face and clothes, highlighting the tweed's texture and the metallic shine, while shadows deepen the backdrop. The overall palette is cool blue-gray with warm pink and gold accents, blending modern and vintage luxury. The mood is still, sensual, and artfully posed—as if captured by a pro studio photographer using softboxes and reflectors—yielding a sharp, dreamy realism that emphasizes her expression, the tactile fabric, and the seductive detail of fruit against silk.",
