          "id": "krea2-0d3adacd9ad457e3a161d236",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫舞台媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, wearing a sheer white long-sleeve blouse that clings to her skin, revealing the outline of her erect nipples and the full shape of her breasts beneath the translucent fabric. The deep ribbon tie at her neck is loose, and the hem lifts just enough to expose her bare waist and toned midriff—a sliver of flesh drawing the eye downward. A tight black miniskirt rides high, barely covering the curve of her ass, over black high-waist shorts that strain against her hips, lace-trimmed black stockings encasing her long thighs and calves, ending at shiny black heels that arch her feet. Her pose is deliberately provocative: right leg bent and raised, knee slightly bent, the inner thigh exposed and the outline of her pussy visible through the clinging shorts; left leg straight, planted firmly, supporting her weight with a subtle sway. Her head turns just enough to stare directly into the lens, eyes sharp and cold, lips painted vivid red and slightly parted—a silent invitation. Black hair with straight bangs falls in a sleek curtain, strands lifted by an invisible stage breeze. The stage around her is modern: two vertical columns of warm orange LED lights flank the scene, their amber glow pulsing softly. Behind her, a dark gray textured curtain bears faint, illegible patterns and text. The floor is polished black, reflecting her body and the lights, creating a mirrored tension. The shot is mid-frame, her figure slightly right of center, body angled diagonally, heightening the sense of motion and raw sensuality. The foreground captures the full detail of her legs, stockings, and the flash of skin at her hip; the middle ground holds her torso and outfit; the background blurs softly, focusing all attention on her. Light pours from overhead and the sides—strong, directional, casting sharp shadows that carve out her cleavage, the curve of her waist, the contour of her ass. Her skin glows under the warm light, the fabric translucent, edges crisp. The atmosphere is charged, intimate, theatrical—as if caught mid-performance at a pop concert, a moment of power and allure. Monochrome tones dominate: black, white, silver, with the orange LEDs as a single warm accent. The image feels both professionally lit and spontaneously alive, every detail sharp, from the texture of the stockings to the gloss on her lips.",
