          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the center of the frame, wearing a deep wine-red silk slip dress that clings to her curves, the thin straps slipping off one shoulder to reveal bare skin. Her long, dark hair falls in soft waves, some strands brushing her collarbone, catching the warm light with a natural sheen. She turns slightly, her gaze fixed on the lens with a seductive, focused intensity, lips painted in a soft nude pink, slightly parted. Her makeup is natural yet polished—earthy eyeshadow, defined brows, long lashes making her eyes deep and luminous. She wears a delicate gold necklace with a small geometric pendant set with colorful gems, and long gold chain earrings with red and green stones that sway gently. Her right hand rests lightly on her chest, fingers adorned with vintage-style rings, nails painted deep blue. Her left hand hangs loosely by her side. The background is a lush, dark red rosebush, petals densely layered with soft bokeh. A warm golden glow from the right side creates dramatic chiaroscuro across her cheek, neck, and décolletage, highlighting the sheen of her skin and the silk fabric. Mid-shot composition, the figure filling two-thirds of the frame, head slightly tilted, directing attention to her face and the glittering jewelry. The overall palette is rich reds, golds, and warm yellows, with subtle film grain and natural noise, evoking a high-fashion editorial shot with a raw, intimate feel. The low angle and tight framing heighten her presence, the atmosphere warm, sensual, and charged with understated erotic tension.",
