        {
          "id": "krea2-6550e3de2f8ce3f7bdc857ee",
          "alias": "单女灰连帽衫霓虹夜景忧伤坐阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits beside a retro arcade machine, wearing a light gray hoodie with cartoon-patterned sleeves. Her dark brown hair has subtle light highlights; bangs fall softly across her forehead. Her gaze is slightly melancholy and intimate, lips parted just enough to hint at arousal, eyes locked with the viewer in a quiet, seductive invitation. Her right hand rests on the arcade's curved neon tube, fingers long and slender with pale pink nails, trailing slowly along the glowing glass. Her left hand lazily cradles her chin, body leaning in a relaxed, inviting slant. Behind her, red-and-white gingham drapes fold naturally, lit by warm ambient light and the arcade's multicolored neon—green to orange to red—casting soft, layered halos. The machine's metallic trim glints faintly; the screen edge reads \"KAR.\" Foreground focuses on her hand and the neon, framing her face and the hoodie's contours. The composition is asymmetrical: vivid neon and hand on the left, her face and hoodie on the right. High-saturation warm tones contrast with her gray top. Lighting is soft side-light from the machine and room, creating delicate shadows on her cheek and hand, accentuating the intimate mood. The scene feels like a candid film-camera shot—slight grain, warm color shift, a lazy afternoon captured. Her expression carries a blend of nostalgia and quiet desire, as if she's lost in thought, touching the neon, inviting the viewer into her private moment. The visual flow starts from her eyes, down her arm to the glowing tube, then to the curtain rhythm. No forced poses, just raw tension and storytelling warmth, a fusion of youthful memory and urban sensuality.",
