          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a pure red wall, her deep crimson hair cascading softly over her shoulders and chest, the vivid shade standing out richly against the backdrop, with subtle highlights catching the gentle light. Her fair, smooth skin and sharp facial features are accentuated; big bright eyes hold a playful, inviting gaze, lips slightly parted in a warm smile. She wears a black short-sleeve knit top with fine vertical texture, long sleeves covering her elbows, the fabric soft and slightly wrinkled, revealing a hint of cleavage. A dark Scottish plaid miniskirt in deep gray, black, and blue flares out with uneven edges and frayed details, adding a casual street edge. Her hands rise to her chest, fingers interlaced to form a heart shape, a simple ring on her left ring finger and pale pink polish on her neatly trimmed nails; the sleeves drape naturally. Her body is turned slightly, head tilted, looking directly at the viewer with an inviting, sensual confidence. The medium shot places her at center, the high-saturation red wall behind creating bold visual impact; a sliver of white furniture on the left adds depth. Soft, even lighting from above front illuminates her face and clothes, casting natural shadows. The warm, vibrant atmosphere combines daring red and black with a modern, youthful feel. The image has a realistic, phone-snapped quality, capturing a moment of intimate, everyday allure with artistic composition.",
