          "prompt": "A graceful Eastern noblewoman stands in a sweeping blue sky, her gaze distant and melancholic, as if lost in sensual longing. Her black hair is piled into an elegant high bun, adorned with an intricate golden dragon hairpin, with a few loose strands brushing against her pale, flawless neck. She wears a luxurious white fox fur coat, its soft, fluffy texture slightly parted to reveal a deep green brocade robe embroidered with golden lotuses and geometric patterns. A dark green silk bow is tied at her collarbone, drawing attention to the delicate curve of her shoulders and the subtle swell of her breasts. Her skin is luminous, her lips softly tinted, and her eyes enhanced with fine black liner, deep and inviting. The lighting from the upper left casts gentle shadows across her face and shoulder, highlighting her elegant bone structure. The composition is a close-up, emphasizing her refined features and the rich textures of her attire, while the open sky behind her adds a sense of timeless, open freedom. The mood is both regal and intimate, with a sensual, ethereal quality.",
