        {
          "id": "krea2-76f887c8fe4e4a8c526509a2",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣街道戏谑倚靠拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman steps out from the side door of a sleek black commercial van, her tall, lean body wrapped in a loose camel knit cardigan with white V-neck and cuffs, deep brown buttons, and a bold white letter logo on the right chest. Beneath it, a thin black spaghetti-strap tank top clings to her subtle curves, revealing her collarbone and a teasing hint of cleavage. She wears sheer black pantyhose printed with tiny hearts and letters, the transparent fabric hugging her long, slender thighs and calves. Black high heels with gold metal toe details lift her steps. Her right hand holds a small light brown leather bag with a gold chain strap; her left hand rests on the van door frame as she leans forward, one foot descending the step. Her wavy jet-black hair flutters in the breeze, strands lifting naturally with the motion. Her delicate face looks slightly to the side, eyes half-lidded and dreamy, lips pale and soft, giving an air of effortless, sensual elegance. The van interior shows cream leather seats, the exterior dark metal reflective. The scene is shot from a medium distance, the woman positioned slightly right of center, against a gray concrete curb with yellow markings and a silver metal railing crossing the foreground. Soft, overcast natural light creates even, diffused highlights and no harsh shadows. The palette is warm brown, black, white, with metallic gold accents. The overall feel is a realistic street-style snapshot with subtle bokeh blur on the background, focusing on her poised, yet subtly provocative exit—a moment of urban grace with a seductive, cinematic edge.",
