        {
          "id": "krea2-f9f3f327427c96abafef0234",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙室内媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A stunning young woman with rich auburn hair tied in a low ponytail and blunt bangs, her face framed by flawless makeup—sharp winged eyeliner, full pink lips, and a sultry, half-lidded gaze that locks onto the viewer. She leans casually against the open trunk of a sleek black SUV, her left hand gripping the edge of the tailgate while her right hand holds a sweating plastic cup of iced coffee, a white straw between her glossy lips. She wears a black off-shoulder top, one sleeve slipping down to bare her shoulder and tease the curve of her collarbone, the fabric hugging her waist tightly. Her black pleated micro-skirt rides high, revealing the lace trim and the golden logo just above her exposed thigh, the hem barely covering her ass. A thin silver chain with a tiny bead dangles between her breasts, drawing the eye down her cleavage. The setting is a lush green lawn with distant trees under a pale blue sky, the light warm and golden, casting soft shadows that accentuate the contours of her body, the condensation on her cup, and the texture of her skirt. The interior of the SUV shows cream leather seats, the trunk lid a soft beige, all details sharp and sensual. The shot is mid-range, centered on her, background blurred, focusing on her face, her wet lips, and the way her top pulls tight across her nipples. The mood is lazy, confident, and dripping with quiet desire—a perfect, everyday NSFW moment that feels both intimate and staged for seduction.",
