        {
          "id": "krea2-196a8aefb0b873d61350fe20",
          "alias": "单女舞者黑短裤舞台媚态站立跳舞",
          "prompt": "A female dancer in a sheer white long-sleeved mesh top and black high-waist shorts stands center stage, striking a sensual, powerful dance pose. Her long hair falls naturally, strands lifting with movement; dark eyeliner and red lips define her face with intense stage presence. She presses her palms together at her chest, body leaning slightly forward, left leg bent and lifted, right leg straight and strong. Black thigh-high stockings hug her long legs, and black high heels with metal buckle accents elevate her stance—a perfect balance of strength and grace. In the foreground, blurred silhouettes of the audience create an immersive live feel. The midground focuses on her full-body motion: sleek muscle lines, precise, rhythmic movements. The background is a massive LED screen displaying abstract red heart shapes and white geometric patterns arranged diagonally, producing a powerful visual impact. Red halos and white cold light interweave, crafting a passionate, dreamlike atmosphere. Stage lights beam from above, forming multiple bright spotlights; light rays cut through dust particles, creating visible beams that deepen the space and drama. Shadows and highlights play across her body, accentuating muscle tone and fabric texture. The composition follows a shifted golden ratio: she is on the right, with empty space and partial arm movements from teammates on the left for visual balance and interaction. The camera angle is slightly low, emphasizing her height and aura, shortening the distance between performer and audience. The color palette centers on red, black, and white—red for passion and love, black for mystery and power, white for cleanliness and modernity—merging to build intense emotional tension. The image presents a high-saturation, high-contrast stage aesthetic, as if captured from a major music award ceremony or live TV broadcast, with professional-level sharpness and detail, yet retaining the slight noise and motion blur of amateur footage for realism and presence. Light flows like waves: warm tones glisten on her skin, while cold light outlines edges, creating clear layers. The scene radiates youth, passion, and art fusion, as if the music thumps and the crowd cheers. Visual guidance starts from her facial expression, follows her body language to the background elements, and returns to the overall stage composition, leading the viewer to feel the complete narrative and emotion of the performance.",
