        {
          "id": "krea2-27d03a18002b456dea77201e",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙小径微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman stands center frame in a vivid scarlet long-sleeve dress, her black hair pinned up to expose an elegant nape and refined makeup—defined eyeliner, thick lashes, full lips, a sculpted yet soft face. She tilts her head slightly toward the lens, lips curled in a subtle, knowing smile, eyes radiating confidence and invitation. Her right hand lifts, palm open, as if beckoning or revealing, a simple silver ring on one finger, a slender diamond earring catching the light. The red dress features a clean, layered design: a rounded neckline, natural shoulder gathers, a fitted waist, and an A-line skirt that flares out; the fabric is smooth with a subtle sheen, evoking plush velvet. The background is a decorative wall of gold and cream leaves, varying sizes arranged across fine branches, creating a lush, opulent texture. Several red rectangular cards hang at different angles among the foliage, stamped with golden horse motifs and \"ESTEE LAUDER\" lettering, adding a festive, branded atmosphere. Light pours from above front, illuminating every detail of her face and dress, casting soft highlights on skin; the leaves and cards glow warmly, their gold reflecting a cozy brilliance. Composition is central, with the woman dominating the frame, surrounded by ornamentation that draws the eye inward. The red of her dress contrasts sharply with the golden leaves, enhancing a celebratory, luxurious feel. Midground captures her body and hand gestures rich with folds, posture, and jewelry reflections; the background is a complex, layered mix of natural and geometric forms. Overall palette is red and gold, with blacks, whites, and grays as transitions—high saturation yet harmonious. Lighting is even, no strong shadows, giving a clean, bright, professional look. The image feels like a high-end fashion event, a brand launch or gala, yet carries a hint of candid, amateur realism—slightly soft focus, subtle noise and compression at edges, as if captured on a phone or compact camera in a close, intimate moment. The dress clings to her curves, the neckline hinting at cleavage, her pose both elegant and sultry, inviting the viewer's gaze to trail from her face down to her raised hand, then to the surrounding lavish decor. The atmosphere is both dignified and playful, filled with festive joy and brand prestige—soft lighting, rich colors, intricate details, deeply evocative.",
