        {
          "id": "krea2-24dde4e7057e37318f1a562a",
          "alias": "单女米外套雪地困倦坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a rough-hewn wooden railing at the summit of a snow-covered mountain, her cream-white long down jacket unzipped low to reveal the curve of her breasts beneath a thin camisole, the fluffy white collar grazing her collarbone. Her black hair falls loosely as she tilts her head back, eyes half-closed, lips parted in a soft sigh of pleasure. One hand rests on her thigh, drawing attention to the white leggings stretched taut over her crossed legs—right leg hooked over left, pink fluffy slippers dangling from her toes. The other hand toys with the jacket’s zipper, hinting at further undress. Sunlight pours from a high noon sky, casting sharp shadows on the snow and accentuating the contours of her body. The background shows jagged mountain peaks and a deep blue sky, with a wooden boardwalk vanishing into the distance. Cold tones dominate—blue, white, gray—but her warm skin and pink shoes create an intimate focal point. The composition is three-part, with her body occupying the left third, the vast landscape opening to the right, evoking a sense of serene isolation and raw natural beauty, now charged with sensual tranquility.",
