        {
          "id": "krea2-9d8928bbe628492f4258695f",
          "alias": "单女白礼服镜前媚态自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman snaps a sultry selfie in a floor-length mirror, wearing a glamorous white off-shoulder gown with delicate lace and shimmering sequins, her cleavage softly revealed. A thick, plush white fur shrug drapes over her bare shoulders, cascading in fluffy layers. She wears a sparkling tiara of cut crystal and diamonds, its pointed peaks catching the light. Her deep brown hair is pinned up, loose tendrils brushing her cheeks. Her makeup is flawless: winged eyeliner, long false lashes, shimmering pearl-pink eyeshadow, and a soft pink gradient on her full lips. She tilts her head, right eye closed in a playful wink, a sweet, seductive smile on her lips. In her right hand, she holds a black-framed smartphone with a white case decorated with pink bows and hearts. Her fingers, long and pale with light polish, wear gold rings on her ring and middle fingers. Her left hand rests on the furry shrug, another gold ring on her finger. The background is a blurred soft gray wall, with a dark door to the right. The mirror reflects warm, soft lighting from above, highlighting her forehead, nose, collarbones, and tiara. The mood is intimate, warm, and fantasy-style, combining royal princess elegance with a modern, inviting tease. Center focus on her face, hands, and the revealing neckline.",
