        {
          "id": "krea2-64f6bc053ad9edf6b014cc25",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙咖啡厅媚态坐举手",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits at a dark wooden restaurant table, wearing a black deep V-neck sleeveless dress, a sheer light gray translucent jacket over it, and a long black leather glove on her right hand, the material glossy with fine leather texture and creases. Her left hand rests naturally on her lap. Her long, slightly wavy hair falls over her shoulders, silky and shiny. Her makeup is precise: sharp eyeliner, full lips, eyes locked directly on the camera with a lazy, confident expression. Around her neck, layered thin chain necklaces catch the light; a small tattoo is visible on her left shoulder. She leans back slightly in a black leather dining chair with a beige plush cushion, her right hand raised to touch her lips, fingers long and elegant, pose both graceful and charged with tension. The background is a dark blue textured wall, from which hangs a gold-framed Chinese carved decorative painting with intricate geometric and traditional patterns, the gold foil reflecting warm metallic light. On the left side of the frame, part of the table setting is visible: a white plate, transparent glass, cutlery, and a napkin holder, the surface clean and softly reflecting light. The composition is a medium close-up, subject centered slightly right, the gold painting creating a symmetrical visual frame that draws focus to her. The table edge and utensils in the foreground guide the eye, enhancing depth. Lighting comes from the right, creating soft side light that sculpts her silhouette and facial features, with delicate highlights and shadows on skin, hair, and gloves, evoking a quiet, luxurious atmosphere. The palette is deep blue, black, and gold, with strong cold-warm contrast, giving an artistic, high-end feel as if shot by a professional camera with precise focal length and depth of field—the background slightly blurred, subject sharp, saturated colors, rich textures, and a fusion of modern urban fashion and Eastern classical aesthetics, full of narrative tension and sensual allure.",
