        {
          "id": "krea2-fb8749601e999215db3bdee7",
          "alias": "单女灰外套街道冷淡坐吸烟",
          "prompt": "A woman sits on a wooden bench on a nighttime city street, wrapped in a fluffy gray faux-fur coat with the hood draped over her head, the soft fur showing subtle gray-blue tones and curled edges as if brushed by a breeze. The coat falls open over her thighs, revealing a short black skirt and long, bare legs. She wears sleek black pointed-toe high heels that catch the light, her ankles slightly crossed in a relaxed, confident pose. In her right hand, she holds a lit cigarette, smoke curling upward into the cool night air, while her left hand rests on her knee, fingers long with dark nail polish. A black studded crossbody bag hangs at her side, its metal rivets adding an edgy detail. She turns her body slightly, her head tilted, eyes gazing directly toward the camera, lips parted in a lazy, detached expression. Her hair falls naturally, partly obscuring her face. In the background, blurred city buildings glow with warm yellow light from windows, contrasting with the cold white streetlamp above, which illuminates the dark gray cobblestone pavement with fine wear lines. The composition is a low-angle shot, the woman positioned slightly right of center, her body creating a dynamic diagonal line. The wooden bench's grain is sharply visible in the foreground, echoing the angle of her legs. Midground focuses on the figure and bench, while the background softens into a shallow depth-of-field urban nightscape. Light comes from above left, highlighting her face and the left side of the coat, leaving the right side in deep shadow, creating natural chiaroscuro and a sculpted, realistic feel. The overall mood is cool, urban, stylish, and laced with a touch of loneliness — a mix of cold grays, blacks, and browns punctuated by warm yellow glows, evoking a quiet, mysterious night. The image carries a high-end street photography aesthetic, with slight grain and film texture, simulating a professional camera in low light, rich in detail with balanced color saturation, producing a realistic yet subtly artistic visual.",
