        {
          "id": "krea2-33dea58981c54c0ea8b089cf",
          "alias": "单女黑西装公寓媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands by a low grey concrete wall on an outdoor terrace, wearing a loose black blazer, a white pleated blouse, and a black-and-white split micro-skirt, a silk bow tie knotted at her throat. Her legs are bare, black pointed-toe stilettos arching her feet. Long hair falls over one shoulder as she leans back against the wall, left hand hanging limp, right palm pressed flat against the concrete. Her dark nail polish gleams, a silver ring catching the light. Her gaze drops to the side, lips slightly parted, expression cool and distant yet sensuously relaxed. The blazer hangs open, the white blouse strained at the bust, one button undone. The short skirt rides up, exposing the upper curve of her thighs. Behind her rises a soft-pink European building with white-framed windows and a rooftop dormer, a tower with a cross visible to the right. The sky is clear, bright blue, sunlight streams from the upper right, casting sharp shadows of her silhouette across the wall and the pale grey square tiles. A hint of moss grows between the tiles. Medium shot, subject framed slightly to the right, foreground of ground and low wall, midground of the woman, background of the architecture. The cool tones and clean light emphasize her poised, aloof beauty, touched by a quiet, urban eroticism.",
