        {
          "id": "krea2-428a9919f42d7072438fb67e",
          "alias": "单女半褪白衬衫闺房媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in soft natural light indoors, her deep brown hair pulled into a high ponytail secured with a pink bow barrette, bangs neatly framing her forehead. She wears thin-rimmed round glasses, her gaze warm and sensual as she looks directly at the camera with a knowing, slightly teasing smile. Her right hand rests under her chin, while her left hand lightly cradles a plush toy with fluffy pink curls and large red eyes, dressed in a green onesie with blue straps and colorful buttons—though her own clothing is more daring: a loose, unbuttoned white shirt that slips off one shoulder, revealing a hint of lacy bra and the curve of her breast, paired with shorts so short they barely cover her hips. She sits slightly turned, close-up framing emphasizing her face and the toy. The foreground is dominated by her and the toy; midground shows the edge of a white table and blurred chair outlines; background is a pale wall with a handwritten note reading \"NO商拍 NO外带 WiFi：贴贴甜 hey: tie tie 123\" and simple doodles. Light streams from the left, creating warm backlighting that traces soft rim light on her hair and cheeks, with delicate shadows playing over her skin and the toy's fur. The scene feels daily, intimate, and slightly voyeuristic. Color palette is soft pink, creamy white, and pale green, evoking a sweet, healing aesthetic with a film-grain, slightly overexposed soft-focus quality. Focus is sharp on her face and the toy, with natural bokeh in the background. The atmosphere blends innocent nostalgia with a deliberate, seductive undertone, as if capturing a candid yet staged moment in an afternoon café—now transformed into a private boudoir. Her pose is relaxed but inviting, and the toy sits slightly left of center, creating an interactive, story-driven tension that balances childhood comfort with adult desire.",
