        {
          "id": "krea2-4b3c73deb4dc7306cb2c8244",
          "alias": "单女透视蓝高领衫摄影棚媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a soft light-blue backdrop, wearing a form-fitting dark blue turtleneck knit dress that hugs every curve—the ribbed fabric taut across her breasts, hinting at the outline of her nipples beneath. The hem rides mid-thigh, exposing long, sleek legs clad in glossy black sheer stockings that shimmer and reveal the smooth skin underneath. She stands slightly sideways, one hip cocked, creating a subtle arch in her spine that accentuates her waist and the gentle swell of her rear. Her black, straight shoulder-length hair falls softly around her face, which is fair and flawless, with a sultry, half-lidded gaze and a teasing, subtle smile. Her lips are glossed a delicate pink. She holds a white speech-bubble sign with Korean text '청설' in purple-pink letters, the prop drawing attention to her hands. On her left arm dangles a black diamond-stitched leather chain bag with a shiny Y-shaped metal clasp. Her feet are encased in black pointed stilettos, the heels tall and thin, reflecting the studio light. The red carpet beneath her gleams faintly. The background wall is plain blue, out-of-focus Korean text (cast names, film info) scattered behind her. The lighting is soft and even, highlighting the sheen of her stockings, the subtle wet-looking gloss on her lips, and the way the dress clings to her body. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, leading the eye from her face down to the sign, then along her legs to her heels—a deliberate, sensual visual path. The mood is clean, professional, yet charged with a hint of intimate allure, like a behind-the-scenes moment for a promotional shoot.",
