          "prompt": "A young woman with intricate golden braids and flowing hair sits indoors, wearing a tight red-and-white striped tank top that clings to her slender body, her left hand pulling the strap down to expose her bare shoulder and a glimpse of cleavage. She stares directly at the camera with a deep, lustful gaze, red lips slightly parted, nipples visibly erect beneath the thin fabric. In the foreground, a crumpled red-and-white cloth lies at the bottom left. Mid-shot reveals her torso from chest to waist, the soft fabric hugging her curves. Background: pale green walls, white grid ceiling with fluorescent lights, a large wooden-framed mirror reflecting \"IMPACT RE!T\", a black cabinet cluttered with a mini fridge and bags. Overhead light casts soft shadows on her face and body, hair glowing with highlights. She exudes a cool, elegant sensuality, posing naturally as if caught in a backstage moment, her hand teasing the neckline while she bites her lip. The scene feels like a candid, erotic snapshot with vivid red, white, and gold tones contrasting the cool background.",
