        {
          "id": "krea2-6daf5a9e0e9f5ac808dd78e6",
          "alias": "单女透视米外套楼梯媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands poised inside a grand classical palace, her body subtly arched as she grips the marble railing. She wears a cream tweed jacket, cropped and textured, unbuttoned to reveal a tight white high-collar blouse that clings to her breasts, with a matching short skirt riding high on her thighs. Black sheer stockings define her long legs, contrasting with her tousled dark hair and the small gold-lettered headband. Her gaze meets the camera, serene yet charged with a quiet confidence. One hand rests on the polished marble balustrade, fingers adorned with delicate rings; the other hangs loosely at her side. Behind her, soaring Corinthian columns rise to an arched ceiling with intricate reliefs. A sweeping circular staircase with ornate iron railings and vintage sconces ascends into the warm amber light of crystal chandeliers. At the center, a marble pedestal supports three angel statues surrounded by books and ornaments, with distant tourists adding depth. The symmetrical composition draws the eye to her face and the subtle tension in her posture—the tweed tight across her hips, the hint of lace at her collar, the play of light on her stockinged thighs. Soft, even illumination casts a golden glow over the marble surfaces, creating an atmosphere of refined eroticism—a still from a high-fashion editorial where elegance meets raw sensuality.",
