          "alias": "单女白连衣裙摄影棚微笑倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long, glossy black hair cascading down, strands softly framing her face. Her skin is pale and smooth, with subtle shimmering eyeshadow, defined eyeliner, and full curled lashes. She gazes directly at the camera with a slight, inviting smile, lips glossed in pale pink, slightly parted to reveal white teeth. She wears a white lace slip dress with thin straps, puffed sleeves trimmed with tiny pearls, the fabric sheer and translucent, hinting at her curves. Her right hand gently touches her chin, fingers slender, posture relaxed and leaning forward slightly. Lighting from a large softbox above right casts gentle highlights on her cheekbones, nose, and collarbones, while shadows deepen her neck and shoulders. The background is a dark night garden with dense green foliage—palm leaves, ferns, broad leaves—some lit bright, others lost in shadow. In the upper-left corner, a hand holding a professional camera and a reflector stand are visible, indicating a studio-like outdoor shoot. A cool white key light creates lens flare and visible light beams through dust particles. Composition is a close-up portrait, slightly tilted, subject facing the viewer. The focus is sharp on her face and hand, background blurred. Color palette is cool: white dress and dark green foliage contrast with warm skin and lip tones. The overall feel is both fashionably intimate and sexually charged, capturing a moment of seductive vulnerability in a nighttime shoot.",
