        {
          "id": "krea2-0783d4930040c83a79441056",
          "alias": "单女长裤健身房媚态站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A fit, toned Asian woman takes a sultry selfie in a gym, standing beside a dark gray squat rack. She wears a skin-tight light gray athletic top with a zipper, stretched taut over her firm chest and defined abs, and matching high-waisted leggings that cling to her round ass and strong thighs—the shiny fabric accentuates every curve and muscle. Her long black hair falls freely, strands brushing her shoulders. Her face is sharp, eyes focused and confident. She holds a phone with a cartoon case in her right hand for a mirror selfie, while her left hand grips the silver bar of the rack. A sleek silver watch adorns her wrist. She turns her body slightly, creating a pronounced S-curve that emphasizes her hips and waist. In the foreground, the red-capped barbell and black weight plates are clearly visible. The mid-ground shows her full figure amid blurred gym equipment. Warm overhead yellow light spills over her, creating soft shadows and highlighting the glossy texture of her outfit. The dark rubber floor reflects faint light. The composition places her to the right, with the rack dominating the left. The vibe fuses modern fitness culture with a private, intimate moment—as if captured by a smartphone, with slight grain and natural color. The palette is gray, black, silver, with red barbell caps as focal points. The image radiates raw, unabashed sensuality, strength, and a touch of exhibitionism.",
