        {
          "id": "krea2-972279c641c50ee9de7db84c",
          "alias": "单女竹林媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A female warrior in tight black leather armor, wide-brimmed bamboo hat adorned with a few dead leaves, stands in a slight side pose. Her right hand grips an antique longsword, cold metallic sheen under warm amber light, intricate hilt carvings. Her left hand gently touches the blade, fingers slightly apart, feeling its weight and heat. Her face is cold and resolute, eyes sharp and deep, gazing forward with weathered calm and defiance. A few strands of hair blow across her forehead, adding motion and rebellion. The armor is detailed with fine stitching and rivets, heavy shoulder and arm guards, layered and textured. Several short swords hang at her waist, scabbards etched with ancient runes. The leather hugs her curves tightly, accentuating her full breasts and hips, a hint of sweat-sheened skin at the exposed collarbone and lower back. The composition is a close-up, character filling the frame. Background is profound darkness, one warm yellow light from the side creating stark chiaroscuro, highlighting her face, sword, and armor contours. Foreground has the vertical line of the blade, leading the eye up to her face. Midground shows her body and motion. Background lost in black. Atmosphere is mysterious, tense, as if in a night battlefield or deep bamboo grove, air thick with killing intent. Tones: black, brown, gold. Warm golden light vs cold black armor, strong visual contrast. Shot with a high-resolution cinema camera, filmic texture with slight grain and natural depth-of-field blur. Smooth light transitions, rich detail: skin pores, leather wrinkles, metal reflections. The result is an artistic yet hyper-realistic visual, like a classic scene from a wuxia film, full of story and immersive sensuality.",
