        {
          "id": "krea2-fd45270ae151715fa9923416",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣摄影棚媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a plain light gray backdrop, her black hair woven into two thick braids draped over her chest, topped with a red reindeer antler headpiece adorned with gold ornaments and tiny glittering sequins, radiating festive warmth. She wears a vivid red knitted cardigan with a daring low neckline that reveals a black thin-strap camisole underneath, the back features a circular cutout connected by a metal buckle ring, blending fashion and sensuality. A dark blue plaid pleated skirt sits high on her waist, cinched by a black leather belt with a silver metal buckle. She gently grasps both braids, tilting her head slightly toward the camera with clear, bright eyes, lips painted in soft coral. Her skin is fair and smooth, facial features delicate with a straight nose bridge, harmonious and three-dimensional. The composition is centrally symmetrical, the figure positioned center with a slight tilt for natural visual balance. The foreground shows the sharp, detailed subject from hair strands to fabric textures, the midground reveals her upper body and part of the waist, emphasizing layers and accessory details. The background is clean and uncluttered. Lighting comes from a soft source above and in front, evenly illuminating her face and body with subtle, naturally transitioning shadows, creating a clean, bright tonal effect. The overall mood is warm, festive, and inviting, with red dominating, accented by black, blue, and skin tones, saturation moderate and not harsh. The image texture feels like a professional studio shot with high-resolution detail yet retains an amateur, everyday intimacy—slight grain, soft bokeh, natural skin texture—enhancing realism and life. This captures a blend of artistic beauty and casual photography, exuding a relaxed, joyful yet refined and elegant atmosphere.",
