          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a deep navy blue backdrop, wearing a fitted black blazer unbuttoned over a rumpled white shirt and loosened plaid tie, black shorts riding high on her thighs, sheer black fishnet stockings hugging her long legs, and stiletto black heels. Her right hand rests casually on the body of a glossy white electric bass guitar, fingers brushing the strings; her left hand is tucked into her blazer pocket, pulling the fabric taut across her chest. She tilts her hips slightly, posture relaxed but powerful, staring directly into the lens with cold, confident eyes. Black hair falls loose, strands teasing her cheek, a tiny silver earring catching the light. The white bass guitar has four pickups and gold knobs, a black neck, and a subtle logo on the headstock. Lighting is soft and directional from above front, casting natural shadows that emphasize her collarbones, the curve of her waist, and the sheen of the fishnets. The deep blue background is uniform, creating a clean, layered space. The composition centers her, with the guitar as a stark white focal point against dark tones. Details are sharp—fabric wrinkles, texture of the fishnets, the slight gleam on her lips. The overall mood is cool, controlled, and subtly seductive, blending schoolgirl edge with rock attitude, as if for a luxury music editorial or album cover. Every element feels deliberate, from the way her blazer gapes to the way her fingers hover near the bass strings, promising both melody and tension.",
