        {
          "id": "krea2-4a95278dcc8209727b6d3878",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑毛衣床媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman with jet-black hair and blunt bangs, pale skin, bright, sultry eyes and a seductive half-smile, sits on a soft bed in warm indoor lighting. She wears a sparkling silver \"BIRTHDAY GIRL\" crown with tiny crystals, and a matching silver \"BIRTHDAY GIRL\" sash across her bare chest. Her black knit cardigan is open, revealing she is completely topless underneath, with perky nipples visible. She wears only a gray cropped tee (pushed up) and unbuttoned dark jeans, open at the waist. She holds two giant gold foil \"20\" balloons in each hand, one pressed playfully between her thighs. The balloons have metallic creases and shine under the soft front-top light. A white stuffed toy with blue eyes and a pink bow sits on the bed beside a \"Cinnamoroll\" cushion, blurred in the background. Warm yellow lighting highlights her face, breasts, and the balloons. Slight film grain gives a candid, intimate feel. Close-up shot from slightly below, focusing on her expression and the erotic contrast between birthday innocence and exposed skin.",
