        {
          "id": "krea2-51a66e407cdb9d7dcea5be81",
          "alias": "单女白外套摄影棚困倦站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a pure pink gradient backdrop, her long black hair falling in glossy, silken strands, framing a face with sharp, elegant features. Her gaze is calm and direct toward the lens, lips parted slightly, exuding a blend of soft intimacy and distant allure. Her body is turned in a subtle three-quarter pose, head tilted just enough to create a tender, flattering angle. She wears an off-white short wool coat with a wide, draped lapel and a massive, puffy bow at the chest—symmetrical, plush, and drawing the eye. The coat flares into an A-line hem that stops at mid-thigh. Beneath, a tight gray-and-white plaid miniskirt hugs her waist, flaring slightly at the hem, emphasizing her narrow waist and the curve of her hips. Her legs are sheathed in transparent silver shimmer stockings, each movement catching light in a cascade of tiny metallic sparkles, skin visible through the gossamer fabric. On her feet, glossy black patent leather stiletto pumps with pointy toes and a small black bow at the vamp echo the coat's bow. The full-body composition places her centered, feet to crown, the seamless pink background melting into floor so that no horizon breaks the dreamy space. Soft, directional front-top lighting creates creamy highlights on her face, the silk of the stockings, and the patent leather, with smooth, shadowless transitions. The mood is quiet, sensual, and polished—sweet yet cool, high-fashion but natural. The eye travels from her face down to the oversized bow, then along the coat's line to her legs and shoes, a graceful vertical flow emphasizing her elegant form and the tactile sheen of her outfit. Every detail is crisp, as if captured by professional studio photography, with a subtly erotic charge in the way her lips part and the stockings cling.",
