        {
          "id": "krea2-e5238bb139d391a0956b426d",
          "alias": "单女粉T恤酒店媚态站立比耶",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a full-length mirror in a hotel room, her soft, light-brown wavy hair glowing under warm yellow light, falling naturally over her shoulders and back with slightly curled ends, giving a lazy, elegant vibe. Her makeup is flawless: sharp eyeliner, a gradient of pale pink and champagne eyeshadow, thick curled lashes, a faint blush on her cheeks, and full, naturally pink lips. She turns slightly, head tilted, eyes lowered, gazing at her white polka-dot handbag as she bites the strap with her lips, a relaxed yet playful pose that exudes youthful sensuality. She wears a pink lace camisole with thin straps, revealing part of her collarbone and shoulder skin, layered under a sheer, lightweight short peplum top in pale pink. Her lower body is sheathed in a high-waist brown leather skirt, smooth and glossy, hugging her curves and emphasizing her long legs. Her right hand holds the black strap of the handbag, her left hand hangs naturally with fingers slightly curled. The bag is white leather with black polka dots, a simple yet chic rectangular flap design with a gold V-shaped metal logo, edged in black. She stands before a large floor-to-ceiling mirror, reflecting the room: a large bed with white linens and neatly arranged pillows, a dark wooden bedside table with a red book, a lamp, and small items. The walls are light beige with wooden wainscoting, a simple pendant lamp hangs from the ceiling casting warm yellow light, creating halos and lens flares in the mirror. The compact space feels layered, with a doorway visible in the distance, softly lit. The shot is at eye level, the subject centered slightly right, balanced composition. Foreground focuses on her and the handbag; midground shows the mirror reflection and some furniture; background reveals the bed and doorway, creating a circular visual path from her face to the bag to the reflection. Lighting is soft and even from the ceiling and ambient sources, with delicate shadows. Her skin is smoothly illuminated, fabric wrinkles visible, and the bag's surface reflects light, highlighting its texture. The overall mood is warm, intimate, with a casual, fashionable, lived-in feel. The color palette is dominated by warm yellow, accented by pink and brown, evoking a relaxing, everyday moment that feels like a spontaneous capture from a phone or camera, with an amateur, authentic quality. The image is rich in detail, with clear layers and harmonious tones, full of narrative and emotion.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
