        {
          "id": "krea2-0600e903d9d3d381fed3a730",
          "alias": "单女黑外套戏谑拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman on a red carpet, half-turned with a teasing, sultry smile over her shoulder. She wears a cropped black-and-white checkered jacket with black piping, slightly open to reveal her white high-neck blouse clinging to her breasts. A short black velvet skirt hugs her hips, rising slightly as she shifts, exposing the tops of her thighs. Sheer black stockings shine under the warm lights, outlining every curve of her legs and the shape of her ass. Black stiletto heels with metal ankle straps elongate her legs. Her right hand lifts in a casual, inviting wave; her left rests at her hip, fingers painted pale pink, a ring catching the light. Her hair is in a neat low bun, makeup natural yet lips soft and glossy, eyes smoldering with a seductive gaze. The red carpet texture is crisp, edges glinting. Blurred audience in heavy coats and hats fills the background, along with camera equipment in the right foreground. Stage lights brighten the backdrop featuring 'dTV' branding. In the distance, a man in a green suit holds a camera. Lighting from above and front casts soft shadows, emphasizing the sensual contours of her body—the curve of her waist, the swell of her chest beneath the blouse, the sheer cling of the stockings on her thighs. Mid-shot composition, subject left, diagonal lines guide the eye along her form. Colors: red, black, white with hints of green and blue. Subtle motion blur and natural grain create a candid, documentary aesthetic, capturing the confident, erotic allure of a star commanding the red carpet.",
