        {
          "id": "krea2-3ad0147745e0076b02fca49e",
          "alias": "单女米毛衣城市媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits sensually on a beige corduroy armchair, dressed in an elegant khaki outfit: a loose knit cardigan slightly open to reveal a white top, paired with a short high-waist skirt that rides up her thighs. Her deep brown hair is pulled into a tight high ponytail, and she wears thin-rimmed glasses, her gaze intense and seductive through the lenses. Her right hand caresses her cheek, while her left hand rests lazily on the armrest. She crosses her legs, one foot in a black knee-high stocking and brown pointed heel, the other dangling bare, showcasing long, shapely legs. Her body leans back in a relaxed, confident pose, exuding a subtle invitation. The warm indoor setting features soft curtains, a vintage side table with a colorful ceramic piece, a wooden cabinet, and a dark wooden floor. Several books are scattered on the right. The mid-shot composition places her slightly right of center, with the sofa dominating the foreground and soft side lighting accentuating her curves and the textures of her clothes. The warm earthy tones—beige, khaki, brown—contrast with the black stockings and shoes, creating a cozy yet provocative atmosphere. Every detail, from her alluring gaze to the natural light, crafts a cinematic, sensual portrait of modern urban femininity—independent, composed, and deeply enticing.",
