          "alias": "单女露胸粉连衣裙水边戏谑站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the edge of a tranquil pond, wearing a sheer pale-pink lace dress that clings to her curves, the lightweight skirt fluttering in the breeze and leaving little to the imagination—her nipples visible through the delicate fabric, the white lace trim and drawstring at her chest accentuating her cleavage. Her long black hair is braided loosely, strands teasing her cheeks and neck as she turns her head slightly, a soft, knowing smile on her lips, eyes half-lidded and inviting, as if sharing a silent, intimate secret with the viewer. The mid-shot composition centers her below the frame, the foreground a shimmering pool of water reflecting the sky and her bare legs, the surface rippling around the rocks and reeds. Midground shows mossy stones and lush greenery framing her silhouette, while the background is a sun-dappled hillside under a clear blue sky. Warm afternoon light pours from above, casting soft shadows across her face and highlighting the dampness on her skin, the dress clinging to her wet body in places. The scene has a nostalgic, slightly grainy film aesthetic with warm tones, blurred edges, and a sense of stolen summer intimacy—erotic yet dreamlike, capturing a moment of quiet desire.",
