        {
          "id": "krea2-44baaeaef8ae07778746cb63",
          "alias": "单女白外套戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the dirt infield of a baseball stadium, wearing a white Los Angeles Angels varsity jacket with red trim at cuffs and collar, black lettering on chest, unzipped to reveal a tight white crop top that exposes her toned midriff and the swell of her cleavage. Low-rise jeans hug her hips and thighs, unbuttoned at the top to show a hint of lace. She adjusts a vivid red Angels baseball cap pulled low over her face, eyes barely visible, lips slightly parted in a confident, almost teasing smirk. Her short wavy hair frames her face; natural makeup with a glossy lip. White long acrylic nails, layered silver necklaces, bracelets, rings, and a smartwatch glint. Body leans forward, head tilted, one hand lifting the cap, the other resting on her hip, pushing her jacket open further. Foreground: sharp close-up on her face and exposed skin. Midground: green outfield grass and brown dirt. Background: massive stadium stands with deep blue seats, scattered spectators, red advertising boards, a large electronic scoreboard, and a soft blue evening sky with warm golden sidelight casting rim light on her curves. Slight low-angle wide shot with subtle edge distortion, central composition. Natural evening light, shallow shadows, vibrant red/white/green/blue palette. The image feels like a candid moment between innings, with slight grain and motion blur for a realistic phone-camera aesthetic—intimate, youthful, and charged with sensual confidence.",
