        {
          "id": "krea2-b2776ee783ab94f9932e7068",
          "alias": "单女蓝旗袍窗边媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired, blue-eyed woman with white rabbit ears, wearing a tight blue cheongsam top unbuttoned partway to reveal her ample cleavage, decorated with white tassels and red Chinese knots, ornate metal shoulder ornaments, a white belt cinching her waist, and black leather guards. She wears black thigh-high boots and black bandage stockings. She sits on an orange-yellow traditional patterned cushion, leaning forward, her left hand in a black glove gently caressing her own exposed thigh, right hand resting naturally beside her. She gazes seductively at the camera, lips slightly parted. Scattered at her feet are papers with Chinese characters and discarded clothing. Background is an oriental classical interior: left side a wooden screen and hanging bead curtains of transparent beads creating vertical light streaks; behind her a small dark wood table and chair with a floral-decorated plate and a potted plant; right side red drapes and a carved wooden window frame letting in soft natural light. Warm color palette of brown, orange, and blue. Medium shot composition: figure center-right, foreground with clothes and papers, midground with her and the cushion, background furniture. Light from the right window casts soft chiaroscuro on her body and floor, with dappled light through the bead curtain, enhancing depth and sensual atmosphere. The scene feels like a candid, intimate moment captured in natural light, rich in artistic tension and immersion.",
