          "alias": "单女白衬衫害羞站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways, her long black hair cascading softly, strands brushing her flushed cheek as she lowers her head to gaze at a decadent cake, her glossy red lips parted slightly, eyes half-lidded with sensual focus. She wears a white striped long-sleeve blouse, unbuttoned at the V-neck to reveal sharp collarbones and a hint of cleavage, sleeves puffed with vintage flair, paired with tight black shorts and sheer black stockings that cling to her thighs. Her left wrist dangles a thin black string bracelet, while her right hand gently holds a clear glass plate bearing a layered chocolate cake with creamy caramel filling, topped with white frosting and a fresh strawberry, a label reading \"TWOBONE\" stuck into it. The scene is set against a dark grey wall with a pale vertical seam, soft lighting from the front-right casts warm shadows across her body, emphasizing the curve of her hips and the smooth skin of her legs. She leans slightly, her gaze directed downward at the cake, a quiet, intimate moment with an undercurrent of seduction—the air thick with indulgence and desire.",
