        {
          "id": "krea2-bc149fbdfcaa04f31fcca4c2",
          "alias": "单女粉连衣裙霓虹夜景媚态脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges elegantly on a wide, plush grey velvet sofa, wearing a delicate light pink two-piece dress—a short cropped top with sheer lace ruffles that barely covers her breasts, and a high-waisted tight pleated mini skirt with a sparkling rhinestone belt, clinging to her hips. Her deep brown hair falls in natural curls over her shoulders, makeup flawless with glossy red lips, eyes hazy and seductive, staring directly into the lens. One hand lifts near her head, the other rests casually at her side, showing off her long bare legs and silver crystal high heels shimmering with dense diamonds, catching the light. The velvet sofa has a soft grey-purple hue with gold stitching, adorned with a gold velvet throw pillow and a leopard-print dark cushion. Behind her, a massive floor-to-ceiling window reveals a glittering city nightscape—tall buildings, neon blues, purples, and whites, a distant landmark glowing blue. Semi-transparent white sheer curtains drift in a breeze, casting soft blurred shadows. A reflection of two blurred figures using phones appears on the glass left side, adding a slice of real life. Low-angle shot composition, her body extends diagonally toward the lower left, creating strong visual flow from the glittering heels in the foreground to her sensual pose, then to the urban backdrop. Warm indoor lighting caresses her skin, contrasting with cool city light pouring through the window, enhancing every texture and detail—the velvet, the rhinestones, the lace, the curves. The atmosphere feels like a high-end social party moment, intimate and cinematic, with a polished yet natural film-grain quality, rich in detail and visual impact.",
