        {
          "id": "krea2-230b9b1e319b0f5549a8b83a",
          "alias": "单女粉内衣寺庙困倦站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a bust shot before vintage floral wallpaper, her head tilted slightly, gaze meeting the camera with a languid, soft expression. Her long black hair is swept up in a high bun, with loose strands falling naturally across her forehead and cheeks, adding a casual, realistic feel. She wears thin-rimmed glasses, their lenses catching soft light, with a delicate chain earring dangling from the temple, swaying with subtle movement. Her makeup is light, lips a natural pink, skin fair and smooth, showing a healthy, authentic texture. She is dressed in a pale pink lace bra with thin straps, intricate layered floral patterns at the bust, matched with a lace panty of the same design—elegant and intimate. Her right hand grips a bouquet of dried flowers in white, pale pink, and beige, petals slightly curled, long stems tied with a thin string, simple and romantic. Her left hand holds a burgundy shirt jacket, sleeves casually rolled, hem falling naturally in rich folds and shadow play, the fabric soft with a faint sheen. The background is vintage floral wallpaper in pinks, reds, and greens, full blooms and intricate vines creating a nostalgic atmosphere. To the right, a gilded frame is faintly visible, containing a blurred landscape painting with a bright circular light source—maybe a moon or sun—adding a dreamlike touch. The composition is centered, the figure occupying the middle, head slightly tilted, eyes engaging the viewer directly. Foreground: dried flowers and shirt; mid-ground: the subject; background: wallpaper and frame, layered with clear depth. Visual flow starts from the face, extends to the flowers and clothing details, then back to background elements, forming a complete visual loop. Light comes from the left front, soft and warm, like indoor light or dusk, with shadows transitioning on the right and behind her, enhancing three-dimensionality and space. The overall lighting is cozy and private, carrying a quiet poetic mood. The image has an amateur, everyday quality—like taken with a regular camera or phone at home—preserving slight noise and imperfect details: fabric creases, slightly messy hair, skin texture, making it lifelike and genuine. The color palette is warm pink, cream, burgundy, and light green, harmonious, evoking a gentle, romantic, and subtly sexy atmosphere. The style blends vintage, romantic, and modern intimate aesthetics, with strong artistic appeal and emotional expression.",
