        {
          "id": "krea2-96e6fc2d5b27c778d0fd34c4",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙广场媚态坐演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a white woven hanging egg chair on an outdoor balcony, her tousled shoulder-length warm brown hair falling in soft, layered waves with a few loose strands framing her face. Her skin is porcelain-smooth, with delicately defined features—soft, naturally arched brows, earthy smoky eye makeup with a subtle cat-eye flick, thick curled lashes, and glossy pale pink lips parted just slightly, a knowing, seductive half-smile playing at the corner of her mouth. Her gaze is direct, glistening with invitation, exuding an intelligent, approachable sensuality. She wears a deep-V-neck dress in blue with tiny white floral print, short puff sleeves with ruffled cuffs, cinched at the waist to accentuate her slim figure, the skirt barely reaching mid-thigh, made of light, flowing fabric that drapes elegantly. Her hands are crossed demurely over her knees, left resting on right, a delicate gold chain bracelet on her right wrist, a simple gold pendant necklace at her collarbone, and tiny gold studs in her ears. The overall look is fresh, sweet, yet undeniably alluring. Beside her sits a cream chain-strap square bag with chunky white metal links, exuding luxury. The composition places her slightly left of center in the midground, following the rule of thirds. The background opens to a sprawling cityscape: distant rows of modern high-rise residential buildings in gray-white tones scattered on hillsides, a broad calm lake mirroring the sky and structures, tree-lined shores with dense greenery showing rich layers of green. The sky is clear blue with wispy clouds, bright soft sunlight streaming diagonally from the right, casting natural shadows on her face and body, with subtle highlights on the chair’s woven texture. The color palette is harmonious—blue, green, white—creating a fresh, serene atmosphere. The scene is layered: foreground with woman and chair, midground with lake and buildings, background with skyline and distant mountains, leading the eye from her face outward into the expansive view. The lighting is smooth, contrasts gentle, giving a luxurious yet everyday candid feel, as if captured by a high-end professional camera, perfect for showcasing modern female independence, confidence, and sensual ease.",
