        {
          "id": "krea2-57f61875080146c4fac2ddca",
          "alias": "单女粉短裙桌边媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long brown hair adorned with colorful butterfly clips sits in a pink-themed room, her gaze locked on the camera with a seductive, confident stare, right hand cupping her cheek. She wears a floral short-sleeve top that reveals a hint of cleavage and a short pink furry skirt, crossed thighs exposed, one leg bent with a foot in rainbow Crocs covered in small charms resting on a circular pink mat, the other foot dangling. Her wrists are stacked with layered bracelets. In the foreground, a round mirror reflector on the floor captures part of her foot and the carpet, adding depth. The desk beside her holds an open manga, a pink keyboard, white mouse, a small game controller, a retro portable player, and scattered stickers. Behind her, a white desk with a turned-off monitor and pink headphones. The room's walls are soft pink, decorated with red-and-white braided rope, and pink plush bunnies and bears hang from the ceiling on bead chains. A glass-brick window lets in soft natural light, casting faint green plant shadows. In the corner, a pink chair draped with a plaid blanket and white pillow. Composition centers her slightly left, with diagonal lines from the foot mat to the upper-right decorations, enhanced by perspective. The color palette is predominantly pink with bright yellow, purple, and white accents, high saturation and contrast. Lighting combines left natural window light with right desk lamp, creating soft side shadows on her face and body, highlighting curves. The scene feels sweet yet rebellious, blending pop culture, anime aesthetics, and everyday realism, like a candid digital camera shot with light grain, oozing youthful sensuality and personal expression.",
