        {
          "id": "krea2-a075ae6f4a1ec71a389b8734",
          "alias": "单女半褪镜前困倦倚靠注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman captured from a low-angle upward gaze, wearing a slightly tilted white beret with black hair cascading naturally, loose strands brushing her cheeks and forehead—casual and languid. Her eyes lock directly into the lens, clear and deep, with faint pinpricks of light reflecting in her pupils as if she can see through the soul. Her lips part slightly, caught in a moment between speech and silence. Her skin is fair and luminous with a natural sheen. Her arms are crossed and folded before her, hands supporting her chin, fingers long and nails neatly trimmed with a soft natural color. Her body leans back slightly, shoulders relaxed, wearing a simple white strappy top that reveals a slender collarbone and shoulder line—the whole posture elegant yet charged with tension. The subject fills the lower half of the frame, with the upper half dominated by a deep blue gradient background transitioning from slate gray-blue at the top to a cool-toned halo around the figure, forming a soft circular light patch that creates a dreamy atmosphere. The foreground is a sharp close-up of her face and hands; the background is completely blurred with layered shadows. Midground is formed by her body contours and arm lines, creating strong chiaroscuro against the background. Visual guidance is drawn by her eyes and the tilt of her head toward her face, while the reflection below enhances symmetry and depth—she casts a clear inverted image on a mirror-like or glossy surface, her reflected facial expression slightly distorted but retaining the same mood, adding mystery and artistry. The composition is vertical, emphasizing elongated proportions and spatial extension. Lighting comes from a soft source slightly above and in front, casting delicate highlights and shadows across her face, hands, and hat, enhancing three-dimensionality. The cool background halo contrasts warmly with her skin, boosting visual impact. The overall mood is quiet, slightly melancholic, modern and artistic, like a meticulously styled fashion portrait shot with professional equipment, achieving cinematic texture and fine grain control, with film-like warm color reproduction and natural depth of field. No extraneous decor or distracting elements—minimalist treatment forces full attention on her emotional expression and aesthetic details. The scene is subtly sensual: the thin strap of her top slips just a little off one shoulder, revealing the soft curve of her breast, and her parted lips invite a breathless intimacy.",
