        {
          "id": "krea2-77de72843b82d2a226ddb64c",
          "alias": "单女粉礼服舞台微笑站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A woman in a sheer, light pink satin strapless gown stands center stage, the sweetheart neckline cut low to expose the full swell of her breasts, a delicate bow perched between them. The fabric clings to her waist before cascading into lustrous, wide pleats that shimmer like liquid silk. Her right hand lightly lifts the hem, hinting at a glimpse of bare thigh; her left wrist bears a crimson bangle, a ring glinting on her finger. She tilts her head, eyes soft and inviting, lips parted in a subtle, knowing smile. Her black hair is swept into a sleek low bun, baring her long neck and sharp collarbones; diamond teardrops sway at her ears, a fine chain nestles at her throat. In the deep blue backdrop, soft bokeh lights blur into a dreamy haze. On the right, a second figure in a white fringe dress enters the frame—her arm and part of her skirt visible, the fringe cascading like rain, adding texture and movement. Front-top lighting caresses the woman’s skin and gown, creating warm highlights and shadowed valleys that emphasize her curves. The composition is cinematic, mid-shot, with the subject at the golden ratio, her gaze drawing the viewer into an intimate, charged moment. Film-grain texture, high color saturation, and realistic depth of field give it the feel of a high-end fashion editorial—sensual, elegant, and provocatively alive.",
