        {
          "id": "krea2-a5b8541bb6baba0773551661",
          "alias": "单女红西装卧室困倦蹲注视",
          "prompt": "A young blonde woman crouches on pale tiled flooring, wearing a tight, glossy red latex bunny suit with a bare-back cutout that accentuates her spine and shoulder blades. The outfit perfectly molds her waist and hips, with a high slit exposing her thighs, paired with white stockings and pink high heels. A white wristband with black stripes is visible at her ankle. She wears oversized pink latex bunny ears tipped with white fluff, her long straight blonde hair falling neatly in bangs. Her makeup is heavy: deep purple smoky eyes, long curled lashes, soft pink lips. She gazes at the camera with a hazy, bedroom look, her right hand gently touching her cheek, left hand resting on her knee, body slightly twisted into an S-curve. A large white fluffy teddy bear sits to the left. The background shows a colorful interior: a pink-framed multi-tier shelf with glass-domed desserts, small toys, and a glowing carousel decoration emitting a faint blue-purple light. A three-drawer chest in pink, sky blue, and light green with gold handles holds a glass bottle of pink liquid tied with white ribbon, beside a spherical lamp radiating a warm yellow glow. Sheer curtains in lavender-to-white gradient drift softly. The room has light blue walls. Soft lighting from the front-left casts natural shadows, highlighting her form and the plush textures. A medium shot frames her slightly right of center, with a shallow depth of field blurring the background. The atmosphere is sweet, dreamy, and subtly seductive, with dominant pink, white, and lavender tones accented by red and blue, evoking a polished Japanese kawaii aesthetic.",
