        {
          "id": "krea2-2640a9e36a860d1f1f8847d0",
          "alias": "单女连衣裙摄影棚媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands centered, wearing a dark brown, pleated, tight-fitting dress with crossed shoulder straps and a high waist that accentuates her slender waist and long legs. The hemline ends mid-thigh, revealing black stockings and black pointed-toe high heels, creating an elegant yet sensual silhouette. Her hair is braided into two strands resting over her chest, topped with transparent-framed glasses and gold earrings. Her makeup is refined, with natural lips, her eyes locked on the camera with a calm, confident expression—slightly suggestive. A gold bracelet adorns her left wrist, and a ring on her right ring finger. Her body is slightly turned, relaxed, exuding a dynamic poise. The foreground is green artificial turf with clear horizontal stripes, soft and layered, dotted with metal stands and wires, hinting at an event or studio setting. The woman fills the midground, fully visible. The background features a massive, hyper-realistic face art installation—a close-up of a face with striking gray-green eyes, detailed pupils, and realistic skin texture including pores, spots, and freckles. The nose and lips are rendered in a surreal style, with smooth skin and natural light transitions. The scene is lit by soft, even front light, creating natural shadows and enhancing the sensual contrast between the dark brown dress and the green ground. The composition is centrally symmetrical, with the woman as the focal point, the giant face echoing her presence, and the depth amplified by the foreground turf and abstract background. The visual flow draws the viewer's gaze from her face upward through the background eyes. The lighting merges clean commercial photography with avant-garde artistry, creating a cool, rational yet alluring atmosphere. The image is highly detailed, blending realistic human form with surreal background elements, like a captured moment from a high-end fashion event—both documentary and artistic. Shot with professional indoor lighting, high resolution, and no watermarks, it exudes a polished, sensory-rich quality that makes her presence both elegant and provocatively forward, merging fashion, art, and technology into a contemporary portrait.",
