        {
          "id": "krea2-9a0813dd4a45593f64d91bcc",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙广场媚态注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a deep-cut black sleeveless dress with wide satin ribbons accenting her shoulders and chest, the fabric clinging to her breasts, her nipples faintly visible through the material. Her brown hair is swept into a high bun with blunt bangs, her eyes lined with sharp black liner, lips painted glossy crimson, parted in a sultry, knowing smile. She wears long black mesh gloves studded with tiny rhinestones, her left hand cradling a square white cream cake with pearl-like frosting and a single candle, while her right hand lifts, fingers slightly spread, as if teasing the falling silver confetti. Her gaze drops to the cake with a mix of anticipation and hunger, her body angled slightly toward the camera. In the left foreground, a crystal champagne glass half-filled with golden liquid catches the light, the surface rippling. Silver confetti scatters across the white tabletop beside a fork. The background is a soft gray wall covered in drifting silver diamond-shaped confetti, and on the right, a stack of glossy black balloons tied with white ribbons, some ribbons hanging down. The lighting is soft and directional from above, casting delicate shadows that define her jawline, the creases of her dress, and the curves of her body. The scene feels like an intimate home celebration—a birthday or personal victory—with a raw, almost amateur photography quality, yet the contrast of black, white, and silver with a pop of red lipstick gives it a high-fashion, sensual edge.",
