        {
          "id": "krea2-1d0194c0cfd04ec8ab3e08d0",
          "alias": "单女蓝浴袍害羞注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in dark, semi-transparent Hanfu, black hair intricately coiled in a traditional bun adorned with silver hairpins and dangling tassels, a few strands brushing her flushed cheek. She gazes downward at the longsword held in her hands, her expression intense and focused, lips slightly parted. The deep blue-black robe, embroidered with delicate white floral motifs, drapes loosely across her shoulders, the sheer fabric clinging to the curve of her breasts and hinting at the taut outline of her waist. Wide sleeves flutter with a subtle movement, catching the side light from the left that illuminates her jawline, collarbone, and the subtle swell of cleavage beneath the gossamer layers. The sword stretches diagonally toward the upper left, leading the eye along her grip. Warm, blurred background of a wooden pillar and lamp gives a cinematic, historical ambiance. High-resolution, shallow depth of field, film grain, dramatic side-lighting creating deep shadows on her right side, enhancing the sensual tension between her solitary strength and her latent vulnerability. The composition follows the rule of thirds, her gaze and the sword's line directing the viewer into a moment of quiet, charged stillness—a fusion of Eastern elegance and modern cinematic intimacy. Loneliness, resolve, and fate resonate through the image.",
