        {
          "id": "krea2-9c825fcdd4300e759bcdbfa1",
          "alias": "单女棕外套雪地冷淡坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits deep in the thick snow, her fluffy brown faux fur coat hanging open, revealing her bare skin beneath a tight white knitted dress that cups her breasts and rides high on her thighs. She wears a beige chunky knit hat, brim sagging over her forehead, dark brown wavy hair with air bangs spilling from under the hat. Black cat-eye sunglasses hide her eyes, but her gaze is fixed forward, lips glossy pale pink, slightly parted with a cold, detached hunger. Her right hand rests on the snow, fingers long, nails pale; her left hand loosely grips a small dark brown canvas bag. Her legs are bent together, but one knee nudges the other, creating a subtle tension. Thick white fluffy snow boots rise to her calves, laces tight. The shot is top-down, she sits left of center, body turned slightly toward the lens, head tilted—a lazy, elegant invitation. Foreground snow shows deep impressions and glistening reflections. Midground shows her entire form, the fur texture, the knit patterns, the plush boots. Background left is a rough concrete wall with vertical streaks; right, a natural snow slope with disturbed edges. Scene is evening or dusk, harsh flash from above lights her face and body, casting soft shadows on the snow, high contrast, dramatic and cold. Palette: white, brown, black, beige, pale pink. Style blends street photography and fashion editorial—raw, intimate, as if caught in a frozen moment, with all focus on her, nothing else. She exudes a quiet, confident sexuality, the snow against her exposed skin, the coat barely containing her curves.",
