          "alias": "单女透视舞者白长裤摄影棚媚态坐自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the white dance studio floor, wearing a sheer pink cropped top that hints at her nipples and tight white leggings that cling to her curves, white thigh-high socks, her hair in a messy bun. She gazes into the camera with a soft, sultry expression, holding her smartphone for a selfie with her right hand, her left hand resting on the floor to support her, legs slightly parted in a relaxed yet provocative pose. The bright studio features white walls, track lighting, a wooden barre diagonally leading right, a white air purifier, blue curtains, a purple tutu decoration and pom-poms, a digital clock reading 20:14, and a large glass door with city lights visible. Soft natural light mixes with overheads, casting gentle shadows on the glossy floor that reflects her body. Low angle, shallow depth of field, focus on her face and sheer top. The mood is intimate and sensual, capturing a dancer’s private moment of erotic stillness after practice.",
