        {
          "id": "krea2-450ba08cf0c0c1bac75440ee",
          "alias": "单女黑网袜媚态站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands elegantly and confidently before a warm orange-yellow gradient backdrop, wearing a futuristic yet retro black tight leather catsuit with glossy patent finish, deep plunging V-neckline, corseted waist, and a row of silver metal buttons. Her arms are encased in contrasting blue long sleeves. Her black hair features blunt bangs, styled into two thick braids hanging over her chest and twin buns on top, secured with sparkling crystal hair accessories. She stares directly at the camera with clear, bright eyes and slightly parted lips, exuding a cool, mysterious, and seductive aura. She wears black fishnet stockings with garter belts and high-thigh black patent leather boots with blue decorative patterns. Her right hand rests lightly on a large weathered natural wooden stump, rough and cracked, extending from lower right into the midground. Composition centers her slightly left, with the stump balancing the right. Lighting from upper left creates strong side-backlight, outlining her silhouette with golden rim light, casting soft shadows that enhance the glossy leather texture and her skin. The scene evokes a sci-fi fashion shoot, blending high-tech and classical beauty, with a warm yet cool-toned atmosphere. Overall mood is powerful, sensual, and mysterious, with high realism and rich detail.",
