        {
          "id": "krea2-cb6e7c117226c421d64b8f34",
          "alias": "单女黑外套酒店困倦站立整理头发",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a modern interior, her long, sleek black hair with straight bangs cascading over her shoulders. Her pale, flawless skin contrasts with her sharp, refined features. Her eyes are half-lidded, lazy and dreamy, locking onto the lens with a sultry, teasing gaze. Her lips are slightly parted in a knowing, seductive smirk, wet with anticipation. Her body is elegantly poised but charged with tension, leaning slightly to one side as one hand rests on a wooden door frame, the other fingers combing through her hair, revealing the delicate curve of her neck and collarbone. She wears a short black sequin jacket with gold buttons, open just enough to show the tight black leather dress underneath, clinging to every curve of her breasts, waist, and hips, the fabric straining and glistening. A pair of black woven stiletto heels elongate her already perfect legs, the slender heels lifting her posture into pure confidence. A simple ring adorns her left wrist, while her right hand carries a small black diamond-stitched chain bag, its metal chain catching the light. The foreground frames her long, smooth legs and the sharp lines of her heels, the skin glowing like porcelain. The midground captures her half-body pose and the intricate details of her outfit. Behind her, a warm light-wood wall and a glass door let in bright daylight, with distant city buildings blurred through the glass. White floor tiles reflect soft, diffused light. The composition is vertical, with her occupying the right side, empty space on the left balanced by the door frame that acts as a natural vignette to draw the eye. A strong beam of light slants in from the right door gap, creating dramatic chiaroscuro—warm yellow side light sculpts her face, arms, and legs, while deep, velvety shadows add volume and intimacy. The color palette is restrained: black, white, brown, with gold accents, exuding understated luxury. The entire scene feels both candid and posed, like a stolen moment in a hotel corridor at dusk, with the raw texture of amateur photography yet the precision of a professional shoot. Simulating a Canon EOS R5 with a 85mm f/1.2 lens, close-up portrait, shallow depth of field, creamy bokeh, true-to-life colors, sharp details, minimal noise. The mood is quiet, intimate, and electric—unforgettable, like a still from an indie film.",
