        {
          "id": "krea2-7ac8c0b8802f150e064602aa",
          "alias": "单女白衬衫桌边温柔坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in the audience of a high-fashion runway show, wearing a sheer white puff-sleeve blouse with the top buttons undone, revealing the swell of her breasts and a hint of a black lace bralette. Her black leather mini-skirt rides high on her thighs as she crosses her legs, the crimson soles of her black suede stilettos catching the low light. Her glossy black hair falls in sleek waves over her shoulders; her makeup is sharp—winged eyeliner, soft pink lips parted slightly, eyes half-lidded in a trance of desire. She holds a small program booklet loosely on her lap, fingers adorned with silver rings, nails painted dark lacquer. In the dimly lit venue, a bottle of \"PRINCE ZERO CALORIE\" sits on a nearby table, and behind her a blurred figure wears a black hoodie with \"CHANEL PARIS.\" The camera captures her from a mid-shot, slightly off-center, with natural grain and subtle lens flare—as if a candid snap from a phone or disposable camera. The lighting is soft and directional, casting a shadow across her collarbone and inner thighs. The atmosphere is hushed, intimate, charged with unspoken heat. She is still, composed, but the tension in her jaw and the way her fingers trace the edge of the booklet suggest she is acutely aware of being watched.",
