          "prompt": "A stunning young female flight attendant in a crisp white short-sleeve uniform shirt, unbuttoned enough to hint at her cleavage, and a snug cream-colored pencil skirt hugging her hips and thighs, stands sensually before the airport’s floor-to-ceiling windows. Her glossy black chin-length hair frames a radiant face with a warm, inviting smile, perfectly white teeth, and bright, seductive eyes that lock onto the viewer. She holds a dark smartphone in her right hand, lightly brushing her skirt’s waistband, while her left wrist shows a sleek smartwatch. An orange-red silk scarf is tied in a delicate bow at her neck, and a small airline badge gleams over her left breast. Her pose is poised yet alluring: one hip slightly cocked, her free hand resting on her thigh, fingers tracing the fabric. The background reveals tarmac, runway, distant green hills, and a blue sky filled with fluffy cumulus clouds. Sunlight slants from the right, casting soft, warm shadows across her body, highlighting the curve of her breasts and the contour of her hips through the skirt. The dark gray carpeted floor and silver-gray window frames complete the scene. Mid-shot composition places her prominently, filling two-thirds of the frame, focusing on her expressive face and the subtle, erotic tension in her upper body. Color palette: white, cream, orange-red, with blue sky and green hills. The image feels like a high-resolution photograph, crisp and lifelike, capturing a moment of professional grace mixed with undeniable sensuality.",
