        {
          "id": "krea2-403aa769f15a9557c2a89528",
          "alias": "单女白T恤城市媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands outdoors at dusk, her pitch-black silky hair cascading over her shoulders, strands gently tousled by the breeze. Her face is soft, porcelain skin glowing, eyes bright and inviting, lips parted in a seductive half-smile, teeth white and perfect. She wears a white strappy camisole with crisscross ties across her chest, the fabric pulled tight to emphasize her cleavage, loosely covered by a deep-green tweed jacket with black-and-white woven texture, sleeves pure knit, wrinkled naturally. Her body is slightly turned, head tilted, gaze locked off to the right, as if caught mid-desire. Foreground: waist-up medium shot, centered left. Background: blurred city buildings in warm twilight, sky deep blue merging with pale gray, thin clouds edged with orange afterglow. Ground: rough stone steps, worn texture. Light from the sky casts cool tones, but her face and top are kissed by faint warm light, creating a soft, layered contrast. Focus sharp on her face and upper body, background shallow. The composition uses her eyeline to draw the viewer into the unknown space right, creating intimacy and narrative. Cinematic realism, moody, subdued palette, rich detail, film-like grain and natural noise, moderate focal length, eye-level with slight upward tilt, enhancing her presence. The atmosphere is tender, sultry, nostalgic—a raw, romantic urban capture.",
