        {
          "id": "krea2-cf3f18618e3fcc96ec1c86d0",
          "alias": "单女白毛衣花园媚态站立回眸",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on an outdoor wooden balcony, her shoulder-length light brown hair falling naturally, with neat bangs sweeping over her forehead. She tilts her head slightly toward the camera, eyes clear and bright, a mix of gentle warmth and playful allure. Her skin is fair and smooth, makeup soft and natural with a dewy finish, lips a tender pink. She wears a white thin-strap knit tank top, the fabric clinging to her curves, revealing the subtle shape of her breasts and the delicate lines of her back through the vertical texture; the thin straps hint at bare shoulders. She pairs it with high-waisted black wide-leg trousers featuring waist pleats that cascade softly, accentuating her hips and waist. In her hands, she holds two transparent plastic bottles filled with pale pink liquid—brands \"DULLA\" and \"MEDULA\" clearly visible—the translucent fluid catching the light in gentle glows. The background is dense green foliage, layers of leaves dappled with sunlight breaking through, casting natural highlights and shadows, evoking a warm, tranquil summer afternoon. The composition is a mid-shot with the subject on the right side, body slightly turned, head looking back at the lens, creating dynamic visual flow. In the foreground, part of the gray-white wood railing, weather-worn and realistic. The background is tastefully blurred, keeping focus on her figure and the products. Natural sunlight from the upper right illuminates her face and upper body, forming soft shadow transitions that enhance her contours. The overall palette is green, white, and pink, harmonious and vibrant, exuding youthful energy. The mood is relaxed and seductive, as if captured casually in a quiet garden, blending everyday intimacy with subtle eroticism. The style suggests a professional camera with a large aperture, yet retains a slight film-like grain and real noise, simulating an amateur feel while emphasizing authentic light, skin texture, and the sensual presence of the moment.",
