        {
          "id": "krea2-1260fc04cb0a3ddbdd3552ed",
          "alias": "单女红毛衣城市冷淡坐注视",
          "prompt": "A woman in a tight red high-neck knit dress sits on a modern light gray fabric sofa, her short black hair and refined makeup framing sharp, calm eyes that stare directly into the lens with cold confidence. Her left hand wears a black leather fingerless glove, right hand rests naturally on her hip. A wide black tactical belt with multiple pouches and metal buckles cinches her waist, while black leather shoulder straps extend from shoulders to waist like a tactical vest. Her legs are crossed at the knee, shiny black over-knee boots catching the light, right thigh resting over left, the position relaxed but radiating power. Behind her, a massive floor-to-ceiling window reveals a night cityscape—countless lights scattered like stars in darkness, distant skyscrapers forming a glowing sea. The window frame is sharp in the foreground. Interior light is soft, with a main source from the front illuminating her face and body contours, creating warm layered shadows. The composition is center-symmetrical, her body slightly lower center, drawing the eye. Foreground is the sofa and her lower half, midground her full figure and part of the sofa, background the urban night, producing strong depth. Visual lines follow her pose and gaze toward the distant city lights. The mood blends urban coldness with individual resolve—a fashion shoot's precision meets cinematic drama. Colors are red, black, gray; the red dress stands out vividly against the dark backdrop. Lighting is delicate, shadows transition naturally, details rich and realistic, as if shot with professional equipment at night, high-resolution with high dynamic range. The image carries strong artistic expression and narrative, while retaining an everyday spontaneous feel, like capturing a carefully staged quiet moment in a private apartment. It exudes a futuristic yet lived-in atmosphere, a sense of independence, mystery, and story.",
