        {
          "id": "krea2-dc3ce7b6cc09aeab35098eb6",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套机场媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands inside an airport terminal, wearing a light blue wool coat slightly open to hint at a fitted top beneath, a black chain-strap purse slung over her shoulder, and black fluffy ear muffs adorned with cute white bear plushies. Her long hair spills past the ear muffs, strands framing her face. She raises her right hand in a stop gesture toward the camera, palm out, while her left hand hangs naturally with a slight bend at the elbow. A black mask covers her mouth and nose, but her bright eyes are sharp, playful, and seductive, revealing a confident, teasing expression. Her posture is relaxed yet poised, exuding a subtle sensuality. The background is a blurred airport hall with soft overhead lighting, glass walls, signs, and moving passengers in dark coats and luggage. Central composition places her slightly right, foreground crisp, midground and background softly blurred for depth. Warm, even indoor light creates gentle shadows and a natural, intimate feel. The image has a candid, snapshot quality with slight grain and imperfections, enhancing the raw, realistic vibe. The color palette of blue-gray, black, and warm yellow evokes an everyday, urban atmosphere, while her masked face and body language convey a mix of allure and mystery, turning a mundane airport moment into a charged, NSFW encounter.",
