        {
          "id": "krea2-2ab0ed7fbba3dfe5a56bb230",
          "alias": "单女黑长裤健身房微笑站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A fit young woman with shoulder-length brownish-blonde hair stands in a gym, her soft strands falling naturally beside her face. Her pale skin is smooth and flawless, her features sharp and elegant, her eyes bright and confident with a warm smile. She poses slightly sideways, holding a colorful gradient phone case smartphone with her left hand, taking a selfie that partly hides her face. Her right hand pulls up the hem of her white long-sleeve athletic top, exposing her flat, toned belly and the waistband of high-waisted black yoga pants. Her body flows with sleek, curving lines, showcasing a healthy, energetic physique. She wears a tight white long-sleeve top with subtle texture that hugs her torso and highlights muscle definition, and high-stretch black leggings that trace the long lines of her legs. The outfit is clean, sporty, and stylish. The background is a modern gym with several treadmills on the left, dark gray and silver metal, brand logos visible. A blurry male figure runs on one in the distance. On the right are silver weight machines with complex structures. The floor is light wood, reflecting soft light. A dark ceiling with recessed warm yellow-white lights creates soft patches of light and shadow, making the space bright and cozy. The composition centers slightly right on the woman, who dominates the frame. The camera angle is near eye-level, slightly low, emphasizing her posture and proportions. The foreground is sharp, the midground shows equipment and motion, and the background blurs for depth. Light from above and front illuminates her face and body evenly, creating natural shadows and muscle contours with smooth transitions. The mood is relaxed, positive, capturing a real everyday gym moment with slight amateur camera noise and authenticity. The color palette is mostly black, white, and gray, accented by warm yellow light and the phone case's rainbow gradient. Tones are harmonious, details rich, layers clear, giving a strong sense of immersion and life—like a candid shot of a fitness enthusiast recording her routine. The composition is stable and balanced, guiding the eye from her face down her body to the background equipment, completing a narrative of urban youth pursuing a healthy lifestyle with a blend of dynamic energy and quiet beauty.",
