        {
          "id": "krea2-3aada778255631d54b16c7fe",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣桌边微笑站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors, her brown blunt bangs and short hair falling softly across her forehead and cheeks, her gaze tender and focused on the lens, a calm smile playing on her lips. Her skin is fair and flawless, with gentle facial contours, a straight nose, and full lips—overall a sweet, pure look. She slightly turns her body, left hand resting lightly on her hip, right hand dangling naturally, posture elegant and composed. She wears a light green round-neck short-sleeve knit top, soft and form-fitting, highlighting the subtle curves of her torso, the fine knit texture visible, sleeves ending at the elbows. Below, a high-waist floral pleated skirt with a yellow base dotted with orange, red, green, and white small floral patterns, the fabric gathered in horizontal pleats that create rich texture, the hem trimmed with a ruffled edge for a playful, romantic touch. The background features a dark green vertical striped upholstered wall with a slight embossed texture, creating a warm, stable atmosphere. In front stands a round white table, smooth surface, with a modern white chair beside it, clean lines. To the upper left hangs a vintage-style pendant lamp with a creamy white conical shade, a warm yellow bulb emitting soft light that cascades down, casting shadows on her figure. On the right, a floor-to-ceiling window with sheer curtains filters faint natural light, making the space bright and airy. The floor is large light gray tiles, neatly aligned, with subtle reflections. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, the subject slightly right of center, head just above the frame edge, body naturally standing with legs slightly apart, knees slightly bent, arms curved into a graceful S-curve. The foreground shows her upper body and part of the lower body, midground includes the table, chair, and wall, background extends to the window and far wall, layers distinct. Her gaze directly draws the viewer, while the lamp’s light guides the eye upward, deepening the spatial sense. The lighting is warm and soft, main light from the overhead lamp creating top illumination, with bright highlights on her face and shoulders, and delicate shadow transitions along her side and skirt pleats, enhancing volume and realism. Overall tones are green, yellow, and white, harmoniously blending retro and modern aesthetics. The image is highly detailed, as if captured by a full-frame camera with a standard prime lens, in low light with slow shutter and high ISO, achieving an artistic yet candid documentary feel.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
