        {
          "id": "krea2-b85717f07ed3c226c56e21ed",
          "alias": "单女半褪和服浴室媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a modern bathroom stands before a mirror, wearing a silk kimono with pale blue floral patterns—white, soft lavender, and pale yellow blossoms scattered across the fabric. The kimono hangs slightly loose, slipping off one shoulder to reveal smooth skin and the edge of her collarbone, while the deep blue velvet obi is tied in a full bow but undone at the top, suggesting it could fall away. Her long hair falls naturally, some strands softly tied back, forehead bare, features delicate. She holds a gold smartphone with an Apple logo, taking a selfie, but her other hand tugs at the kimono's lapel, parting it to expose a hint of bare breast. She gazes at the screen with a gentle, contemplative expression, head tilted, pose elegant yet inviting. The mirror reflection captures her centered slightly right, framed by a light brown wooden frame. Behind her, a modern interior: off-white walls, dark gray ceiling with warm recessed lighting, a partially open door suggesting depth, gray-white striped tiles on the right, a white sink corner visible. Soft top-down light creates gentle highlights on her face and kimono, casting subtle shadows for depth. The scene feels like a quiet, intimate moment—traditional kimono and modern simplicity blending, now charged with sensual undertones. Standard wide-angle lens, eye-level focus on her, slight background blur.",
