        {
          "id": "krea2-8b92c797654d9dfa0c23a8a9",
          "alias": "单女女仆蓝女仆装霓虹夜景媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman in a revealing blue-and-white maid cosplay, her head adorned with blue bunny ears, sits at the center of a pink arched doorway. She wears a tightly laced corset with deep blue ribbon and lace, a white frilly miniskirt, black fishnets, and light blue heels with red heart decorations on the soles. One leg is lifted high, exposing her thigh, while her hands gently stroke her inner thighs. Her gaze is sultry and inviting, lips slightly parted. The background is a soft pink fitting room with curtains, a glowing \"Fitting room\" neon sign, pink furry wreaths, fake roses, and a pink grid door. The floor is deep pink-purple carpet. Soft, even lighting from the front creates a bright, dreamy glow, highlighting her curves and the intricate details of her costume. The composition is symmetrical, with the arch framing her body. The scene exudes a sweet yet explicitly sensual anime aesthetic, as if captured by a professional camera in a fantasy studio, blending innocence with erotic allure.",
