        {
          "id": "krea2-9db2d4e64ec562e4fb9a8b0d",
          "alias": "单女红泳装街道媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a metal folding chair, her body leaning back against a red brick wall, black short hair pinned high with straight bangs, transparent framed trendy glasses, eyes low and lazily gazing into the camera, lips slightly parted, exuding a cold, sensual confidence. She wears a red-and-black one-piece swimsuit covered in repeating \"DIESEL\" logo print and white brand marks, retro street-style, paired with black tight shorts, arms resting naturally on knees, white Adidas sport wristbands, orange gloves, silver-gray long stiletto nails, fingers long and elegant. Legs clad in red-and-white striped high-thigh knit socks, loosely bunched at the calves, white CELINE sneakers. The look blends retro fitness, 80s disco, and modern streetwear. Background is a rough red-brown brick wall with visible mortar lines, a dark-framed window on the right, concrete floor with scuffs and wear. Soft natural light falls from the left, creating subtle chiaroscuro across her face and body, warm and nostalgic. Mid-shot composition, subject centered slightly left, legs crossed diagonally extending toward the foreground, forming a strong visual lead. The metal chair's clean lines and her pose create a stable yet dynamic triangle. Primary colors red, black, white with orange accents, high contrast but harmonious. Retro-futuristic feel, like a candid fashion capture in an urban corner. Shot with professional equipment like Canon 5D Mark IV or Sony A7R IV, 35mm prime lens, shallow depth of field making her sharp against a slightly blurred background, real film grain and subtle noise for authenticity. The overall aesthetic sits between commercial ad and personal art, a cool, independent, unapologetic urban young woman's image, sensual and commanding.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
