        {
          "id": "krea2-ec12aaef513e4de1b7ebe3d3",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙街道困倦站立阅读（3）",
          "prompt": "A young woman with glossy jet-black straight hair and blunt bangs stands on a nighttime city street, her pale skin glowing under mixed warm and cool lights. Her delicate features are framed by a dreamy, intense gaze as she glances back over her shoulder at the camera, lips parted in a lazy, seductive expression. She wears a tight black sequin mini dress, high-waisted with a tie detail at the side, the back completely exposed with thin halter straps, paired with a black leather bustier top and narrow straps—the outfit clinging provocatively to every curve. Her right hand hangs at her side, long fingers tipped with dark nail polish, a minimalist bracelet around her wrist. Her body twists slightly, accentuating her elegant silhouette. In the foreground, rough concrete pavement with cracks and a manhole cover, a red curb. Midground, an empty street with a distant orange-yellow bus marked “Metro Bus”. Background, a grand theater building called “TOWER THEATRE”, its vertical neon sign glowing, an electronic display reading “EARTH DAY”, classical arched windows and stone carvings on beige facade. To the right, modern shop windows reflect interior lights, with blurred figures moving inside. Street lamps, traffic signs, a fire hydrant complete the urban scene. Low-angle composition places the woman on the right, leaving left space for depth; the building towers above, creating strong perspective. Lighting from streetlights and theater neon casts warm yellow and cool blue contrasts, with a soft rim light outlining her body, her hair and sequins catching the light. The image has a realistic amateur-device feel with slight grain, lens distortion, and a cool-toned yet locally warm palette, evoking a cinematic, nocturnal fantasy—capturing a moment of urban allure and temptation.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
