        {
          "id": "krea2-7bf6158fb5b87a7bab26efd1",
          "alias": "单女半褪紫内裤纯色背景媚态躺脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies sensually on a pink-and-white checkerboard floor, wearing a sheer pink cami top that barely covers her nipples and a tiny lavender thong, one strap slipping off her shoulder. Her black wavy hair cascades over her bare shoulders, strands teasing her flushed cheeks. She wears a sultry, confident grin, eyes half-lidded with desire, one hand holding a pink vivo smartphone as if offering it seductively, while the other hand traces along her inner thigh. A gold wave bracelet glints on her wrist. The minimalist white background frames her, with the VOGUE logo in the top right. In the foreground, pink lip gloss, a silver lipstick case, and a clear small bottle lie scattered on the floor. Low-angle shot, soft overhead light glistens on her skin and the phone's glass back, highlighting the curve of her breasts and the damp warmth between her legs. The atmosphere is luxurious, youthful, and blatantly erotic, blending high fashion with raw sensuality.",
