        {
          "id": "krea2-5bf0cad4b05fb6f516bf3fd5",
          "alias": "单女黑外套沙发媚态拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges confidently on a brown leather armchair, her hands clasped behind her head, body slightly tilted to one side in a relaxed, seductive pose. Her long, glossy deep-brown hair cascades in soft waves with subtle curls at the ends, framing her face. She wears a black leather jacket open over a light blue vertical-stripe knit and a crisp white collared shirt, layered fashionably with a high-waist black mini skirt that hugs her hips. Her makeup is refined, lips a soft rose red, her gaze intense and thoughtful as she looks off to the upper right, suggesting a moment of anticipation. One leg is bent, the other stretched out, revealing long, smooth, pale legs and flawless skin. Beside her rests a black Miu Miu handbag with fine-grained leather and a gold logo at the center. The composition is medium shot, focused on her figure, with ambient warm light from an industrial ceiling – white metal, pipes, and fixtures – casting soft, diffused shadows across her face, upper body, and the leather surfaces. The palette is warm browns, blacks, off-white, and light blue, creating a cozy yet intimate atmosphere. The left and background have subtle shadows enhancing depth. Every detail feels like a high-end photoshoot, capturing a private, sensual moment with a blend of fashion edge and raw allure.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
