        {
          "id": "krea2-397b3602c82071dea21dcbb4",
          "alias": "单女绿毛衣桌边媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a bright green vertical striped knit cardigan (loosely open, revealing a hint of lace bra and pale cleavage) and baggy blue jeans sits on the floor indoors. Her long hair falls naturally, her gaze is soft but seductive as she looks directly at the lens, lips parted in a gentle, inviting smile. Her hands rest lightly on her inner thighs, fingers slightly curled. Her skin is fair and flawless, makeup subtle with soft pink lips, overall fresh and natural yet intensely sensual. In the foreground, a stack of half-open books and a golden velvet cushion with visible creases and texture. The midground features the woman’s seated pose on a colorful geometric-pattern rug (orange, yellow, blue) that adds warmth. Background: a modern minimalist room with pale gray walls, a black metal open shelf holding books, frames, small decor, and potted plants. To the right, a black metal mesh circular coffee table with a few books and small items. Left, a curved floor lamp with a warm yellow shade casting soft, even light. The main light source is from the upper left, creating natural shadows and highlighting her face and shoulders. Composition centered slightly right, with depth from foreground books to the woman to background furniture. The scene is bright, warm, with a film-grain texture, evoking a quiet, intimate afternoon moment—sensual and inviting.",
