        {
          "id": "krea2-7f72bd6cf47cbd8db77b5e64",
          "alias": "单女粉连体衣摄影棚微笑站立演奏",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a pure black backdrop, her shoulder-length brown wavy hair cascading naturally around her face, soft with a warm auburn sheen, stray strands brushing her forehead and shoulders for a lazy, alluring look. Her facial features are delicate and sculpted, bright eyes exuding confidence and gentle seduction, a faint smile playing on her naturally red lips, makeup subtle yet enhancing her dewy skin. She wears a sheer light pink lace bodysuit that clings to her curves, the fabric semi-transparent with intricate texture, a deep V neckline and cutout details that artfully frame her cleavage, cinched waist accentuating her slender figure, hemline barely covering her hips, revealing long, toned legs. On her feet, high-thigh pink fluffy boots with plush, gradient fur from pale to deeper rose, reaching mid-thigh, echoing the bodysuit’s hue. Her right hand hangs casually, left hand resting on her left knee, fingers long with pale polish, a simple silver bracelet and delicate necklace with a small pendant adding elegant sparkle. She stands in a relaxed, slightly angled pose, head tilted a bit, exuding a poised yet inviting aura. Medium full-body shot, subject offset to the right, leaving negative space on the left for balance. Soft front-left lighting casts gentle shadows, creating volume on her skin and clothes, while the pure black background and glossy reflective floor show a slightly blurred but clear mirror image, deepening the space. The overall mood is quiet, sophisticated, with a hint of mystery and romance. Pink and black dominate—feminine sweetness meets dark elegance—evoking a dreamy yet tangible aesthetic. The style is high-fashion studio photography, sharp focus on her contours and fabric textures, with smooth bokeh, producing a refined, emotionally charged, sensual portrait.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
