        {
          "id": "krea2-a0a12defbeaff42d46aff149",
          "alias": "单女红礼服舞台媚态站立亲吻",
          "prompt": "A voluptuous woman stands center stage in a fiery red silk gown with a deep plunging neckline and a thigh-high slit, the fabric clinging to her curves and shimmering under warm stage lights. Large sculpted bow flowers adorn one shoulder. She raises a golden trophy high in her right hand—the abstract figure-shaped award glowing with a warm halo—while her left hand clutches a bouquet of deep red roses wrapped in glossy crimson paper with a visible brand logo, accented by pine sprigs and berries. Her body is turned slightly, head tilted, lips parted in a sensual, blown-kiss pout, eyes half-lidded with confident tenderness. Long black hair falls over her bare shoulders; dangling tassel earrings brush her collarbone; a prominent ring sparkles on her finger. Behind her, a massive LED screen pulses with abstract blue-and-red light patterns—deep night blue contrasting with blazing red—revealing a pixel grid that evokes digital modernity. The reflective stage floor captures blurred reflections of the woman and the fiery backdrop. The composition is symmetrical with her as the dominant focal point. Top-down studio lighting creates sharp shadows behind her, accentuating her cleavage, the trophy's gleam, and the satin sheen of her dress. Foreground is dominated by her figure, bouquet, and trophy; midground shows her gown trailing to the floor; background is the dynamic LED glow. The overall mood is celebratory, triumphant, and intensely sensual, capturing an award-winning moment with filmic depth and a candid, slightly grainy photorealistic quality as if snapped by an amateur camera at close range.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
          "created_at": "2026-09-17T13:54:20.693554",
