        {
          "id": "krea2-b3c7d5c919ba27ee2633e781",
          "alias": "单女上衣楼梯媚态坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young blonde woman sits sideways on modern wooden stairs, her golden hair pinned with a yellow clip, wearing a sheer green lace top left partially unbuttoned to reveal cleavage and a hint of bare skin, paired with tight denim shorts that ride up to show her thighs, silver-gray high-heeled sandals. She leans back on one hand, the other trailing suggestively along her inner thigh, her gaze locked on the camera with a sultry, thoughtful expression. Beside her, a pink hard-shell suitcase with vertical stripes and black wheels, a delicate chain crossbody bag slung over her shoulder. Natural light from a left window casts soft shadows across her body, highlighting the curves of her face and hips, while the glass-and-metal railing reveals a bright outdoor view beyond. Warm wood tones, green lace, and pink accents create a stylish, travel-ready scene with a sensual, intimate mood. Medium shot, crisp detail, subtle skin texture, professional portrait style.",
