        {
          "id": "krea2-48e241e0a1b35d3d508afc60",
          "alias": "单女舞者短裙舞台媚态倚靠摆拍",
          "prompt": "A young, seductive female dancer in a vivid pink furry stage outfit poses under brilliant stage lights: a high-neck sleeveless crop top and matching short skirt, a silver rhinestone-studded belt cinching her bare midriff, a butterfly-shaped metal necklace resting between her cleavage, long pink feather gloves on her arms raised high in an elegant arc, a small metal bracelet on her left wrist, a delicate earring on her right ear. Her black blunt-cut hair hangs naturally as she looks directly at the camera with confident, half-lidded eyes, a sultry smile on her lips, mouth slightly open as if moaning or inviting the audience. Her body leans forward, toned abs and the curve of her waist fully defined, the short skirt riding up to reveal the tops of her thighs. The composition is central, her arms creating visual lines that lead to her face and exposed midriff. The midground is a blurred dreamy pink-purple stage with soft halo effects and faint geometric structures. The background is pure pink with gentle light transitions, making her vivid outfit pop. Bright, warm key lights from the front and above illuminate every curve, soft shadows contour her skin, while colorful bokeh and light spots in the background suggest a live performance. The image exudes pop culture glamour and modern stage aesthetic, with intense color saturation and high contrast, capturing a moment of raw sensuality and strength, as if shot by a high-end camera at a music awards show.",
