        {
          "id": "krea2-36faecfc712156de5794a493",
          "alias": "单女黑连衣裙沙发冷淡坐手持物",
          "prompt": "A silver-haired woman with long flowing locks, dressed in a black gothic off-shoulder dress with ruffled seams and sparkling sequins, the fabric a rich blend of velvet, lace, and tulle. Long flared sleeves with gold trim, intricate dark embroidery on the bodice, and a matching satin ribbon bow at the waist. She wears black fishnet stockings with rose-patterned lace embroidery up the sides, and shiny black patent leather high heels with pointed toes. She sits on a modern light gray sofa, body leaning forward, left hand gripping the armrest, right hand lifting the hem of her skirt to expose her long, toned thighs. Her head is slightly tilted, eyes cold and intense, makeup flawless with pale skin and bold red lips, sharp facial contours. The background is an indoor studio: left side off-white vertical striped wall, right side dark brown wood paneling, light gray carpet, a small white side table visible. Mid-shot composition, centered slightly left, with strong diagonal lighting from above creating dramatic chiaroscuro. The atmosphere is darkly elegant, mysterious, and high-fashion, with a palette of black, white, gray, and subtle gold accents. The image is crisp, highly detailed, with balanced saturation, as if shot with professional softbox lighting.",
