        {
          "id": "krea2-5ac0bbd94ffbcd3569ab0183",
          "alias": "单女露胸桌边媚态坐喝",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a dimly lit room with dark wood-paneled walls, completely topless, her pale skin glowing under soft directional light. Her long silver-gray hair cascades in natural gradients, straight bangs framing her face, with loose strands brushing her bare shoulders. Her large, light-brown eyes gaze directly at the camera with a curious, slightly hungry expression. Her lips part as she brings a small, glossy blue bowl to her mouth for a sip. She holds the bowl in one hand, fingers long and manicured, a tiny ring on one finger; the other hand grips a delicate metal spoon. On the red-brown wooden table in front of her sits a clean white plate. The background features vertical dark-stained wood slats, with the white Japanese text \"ついに\" centered at the top. The lighting is warm and concentrated from the front-right, casting gentle highlights on her nipples, collarbone, and the smooth surface of the bowl. The scene feels intimate, sensual, and cinematic — capturing a quiet, erotic moment of indulgence.",
