        {
          "id": "krea2-9ac93e0b28aae5e49225d7a5",
          "alias": "单女灰旗袍桌边忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a deep gray vintage qipao with brown-red floral embroidery, classic stand collar and slanting frog buttons, delicate piping on sleeves and hem, form-fitting silhouette emphasizing curves, high slit exposing long legs, leans gracefully against an old wooden cabinet, left hand resting on drawer edge, right hand hanging naturally, wearing pearl necklace and earrings, hair in a bun with traditional ornaments, soft refined facial features, gazing gently at the camera. Interior setting of Republic-era vintage atmosphere: left side a curtain of green and white beads hanging vertically forming leading lines, right side an old phonograph with black vintage horn, beside it a round table clock with visible face, blue-green bead curtain on the wall, mirrored reflection of the figure's back faintly visible in the background, purple and red artificial flowers scattered around creating a romantic ambiance. Low-angle shot, composition centered on the subject with foreground bead curtain and objects on both sides forming a frame. Light from upper left creates strong chiaroscuro side lighting, highlighting facial contours and clothing details, deep and layered shadows. Overall warm color tone: brown, gray, green with purple and red accents. Warm and nostalgic lighting evokes a quiet afternoon, strong artistic and cinematic quality, elegant and slightly melancholic Eastern aesthetics. Rich details, clear textures, realistic material rendering: silk sheen, wood grain, metal reflections. Style blends vintage, elegance, and poetry, like a carefully painted oil painting or a film photo from an old camera, with slight grain and color saturation processing enhancing the period feel. Natural expression and relaxed pose, as if immersed in a long memory. Background objects are intricate but not cluttered, building a complete and story-rich space. Overall atmosphere quiet and enchanting, as if faint phonograph music can be heard from afar, evoking the unique romance and charm of that era.",
