        {
          "id": "krea2-d6e08951673c9fdcc3cc3d18",
          "alias": "单女全裸红毛衣沙发害羞脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman reclines half-naked on a plush white faux-fur sofa, wearing a loose red chunky-knit sweater unbuttoned to reveal her bare cleavage and smooth skin. A fluffy white fur coat slips off one shoulder, exposing her collarbone and the curve of her breast. Her dark hair cascades over the sofa, a white pom-pom clip with tiny sparkling rhinestones catching the soft light. She smiles warmly, eyes locked on the camera, lips glossy in nude pink, cheeks flushed. She holds two red Hongbao envelopes in each hand, the envelopes slightly crumpled, inscribed with black calligraphy reading \"大吉大利\" and \"平安喜乐\" beside small red seal stamps. A red-and-white striped blanket is draped over the back of the beige sofa. In the upper right corner, red hand-lettered art reads \"有趣有盼\" surrounded by golden glitter particles. Soft warm overhead light sculpts her face and body, focusing on her expression and the red envelopes partially obscuring her torso. The composition is a close-up, intimate and festive, with the fur and envelopes adding layers and erotic tension.",
