        {
          "id": "krea2-4abda0742fa053e56f70a8a5",
          "alias": "单女黑T恤城市媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in profile in the foreground, her long, jet-black hair falling smoothly over her shoulders, strands gently stirred by the breeze. Perched atop her head, black sunglasses reflect the city lights. Her skin is fair and flawless, with delicate features—a straight nose, slightly parted lips, and a distant, contemplative gaze. She wears a black spaghetti-strap camisole with a low-cut neckline and sheer panel details, revealing the elegant curve of her neck and collarbone. Her posture is relaxed, natural, as if caught mid-stride on a street. Behind her, the towering Gothic architecture of St. John the Divine Cathedral rises, its stone facade adorned with intricate religious carvings and pointed arches. To the left, a glass-curtained high-rise; to the right, a classic brick building. Street life bustles—pedestrians, yellow cabs idling at traffic lights, distant greenery. The sky is overcast, casting soft, even light without harsh shadows. Composition: close-up portrait on the left third of the frame, her head slightly tilted, guiding the viewer’s eye into the depth of the scene. Camera angle near eye-level with a slight upward tilt, emphasizing her facial contours and the cathedral’s height. A lens similar to an 85mm portrait lens creates natural compression and shallow depth of field, blurring the church, buildings, and street into a beautiful bokeh. The mood blends urban hustle with personal stillness—a moment of quiet amidst city noise. Color palette dominated by black, white, and gray, accented with touches of yellow and green. The visual rhythm is both relaxed and tense, like a candid street snapshot taken with a phone or compact camera, preserving imperfect, lifelike texture. Slight grain and natural noise simulate a low-light shot, with soft transitions, no blown highlights—an understated yet emotionally resonant aesthetic. The low-cut top and transparent detail accentuate her bust, creating a sensual, adult atmosphere.",
