          "prompt": "A young woman stands in warm outdoor sunlight, her shoulder-length dark brown hair with soft bangs, eyes gentle yet inviting, a subtle, knowing smile on her lips, skin fair with a healthy flush. She wears a light gray zip-up hoodie (GAP 1969 logo), unzipped halfway to reveal a white crew-neck tee, the fabric clinging to the curves of her chest, one hand tucked into a pocket, the other casually brushing the hem of the hoodie, hinting at a relaxed, sensual stance. The composition centers her slightly right, foreground capturing every detail—fine hair strands, fabric folds, soft shadows—while behind her, a large white canopy stretches overhead, a thick black metal pillar with subtle reflections and a string of warm yellow lights. The background shows a modern cityscape with glass buildings, green trees, dappled shadows, and gray tiles, a blue-and-white traffic cone on the left. Morning light from the upper left sculpts her features, casting a soft shadow on her right side and the ground, highlighting her silhouette. The overall tone is clean, crisp, with a gentle, intimate mood—as if a candid street shot but with a deliberate touch of allure, her posture and gaze suggesting a quiet confidence and subtle erotic tension.",
