          "prompt": "A young woman leans against a wooden stall at a nighttime European Christmas market, her gray plaid long coat slightly open to reveal a white high-neck knit sweater stretched tight over her breasts, a short black skirt and pale stockings hugging her thighs, black ankle boots. She rests her chin on her right hand, eyes half-closed in a dreamy, sensual trance, her left arm hanging loosely, elbow on the table. A black leather crossbody bag with metal buckle accents dangles against her hip. Behind her, the wooden Christmas hut glows with warm yellow string lights and green pine wreaths. Soft light spills over her, casting subtle shadows across her curves. In the distance, other visitors wander—some in thick down jackets, others in hats, talking or pausing. A vintage ornate iron lamppost stands tall on the left. The ground is covered in coarse brown wood chips. Low-angle shot, subject slightly left of center. Foreground: wooden table and her body; midground: her, the stall, and some tourists; background: the extended market with more lights. Her face and hands guide the eye into the depth. Warm yellow string lights create chiaroscuro, highlighting her silhouette and glinting off her stockings. Atmosphere is warm, quiet, festive. Color palette deep gray, white, black with golden light accents. Amateur camera feel with slight grain and motion blur, natural light, moderate saturation, no heavy editing. Composition tight but not crowded, her expression restrained yet inviting—a gentle story of a winter night's intimate stillness, full of lived-in beauty and a fleeting, erotic tenderness.",
