          "prompt": "A young woman in a dreamy pink tulle dress that clings sheerly to her curves, the semi-transparent fabric revealing the outline of her breasts and nipples, the skirt layered and fluffy like clouds. She sits on a bed of pink gauze, body arched back, dress slipping off one shoulder to expose bare skin, head tilted, gaze upward with a serene, contemplative expression that hints at self-pleasure. Her black hair is slightly disheveled in an elegant bun, a large pink rose with gradient petals adorning it, loose strands curling against her cheek, adding a post-coital languor. She holds an antique round mirror in her right hand, its dark metal frame carved and tarnished; her left hand lifts, fingers tracing down her neck and collarbone, teasingly caressing her own skin, eyes half-lidded in self-admiration. Pearl earrings glint as they sway, and a pearl necklace with a crystal tassel pendant rests between her breasts, drawing attention to her exposed décolletage. Her makeup is delicate: glossy nude pink lips slightly parted and wet, light pink eyeshadow, defined eyeliner, thick lashes, fair luminous skin. Soft side lighting from the left illuminates her face, neck, and the curves of her breasts, casting erotic shadows that enhance her contours. Background is a warm brown wall with subtle texture, faint scattered pink flowers. Close-up composition with a slight low-angle that emphasizes her curves, making her appear both dominant and vulnerable. Overall pink-toned with warm brown, lighting soft and even, creating a romantic fairy-tale atmosphere, but with a sensual, teasing edge. The shallow depth of field focuses on her exposed skin and the lustful expression, as if captured in a moment of intimate self-gaze, with professional photography detail and a real, raw sensuality.",
