          "alias": "单女黑T恤城市媚态坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a concrete staircase, wearing a black off-shoulder camisole with a large bow across her cleavage, a short plaid skirt, and high-cut black patent leather platform boots with metal buckles and laces that glisten under the light. Her black beret with white logo sits atop her blunt-cut black hair. She has bold red lips, slightly parted, and her eyes lock onto the camera with a confident, flirtatious smirk. Her left hand rests casually on the step, while her right hand shows off a black wristband and silver bracelet. A thin chain necklace hangs against her exposed collarbone. The low-angle shot emphasizes her long legs extending forward, body tilted slightly, creating dynamic balance. The background is rough gray concrete stairs with yellow safety edges, harsh shadows from top-right lighting, and a shallow depth of field that blurs the cold urban setting. The overall tone is monochrome with red lip and yellow accents, giving a gritty, amateur camera aesthetic with subtle grain and uneven exposure, capturing a late-night street-style moment of raw sensuality and urban independence.",
