        {
          "id": "krea2-e6ab9c08bd064ea3de61303e",
          "alias": "单女束身衣船上媚态坐跳舞",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits sideways in the plush captain’s chair of a luxury yacht, her silky light-blonde hair catching the sun in warm, soft waves that dance in the breeze. Her makeup is refined yet sultry—dark-rimmed eyes, full rosy lips, flawless fair skin. She wears a white two-piece outfit with pink-and-green floral print: the top is a square-neck, puff-sleeve corset style, deeply cut and cinched tight at the waist, exposing a sheer strip of bare midriff; the high-waisted shorts are short and snug, barely covering her hips. She leans back, one hand resting on the leather seat, the other lightly grazing her inner thigh, her gold bracelet and delicate necklace catching the light. Her gaze is direct, confident, with a hint of mysterious allure—lips slightly parted, expression calm yet sexually charged. The yacht’s interior is bright, white curved ceiling reflecting soft rays, black metal window frames framing the vast sea. Outside, turquoise water glitters under a pale blue sky, a distant breakwater lined with palms. Sunlight streams from upper right, casting gentle shadows across her skin and fabric, highlighting every contour—the curve of her breasts, the tension in her bare waist, the soft folds of her shorts. Shot in close-up, she dominates the frame slightly left, background dreamily blurred, focus sharp on her face and body. Tones of white, cream, blue, green create a luxurious, serene yet erotic vibe, like a high-end fashion editorial captured on a lazy, sensual afternoon.",
