        {
          "id": "krea2-28598ad9d5af7af78b50af3f",
          "alias": "单女灰外套城市媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges in a white rope hammock outdoors, her long, jet-black hair falling softly over her shoulders. She smiles warmly, eyes bright and inviting, locking onto the lens with a confident, sensual pose. A large cream-colored ribbon headband sits atop her head, adding a playful touch. She wears a dark gray V-neck baseball jacket with white striped trim on the lapels and cuffs, a prominent cream letter \"E\" on the left chest, and white vertical \"RYUHIEO\" lettering on the right sleeve. Beneath it, a black body-hugging dress clings to her slender frame. Her legs are pressed together, clad in black-and-white diamond-patterned thigh-high socks that reach above the knee. Her right hand lifts gracefully, fingers curling slightly to touch the headband, while her left hand rests on her thigh. She leans forward slightly, exuding a relaxed yet deliberately alluring attitude. The hammock is woven from thick white ropes, suspended outside a modern building, with white gravel beneath. In the background, a large black-framed glass door reflects a gray-blue sky and distant city silhouette. Soft natural daylight casts even, flattering illumination, no harsh shadows. The scene feels candid, like a casual phone snapshot, yet meticulously styled with a blend of schoolgirl charm and urban chic—effortlessly sensual, calm, and inviting.",
