        {
          "id": "krea2-e5ee545df7d27b0021525629",
          "alias": "单女白外套城市媚态站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a opulent interior, facing a mirror as she takes a selfie with a silver smartphone, the lens capturing her reflection. She wears a fluffy white faux fur coat with vivid red velvet details and Chinese-style frog buttons, hanging open to reveal a sheer lace top underneath, her nipples faintly visible through the delicate fabric. Her short brown hair falls naturally, soft bangs brushing her forehead, her eyes steady and sultry on the lens, lips slightly parted in a contemplative, inviting expression. Her right hand holds the phone, fingers long and elegant, a simple gold band on her ring finger; her left hand rests in the coat pocket, stance relaxed yet poised. The backdrop is a classic European interior with white wainscoting, intricate molding, and a black vintage sconce on the left wall casting warm yellow light across her silhouette. A long hallway extends behind, its black-and-white marble checkered floor creating strong geometric contrast, with a glittering crystal chandelier visible in the distance, illuminating the scene in soft, warm luxury. In the foreground, a glossy white marble countertop with natural gray veining holds a small black chain bag, adding a touch of everyday life. The lighting from the sconce and chandelier creates gentle shadows on her face and clothing, emphasizing the soft texture of the fur and the vivid red-white contrast. The overall atmosphere blends modern urban fashion with a hint of Eastern elegance, warm and intimate, with a subtle undercurrent of sensuality—the coat slightly open, the lace hinting at skin, her gaze direct and inviting. Tones of white, red, and gray dominate, accented by the warm yellow glow, creating a balanced composition with moderate depth, the woman and environment harmoniously unified in a poised, story-rich moment of self-capture.",
