          "prompt": "A young woman stands center stage, wearing a daring two-piece cow-print denim outfit: a tight, strapless crop top with white spaghetti straps and deep cleavage, paired with a high-waisted pleated micro-mini skirt adorned with silver zippers and buttons, accentuating her curved hips and ass. Her dark brown hair is tied in a loose, high ponytail with strands falling sexily over her forehead. She flashes a bright, seductive smile at the camera, her eyes gleaming with confidence. Her right hand toys with her hair, while her left hand rests provocatively on her hip. She wears a small headset mic, clearly performing. Behind her, a reflective dance floor mirrors purple and pink neon lights; in the distance, stage equipment and a dancer’s camo-booted leg are blurred. The scene is bathed in dreamy neon – violet, pink, and white beams creating a dynamic, sensual atmosphere. Medium close-up composition: she is slightly turned, her body forming a perfect S-curve. Soft front-top lighting highlights her skin’s glossy glow, while the blurred background focuses all attention on her. Cool tones with hot accent lights create rich contrast. The overall effect is a hyper-realistic, artfully shot moment from a pop concert, exuding raw sexual energy and live-performance tension.",
