        {
          "id": "krea2-f4a770bba7ae2da6a3d85004",
          "alias": "单女露胸米毛衣厨房媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a bright kitchen, wearing an unbuttoned cream knit cardigan with delicate lace embroidery and ribbed cuffs, pushed open to reveal her bare breasts and erect nipples. Her deep brown wavy hair falls naturally, ends brushing her shoulders. She gazes at the camera with a sultry, half-lidded expression, lips slightly parted as if tasting something or whispering. Her right hand lightly touches her own cheek, while her left hand grips a wooden-handled brass knife, blade hidden, as if about to cut a loaf. The foreground counter is laden with fresh baked goods: a wicker basket filled with golden baguettes draped with a red-and-white checkered cloth, a metal wire basket holding speckled brown eggs, crispy croissants glistening with butter, a crusty loaf of bread, and a yellow ceramic mug with a matte finish. The background shows a modern kitchen with white tile backsplash, black cast iron pans hanging from hooks, white cabinets, and a silver range hood topped with a green cylindrical lamp casting warm light. Lighting comes from upper left, blending natural window light with warm indoor glow, creating soft shadows. The composition is centered with the woman slightly left, her bare upper body drawing the viewer’s focus. The scene feels like a vintage film photo—grainy, warm-toned, nostalgic—but charged with a lazy, intimate sensuality as she stands partially nude, ready to enjoy a simple, erotic afternoon.",
