          "alias": "单女透视米毛衣街道戏谑行走拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman walks down a city street, her short black hair cut with a neat fringe, fair skin glowing, delicate features sharp and alluring. She wears a beige checkered knit cardigan, V-neck cut low, one shoulder deliberately bared, revealing smooth skin and a hint of cleavage. The matching short skirt hugs her hips, hemline high, letting her long thighs be seen in their full outline. Black sheer stockings cover her legs, highlighting every muscle and curve, ending at black patent leather square-toe high heels that catch the light. She carries a light blue handbag with a metal chain, her left hand relaxed at her side, fingers slim, nails clean. Her walk is confident, her head slightly lowered, lips parted in a sly, knowing smile. Behind her, a black SUV glistens, its rear lights glowing warm orange, reflections of buildings and lights in its windows. The gray pavement shows fine cracks. The shot is a mid-angle, slightly above, focusing on her from the knees up, the direction of her steps leading the eye left to right. Soft natural light falls from above, highlighting her face and body, shadows smooth and warm. The color palette is beige, black, gray, with the blue bag as a subtle pop. The image feels like a candid street capture—real, intimate, with a sensual, voyeuristic edge. Every detail is crisp: the texture of the knit, the sheen of the stockings, the glossy leather of the heels, the subtle bare skin beneath the open cardigan.",
