          "alias": "单女露胸黑西装媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman poses confidently before a vibrant dessert-themed backdrop, wearing a form-fitting black double-breasted suit jacket with shiny gold buttons, open to reveal a white lace camisole that barely covers her cleavage, her collarbone and the upper swell of her breasts exposed. The high-waisted black pencil skirt hugs her hips and stretches taut over her thighs, emphasizing her long legs. Her dark brown hair is styled in soft waves, makeup flawless with sharp eyeliner and a rose-pink lip. She gazes directly at the camera, lips slightly parted, a sultry smirk playing at the corner of her mouth. Her right hand gently brushes her earlobe, fingers grazing the chandelier earrings made of layered metal chains and sparkling gems, while her left hand hangs casually at her side, a thin bracelet catching the light. The foreground captures her full-body shot, slightly off-center, as she stands with a subtle twist, pushing her chest forward. In the midground, giant glossy red strawberries with textured seeds and swirls of creamy white whipped cream create a decadent, dreamlike setting. The soft pink background bathes the scene in a sweet, erotic fantasy. The lighting is soft and diffused from above, highlighting the smooth skin of her shoulders and the shadow between her breasts, the fabric of her clothes clinging to every curve. The image exudes a glossy, high-fashion magazine aesthetic—sensual, powerful, and inviting.",
