        {
          "id": "krea2-7d57a948f208cea534d8a9f5",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙窗边困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a pink dreamy indoor space, wearing a form-fitting red velvet Christmas dress with a plunging neckline and fluffy white fur trim that grazes the tops of her cleavage, the hemline short and edged with fur, a black velvet ribbon cinching her waist. Her long straight black hair and bangs frame an exquisite face; she gazes at the camera with heavy-lidded, seductive eyes, lips curled in a teasing smirk. Her right hand lightly caresses her cheek, fingers trailing down toward her neck, while her left hand hangs at her side, a simple ring catching the light. She stands with her body slightly turned, one hip subtly thrust forward, the dress clinging to her curves and accentuating her silhouette. Behind her, a minimalist white Christmas tree is adorned with pink, silver, and blue glass balls and shimmering star ornaments. The tree is placed against the wall on the right; to the left, a pink wall features an arched window with vintage carved frames, through which dim purple light spills, casting a mysterious glow. The ceiling is arched with layered pink and dark gray wave-like structures dotted with glitter, resembling a starry sky. The floor has a light gray mottled texture, with a few brown cardboard boxes and a metal stand scattered in the lower right corner for realism. The composition is centrally balanced, with the woman slightly off-center left, the tree as a focal point forming a stable triangle. Soft, even lighting from slightly front-right illuminates her face and the rich texture of the velvet and fur, while shadows smooth over her body's contours. Reflections from the ornaments and window light add depth. The color palette is pink, white, red, with touches of silver and blue, creating a romantic, sweet, yet festive atmosphere with an artistic, fashion-forward edge. The scene feels like a professional camera capture in a carefully styled set, blending dreamlike sensuality with real, intimate detail.",
