          "alias": "单女白衬衫摄影棚媚态坐脱衣（2）",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a modern studio, dressed in a crisp white long-sleeve shirt with a delicate bow at the collar, unbuttoned low to reveal a hint of cleavage, paired with a tight pink high-waist mini skirt that hugs her hips and a pair of white pointed stilettos. Her black wavy hair falls naturally, bangs framing her face perfectly; glossy red lips part slightly as she gazes confidently at the lens with a sultry, knowing look. In her right hand she holds a black microphone with a red logo, her left hand clutching a stack of white documents. She leans forward, thighs pressed together, the skirt riding up slightly, her posture both professional and provocatively poised. Foreground features a row of white chairs with orange stripe accents, some blurred to create depth. The midground focuses on her, body angled slightly, knees together with documents and mic resting on her lap. Background is a simple conference room or studio with a whiteboard on a pale gray wall, a desk and office equipment faintly visible in the distance. Soft, even light from overhead diffuses across the scene, highlighting the curves of her body and the texture of her clothing. A low-angle shot emphasizes her authority and allure, with chair lines guiding the eye toward her. The color palette is clean—white, pink, gray—accented with orange and red for vibrancy. The image has a crisp, high-end photographic quality, rich in detail and sensual tension, blending professional elegance with explicit erotic undertones.",
