          "alias": "单女街道忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an exquisite deep-green traditional Hanfu stands centered in the frame, her glossy black hair piled high in an elaborate updo pinned with a ornate silver hairpin studded with tiny gems and intricate scrollwork, a few loose strands falling softly against her cheeks. She crosses her arms confidently over her chest, her posture poised and defiant, her gaze fixed leftward with a pensive, slightly aloof expression—as if lost in distant thought or silent judgment. The Hanfu's rich green silk shimmers with golden embroidery of intertwining vines and auspicious clouds along the collar, lapels, and cuffs, trimmed with black brocade and dotted with tiny green and gold beads, clinging to the curves of her breasts and hips with every slight movement. A wide black belt cinches her waist, fastened with a metal buckle and dangling tassels, emphasizing her hourglass figure. The ancient street scene behind features gray cobblestones worn and uneven, with two blurry figures in pale blue robes walking away—one carrying a brown wooden chest, the other in white cloth shoes—their soft focus creating depth and a sense of a lively yet muted marketplace. The composition is a medium close-up with the woman slightly offset to the right, framed by a vertical wooden beam on the left, enhancing depth. Soft natural light from the upper right casts gentle shadows across her face and body, highlighting the contours of her cheekbones, the swell of her breasts beneath the silk, and the detailed texture of the fabric, creating a warm, golden-green palette that feels cinematic, melancholic, and quietly sensual. The overall tone is filmic, with subtle grain and natural light transitions, capturing a moment that is both artistic and intimately grounded.",
