          "alias": "单女全裸黑连衣裙沙发困倦注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman lounges in an ornate classical armchair, wearing a black sleeveless dress over a white long-sleeve blouse, the neckline slightly open to reveal a pearl necklace and delicate earrings. Her short hair is neatly styled, makeup fresh and natural, eyes half-lidded and dreamy as she gazes into the lens, right hand lightly cupping her chin in an elegant, languid pose. Her legs are crossed, one extended, clad in nude thigh-high sheer stockings and shiny black chunky heel pumps, the graceful curve of her ankles catching the light. The scene centers on the intricately carved gold-framed chair upholstered in dark gray with pale gold striped brocade, plush cushion, smooth curved back, and scrolled armrests. To the right, a matching small classical round table with gold trim and dark glass top holds a white ceramic vase filled with pink roses, white baby's breath, and green leaves. The background is a beige wall paneled with vertical gold metal strips, a painting edge visible in the corner, warm parquet wood flooring in brown-yellow tones. Light streams from the left, casting soft shadows across her face, clothing, and floor, enhancing the low-angle composition that uses the diagonal line of her legs and her gaze to create depth. Colors are warm gold, cream, black, and pink, evoking a rich vintage cinematic atmosphere with slight grain and natural exposure shifts, the mood intimate and sensual, a still from a film noir dream.",
