          "id": "krea2-44ae70eb52f1a74396b09368",
          "alias": "单女灰T恤楼梯媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a dimly lit stairwell, wearing a tight, pale taupe-gray camisole with fine wrinkled texture hugging her curves, paired with a high-waist black long skirt featuring intricate crochet lace cutouts—geometric patterns and vertical stripes—with a side slit revealing a tempting glimpse of bare thigh. She holds a small black leather handbag with gold clasp, her dark hair falling naturally, partly tucked behind her ear. Her makeup is minimal, lips soft and slightly parted, eyes cast downward in a sultry, relaxed gaze. One hand rests on the wooden stair rail, body tilted into an elegant S-curve. Warm golden light streams from the left, casting soft shadows across her face, arms, and the sheer fabric, highlighting every contour. The background is a warm beige wall with simple moldings, wooden stairs with light brown treads and a polished metal railing reflecting faint light. Mid-shot composition, subject slightly off-center right, stairs leading the eye upward. Shallow depth of field blurs the background, focusing on her sensual presence. Realistic photo style, shot with Canon EOS R5, 24-70mm f/2.8, ISO 100, 1/125 sec, daylight white balance, moderate saturation, slight contrast. The scene exudes quiet, sophisticated eroticism—a stolen moment of intimate elegance.",
