        {
          "id": "krea2-879b9a2fa8270eceee036a89",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉短裙摄影棚好奇坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits topless on a futuristic pink-and-white mechanical seat, her light blonde hair braided into a side plait over her left shoulder, blunt bangs across her forehead, soft wavy strands adorned with a pair of cute pink-and-white bunny ear hair clips edged with red trim. She faces the camera with bright blue-green eyes, gentle and curious, perfect eyeliner, long thick lashes, soft pink blush on her cheeks, glossy vivid red lips slightly parted as if about to speak. Her pale, smooth skin is bare from the waist up, collarbones and subtle cleavage visible, layered silver chain necklaces draping over her breasts—one featuring an irregular heart-shaped pink crystal pendant with translucent gloss and internal details, the other a thicker woven metal chain. Intricate gold geometric earrings dangle from her ears, made of small metallic segments. She wears a high-waist pink skirt with red structural panels at the hem, a red-and-white wide belt cinching her waist, and red wrinkled long gloves with elastic cuffs that grip her arms. On the outer sides of her arms, layered red-and-white petal-shaped armor pieces fan out sharply, contrasting with white gathered fabric underneath. The outfit blends cute, sweet, and mecha styles. Background is a dark gray interior with a minimal wall, a single vertical white line on the left, and a large circular device behind the seat—pink and silver-gray with a black center and multiple concentric rings, like a spaceship cockpit or high-tech console, smooth with subtle reflections, creating a strong sci-fi atmosphere. Composition is a medium close-up shot, subject slightly right of center, head tilted left, looking straight ahead, stable focal point. Foreground emphasizes the upper body and clothing details, midground shows the seat and part of the figure, background blurred for depth. Lighting comes from front upper angle, soft and even, illuminating face and upper body, shadows smooth without hard edges. Color palette dominated by pink, white, red with silver-gray and black accents, bright yet sophisticated. The image feels like a professional studio shoot but retains slight natural flaws like gentle noise and lens distortion, balancing polish with realism, brimming with youthful energy and futuristic fantasy, like a virtual idol character from a drama, blending artistic beauty with pop culture.",
