          "alias": "单女露胸白连衣裙摄影棚媚态倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sheer white lace dress, off-shoulder and translucent, with layered skirt and delicate ruffles that barely conceal her curves, her bare breasts visible through the fine fabric, nipples pressing against the lace. She wears black lace gloves, fingers long and elegant, gripping a sleek black pistol with metallic sheen. A semi-transparent veil covers part of her face, revealing sharp cheekbones and deep, focused eyes. Her full red lips are slightly parted, expression cold and intent. Black hair falls smoothly over her shoulders. A black choker encircles her neck. She leans sideways against a rough gray concrete wall, body slightly forward, arm steady with the weapon as if poised for combat. Indoor studio setting: weathered wall, pale wood floor, distant softbox and reflector silhouettes. Close-up composition, tilted angle for dynamic feel, visual line from gun to face to background. Lighting from the right, warm and layered, highlighting her front while casting soft shadows on wall and floor. Background darker to emphasize subject. Black-and-white palette with red lips as the sole color accent. Atmosphere blends elegance and danger, softness and power, like a cinematic still frozen in a tense moment, exuding sensual artistry.",
