          "prompt": "A young nude woman stands center stage, her body bathed in warm stage light, the deep blue and black fabric of her high-slit gown pooling on the reflective floor—her bare shoulders and exposed collarbones gleaming, the glossy silk of the blue section catching the light like midnight sky. The dress's high slit reveals her long, pale legs, and she wears silver strappy stiletto heels with tiny sparkling details. In her hands, she holds a golden trophy with a heart-shaped cutout, its metal surface cool and polished, while her other hand grips a lush bouquet of blue and yellow flowers dotted with white blooms and green leaves. She tilts her head slightly toward the audience, her gaze soft and confident, a subtle smile on her lips. The background shows a large LED screen with \"EI Mate80 系列\", \"鸿蒙\", \"TOD\" and partner logos in white and red, below which warm circular stage lights cast radial beams creating soft halos. The floor reflects orange-red light, contrasting with her deep blue dress. The scene is brightly but softly lit from above-left, with gentle shadows and a slightly blurred background that emphasizes her nude form. The composition is symmetrical, the visual flow from her gaze down to the trophy and bouquet, then along her exposed leg, creating a natural sensual vertical line. The atmosphere is both ceremonial and intimate, like a high-end documentary still, captured with a cinematic lens—sharp focus on her, subtle bokeh, rich details, and an erotic sense of triumph and vulnerability.",
