          "alias": "单女露胸粉外套雪地微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits elegantly on a dark wooden bench buried in thick snow, her long black hair cascading in soft waves over her shoulders. She wears a fluffy pink long coat, unbuttoned and open to reveal her bare breasts, the pink lace of her dress pushed aside, leaving her torso exposed. A sheer lace miniskirt and transparent lace stockings with intricate floral patterns cling to her legs, paired with tall white fur-lined boots. Her delicate silver earrings and choker catch the warm glow. She leans slightly forward, one hand resting on her thigh, the other on the bench armrest, her gaze gentle and inviting, a soft smile on her lips. The foreground shows scattered snowflakes and the weathered wood of the bench. In the midground, the woman sits centered, her body bathed in warm light from the string of soft yellow fairy lights wrapped around the pine trees and bushes behind her. The trees are frosted with icicles, and the distant sky blends pink and purple twilight. The composition is symmetrical, with depth from the snowy foreground to the glowing background. The main light comes from above right, casting delicate highlights on her hair, cheeks, and breasts, with shadows on the left. The cool blue reflection of the snow contrasts with her warm skin and pink coat, creating a dreamy, romantic, and festive atmosphere. Every detail is crisp and realistic, like a candid moment in a winter wonderland that feels both poetic and sensual.",
