          "prompt": "A young woman stands outdoors on a city street, wearing a tight black satin or faux-leather bunny bodysuit with glossy reflective highlights, sculpted bust cups, and a form-fitting waistline. The skirt is short, ending at mid-thigh, emphasizing her long legs. She wears white cuff-style false sleeves, a black bow tie at her collar, and a black bunny-ear headband with slightly curved, perky ears. Her dark brown hair is in double braids draped over her shoulders. She has thin round metal-framed glasses, a delicate face, and a gentle gaze toward the camera, lips slightly curved in a natural smile. Her right hand makes a victory sign—slender fingers with neatly trimmed nails. Black stiletto heels with simple uppers. Her look blends sexy and schoolgirl elements. She stands front-facing, slightly off-center left, leaning forward slightly for an intimate feel. Foreground: gray square cobblestone floor with visible texture and subtle reflections. Background left: a glass shop door and window display with green plastic crates, bottled drinks, and blurred merchandise; a blue-and-white circular Korean sign outside, stacked green crates, one marked “HOT.” Background right: a male figure in white shirt and dark blue jeans walks away from the camera, blurred motion, brown leather shoes. Daylight, natural soft light from upper right, casting subtle shadows on her body and the ground, highlighting fabric folds and contours. Center composition, shallow depth of field with background blur, subject prominent. Color palette dominated by black, white, gray, with accents of green and blue for cool/warm contrast. The scene feels casually encountered, like a street snapshot—professional-grade but with slight grain and natural light transitions, giving a documentary-like aesthetic with amateur camera charm. Balanced composition, rich detail, realistic tones, and a lively, playful atmosphere.",
