          "id": "krea2-6f84b0255da01765f14e8936",
          "alias": "单女露胸蓝牛仔摄影棚微笑坐脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits indoors, her long black hair naturally cascading with soft waves, a few strands brushing her cheek and shoulder, exuding a casual yet refined allure. She wears a blue denim jacket, unbuttoned and open, with a high collar and zipper details, a white horse logo embroidered on the left chest, and white stripe trim on the sleeves. Beneath it, she is topless, her breasts fully exposed, nipples visible against the white fabric of the jacket's inner lining. She pairs this with a cream pleated miniskirt, short and flowy, made of cotton-like material with delicate lace trim along the hem, accentuating her bare thighs. In her right hand, she holds a transparent plastic cup filled with colorful fruit salad (orange slices, strawberry chunks, other fruits), and in her left hand, a black straw ready to stir. A gold bracelet adorns her wrist, and her fingernails are painted with light polish, clean and neat. Her eyes lock directly with the camera, clear and focused, a gentle smile curling at the corners of her mouth, soft facial features, fair and smooth skin, natural makeup highlighting her eyes and lips, creating a fresh, sweet yet seductive vibe. The background is a bright indoor space, possibly a clothing studio or dressing room. On the left, a metal rack holds a variety of clothes—orange, pink, yellow plaid, black-and-white polka dots, leopard print—vibrant but not cluttered, some tags visible. On the right, another rack has empty hangers and fabric. White walls in the distance, gray tiled floor reflecting soft light. A window with black metal frames is behind her to the left, showing green trees and sunlit building outlines outside. Natural light pours in from the left, casting soft, diffused light on her face, arms, and clothes, creating subtle shadows on her skin and the floor, enhancing depth. The composition is a mid-shot portrait, she sits slightly right of center, body turned slightly, face fully toward the camera, direct eye contact creating intimacy. Foreground focuses on her and the cup, her expression and hand action drawing the eye. Midground includes her full outfit, pose, and surroundings (racks, clothes, chair, part of floor). Background blurs the window and outdoor scene, shallow depth of field emphasizing her. Visual path: first her face, then down to her bare chest and the cup, then to the fruit, then the environment. The overall atmosphere is relaxed and natural, like a candid moment of everyday life, yet intensely sensual. Color palette: blue, cream, white, with warm accents from the clothing. The image mimics a realistic phone or camera shot, with slight grain and noise, simulating amateur equipment, rich details, smooth light transitions, blending life and artistic beauty in a realistic style.",
