          "alias": "单女T恤车库困倦蹲侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman squats beside a concrete pillar in an underground parking garage, her soft brown wavy hair cascading naturally over her shoulders. Her skin is fair and smooth, her delicate facial features sharply defined. Her eyes are lowered, slightly glazed, lips parted, expression languid and sensual. She wears a deep burgundy one-shoulder tight leather camisole with a glossy sheen and subtle creases, a small white brand logo printed on the chest. Below, a high-waisted black shiny leather mini skirt with metal rivet detailing on the side, the hem revealing the edge of sheer black stockings. Her legs are crossed and slightly bent, feet adorned with black pointed-toe stiletto heels with metal buckle accents. The outfit exudes urban chic and dark aesthetic vibes. Her right hand rests lightly on her knee, her left hand hangs naturally, a simple silver bracelet on her wrist, multiple rings on her fingers, a delicate chain necklace around her neck, a small tattoo visible on her collarbone, and subtle tattoos on her arms. The background is of rough gray concrete walls and floor, with stains and wear at the corners, asphalt ground with yellow traffic markings, distant green plants and structure. Sunlight falls from an angle above, casting soft shadows on her body and the ground, creating a realistic, textural scene. The composition is a mid-shot, subject positioned slightly left, her body forming an S-curve, head tilted slightly downward, gaze lowered. The visual focus is on her face, chest, and legs. The palette is dominated by gray, brown, and black, with the burgundy top as a focal point, evoking a cool, sexy urban street style. The image resembles a professional camera shot with a shallow depth of field, the background slightly blurred, emphasizing the subject while retaining environmental details. The texture is delicate and realistic, as if captured by high-end photography equipment during daylight outdoors, with strong realism and artistic expression.",
