        {
          "id": "krea2-b95f38639e1ecc60ff95f628",
          "alias": "单女白礼服婚礼媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman in a pristine white wedding dress stands in side profile, the gown's strapless bodice slipping down to expose one full breast and her bare shoulder, the fabric clinging to her curves with delicate lace and subtle sheen. Her sheer veil cascades from her head, adorned with tiny crystals and droplets, glowing under the intense backlight that creates a translucent halo and scattered light flares. Her black hair is swept up elegantly, revealing sparkling diamond drop earrings that catch the light. She tilts her head slightly, casting a gentle, introspective gaze to the side, her skin luminous and pale. The composition places her on the right third of the frame, with deep black negative space on the left, emphasizing her form. The dramatic spotlight from the upper right backlighting traces the silhouette of her body and the veil's edge with bright rim light, while dust motes float in the beam. The overall mood is sacred, romantic, yet intensely sensual, presented in a high-contrast monochrome palette with golden halos and diamond reflections, evoking an artistic bridal portrait with raw, intimate allure.",
