          "prompt": "A young woman stands in an outdoor courtyard, wearing a sheer, body-hugging pale pink spaghetti-strap dress with a square neckline that accentuates her curves, the thin straps and translucent fabric hinting at the shape of her breasts and nipples. Her long black hair falls naturally, some strands lifted by a gentle breeze. She stands with a slight side turn, one hand raised behind her head, the other hanging loosely at her side, fingers long with neatly trimmed white nail polish. A delicate gold chain rests around her neck. Her makeup is refined—sharp eyeliner, soft pink lips, and a dreamy, slightly yearning gaze looking off to the side. The background is an open outdoor scene: dense green bushes and trees on the left, distant hills and a calm blue bay in the distance, heavy gray clouds overhead creating soft, overcast light. To the right, a modern building with light gray walls and wooden louvered shutters; below it, a black woven lounge chair with a white cushion. A light brown wooden folding picnic table and matching bench occupy the foreground, the table surface showing subtle wear. The ground is green grass with a concrete path at the edge. The composition is a medium shot, the woman placed slightly right as the focal point, with the foreground table and bench acting as leading lines. The overcast light is even and soft, with subtle highlights on her skin and dress folds. The overall atmosphere is tranquil and slightly melancholic, like a lazy afternoon. The palette contrasts cool greens, blues, and gray sky against the warm pink of her dress and skin tone. The image has a casual, amateur photography feel with slight grain and natural motion blur, focused on the subject while the background gently blurs for depth yet retains details—a balance between realism and aesthetic portrait, capturing a mundane yet touching moment.",
