          "alias": "单女全裸蓝毛衣雪地媚态蹲阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman crouches naked in the center of a snowy field, wearing only a white fluffy hooded hat with adorable bear ears, light blue knit gloves printed with little penguins and white stars (the left wrist reads \"Pingu\"), and beige plush snow boots. Her tousled brown curls fall naturally from under the hat, face delicately made up with bright, expressive eyes, lips slightly parted, gaze locked directly at the viewer with a playful yet sultry expression. She leans forward, knees bent, hands cupping her chin in a relaxed pose, her bare skin flushed with cold. The foreground shows packed snow with subtle footprints and a finger-drawn circle on the left. Midground features snow-laden bare trees and dark green shrubs. In the distance, a green metal fence, several brown wooden signboards with white papers, and a dense conifer forest under a grey overcast sky. The composition is centered with the woman slightly below midline, soft diffused light creating no harsh shadows, heavy emphasis on white tones contrasted with her warm skin and accessories. The scene feels like a candid winter photo, realistic with fine snow texture, soft fur, and smooth skin.",
