        {
          "id": "krea2-2b549464e801ed0d67c9c4d5",
          "alias": "单女露胸米连衣裙广场困倦跪躲藏",
          "prompt": "A young woman kneels on a bed covered in an orange-red embroidered brocade sheet, completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, wearing only a cream lace slip dress pulled down to her waist, the frayed hem pooling around her hips, thin spaghetti straps dangling off her shoulders, revealing her long neck and collarbone. She wears a light blue knitted beret tilted slightly over her forehead, black hair cascading from under the hat, falling softly over her shoulders and chest, partly covering one nipple. Her legs are clad in black chunky boots with white ribbed socks peeking out at the ankles. She leans forward slightly, right hand resting on the bed, left hand loose at her side, gazing directly at the camera with a hazy, sleepy look, lips parted in a natural rose shade, makeup subtle yet luminous, skin pale and smooth, features sharp and elegant, exuding a gentle vintage sensuality. The background is a nostalgic room with peeling plaster walls revealing gray cement, a dark metal shelving unit holding antique ornaments—a gold round frame, a square photo frame, an oval mirror, a small sculpture under glass, colorful fabric crafts, and an embroidered hanging. Beside it stands an old wooden cabinet topped with a black clock and a floral screen, behind which another painting is faintly visible. Warm, soft light comes from the right, casting side shadows that create delicate chiaroscuro on her skin, the bed, and the room, with a retro palette of orange-red, cream, light blue, and deep brown. The composition is a medium shot, her figure center-right, dominating the frame, background rich but blurred with shallow depth of field, drawing the eye to her gaze, while the sheet’s texture and folds guide the eye downward. The overall feel is cinematic and artistic, like a vintage film still capturing a frozen, intimate moment—quiet, melancholic, rich in detail, warm light, and a story of private allure.",
