        {
          "id": "krea2-cfc542b7db4d47845f93422a",
          "alias": "单女短裙花园媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a lavishly decorated interior, wearing a sheer white lace cropped top that barely covers her breasts, the V-neckline plunging deep, wide sleeves with delicate ruffles, leaving her midriff fully exposed. She pairs it with a matching high-waisted short skirt, layered and airy, riding high on her thighs. Her long black hair is braided and draped over her right shoulder, with blunt bangs framing her face. She wears thin-rimmed glasses, lenses catching soft light, her gaze calm and direct at the viewer, lips slightly parted in a gentle, contemplative expression. A simple silver necklace rests at her collarbone, a tiny pendant glinting, a sparkling silver bracelet on her wrist, and a ring on her finger adding subtle detail. Her hands rest lightly on her bare thighs, posture relaxed. Behind her, a lush floral wall of pink, red, and white roses intertwined with green leaves creates a romantic backdrop, with dark furniture outlines and warm yellow lights glowing softly beyond, casting a private, intimate ambiance. To the left, a round table covered in white cloth; to the right, a red vintage cabinet with carved details. Warm light falls from the upper left, creating soft side lighting that highlights her face and body, with deep, blurred shadows enhancing depth. The composition is central, slightly off-center right, with direct eye contact. The foreground is sharp, midground transitions to the flowers, background gently blurred, giving a natural depth of field. Visual lines from her head, gaze, and body draw attention to her facial expression and the sheer fabric clinging to her skin. The overall mood is warm, romantic, and subtly seductive, like a private garden party or upscale restaurant corner. The image has high detail and artistic quality, akin to a professional fashion shoot but retaining authentic intimacy. Colors are warm yellow and white, accented by red and green, with rich contrast and harmony. Lighting emphasizes the texture of the lace and the glow of her skin, creating a visual style that blends elegance with modern sensuality. The image is hyper-realistic, from strands of hair to petal veins, offering an immersive experience.",
