        {
          "id": "krea2-f2cf3c3b5a20bda1285fd25b",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑短裤床困倦躺侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman reclines on a bed covered in a white down duvet, her body angled diagonally with her head tilted back, long hair falling naturally, a few strands brushing her cheek. She gazes lazily into the camera with a sleepy, seductive expression. She is topless, wearing only black high-waist shorts and black sheer stockings that catch the light with a subtle sheen. A sleek silver watch adorns her right wrist; her left hand lightly cups her chin, fingers long and neatly trimmed. Her legs are crossed and extended, showcasing the elegant line of her ankles. On the plush white comforter beside the bed lie a pair of black high heels with metal buckle accents, creating a stark contrast. The background is a simple interior with a light gray or off-white wall, and a vertical white folding blind visible on the right. Soft side light streams in, casting gentle shadows and creating a warm, tranquil mood. The composition uses a diagonal line from lower left to upper right, guiding the eye from her face down along her body to her legs and feet. Shadows and highlights are finely detailed, with the duvet's folds and the stockings' texture rendered realistically. The overall palette is black-and-white with skin tones and grays, producing a quiet, intimate, modern atmosphere. The image resembles a low-angle professional portrait that captures an unposed, everyday moment, blending artistry with naturalism. Clean, uncluttered, and focused on the fusion of the subject and environment, it conveys a restrained elegance and gentle strength.",
