        {
          "id": "krea2-7d5fb7aa8bdb8789285e71d0",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑连衣裙戏谑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A blonde woman stands with her back to the camera, her hair swept up in a high bun secured by a black velvet scrunchie, with a few loose strands falling naturally against the nape of her neck. She is completely topless, her bare back exposed, with only a simple black off-shoulder long-sleeve dress slipping down past her waist, revealing the curve of her spine and the soft shadow of her sides. The dress hugs her hips and thighs, its waist cutout and transparent mesh sleeves adding a teasing contrast. A single gold hoop earring dangles from her right ear. Her hands rest lightly against the outside of her thighs, posture relaxed and confident. The composition places her slightly right of center, with the foreground showing her bare back and arms, while the midground includes a dark wooden staircase with black metal railings on the left, a red brick wall and light brown curtain on the right. Behind her, heavy beige drapes create a soft, intimate space. The lighting comes from the left front, warm and even, casting gentle shadows that trace every muscle and curve of her spine and the folds of the dress. The overall effect is cinematic, with fine film grain and a desaturated, vintage palette that blends realism with artistry, evoking a quiet, contemplative mood.",
