        {
          "id": "krea2-12ad4a6b73a73f28f54d2b83",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑网袜摄影棚媚态倚靠",
          "prompt": "A young topless woman in black fishnet stockings and black lace panties, adorned with black feathered wings, leans seductively against a vintage black wrought iron staircase railing. Her long, straight black hair cascades down her shoulders; her makeup is flawless with red lips slightly parted, eyes locked on the camera. One hand gently touches her cheek, the other hangs loosely at her side. A colorful circular tattoo decorates her left arm, and an English text tattoo runs down her right thigh. Her body curves into an S-shape, highlighted by soft, cool-toned light from the front-side, casting dramatic shadows that accentuate her bare skin and curves. The foreground features intricate black iron scrollwork framing the composition, while the background is a clean white brick wall, slightly blurred to emphasize her nude form. The overall palette is monochrome with touches of skin tone and vivid red lipstick, creating a high-contrast, darkly erotic fashion-photography aesthetic. The scene feels like an intimate, private moment captured in a studio, exuding a modern urban gothic sensuality with rich detail in lace, feathers, and tattoos.",
