        {
          "id": "krea2-75577bb37536b81d6bbe9879",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑丝袜城市害羞站立持械",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless at a modern indoor event, wearing only sheer black stockings and black high heels with white bow decorations. Her long dark hair cascades in soft curls over her bare shoulders, one hand gently touching her cheek, the other resting on a round black table, a ring glinting on her finger. She offers a shy, tender smile, eyes soft and focused as if lost in a beautiful moment. On the table: a colorful brochure and a gold pen. The background is a futuristic exhibition space with gray walls etched in geometric lines, large tropical plants (monstera, ferns) bathed in purple light, creating a dreamlike glow. To the right, two staff members: one in a black leather jacket holding a device, another with a video camera. A blue cold-light column stands nearby. The floor is light concrete with yellow warning stripes. Lighting combines soft overhead illumination with colorful atmosphere lamps, creating a cool-warm contrast. The subject is center-left, mid-shot, sharply focused, with the background softly blurred. Visual flow leads from the table objects to her face, then to the greenery and tech elements. Tones of black, gray, and green dominate, accented by purple and blue light. The scene feels like a high-end editorial photograph, blending urban sophistication with natural vitality, intimate yet professionally staged, exuding a sensual, elegant, and contemporary mood.",
