          "alias": "单女露胸蓝短裤健身房媚态站立自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands topless in front of a gym mirror, taking a steamy selfie. She wears only high-waist light blue shorts and a white Nike cap tilted low, partially hiding her face. Her right hand holds a smartphone in a glitter case, aimed at the mirror, while her left hand rests on her hip. A gray knit cardigan drapes loosely over one bare shoulder. Her long, slightly wavy hair falls naturally, framing her smooth pale skin and soft facial features. She bites her lower lip, eyes half-lidded, a confident, sensual smirk playing on her lips. The composition is centered, her body turned slightly, forming a natural S-curve. The bright gym has warm wooden floors, a large mirror reflecting the room: dark gray walls, built-in storage, neatly stacked gray yoga mats, and an industrial ceiling with exposed metal pipes and black track lighting. Glass partition doors on the right let in adjacent light. The lighting is bright and even, cool white overhead contrasting with the warm wood, creating a fresh, airy feel. The color palette is blue-gray with warm wood tones and white accents. The image has the raw, unfiltered look of a real phone selfie, capturing an intimate moment of casual fitness style turned explicitly sensual, radiating confident, positive energy.",
