          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a bus seat, her jet-black hair with straight bangs falling softly beside her face. She turns her head slightly toward the window, her eyes calm and contemplative, lips lightly parted, natural pale pink. Her skin is fair and smooth, facial features soft with a straight nose, overall an elegant and aloof aura. She wears a black long-sleeved cardigan left unbuttoned, revealing a white V-neck top pulled down to expose her full breasts, nipples erect. The cardigan sleeves have black-and-white stripes. A silver geometric necklace glints at her collarbone. She rests her right hand on a black leather handbag with fine texture and gold metal clasps, the strap slung across her shoulder. Her left hand rests on her thigh, fingers tracing lightly upward, slightly lifting the hem of her skirt to reveal smooth bare skin. She leans back casually on the light gray fabric seat with subtle plaid pattern and stitched edges. The clear window shows an urban street scene: a white van with Japanese characters and \"670\" on its side, reflections of buildings, a yellow awning, green plants, and a pale blue sky. Warm natural light streams through the window, illuminating her face, bare chest, and clothing with soft shadows and natural contrast. Composition: medium shot, subject on the left, window environment on the right, balanced. Her gaze leads outward, creating a sense of quiet urban commuting. The image has a slight grain, realistic lighting, cool tones, like a candid phone photo capturing a fleeting intimate moment in a public space—understated yet charged with sensual calm.",
