          "alias": "单女全裸礼服忧伤站立摆拍",
          "prompt": "A voluptuous Eastern woman stands in side profile, her body turned slightly toward the viewer, wearing a sheer, flowing ancient-style gown of pink and white that clings to her curves. The luxurious, multilayered fabric is so translucent that it reveals the full outline of her naked torso, her erect nipples pressing against the gossamer material. Her lustrous black hair is swept up into an elegant high bun adorned with a silver hairpin and delicate tassels, a few stray strands escaping to brush her bare shoulder. She bows her head, her expression serene yet melancholy, eyes downcast as if lost in deep thought. Her wide, butterfly-like sleeves flutter open, embroidered with white cloud motifs, and a wide silk sash at her waist is tied in a graceful bow, the fabric loosely draping to expose the swell of her hips. Behind her, a huge, luminous full moon casts a soft backlight that silhouettes her figure, creating a halo of light around her, while the sheer parts of her dress glow with subtle shadows, highlighting the weightless texture and the form of her body beneath. The scene is set against a pale lavender gradient sky, veiled in mist, dreamlike and ethereal, with the composition framing her from the back and side, emphasizing her elegant pose and introspective mood. The overall image blends traditional Eastern aesthetic with modern digital rendering, imbuing the scene with a poetic, sensual atmosphere, as if capturing a timeless moment of unspoken desire.",
