        {
          "id": "krea2-7e1479b95b581bab8f4994da",
          "alias": "单女露胸粉连衣裙椅上媚态坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits in a corner of a vintage café, wearing a pink feathery slip dress with red hearts, the thin straps sliding off her shoulders to expose her bare breasts. She pairs it with white thigh-high stockings and black-and-white heels adorned with fluffy white trim and black ankle straps. Her black hair falls naturally, makeup precise, eyes locked on the camera with a calm, slightly mysterious expression. A silver chain necklace and simple bracelet accent her wrists, black nail polish on her fingers. She poses elegantly on a light green upholstered metal chair, legs crossed (right over left), body leaning back slightly, left hand resting on her knee, right hand dangling by the chair. The mid-left frame places her as the visual anchor. Foreground: dark wood floorboards with visible grain and gaps, faint reflections. Midground: blue vertical striped wall paneling, yellow baseboard, the chair, and a small round table to her right holding a delicate porcelain teacup and saucer, a slice of multi-layered cake with colorful frosting, and a few scattered candies. Background: beige wallpaper with repeating brown rose and bird patterns, a white cone wall lamp emitting soft warm yellow light, bathing the space. The composition is centered and symmetrical, guiding the eye from her face down to her legs and shoes, then right to the table, then back to the wallpaper and lamp, forming a circular visual path. Warm-toned lighting from the upper-right wall lamp creates soft, even illumination, with shadows concentrated on her left side and the floor, enhancing depth and volume. High color saturation and contrast blend pink, blue, yellow, and white, evoking a retro-modern aesthetic. The image has the authentic, amateur-captured feel of a daily snapshot—detailed textures, natural imperfections—yet the composition and color are artfully arranged, creating a sensual, life-styled moment.",
