          "prompt": "A young woman stands at the entrance of a European building, wearing a fluffy white long coat with soft, voluminous curls, the coat unbuttoned to reveal her bare chest beneath a sleek black turtleneck that hugs her curves and accentuates her neck. Her right hand gently touches her cat-eye sunglasses, left hand holding a small black leather purse with gold metal clasp. Her brown hair is styled with blunt bangs and a black-and-white bow clip, adding a playful vintage touch. She wears black cat-eye sunglasses reflecting the surroundings, her gaze focused on the camera with a sultry expression, lips painted soft pink. A gold hoop earring dangles from her right ear, a gold ring on her left hand. She stands slightly turned, body curving in an S-shape, relaxed and confident. Behind her, an ornate black wrought-iron gate with intricate scrollwork; beyond it, a wooden staircase with dark polished railing. To the right, a beige stone wall with a gold intercom panel. Warm yellow-beige tones, natural light from the left casting soft shadows on her body, highlighting the coat's texture and her facial features. Medium shot, center-left composition, depth of field with blurred background. The mood is sensual, urban, and effortlessly chic, with a film-grain aesthetic, slight overexposure, and a natural, candid feel that exudes independent elegance and sexual confidence.",
