          "alias": "单女露胸黑手套婚礼微笑站立注视",
          "prompt": "A woman stands center frame, elegantly topless except for a delicate pink satin fabric draped loosely around her hips, the smooth material catching warm light. Her deep brown wavy hair falls naturally, strands brushing her bare shoulders and cheek. She wears a soft, confident smile, eyes gazing directly forward, a hint of allure in her expression. A multi-layered gold and metal necklace rests against her collarbone, glinting. She has on long black leather gloves, glossy, reaching past her elbows; her left wrist bears a gold bracelet with fine engravings. In her right hand, she holds a bouquet of three velvety purple roses, the stems wrapped by the glove. Background: deep black backdrop with vertical gold pillars topped by small round bulbs emitting a warm yellow-white glow, casting soft halos and highlighting her face and bare chest. Mid-shot composition, slight head tilt to one side, asymmetrical posture—left shoulder higher, right lower. A partial gray suit sleeve enters the frame from the left edge, adding narrative depth. Warm, filmic lighting with subtle grain and natural shadow transitions, emphasizing the smooth texture of her skin, the gloss of the gloves, and the sheen of the fabric. Color harmony of pink, black, and gold. Overall scene feels like a high-end sensual portrait, intimate and refined, evoking a backstage award ceremony or private evening shoot.",
