        {
          "id": "krea2-eaafa1bf0c918a38f9bbebe8",
          "alias": "单女蓝外套公园忧伤坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a weathered wooden park bench, her medium-length dark brown hair falling naturally with a neat fringe, strands lightly stirred by the breeze. She turns slightly toward the camera, her gaze soft and inviting, eyes clear and sparkling with subtle lid shimmer, long curled lashes framing a gentle, slightly melancholic expression. Her lips are parted in a faint smile, naturally red and full, cheeks smooth and flushed. She wears a deep blue wool coat trimmed with thick, fluffy dark brown fox fur at the cuffs, but the coat hangs open, revealing that underneath she wears only a white high-neck sweater, with the top buttons undone and pulled aside to expose the full curve of her bare right breast, the nipple nestled against the soft cream fabric. Her left hand rests on her thigh, fingers relaxed, while her right hand lifts to her chin, silver ring catching the light. Below, black leggings cling to her long legs. The scene is a late-winter park: dry yellow leaves cover the ground, bare trees line a path, empty benches fade into the distance. Warm sunlight streams from the upper left, casting a golden rim light on her hair and shoulder, creating long shadows on the bench and ground. The composition is a close-up, the woman occupying the left two-thirds, her head slightly tilted, eyes locked with the viewer. The background is softly blurred, foreground bench slats sharp with wood grain. The color palette is cool: deep blues, whites, browns, with warm golden highlights from the sun. The mood is quiet, contemplative, and sensual, capturing an intimate winter afternoon moment with the texture of a professional portrait shot on a fast prime lens—rich detail, natural bokeh, and cinematic tension.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
