        {
          "id": "krea2-dfd62e24c49765b0ffe8655a",
          "alias": "单女棕外套街道媚态坐摆拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman with dark hair braided into twin pigtails, the top section dyed teal green and spiked upward in a punk style, sits on a concrete planter edge on a city street. She wears an open brown suede work jacket, revealing a white lace bra and her bare stomach. A high-waist white pleated mini skirt sits above mid-thigh, cinched with a black wide belt. Cream thigh-high boots with a brand logo cover her legs. Her right hand is tucked into the jacket pocket, left hand resting on her knee, blue nail polish visible. She leans slightly to the side, right leg bent and lifted, left leg extended, in a relaxed yet taut pose. Direct eye contact with a cool, aloof expression. Foreground features a tight crop of her lower body and legs, occupying the bottom third. Background: a heavily graffitied white stone column with \"ITO\" and stickers, behind it a pale yellow wall with commercial signs including a purple \"ATM\" sign, yellow \"CLUB DINING SHOPS\", and a red \"$25.\" price board. At left, a purple-green plant. Low-angle shot, subject centered-left, warm retro film aesthetic with grain and slight overexposure. Harsh sunlight from upper right casts strong shadows. The scene exudes urban rebellion, youthful freedom, and sensual street style.",
