        {
          "id": "krea2-9d30cce2631b515c1703def6",
          "alias": "单女全裸黑手套舞台媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman with long pale pink hair and blunt bangs sits center stage, naked except for a vibrant red beret, black elbow-length gloves, and black platform boots—her black high-neck off-shoulder top and red-black check skirt discarded on the floor nearby. Gold star earrings dangle from her ears, a faint smirk on her lips as she stares directly into the lens, exuding raw confidence and allure. A white headset mic curves over her left ear, its cable trailing naturally down her bare shoulder. Her hands rest lightly on her exposed knees, pose elegant and relaxed. Blurred background dancers move in similar risqué attire—some topless, some in torn skirts—under intense fuchsia and violet stage lights that slice from above and the sides, casting dramatic chiaroscuro across her skin and highlighting every curve and strand of hair. The central composition keeps her face and torso in sharp focus, with rich texture on her skin and gleaming wet highlights, while the mid-ground dancers are softened and the backstage set melts into a dreamlike haze. The color palette is dominated by hot pink and purple, accented by red and black, creating a high-contrast, pulsating visual impact. The shot mimics a professional studio photograph yet retains the gritty energy of a live performance, as if captured by a high-end camera in low light—perfect depth of field, precise focal length, saturated yet natural tones. The overall vibe is a fusion of K-pop idol glamour and explicit sensuality, like an album cover or music video still oozing youthful, modern, unapologetic sex appeal.",
