          "alias": "单女露胸黑手套窗边媚态坐吸烟",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully in a vintage-style interior, topless, her bare shoulders and chest exposed, wearing only long black silk gloves that extend up to her hands, one hand elegantly cupping her cheek, the other holding a gold-tipped cigarette with a dark wooden mouthpiece. A multi-strand pearl necklace with a dazzling diamond pendant rests against her skin, complemented by pearl drop earrings. Her dark hair is swept up into a high bun adorned with an intricate silver crown hairpiece, with soft bangs framing her forehead. Her brown eyes are clear and confident, lips painted a soft rose pink, skin pale and smooth. The light falls from the left, casting gentle shadows, illuminating her face, bare chest, and gloved hands. The background features a pale green wooden doorframe and a frost-marked window, with blurred city silhouettes beyond. The scene exudes a sensual, nostalgic 1950s Hollywood film-noir aura, with warm golden tones, subtle grain, and an intimate, story-rich composition.",
