        {
          "id": "krea2-73530dad29f99d4e993b27f7",
          "alias": "单女半褪蓝挂脖室内困倦站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands indoors, her shoulder-length brown hair falling naturally with a neat fringe, a soft pink hairband woven through the strands. Her fair, smooth skin glows, delicate features defined by natural brows and subtle eye makeup, a hint of eyeliner lifting her eyes, long curled lashes. She gazes gently with one eye half-closed, the other slightly open, a soft smile curling her lips, expression serene and sweet. She wears a shallow blue knitted halter top with pink straps adorned with tiny bows, the fabric soft and textured, warm against her skin. The top is pulled down, baring her perky breasts, nipples visible, as she angles her body slightly toward the camera, shoulders relaxed, arms hanging naturally, pose graceful and relaxed. Behind her, a white wall is covered with colorful cartoon patches featuring Snoopy and Peanuts characters—Charlie Brown, Lucy, Snoopy—held by circular magnets, creating a cozy homey feel. The composition is a close-up, focusing on her upper body and face, filling most of the frame, with the cartoon decorations adding depth and whimsy. Lighting comes from front-left, soft and even, highlighting her face and body, casting gentle shadows, with subtle highlights on her cheeks and nose, emphasizing her skin's luster. The overall mood is warm, intimate, everyday casual. Dominant pastel blue and pink tones, accented by warm yellow and orange from the cartoons, evoke a relaxed, cheerful vibe. The image feels natural, like a candid phone or camera shot, with slight film grain and soft depth of field, background slightly blurred to keep her as focus. Details rich, textures realistic, lighting delicate, colors harmonious—a youthful, tender, everyday beauty captured with a sensual twist.",
