        {
          "id": "krea2-e63a4c531ffa492939c6f956",
          "alias": "单女露胸米连衣裙广场自信坐拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a sleek white cylindrical stool, her body slightly turned toward the camera, head tilted and eyes locked forward with calm, confident expression. Her long black hair falls naturally with soft waves, glossy and smooth. She wears a tight beige-brown dress with a daring chest cutout that exposes the full curve of her breasts, nipples visible through the opening. Over it, a matching loose long-sleeve cardigan is draped casually over her shoulders, sleeves hanging free. Her hands rest gently on her knees, fingers long and nails polished pale pink; a simple silver ring adorns her right ring finger, a small bracelet on her left wrist. She wears beige square-toe ankle boots with low heels, hugging her legs. In her hand, a woven handbag matches the outfit, its fine texture adding detail. The background is a minimalist indoor space with pure white walls and floor, a large circular recessed geometric pattern on the wall adding depth and modernity. Soft diffused light streams from the left, casting even illumination that defines her silhouette and smooth skin, with natural folds in clothing and gentle shadows. The color palette is warm beige, cream, and light gray, creating a serene, high-class atmosphere. Composition is a mid-shot, subject slightly left of center, body in an S-curve with crossed legs, guiding the eye from her feet up to her face. The foreground shows her lower body and handbag, midground her torso and stool, background the abstract wall. Lighting is balanced with no harsh contrast, creating a soft, natural photographic effect reminiscent of a high-end studio or candid daylight shot. The image exudes hyper-realistic artistry and everyday elegance, capturing the independent, sophisticated aura of a modern urban woman.",
