        {
          "id": "krea2-d394ea7f2af116c667ec7349",
          "alias": "男女舞者黑短裤舞台媚态站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A female dancer stands center stage in a black high-waisted shorts and a red open-back bodysuit, striking a powerful, sensual pose. Her dark hair is pulled into a high ponytail with strands falling over her shoulders, face sharply made up with a cold, seductive expression, eyes locked intensely on the camera, lips slightly parted as if lost in the beat. A small microphone clips onto her ear, hinting at a live performance. Her back curves smoothly, a decorative black belt cinching her waist. Black mesh gloves cover her shoulders and arms, while her legs are sheathed in sheer black stockings and pointed-toe stiletto heels with slim ankle straps. The outfit blends sexy, avant-garde stage presence. In the foreground, a male dancer crouches beside her, wearing dark clothing, his face partially hidden by a red-and-white checkered scarf that reveals only his lower jaw—muted, submissive, creating sharp visual contrast. He leans slightly forward, hands hanging loosely, as if mid-transition or awaiting a cue. The background glows in warm orange-red stage lights, with beams from behind and the side casting strong chiaroscuro, deepening the three-dimensionality. Soft bokeh lights and drifting colored confetti enhance the festive, electric atmosphere. The stage floor reflects gentle shadows, adding depth. The composition is mid-shot, the dancer slightly right of center, her body forming an S-curve that conveys fluid motion. Her gaze leads directly to the viewer, while her posture draws the eye down along her legs to the heels, creating a visual flow. The lighting is meticulously handled: a main source from above and side, highlighting her contours with smooth shadows, luminous skin, and fabric sheen and wrinkle details. The overall mood is passionate, dynamic, and modern stage art, resembling a full-frame camera shot with a wide aperture, soft background blur, balanced saturation, cinematic warmth, and rich tonal layers—both the brilliance of stage lights and preserved realistic details. The composition is full yet uncluttered, harmonizing figure and environment, capturing a performance of strength and aesthetic eroticism.",
