          "alias": "单女粉礼服困倦倚靠侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a lavish pink off-shoulder gown, the bodice covered in intricate sequins and beadwork forming raised floral motifs, the skirt layered and shimmering with a soft luster. She leans slightly sideways against a rough white stone wall, her black hair loosely pinned up, stray strands brushing her cheek, her eyes half-lidded and dreamy, lips slightly parted in a natural pink hue. A single ornate drop earring hangs from her right ear, set with a dark gem and glittering crystals. Her right hand grips a brown paper bag, two golden crusty baguettes protruding from it, their surfaces crisp and inviting; her left hand rests on her hip, her posture elegant and relaxed. The composition is a close-up, the figure slightly left of center, head tilted, drawing the eye. The background shows the textured white stone wall with cracks and weathering. Lighting is bright and soft, coming from the left front, highlighting the delicate skin and shimmering details of the dress, with gentle shadows across her face and shoulders. Colors: pink, cream, light brown, with dark hair and gems creating contrast. The scene blends romance and luxury with everyday elements—the paper bag and bread—adding intimacy and realism. The style evokes a fashion editorial yet feels candid, like a stolen moment in afternoon sunlight. Focus is on her face and upper body, background blurred, with a balanced layering: foreground featuring the figure and bag, midground the dress and hand, background the wall. The atmosphere is sensual and languid, with a film-grain texture and slight overexposure, mimicking an amateur camera shot while retaining high-resolution detail, giving the image both artistic depth and a natural, authentic feel.",
