          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a marble staircase indoors, her long black hair spilling over bare shoulders. She is fully topless, wearing only a blue knitted cardigan unbuttoned, the fabric parting to reveal her firm breasts, nipples erect in the soft light. Her pale, flawless skin glows. She wears a light yellow high-waisted pleated miniskirt, hiked up to expose the tops of her thighs, and cream thigh-high socks with diamond-textured weave. Beige square-toe chunky heels with thin straps adorn her feet. She sits sideways on the step, left leg stretched out, right leg bent, one hand bracing behind her on the marble, the other resting casually on her knee. The background is a modern staircase: marble steps with metal edges, red metal railings diagonal, black supports, white walls. Natural light streams from a window on the right, casting soft shadows across her body and the stairs, creating high contrast. Mid-shot, slight low angle, focus on her exposed torso and calm, distant expression. The mood is still, urban, with a cinematic film-grain feel. Colors blend warm beige and cool blue-yellow.",
