        {
          "id": "krea2-3e06cf1ea8eeb547928d39ec",
          "alias": "单女红连衣裙忧伤站立注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a sheer, sleeveless red layered gauze dress, the fabric so thin it clings to every curve, revealing the outline of her nipples and the dark shadow between her legs. Her long hair falls naturally, strands stirring in a gentle breeze. She stands slightly turned, right leg lifted and foot planted in black short boots, the pose both elegant and casual. Her gaze drifts dreamily to the left, expression calm yet melancholic, lips parted and faintly pursed. Her skin is pale and flawless, features delicate. The dress is transparent, layers lifting as she moves, the hem riding high to expose her thighs and the edge of a black thong. In the foreground, her body and the red skirt dominate, sheer fabric accentuating her silhouette. The midground shows a red brick archway topped with dark terracotta tiles, slightly weathered, supported by thick brick pillars and an off-white concrete column with cracks and stains. The ground is gray cement, textured with small stones and dust. Beyond, a clear blue sky with fluffy white clouds, modern buildings with glass facades and metal structures, green trees, and a triangular warning sign. The composition uses asymmetric thirds—subject on the right, leaving space for the background, the arch framing her. Light streams from the upper left, bright and soft, casting sharp shadows on the ground and columns. The red dress glows with high saturation against the cool sky and earthy browns, creating a warm, candid, everyday scene with slight lens distortion and natural grain, as if captured on a phone or compact camera—intimate, raw, and beautifully explicit.",
