          "alias": "单女半褪黑连衣裙卧室媚态自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman takes a sultry selfie in front of a mirror indoors, wearing a black strapless mini dress that hugs her curves, paired with a fluffy off-white faux-fur coat that she lets slip off one shoulder, revealing the smooth skin of her décolletage and the upper swell of her breasts. The fur coat is soft and layered, casting gentle shadows, with fine fiber textures contrasting the sleek fabric of her dress. Her dark hair is styled with blunt bangs and slight waves, topped with a jeweled tiara—purple, green, pink gems set in an arc—and a black three-dimensional flower ornament on the right side, petals dense and lush. Her makeup is sultry: elongated winged eyeliner, shimmery eyeshadow, thick curled lashes, a small straight nose, and glossy nude-rose lips slightly parted as she gazes at her phone screen with a lazy, focused expression. In her right hand she holds a black smartphone with a triple-camera module and flash; her fingers are long with pale nail polish, a simple silver ring with a tiny diamond on her ring finger. Her left hand gently touches her right forearm, wrist adorned with a delicate metal chain necklace with a small pendant. Her neck is fair, collarbones prominent. The background is a warm wooden wall with vertical grain, soft left-front lighting creating a cozy, intimate atmosphere—like a late-night bedroom or dressing room moment. The close-up composition centers on her, the phone framing the left side, guiding the eye from screen to her face and then her outfit. The image has a realistic, slightly grainy, amateur-photo feel with natural lens distortion, warm tones, and rich texture, emphasizing her elegant yet casual sensuality.",
