          "prompt": "A woman in a tailored black single-breasted suit jacket worn open, revealing her bare chest and a hint of cleavage, the jacket's clean lines accentuating her silhouette. Underneath, she wears no top, allowing the soft curve of her breasts to be exposed. A slim gold-buckled belt cinches her waist, paired with a high-slit black skirt that ends mid-calf, the slit riding up her thigh to expose a glimpse of skin. Her deep brown hair falls in loose waves over her shoulders, a simple black headband across her forehead. She wears small pearl earrings. Her left hand rests on her hip, right hand raised with fingers slightly parted, pose relaxed and confident. She stares directly into the camera with a calm, focused expression. Behind her, floor-to-ceiling black metal-framed windows reveal blurred city buildings and distant greenery. To the right, a gray fabric sofa with dark wood frame and soft cushions, scattered pillows. Light gray matte tile floor reflects soft light. The space is monochrome black, white, gray with touches of cream and gold. Centered composition, slight turn of her body for dynamic balance. Soft side light from left window illuminates her face and the texture of the suit and bare skin, creating delicate shadows and a warm, bright atmosphere. Overall cool but inviting tones, high quality, detailed, evoking a confident urban professional woman in a sensual, nakedly confident pose, like a high-end corporate portrait with artistic flair.",
