        {
          "id": "krea2-358c7c22d9fefea6b933aeb7",
          "alias": "单女女仆黑女仆装街道媚态站立",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sleek black-and-white maid outfit stands under the warm glow of a streetlamp on a nighttime city street. She wears a white lace cat-ear headband, the fluffy white ears tipped with soft pink inner fur contrasting her long black hair and straight bangs. Her makeup is flawless with sultry, hooded eyes, thick lashes, and glossy red lips slightly parted. She teasingly cups her hands over the black bow at her chest, fingers adorned with silver rings—one set with a black gem—and lace-trimmed wrists. The fitted black corset top has a white ruffled collar and puffy sleeves with black stripes, while her short, flared white pleated skirt reveals a hint of thigh. Her waist is cinched with black crossed straps. She looks directly at the viewer, a shy yet confident smirk on her face. The background shows blurred city lights, a white car parked to the left, a red taillight trailing to the right, and a silhouetted passerby in jeans walking away. The low-angle composition emphasizes her legs and height, with soft overhead streetlight casting warm highlights on her front and deep shadows on her sides. The image is rich in detail with subtle film grain, evoking a dreamy yet urban night atmosphere. Color palette is mostly black, white, with accents of red (lips, tail light) and pink (inner ear), plus warm yellow streetlight.",
