        {
          "id": "krea2-d099460870e5238d328d8b4c",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑礼服摄影棚戏谑坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits regally on an ornate red velvet high-back chair with intricate gold Baroque carved frame, tufted buttons, exuding aristocratic opulence. She wears a sheer black lace gown, the delicate floral pattern barely concealing her bare breasts and nipples, the translucent fabric teasing glimpses of her pale skin. The neckline and sleeves are trimmed with ruffled lace; a deep crimson rose garland adorns her throat, adding a Gothic romantic touch. Her right hand holds a black-and-gold folding fan adorned with red roses and dark motifs, while her left hand rests casually on her thigh, fingers long and white. Her ankles are slender, feet bare against the red velvet flooring, left leg elegantly crossed over right, posture poised and erotic. Her black hair flows smoothly over her shoulders, makeup refined—sharp eyeliner, deep wine-red lips, her gaze calm and distant as if lost in time. The background is a gray stone-textured wall hung with multiple clock devices: Roman numeral faces, exposed mechanical gears, and vintage pocket watches, some hands frozen at different times, symbolizing stagnation and cycle. To the left stands a white classical pillar adorned with scrollwork, beside it a sheer black veil swaying gently in the breeze. Several deep red roses cascade from the upper left corner, petals rich and lush. The floor is black-and-white checkerboard tiles, enhancing geometric order. The composition centers on the woman, mid-shot, with the chair forming a stable triangular structure directing focus to her face and upper body. Foreground red velvet fabric extends to the ground, adding layers and tactile sense. Light comes from front-left, softly and evenly illuminating her face and body contours, creating subtle highlights on the gold edges and gentle shadows for depth. The overall atmosphere blends Gothic aesthetics with Baroque luxury, dramatic tension and temporal themes. Color palette: black, red, gold, with gray-white background for strong contrast. The scene has high artistic expression and narrative depth, like a film still or high-fashion editorial, with surrealism as if in a forgotten palace of time. Every detail speaks of power, beauty, and eternity. The shot mimics a professional studio, using a large aperture prime lens for shallow depth of field, subject sharp and background naturally blurred, texture fine, color saturation moderate—preserving realistic light and shadow while artistic. Overall a refined, coldly sensual, story-driven visual experience.",
