        {
          "id": "krea2-5c9b10eaeac592d1609b9e1f",
          "alias": "单女女仆黑女仆装闺房困倦躺拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman with silver hair and piercing blue eyes reclines languidly and seductively on a carved dark-brown leather sofa, her body clad in a scandalously reimagined black lace and patent-leather maid ensemble—the bodice barely containing her, white ruffled lace at her chest giving way to a deep, revealing neckline. A black choker with a dangling metal ring hugs her throat; her hands are gloved in black lace, wrists cinched with tight ruched fabric. Her soft silver-gray hair spills over bare shoulders, adorned with fluffy cat ear headband, adding playful innocence to her smoldering gaze. She looks down with half-lidded eyes, a faint smirk on her lips, one slender hand lifted behind her head, the other resting casually on the sofa arm. Her long legs cross at the thigh, sheathed in glossy black high-thigh stockings—one foot arching gracefully as the hem rides high, hinting at the absence of anything beneath. Beside her on the cushion lies a small orange pumpkin with fine ribbing and a green stem, a circular white label affixed to its side, evoking a Halloween or autumn theme. In the background, a dark upright piano with visible keys, stacks of assorted pumpkins, and a blue-and-rust geometric Persian rug fill the cozy, vintage scene. Soft warm light from the front-right caresses her skin, catching every curve and the glossy leather of the sofa, while shadows deepen the folds of her scantily worn dress. The composition is low-angle, drawing the eye upward along her legs, past the exposed thigh, to the hint of bare hip where the lace fails. The overall palette is rich brown, black, silver, orange, and blue, creating a private, warm, yet teasingly mysterious atmosphere—a striking fusion of realism and fantasy, as if from an high-fashion boudoir shoot.",
