e negative space, emphasizing her presence and aura. This is a commercial fashion editorial style, sensual yet restrained, exuding cool confidence and independent femininity. The image quality is ultra-high resolution, crisp details as if shot by a professional camera, capturing every nuance. She looks like a fashion blogger in a studio, effortlessly sexy with a star-like allure but approachable vibe. The light and color interplay creates a quiet, powerful visual impact.",
