        {
          "id": "krea2-5f711eed610cfd296b3d70e4",
          "alias": "单女全裸红手套纯色背景媚态坐过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits gracefully on a pure white background, wearing nothing but a pair of vibrant red leather gloves that gleam with a subtle shine, her hands crossed elegantly over her bare chest, fingers slightly spread, as she touches her own skin with quiet confidence. She wears black lace stockings with intricate floral and vine patterns, her legs crossed, revealing the semi-transparent texture. Her deep brown wavy hair cascades over her shoulders, a few strands brushing her face. Her makeup is bold—deep red lips matching the gloves, smoky eyes with a cold, intense stare directly into the lens. Gold circular earrings add a touch of luxury. The composition is a mid-shot, slightly tilted, with her head lifted, creating a tall, poised silhouette. Soft overhead light illuminates her smooth skin and the fine details of the leather and lace, with no harsh shadows. The clean white background keeps all focus on her nude form, blending high-fashion photography with a raw, natural feel. The dominant colors are red, black, and white, delivering a strong visual impact and a sensual, artistic tension.",
