        {
          "id": "krea2-b66457a72d01f26a8661cb05",
          "alias": "单女半褪连衣裙镜前媚态站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands before a vintage full-length mirror, her loose floral dress (cream with small pink and red blossoms) featuring a ruffled collar, gathered hem, and puffed sleeves—now intentionally pushed down to bare her left shoulder and the upper curve of her breast, one hand tugging at the strap as if adjusting or revealing more. Her black hair falls naturally, her face softly lit with a focused, contemplative expression, lips slightly parted, a hint of curiosity and quiet sensuality. She wears a grey knit cardigan open and slipping off, light blue jeans hugging her hips. The foreground shows the mirror edge and partial body outlines; behind, a warm ochre wall with a classic white fabric lampshade casting a gentle golden glow. Deep brown wood mirror frame with ornate carvings reflects the room's details: a stag horn mount and blurred furniture. Mid-shot composition, she is centered-right, the mirror dominating the left, creating a dual visual of reflection and reality. Light from the right-side lamp creates delicate chiaroscuro on her face and clothing, evoking an intimate, cinematic atmosphere. Warm tones dominate—amber, cream, blush, soft denim blue—with film grain, natural bokeh, and subtle depth of field. The focus is on her expression and the subtle erotic tension of her exposed skin, capturing a quiet, tender, yet charged moment of everyday beauty.",
