        {
          "id": "krea2-8b6f08fcf6330fca1a713752",
          "alias": "单女黑外套雪地忧伤站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in the snowy winter night, her long, straight black hair cascading freely, the strands lightly curling and drifting in the cold breeze. Her face is delicate, her gaze clear yet slightly melancholic, staring directly at the lens with lips slightly parted, an expression of tranquil depth. She wears a long black coat, the collar opened wide, revealing the bare skin of her chest—no inner garment beneath, the soft curve of her breasts visible against the cold air. A thick red-and-white plaid scarf wraps around her neck, the lines sharp and warm, contrasting with the frosty surroundings. Her hands are tucked into the coat's pockets, her posture relaxed, body turned slightly left, head tilted—an elegant, languid pose. In the foreground stands a decorated white Christmas tree, thick with snow, its branches adorned with shimmering silver lights and orange bows, a gold star at the top, the trunk softly blurred for shallow depth of field. The woman stands in the middle ground, behind her a warm interior space visible through a wooden-framed glass door, soft amber light spilling out, illuminating the scene. Through the door, hints of bookshelves, picture frames, and everyday objects appear. To the right, another larger white Christmas tree, also snow-covered, hung with colorful lights and ornaments. Snowflakes fall midair, each crisp, with a dynamic blur. The lighting comes from the warm interior glow behind her and the small lights on the foreground tree, creating a mix of backlight and side light. Her face is evenly lit, contours sharp, shadows soft, the whole composition layered with light and shadow. The framing is centered, with the woman slightly left, guiding the viewer's eye to her expression. The foreground tree and falling snow add depth and motion, while the background architecture and lights provide context. The atmosphere is warm and romantic, holiday-rich, yet tinged with solitude and contemplation—as if waiting in the silent snowy night. The palette leans cool, punctuated by warm amber light, creating a poetic winter evening aesthetic. The image is crisp, detailed, with high-definition professional quality yet a natural, candid feel—a moment brimming with emotional warmth, as if you can hear the snow landing and distant chimes. The scene feels cinematic and story-driven, making you wonder her tale: expecting someone, or savoring the quiet night alone. The style merges realistic modern urbanity with nostalgic holiday warmth, light and color deeply evocative. The composition is balanced yet dynamic, with a visual path from the foreground tree to the woman, then into the glowing interior—an immersive journey into the stillness and beauty of a winter night.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
          "tags": [],
          "favorite": false,
          "template": false,
          "is_user_plan": false,
