        {
          "id": "krea2-001f554fdbb973f55d9b4f5e",
          "alias": "单女灰长裤健身房媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands sideways in a modern indoor gym, wearing a tight, sheer pink long-sleeve crop top that exposes her midriff and the curve of her breasts, paired with high-waisted dark gray yoga leggings that cling to her hips and thighs, white knit ankle socks. She balances on one leg atop a wooden and black leather Pilates reformer, the other leg extended back and resting on the curved backrest, one hand gripping a black metal training frame beside her, body leaning forward slightly, head tilted up, gaze fixed out the window, expression focused and serene. Her long brown hair falls freely, a vivid red flower tucked behind her ear as a sensual accent. The pose emphasizes her toned core, glutes, and the elegant line of her spine. The foreground shows her body and the Pilates machine with smooth wood grain and black padding, next to a sleek black metal frame with circular holes. Midground is a large floor-to-ceiling window with thin black frames, revealing the Shanghai skyline including the Oriental Pearl Tower with red and blue lights faintly visible, surrounded by high-rises in soft morning/evening light. The background is an urban skyline with distant buildings slightly blurred for depth. Composition side view, subject on left third, window on right creating balance. Slight low-angle shot makes her look tall and fit. Warm ambient light from recessed yellow ceiling strips evenly illuminates the space, with natural light from the right window blending softly, casting subtle shadows on her body that accentuate her curves. Walls are light brown wood paneling with a subtle sheen. Overall color palette: warm brown, cream, gray-black, with the red flower as a vibrant focal point. The scene has a candid, everyday feel, as if captured with a smartphone or compact camera, realistic details, slight wide-angle distortion (16-35mm equivalent), focus on her face and movement, background slightly blurred, shutter speed freezing the dynamic pose, natural exposure, blending artistic beauty with authentic daily life—a quiet, sensual moment of a city woman pursuing fitness and well-being.",
