        {
          "id": "krea2-d762cd28c2b4e69319b26195",
          "alias": "单女灰毛衣咖啡厅微笑站立阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands at a coffee shop counter, her brown bob with blunt bangs framing a face painted with a playful, curious smile. She wears a thin, off-shoulder grey sweater that slips down to reveal a bare shoulder and the top of her chest, hinting at curves beneath. Her deep blue wide-leg jeans hug her hips loosely, and a pink backpack rests on one shoulder. In her right hand, she holds a menu with food photos, her body slightly turned toward the camera as she looks back over her shoulder, lips glossed in pale pink, cheeks flushed. The dark wood counter and white marble surface fill the foreground, with a black commercial grinder, a transparent glass hopper, a smaller grinder, and a metal espresso machine. Behind her, a yellow ring light casts warm glow, illuminating the space with soft, layered shadows. On the wall hang vintage decor: one poster reads \"MAGIC POTTER,\" another is a red abstract piece in a gold frame. Silver ventilation ducts run overhead, textured and hanging on chains. An exposed bulb on a chain, a black wall fan, wooden cabinets with glass bottles and metal containers, pale gray wood floor, and a clay vase with dried pink flowers complete the scene. The composition places her slightly right of center, her gaze directed left, creating visual flow. Natural light mixes with the warm ring light, contrasting with cool wall tones and equipment, evoking a cozy, nostalgic, slightly industrial vibe. Details abound: brand logos, potted plants, poster text, fallen petals on the floor. The overall aesthetic feels candid, like a real everyday shot, with a palette of pink, gray, brown, and white accented by green plants and red art, exuding youthful, literary, leisurely intimacy.",
