          "id": "krea2-f494cb41b35939d4f5dd56e2",
          "alias": "单女短裙冷淡侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman in an exquisite red traditional Hanfu, her long black hair swept up into a high bun adorned with gold tassels and white feather ornaments, loose strands cascading beside her ears. Her makeup is delicate and refined with soft eyeshadow and natural pink lips, her gaze clear and resolute, head slightly tilted as she stares into the lens with a calm, composed expression. Her right hand grips a slender silver ancient sword, the blade long and smooth, reflecting cold metallic light, the hilt wrapped in dark fabric; her left hand rests lightly on the blade. The red Hanfu is made of silk, the front opened wide, revealing her bare chest and the curve of her breasts, the garment's edges embroidered with golden fan patterns and curling vines, white piping at the collar and cuffs. A wide red belt cinches her waist, and the layered skirt flows around her with a weightless quality. The foreground focuses on her face and upper body, emphasizing her features and the texture of the exposed skin and silk. In the midground, her arm and the sword extend diagonally toward the upper right, creating a strong visual line. The background is a blurred gray-green rock or cliff face, rough and textured, softly out of focus to highlight the subject. The composition is a close-up, with the figure positioned left of center, her head tilted slightly, meeting the viewer's gaze with an intimate yet distant tension. Light comes from the left front, soft and even, illuminating her face, shoulder, and the folds of the fabric, while the right side of her face and neck fall into natural shadow, enhancing three-dimensionality. The sword blade catches a sharp highlight, underscoring its cold elegance. The overall palette is dominated by passionate red, with gold, white, and gray accents—contrasting yet harmonious. The atmosphere is quiet, charged with latent power, as if frozen in a wuxia world, blending Eastern classical beauty with the daring spirit of a swordswoman. The image resembles a professional portrait shot with a full-frame mirrorless camera and a wide aperture, with creamy bokeh, sharp details, true-to-life colors, and a slight film grain that adds a nostalgic, artistic touch.",
