        {
          "id": "krea2-d9e9042104c5294d4a98cb28",
          "alias": "单女白T恤广场害羞坐侧头",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on the wooden floor of a traditional Japanese room, wearing a sheer white lace-trimmed camisole nightgown with delicate cutouts along the hem and straps, a thin white satin ribbon tied into an elegant bow at her chest. Her waist-length light brown hair falls in soft layers with blunt bangs, cascading naturally over her shoulders and back. She wears subtle, fresh makeup with a hint of pink shimmer on her eyelids and coral-pink lips. A fine silver chain with a small heart pendant rests at her neck. She sits cross-legged with bare feet, hands folded in her lap, dark nail polish on her toes and fingers. Her pose is demure yet slightly shy, her gaze lowered toward the camera with a soft, dreamy expression. Her body turns slightly to the right, head tilted, creating a quiet, introspective atmosphere. Foreground features blurred warm bokeh probably from sunlight filtering through leaves, adding depth and a dreamy feel. Midground shows the wooden platform of dark brown planks with visible grain and slight wear, evoking age. Background has a rustic wooden wall with a traditional sliding door, dark brown frame, frosted glass panels revealing shifting light outside. On the left wall, a dense collage of small square vintage-style instant photos, blurry but forming a nostalgic memory wall. Below them, a dark wooden table with a few papers or magazines casually placed. The overall lighting is soft and warm, from upper left simulating afternoon sun, casting gentle highlights on her skin and long shadows across the floor and wall, creating a calm, intimate interior. Composition uses classic rule of thirds, figure placed right of center, leaving enough space for background details. A large mirror behind her reflects part of her back and hair, enhancing spatial depth. Visual guidance uses her gaze and body orientation to draw the eye toward the center, while the left photo wall and right wooden structure balance the frame. Light palette contrasts warm gold tones with cool gray-blue shadows, preserving indoor coziness while accentuating her pale skin and the pristine white of her clothes. Overall style echoes Japanese portrait photography, merging vintage film grain, soft color transitions, and delicate light handling, as if shot with an old film camera, with slight grain and color shift. The scene exudes quiet poetry and a hint of melancholy, capturing a gentle moment in passing time.",
