        {
          "id": "krea2-6ee8b577fd0c35431edc7e85",
          "alias": "单女露胸白衬衫镜前沉思站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a city sidewalk, her long black hair falling naturally, pale skin, delicate features, eyes cast downward to the ground, her right hand lightly resting on her cheek, an elegant and slightly contemplative pose. She wears a sheer white puff-sleeve blouse, its fabric slightly translucent with natural wrinkles, unbuttoned to reveal her bare breasts and erect nipples, matched with high-waisted dark gray tailored trousers that fit snugly. She holds a soft light-blue handbag with a thin strap. Her body angles slightly toward the camera, head tilted, creating a casual, dynamic beauty. In the foreground, a tall ornamental plant with slender stalks and pinkish-purple and beige spike flowers, some leaves yellowed and curling, frames the left side naturally. Midground, the woman is center-right, contrasted by a silver-gray SUV parked on the right, its reflective body showing blurred surroundings, clean windows, white side mirror, modern door handle. Background is a urban street: left a multi-story building with dark gray brick, aligned windows some with security bars, \"ARTSTYLE\" sign visible; farther a white residential building and lush green trees forming a green barrier; sky a twilight pale blue, soft light from upper-right creating warm backlight, a subtle halo outlining her silhouette, her hair, shoulders, and clothes with delicate chiaroscuro. The overall mood is tranquil and intimate. Composition follows rule of thirds, woman center-right, foreground plant lower-left, vehicle extending lower-right, forming a stable visual triangle. Slight low angle enhances her proportions while retaining street depth. Focus on her face and upper body, background slightly blurred for shallow depth of field. Predominantly cool tones: white shirt and gray pants clean, plant's pink-purple and yellow-green accents add natural life. Image feels photorealistic, as if shot with a professional camera, rich in detail and texture, cinematic visual depth, soft natural light evoking the warm atmosphere of early evening. The scene captures poetic everyday stillness. Bare patches of sidewalk pavement and scattered fallen leaves at the edges reinforce realism and the passage of time.",
