          "alias": "单女露胸粉礼服城市忧伤站立过肩",
          "prompt": "A woman in an elegant pink strapless gown stands on the balcony of a modern high-rise building, the top of the dress slipped down to expose her full, bare breasts. Her long, wavy black hair falls naturally over her shoulders, her fair skin flawless, with delicate, layered makeup and soft rose-pink lips. She gazes intently into the camera, slightly turned, her posture poised and confident. One hand rests lightly on the silver metal railing, the other hangs beside her flowing gown skirt. A glittering jeweled necklace adorns her neck, and tassel earrings dangle from her ears. The satin gown has a subtle sheen, with embroidered and lace details at the waist, and a wide A-line skirt that catches the light. Behind her, towering skyscrapers with glass facades reflect a gradient of blue-purple and golden hues under the setting sun. The warm orange sky casts a golden backlight, creating a soft halo around her silhouette. The side-backlighting sculpts her figure with dramatic chiaroscuro. The foreground shows the horizontal metal railing and light beige marble with natural speckles. Composition follows the rule of thirds, with her positioned left-center, leaving the right side open to the cityscape. A slight low-angle shot makes her appear taller, contrasting the elegant figure against the oppressive vertical lines of the skyscrapers. The golden-hour light gives a warm, romantic atmosphere with a touch of urban isolation and lonely beauty. Rich details, harmonious colors, cinematic quality—like a still from a high-end fashion shoot. The reflection of buildings and her silhouette create a quiet, story-rich scene, blending realism and dreaminess.",
