          "id": "krea2-5820ff1a11ce368570aa9afe",
          "alias": "单女红礼服洗手台忧伤坐出神",
          "prompt": "A stunning East Asian woman in an exquisite red ancient-style gown, her long black hair piled high atop her head, adorned with an intricate golden crown and ruby-studded hair ornaments, white feathers and tassels dangling among the curls, a few loose strands falling softly over her bare shoulders. She gazes downward with a melancholic, contemplative expression, lips slightly parted as if whispering or lost in thought. She wears a red silk dress with a plunging off-shoulder neckline, delicate lace trim, gold chain links across her cleavage, and layered gold bangles, ruby bracelets, and stacked gold hand chains on her arms. Her hands rest lightly on the edge of a pink plastic basin, which sits on a wooden table. The background is a dark brown vertical wood slat wall, creating a classical yet slightly oppressive atmosphere. The composition is a medium close-up, tilted diagonally from upper left to lower right, drawing the eye along her posture and mood. Soft warm light falls from the left, illuminating her face and the rich textures of her costume, with natural shadows on the right enhancing depth. The overall mood is tranquil and mysterious, blending ancient courtly drama with an intimate, almost voyeuristic realism. The image is rendered in 8K resolution, with balanced color saturation, fine skin texture, natural fabric folds, and a subtle film grain and slight noise for a lifelike feel. The palette is dominated by red and gold, accented with black, white, and pink, creating striking contrast and harmonious composition. Her expression is nuanced, her eyes deep with narrative. The background is tastefully blurred, emphasizing her, while the pink plastic basin in the foreground juxtaposes ancient elegance with mundane modernity, adding a surreal, cross-temporal tension.",
