        {
          "id": "krea2-ce41517ac12bb6207b7604ca",
          "alias": "单女全裸高跟鞋舞台忧伤坐",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a dark theater seat, completely nude, her skin glowing under cool blue spotlights. She crosses one long leg over the other, a stiletto-clad foot dangling—black glitter heels catch the light. Her body is slightly twisted, head turned back toward the camera, lips parted, eyes hooded with quiet confidence. Her black hair is loosely pinned up, a few strands falling across her cheek. The deep black velvet of the empty seats around her is detailed with subtle textures and small white labels. Overhead, a row of cold stage lights cuts through the darkness, casting dramatic shadows. The frame is low-angle, slightly upward, emphasizing her silhouette. She sits off-center to the right, leaving negative space on the left. The lighting is cinematic, soft yet sharp, with a shallow depth of field that blurs the background into obsidian. The scene feels like a silent moment before a show—elegant, lonely, and intensely sensual. High-end camera, large aperture, film-grain quality.",
