        {
          "id": "krea2-2d0655603568846566566d7d",
          "alias": "单女露胸黑衬衫公寓媚态坐交叠",
          "prompt": "A young woman with jet-black hair and blunt bangs sits in a retro Coca-Cola themed diner, her skin pale and flawless, eyes clear and inviting, lips slightly parted as she sensually sucks on a red-and-white striped straw, staring directly at the camera with a playful, seductive gaze. She is completely topless, her bare breasts exposed, pale nipples visible, the black-and-white striped short-sleeve shirt hanging open and untied, falling loosely to frame her flat stomach. Her high-waisted blue denim shorts sit low on her hips, legs crossed naturally on the red-and-white leather booth seat. She holds a clear glass filled with ice and cola, the \"ICE COLD\" logo and Coca-Cola emblem on the glass. The white tabletop in the foreground features a round red Coca-Cola logo. The background shows a light blue and black tiled wall, with a large hexagonal neon sign above: red background, white cursive \"Coca-Cola\", a green area depicting a classic bottle and \"ICE COLD\" text, framed in metallic green. Behind it, a reflective silver metal panel creates wavy mirror distortions. The composition is centered, focusing on her face and the drink, with layers from foreground logo, middle subject, to background sign and wall. Color palette: red, white, blue, with silver-gray and light green accents, evoking American retro fast-food style. Lighting is soft, diffused from indoor sources, highlighting facial contours, skin texture, and bare upper body. The neon sign casts warm red light, contrasting with cool metallic reflections, adding depth and atmosphere. The overall mood blends nostalgia, youthful sensuality, modern edge, and casual elegance, like a candid yet carefully staged photograph captured with a professional camera, full of detail and artistic flair, but retaining a sense of everyday intimacy, reminiscent of street photography or a travel snapshot.",
