        {
          "id": "krea2-2a4e91d4ab246590702fe87d",
          "alias": "单女黑内衣丛林戏谑躺阅读",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies sideways on crisp white sheets, wearing a black lace bra and matching panties, a burgundy baseball cap tilted low over her forehead, her long hair spilling over her shoulders and chest. She reads an open book, one hand tracing the page, the other supporting her body, her legs bent and crossed at the ankles in a lazy, teasing pose. Her face is delicate, skin pale, lips slightly parted, eyes soft and focused on the text. The bed fills the lower frame, the white linen wrinkled and inviting. Above, a sheer white mosquito net hangs like gossamer, catching the light, its edges fluttering gently. A dark wooden bed frame frames the scene, contrasting with the lush tropical rainforest background—layered green leaves from palm to shrub, dappled with soft sunbeams. The composition is centered but slightly left, with the book guiding the eye through the netting into the deep green. Soft natural light streams from the right, highlighting her face, arms, and the pages, casting subtle shadows across the sheets and net. The palette is white, green, and burgundy—the cap a vivid accent. The mood is intimate, relaxed, and slightly voyeuristic, like a stolen moment in a tropical resort afternoon. Sensual and natural, no staged stiffness, just the poetry of a quiet, private escape.",
