          "alias": "单女半褪白外套船上微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands on a cruise ship deck, her short white down jacket hanging open, revealing her bare chest and a beige knitted dress slipping off one shoulder, fluffy grey fur collar framing her neck, black hair cascading naturally. She closes her eyes with a gentle smile, right hand raised in a victory sign, left hand gripping the white metal railing, pose graceful and relaxed. Bright daylight natural light from upper right casts soft shadows on her skin and clothes. Foreground: sharp white metal railing and ship structure. Midground: churning blue waves and white foam. Background: vast ocean, distant green hills, clear blue sky, a Korean flag fluttering in the breeze. Composition follows golden ratio and rule of thirds, subject left-third, sightline right to open sea. Warm beige of her outfit contrasts with cool blue tones. Slight wide-angle distortion and natural grain, edges slightly blurred, giving a realistic amateur snapshot feel. Rich details: quilted texture of jacket, softness of fur, foam on waves, contours of hills, folds of flag. Overall: a candid, joyful vacation moment, capturing freedom and exploration.",
