          "prompt": "A young female DJ stands at a professional Pioneer mixer, utterly absorbed in her mixing. Her long black curly hair cascades over bare shoulders. She is topless, her full breasts exposed and nipples slightly hardened in the cool studio air. Her fair skin glows under soft overhead lighting. She looks down at the console, red lips parted in concentration, black studio headphones with blue accents snug over her head. She wears only the headphones, a thin light-beige strap top slipped off one shoulder and draped around her waist, leaving her torso nude. Her right hand gently touches a knob while her left holds a pink fluffy pen. On her wrist, a pink cat-ear furry band and a white smartwatch. The black Pioneer mixer is covered in knobs, faders, and glowing displays, with a Stomp! effect unit in front. The background fades into black drapes on the left and pink-white fabric on the right, with dim stage lights. Medium shot, her body slightly angled to the left, natural composition. Light comes from above and front, highlighting her face, bare chest, and the mixer’s metallic reflections. Color scheme of black, white, gray with pink and blue accents. The result feels like a real, candid photo from a professional DJ set—sensual, focused, and unpolished in its raw authenticity.",
