          "alias": "单女黑T恤雪地冷淡站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands in a snow-covered outdoor setting, wearing a black fur-trimmed trapper hat with a wide brim, thick body, and ear flaps hanging down, the hat straps naturally falling beside her cheeks. Her long hair is dark brown, slightly wavy, and falls softly over her shoulders, speckled with snow, giving it a damp, textured look. Her eyes are clear and bright, staring directly at the camera with a cold, calm expression, lips slightly parted in a natural pink hue, facial features defined, skin fair and delicate with a faint blush. She wears a black thin-strap camisole, revealing her flat stomach and slender waist, with a small navel at the center. Over it, she has a camo-patterned down jacket, unzipped and open, showing an orange inner lining. The jacket's surface features intricate designs including animals, plants, and geometric elements, primarily in gray-brown with orange and blue accents, with puffy, thick sleeves. Her right hand hangs naturally, holding a black object (possibly a phone or remote), while her left hand rests on a thick tree trunk behind her, its bark rough and cracked, dark gray, piled high with snow. Surrounding the trunk are dense snow-covered pines, branches bent under the weight of snow, creating a silver-white world. In the background, a dark gray wooden cabin with vertical planks and windows reflecting faint light. The sky is overcast, gray-white. The entire scene is blanketed in thick snow, the ground pristine white, with distant trees and buildings shrouded in soft mist, evoking a quiet, cold atmosphere. Composition is centered on the woman, occupying the main visual space, with the subject in the foreground, trees and snow in the midground, and cabin and far hills in the background. Visual guidance leads through her gaze and body posture toward her face and upper torso. Lighting comes from diffuse overcast light, soft and even without harsh shadows. Overall color palette is cold, emphasizing the icy feel, with contrast from the orange jacket lining and her skin tone, adding visual depth. The image has a strong sense of everyday realism, as if taken with a point-and-shoot camera, rich in detail and texture, presenting a lifelike, authentic beauty.",
