        {
          "id": "krea2-257bca50ac3654c1d6d8eb79",
          "alias": "单女湿身黑泳装海滩媚态站立",
          "prompt": "A red-haired woman stands on a sandy beach at sunset, wearing a barely-there black bikini with thin straps and a deep waist cutout that accentuates her long, curved figure. Her skin glows with a warm golden tan under the setting sun. The breeze lifts her flowing hair, and she wears a dark gray baseball cap tilted low, shadowing part of her face for a mysterious, sultry look. She raises her right hand, fingers lightly brushing her lips in a thoughtful, sensual gesture, while her left hand hangs at her side, a delicate chain running from her wrist to her hip, tracing an elegant line down her body. Her stance is slightly tilted, leaning forward with confident, almost provocative poise. Behind her, the ocean glitters with rippling waves that crash into white foam on the shore. The sky blends soft orange-pink hues with deep blue water. The composition centers her slightly left, with the foreground showing fine sand and rolling surf, the midground on her wet body, and the background stretching to the horizon. Harsh but warm sunlight comes from the right side, illuminating her profile, arms, and legs, casting sharp shadows on her left side and the ground, enhancing her curves and depth. The mood is serene, romantic, with a lazy summer dusk feel. Colors are warm—orange, pink, purple, deep blue, and black—creating a realistic yet artistic look, like a high-quality candid portrait. The lens focuses on her face and upper body, with the background softly blurred, emphasizing her wet skin, the texture of her hair, and the spray of the waves. The image is full of life and erotic tension, conveying freedom, independence, and raw beauty.",
