        {
          "id": "krea2-f8fe2a43793f530550241415",
          "alias": "单女紫T恤摄影棚媚态自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman shot from a low angle, her long jet-black hair cascading naturally, strands catching soft light with a subtle sheen, some brushing her cheek and shoulder for a lazy, sensual effect. Her facial features are delicately sculpted, fair skin flawless, makeup layered and precise—sharp winged eyeliner, warm earth-tone eyeshadow blending into a gradient, and full rose-red lips parted just enough to hint at invitation. Her gaze locks onto the camera, confident and deep; head tilted back slightly, one hand elegantly draped behind her head, arm showing a smooth line that accentuates her body’s curve. She wears a deep purple lace camisole with delicate ruffle trim at the edges, transparent mesh fabric revealing hints of skin beneath, an antique-style dark pattern printed on the chest. Her neck is adorned with a gold chain necklace featuring a double-C logo luxury pendant, details crisp. The composition places her in the left foreground, dominating the frame; the midground reveals an ornate European interior with a ceiling decorated in intricate Baroque stucco and gold leaf motifs—acanthus scrolls, spirals, and classical figural elements. At the center, an oil painting depicts blue sky with clouds and branching trees, its gilded frame contrasting sharply against the wall. In the background, dark wooden balustrades and stair rails gleam with metal rivets, reflecting ambient light and creating depth. The whole scene is bathed in warm amber lighting from ceiling sconces and hidden fixtures, casting soft highlights and shadows across her face and body, enhancing dimensionality while glinting off the golden surfaces, amplifying the opulent atmosphere. The low-angle perspective stretches space, making her appear taller and more commanding; the interplay between foreground figure and background architecture guides the eye from her face upward to the lavish dome. The overall mood blends classical luxury with modern sensuality, both artistic and intimately voyeuristic—as if capturing a socialite’s spontaneous selfie in a lavish theater box. The image quality feels hyper-real, like a professional studio shot yet retaining casual authenticity. Tones are warm and rich, details abundant, brimming with narrative tension and erotic charge.",
