        {
          "id": "krea2-5b01cc936ba95d9462ffbbf6",
          "alias": "单女全裸金网袜泳池媚态坐注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a metal grate by the pool, her soft pink hair gleaming faintly in the dim light, bangs neatly framing her forehead with a few strands falling naturally across her cheeks. She looks down into the lens with a lazy, seductive gaze, her skin pale and flawless, makeup expertly done – lavender-to-silver shimmering eyeshadow, thick curled lashes, and a nude pink lip. She wears a tight, shimmering purple minidress covered in tiny sequins that catch the light, with a heart-shaped neckline, delicate pearl-and-crystal straps, and a silver rhinestone belt cinching her slim waist. A multi-layer pearl necklace with a pink heart pendant rests on her chest, matching crystal earrings and a beaded bracelet adorn her, light nail polish and rings on her fingers. Her right hand holds up a transparent high heel with a metallic spike heel, the sole beige and the heel studded with sparkling gems. She wears yellow fishnet stockings that clearly show their pattern, outlining her long legs. She sits sideways, leaning slightly forward, one hand on the ground, the other holding the shoe, her pose both elegant and teasing. The background is a deep green pool surface with blurred reflections, concrete pool edge, and the metal grate extending diagonally into the frame. A low-angle shot places her center-right, guiding the eye from the fishnets and shoe in the foreground, through her body, to the pool behind. The lighting is soft, from above and front, highlighting her face and figure, casting shadows on the pool and creating a mysterious, nighttime or dusk atmosphere. The palette blends purple, pink, and yellow against deep green – stark yet harmonious. The image feels fashion-forward and artistic, like a high-quality photo with fine detail, slight film grain, and natural noise, evoking a raw, amateur-device realism. It tells a story of urban nocturnal loneliness and beauty, fusing futurism, cyberpunk, and romantic elements into a modern yet nostalgic vibe.",
