        {
          "id": "krea2-805cd793a1649127932fc7a9",
          "alias": "单女露胸白背心舞台神秘倚靠过肩",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a sexy western cowboy style, wearing a wide-brimmed brown sheepskin hat with metal rivets and a star badge, slightly distressed with natural wear and vintage sheen. Her long black hair falls softly over her shoulders, slightly wavy, catching the light. She has a sharp, sculpted face with clean makeup—deep eyeliner, natural pink lips, eyes locked on the camera in a calm, confident, and mysterious stare, lips slightly parted. She is topless, her bare breasts exposed, with only a loose white high-neck vest hanging open at the sides, revealing her shoulders and collarbone. A dark brown tie hangs from the neckline, ending in a decorative metal buckle with a star motif and small chain, blending rock and vintage detail. She wears high-waisted brown faux-leather shorts with worn texture and creases, matte finish, multiple metal buckles and adjustable strap loops on the sides, giving a western workwear vibe. In her right hand she holds a silver-gray professional microphone with a black pop filter; her fingers are adorned with several rings—a thick band and delicate chain rings—and a chunky metal chain bracelet on her left wrist. She leans lazily against a large black stage equipment case with red stripes and metal locks; a silver metal stand is visible nearby. The background is a backstage concert area with empty gray upholstered seats in curved rows, and through the glass windows distant stage lights flicker with blue-green spots in a night scene. The overall lighting is dim, but the subject is front-lit from slightly left, creating clear chiaroscuro on her face and body, highlighting her nude torso and the curve of her breasts. Mid-shot portrait, subject centered slightly left, foreground equipment case and microphone draw the eye. Color palette: brown, white, black, with cool color points in the background, blending warmth and coolness. The image is finely detailed, realistic yet artfully composed, like a candid shot taken with a wide-aperture professional camera in low light, capturing a star's moment between performances—full of narrative and emotion, modern yet retro, fusing pop culture with western aesthetics.",
