        {
          "id": "krea2-d9863d393b55cc4b1834b05e",
          "alias": "单女半褪白连衣裙客厅媚态倚靠脱衣",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a white one-shoulder pleated short dress, now undone and slipping off her shoulder to expose her bare breast, leans sensually against a dark wooden cabinet. Her long hair falls naturally, eyes soft and focused on the lens with a quiet, alluring gaze. She wears light pink thigh-high stockings and fluffy white boots, adding a playful yet warm touch. Her right hand rests lightly on the cabinet edge, left hand hanging down, with a delicate bracelet and a thin necklace. Her body is slightly turned, accentuating her curves. The foreground features black-and-white geometric hexagonal floor tiles with soft reflections, indicating gentle indoor light. The midground includes a vintage dark wood door and a wooden cabinet with metal handles, a small weathered horse-head sculpture on top right, adding artistic flair. The background is warm orange-toned textured walls, creating a cozy atmosphere. Composition follows rule of thirds, with the woman occupying the left third, leaving space for furniture and decor, creating visual balance. Lines from the door frame and corner guide the eye toward her, then along her face, body contour, down to her fluffy boots, forming a smooth viewing path. Lighting comes from the front right, soft warm light defining her silhouette, with clear highlights on face and shoulders, subtle shadows on fabric folds, and faint floor reflections enhancing realism. The overall mood is warm, serene, and artistic, as if in a private living room or study. Shot with medium-format camera and large aperture lens, simulating film grain and natural bokeh, high resolution, fine texture, rich color tones, slight grain and film color for nostalgia and authenticity. Stable composition, slightly low angle emphasizing her posture and environment, capturing an elegantly candid moment with story and emotional warmth, like a fashion magazine editorial blend of style and life.",
