          "alias": "单女全裸泳池冷淡躺戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman lies diagonally on the bottom of a swimming pool, her nude body stretched out and resting against the blue mosaic tile wall, head tilted back slightly, arms draped lazily over a metal handrail above her. She wears a white diving mask with transparent lenses reflecting faint blue light, and long white scuba fins that lift gently at the tips as if caught by a current. Her nipples are visible, the water's caress leaving her skin goosebumped. The camera tilts, capturing her from a low angle: foreground shows crisp blue square tiles with white grout lines receding into sharp perspective; midground focuses on her toned legs, smooth curve from knee to ankle, and the detailed holes and ridges of the fins; background fades into deeper blue, with shafts of sunlight breaking the surface, casting dappled patterns on the tiles and her body. Her expression is calm, lips slightly parted, eyes meeting the lens with a hint of mystery. The composition follows a diagonal from bottom-left to top-right, the metal handrail creating a horizontal counterpoint, guiding the eye along her torso to her face. The cold blue tone simulates underwater light filtering, with soft halos and scattered highlights illuminating her pale skin against the dark backdrop, subtle grain and desaturated color lending a candid, amateur-shot realism—an intimate, dreamlike summer moment of solitude and submerged desire.",
