          "prompt": "A topless female police officer stands at the center of a city street, wearing a white mesh police cap with a black brim, the cap badge clearly visible. She stands sideways, her gaze soft and sultry as she looks toward the left of the frame, lips slightly parted in a knowing, sensual smile. Her long dark brown hair is neatly tied in a low bun, with a few strands falling from under the cap, blending efficiency with erotic allure. She wears the standard short-sleeved police uniform, but the front is completely unbuttoned, exposing her bare breasts with erect nipples, the fabric hanging open at the sides. Her shoulder patches and arm patches still read \"People's Police of the People's Republic of China\" with the police emblem, and her chest badge reads \"006017\". A red Party emblem is pinned over her bare skin, and a blue-and-white lanyard hangs around her neck. A walkie-talkie is slung over her right shoulder, and her duty belt holds a body camera, handcuffs, and baton. On her right hand she wears a white glove, holding a mobile phone, while her left hand rests casually at her side. The overall pose is professional yet provocatively relaxed. The foreground is a sharp half-length close-up of her, the midground a blurred city street with faint road markings, and the background features soft-focus pedestrians, green trees, distant lampposts and building outlines. The composition follows the rule of thirds, with her positioned on the right third of the frame, her gaze directing the viewer's eye off-screen, creating a dynamic visual extension. The camera angle is slightly low, lending a sense of intimacy and authority. The light is soft and even, as if from an overcast day or early morning diffused light, giving moderate color saturation, detailed skin texture, clear uniform details, and natural shadow transitions. The overall palette features light blue, white, and black, accented by the red Party emblem and yellow insignias, harmonious and unified