          "prompt": "A young woman sits on snow-covered wooden steps, wearing a loosely draped off-shoulder Nordic knit sweater in cream and light blue with geometric snowflake patterns, pulled down to expose one bare shoulder and the top of her chest, hinting at a lack of a bra underneath. She pairs it with a very short light blue ruffled miniskirt that rides up as she shifts, revealing the tops of her creamy thighs. She wears a white cat-ear beanie with a small black tag, her long wavy brown hair cascading over her shoulders. Her eyes are downcast, lips slightly parted in a soft, serene expression. Her hands rest gently on her knees, fingers long with deep red nail polish. She wears tall white fluffy knee-high socks adorned with pom-poms at the cuffs, and chunky light gray-blue mesh sneakers. She leans forward slightly, legs crossed, one foot flat on the snow and the other bent upward, creating an elegant curve. Behind her, a white wooden house with horizontal siding, white-framed windows with lace curtains, and two artificial snow-covered pine trees frame the scene. A thin layer of snow covers the ground, dotted with a few dried leaves. Sunlight streams from the upper right, casting soft warm shadows and highlighting the texture of her skin and clothing. The shot is a medium, slightly high angle, capturing her full figure and the intimate, cozy atmosphere. The image has a subtle film grain, natural color saturation, and a dreamy yet candid feel.",
