          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a pure white background, wearing a deep blue high-neck sweater with a soft, chunky knit texture. The sweater is slightly unbuttoned at the top, revealing a hint of cleavage, and features a silver chain of four-leaf-clover links draped diagonally from the left shoulder to the right waist. She wears a semi-sheer white lace skirt with intricate geometric patterns and floral embroidery, asymmetrical hem—a high slit on one side exposes her long legs clad in glossy black stockings that cling tightly to every curve. Black pointed stiletto heels with metal buckle details complete the look. Her pose is natural and relaxed, body slightly tilted, left hand resting on her hip, right arm hanging down. Long black wavy hair cascades loosely, some strands falling across her face. Delicate makeup with soft eye shadow and natural lip color; she gazes directly at the camera with a contemplative expression. The composition is a mid-shot from head to toe, with a clean white background. Soft overhead lighting creates a bright, professional studio feel. The color palette is blue, white, and black, focusing on the intricate clothing details, the metal chain, and the transparent effect of the lace skirt, enhancing the sensuality and artistic look. High detail, sharp textures, capturing a moment of modern urban elegance and confident allure.",
