        {
          "id": "krea2-f158bb9585a1cd9b83e7c6c7",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙舞台微笑站立脱衣",
          "prompt": "A woman stands center stage in a black pleated mini skirt and a sheer white bubble-sleeve blouse, holding a clear crystal trophy. The trophy reflects soft light with geometric cuts, blurred gold text, and a dark base. She poses slightly sideways, elegant, with a gentle smile, bright eyes looking at the viewer, exuding confidence. Her long hair is tied in a low ponytail, stray strands framing her face. Simple silver hoop earrings adorn her ears. She wears black high-heel ankle boots with rugged woven shafts, metallic thin heels, and black sock tops visible at the ankle. Her long legs are smooth, fair, toned. She stands on a dim stage with dark gray carpet texture. Two large professional stage lights flank her, black metal bodies with round lenses and control panels showing blue numbers \"051\", solidly built with visible details. Behind, a giant LED screen displays dynamic light effects in reds, pinks, purples—flowing light spots, abstract geometric patterns, scattered glowing circles, blurred white Chinese characters and symbols, creating a dreamy futuristic vibe. The scene is lit with warm, dramatic light from above and sides, casting soft shadows. Her skin is smooth, clothing folds visible; the sheer sleeves appear translucent under light, outlining her silhouette. The composition is centered, her face and trophy as focal points. The background gradient and dynamic light elements complement the subject. Foreground is her and the trophy, midground lights and floor, background LED screen. Deep spatial layers guide the eye upward from her face and trophy to the light effects. Overall atmosphere blends celebratory solemnity, futuristic technology, and artistic photography—like a high-end award ceremony moment, captured with medium format camera in studio lighting, rich details, saturated yet natural colors, smooth transitions, low noise. It evokes a Leica M-series film shot with wide aperture in low light, full of narrative and warmth. NSFW version: Her blouse is partially unbuttoned, exposing her bare chest and nipples, with the sheer fabric clinging to her skin.",
