        {
          "id": "krea2-58541a27d80bb74bcc425d04",
          "alias": "单女黑短裙媚态站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a deep black backdrop, wearing a sleek black velvet off-shoulder top and a floor-length black lace skirt with a dramatic high slit that reveals sheer black stockings hugging her long legs. She gently touches her cheek with one hand while the other holds a black Chanel double-C handbag. Her hair is swept into a sleek high bun, with a few loose strands falling across her forehead, gold hoop earrings and a delicate chain necklace accenting her neck. Her makeup is flawless, lips full and glossy, eyes locked on the camera with a sultry, confident gaze. The outfit exudes high-end luxury, the velvet top cut low to show a hint of cleavage, the lace skirt's slit rising high to expose the curve of her thigh and the top of the stockings. The composition is centered, full-body shot, with the pure black wall behind and blurred gold decorative elements above. Soft front-left lighting casts gentle shadows across her form, highlighting the texture of velvet and lace, the sheen of stockings, and the fine details of her jewelry. The mood is sophisticated yet intensely sensual, with a black and gold palette, moderate saturation, and a fine film grain that gives a timeless, editorial quality. The visual flow draws the eye from her face down her neck, past the exposed skin, to the long, bare leg revealed by the slit, creating a powerful, artful image of restrained desire.",
