        {
          "id": "krea2-dfa9356ecea1e264506247e1",
          "alias": "单女蓝泳装户外媚态站立侧头",
          "prompt": "A young adult woman stands under an outdoor shower, her body glistening with water. She wears a blue and white floral patterned bikini—the triangle top clings wetly to her breasts, thin straps cutting across smooth shoulders, the fabric sheer and stretched, revealing the outline of her nipples; the low-rise bottom features multiple cross-straps at her waist and thighs, creating intricate cutouts that frame her bare skin. Her arms are raised high, fingers running through her wet short black hair, head tilted back slightly. Her gaze is direct, eyes half-lidded with lazy confidence, lips parted in a subtle, knowing invitation. A thin chain necklace with a minimalist pendant rests at her collarbone. Water streams from the metal shower head above, cascading in sparkling arcs, droplets catching light and beading on her skin, leaving trails of wet reflection. She stands before a rough beige concrete wall, its texture worn. In the blurred background, muted city buildings rise, while green plant leaves sway in the foreground. Her body forms an elegant S-curve, left leg bent, right extended. Soft, warm daylight from above sculpts her curves, casting subtle shadows across her damp skin. The overall mood is intimate, fresh, and charged with sensual stillness—a captured moment of pure summer indulgence.",
