          "id": "krea2-59837c6a445b73bfe92979f8",
          "alias": "单女露胸米外套城市媚态站立持包",
          "prompt": "A woman with long black wavy hair, glossy under warm light, wears only an open cream tweed short jacket and matching shorts, her white knit top discarded, bare breasts exposed, nipples prominent. She stands in a luxurious interior, right hand resting on a dark brown geometric wooden wall, left hand holding a small black leather handbag with gold chain detail. She wears black high heels with gold floral ornaments. Her makeup is elegant, lips soft, eyes confident and gentle, looking directly at the viewer. Background: left side red-brown vertical striped wood paneling, right side light gold wall with black power outlets, hinting at a real living space. A purple orchid on a marble surface in the distance. Dark polished wood floor reflects light and her silhouette. Center-left composition, body slightly turned, creating a natural visual lead. Soft warm front-right light highlights her face, bare skin, and clothing details, casting subtle shadows. Warm beige, brown, black tones with purple floral accents. Professional photography style with realistic lighting, high-end fashion magazine feel, emphasizing modern urban elegance and sensual luxury.",
