        {
          "id": "krea2-b7c468602f56230eb2e01af3",
          "alias": "单女绿泳装泳池俏皮坐戏水",
          "prompt": "A young woman sits on a giant pink flamingo inflatable float, wearing a deep green one-shoulder one-piece swimsuit, the simple elegant design with a thin white strap accentuating her smooth neck and shoulders. Her long black hair falls naturally, a pair of sunglasses perched on top of her head. Her hands rest lightly on the float's edge, legs crossed, pose relaxed and confident. She stares directly at the camera with a playful yet composed expression, her fair skin, delicate makeup, and slightly parted red lips exuding summer vitality. The pink flamingo float is huge, its bright color contrasting with the blue pool water, its head raised high, neck curved in an elegant S-shape, cartoonish black-and-white eyes, black beak, with natural wrinkles and light-shadow details showing realistic inflatable texture. The background is an indoor heated swimming pool with clear blue water, fine ripples reflecting circular ceiling spotlights and wall lights. The pool edge has blue-and-white striped tiles, the walls are light gray large tiles with slight reflection, and a vintage wall lamp emits warm yellow light, creating soft illumination. In the distance, a passage to changing or lounge area, dark non-slip floor tiles, several wooden lounge chairs neatly arranged, metal handrails and steps leading to deeper water. Composition centers left, with the woman and flamingo float as main visual elements, guiding the eye from foreground to midground to background. Camera angle slightly overhead, capturing full body and some environment, enhancing realism. Lighting: top spotlights provide even main light, natural light from the left creates alternating light patches and reflections on wall and water, water surface glows softly, scene bright but not harsh. Color palette is cool-toned—blue water and gray walls form a calm base—while pink flamingo and green swimsuit add vibrant contrast, making the image visually striking. Overall mood is relaxed, joyful, like a quiet afternoon enjoying pool time alone. The image has a realistic amateur-device quality: slight grain, natural depth-of-field blur, face sharp, background softly blurred, simulating a phone or consumer camera. Composition natural, unoverprocessed, preserving a candid daily-life moment, conveying a carefree, confident, slightly cozy everyday emotion.",
