        {
          "id": "krea2-bd6d8b7547eed9a2412f776b",
          "alias": "单女露胸短裙公寓冷淡站立拥抱",
          "prompt": "A young woman stands against a pure white background, topless, her bare chest exposed with perky nipples, smooth pale skin glowing under soft overhead light. Her short black hair falls naturally, slightly tousled with a subtle sheen, ends neatly framing her neck. Sharp facial features, focused gaze with a hint of cold intensity, lips slightly parted, naturally red. She wears a high-waisted red pleated miniskirt, the skirt puffing out in layered, airy folds, revealing her flat stomach and waist curves. Her arms are encased in long red gloves extending above the elbows, matching the skirt. On her legs, red over-the-knee boots with shiny, tight leather, pointed toes, stiletto heels, hugging her thighs, legs pressed together, toes slightly turned inward. Her body angles slightly, head turned to the right, eyes looking into the distance, creating a contemplative, waiting mood. Mid-shot full body, subject slightly left of center, negative space on the right for balance. Camera from a slight side angle, capturing complete proportions and fabric details. Lighting from front-top, soft and even, minimal shadows, highlighting her skin and the vivid red outfit. Background is light gray-white, clean, enhancing the red saturation. Subtle reflections on boots and gloves suggest silk-like texture. Overall mood: cool, stylish, with strong color contrast and minimalist high-fashion aesthetic. A professional studio feel, yet a hint of amateur realism—faint floor reflections and a barely visible yellow marking line hint at the shooting environment. Dominant red tones, white backdrop, skin tones create layered visual hierarchy. Composition draws the eye from her head down along the red lines to her heels. The image blends futuristic and retro influences, exuding artistic appeal and commercial allure.",
