        {
          "id": "krea2-81d74136c566cd86a5780c41",
          "alias": "单女全裸长裤泳池媚态自拍",
          "prompt": "A young woman poses in a private poolside space at night, wearing a sheer light gray-purple mesh outfit—a thin-strap top with cutouts and dense silver beadwork, paired with high-waisted tight mesh pants also shimmering with beads. The ensemble is both sensual and futuristic, revealing glimpses of bare skin through the transparent fabric. Her brown hair is swept up in a high bun, with loose strands falling softly around her face. She has flawless, glowing skin with a dewy finish, dramatic metal-gradient eyeshadow, thick lashes, and nude-pink lips. She holds a phone up with her right hand for a selfie, her arm elegantly posed, a simple silver bracelet on her wrist, and silver-gray geometric nail art. Her body angles slightly, left arm resting naturally. The background is an infinity pool with cold blue water reflecting ambient light, rough dark stone edges contrasting with smooth water. The phone’s edge partially frames the left side, adding a candid, intimate feel. Lighting comes from a front fill light or flash, creating sharp highlights on her skin and clothing, while the pool’s blue glow provides cool backlighting. The color palette features cool blues and gray-purples against warm skin tones. The composition is a close-up portrait, her gaze direct and confident, evoking both K-pop stage presence and spontaneous everyday sensuality. The image is hyper-detailed, realistic, like a high-end digital photo, with the mesh texture, skin sheen, and water reflections all sharply visible—blending futuristic glamour with raw, intimate selfie energy.",
          "description": "",
          "image": "",
