          "alias": "单女露胸灰长裤摄影棚媚态注视",
          "prompt": "A young woman in a private studio performs an intense pilates inversion, completely topless, her pert breasts swaying with the movement, wearing only deep grey high-waist leggings and black knee-high socks with white stripes. Her hair is pulled back in a sleek ponytail. She balances upside down with her hands pressed onto the wooden platform of the pilates reformer, one leg extended straight upward, the other bent and crossed over it, showcasing her toned abs and flexed core. Her head is tilted back slightly, gaze focused ahead, expression calm and concentrated. The camera angle is slightly low, simulating a handheld shot—the wooden reformer with its curved bumpers and metal nameplate dominates the foreground, while the woman’s nude torso and elongated legs fill the midground. Soft, even natural light from above casts gentle shadows across her skin and the equipment, enhancing muscle definition and the geometry of the pose. The background is a smooth cream wall, the floor pale grey. The composition is vertical, emphasizing the diagonal line of her body from hands to extended foot. Clean, modern aesthetic with neutral tones (cream, light wood, black, deep grey) and tiny blue accents from the sock stripes. The image has a realistic, amateur quality, as if casually captured in a home gym, focusing on her core action with slight background blur. The atmosphere is serene, professional, and intensely sensual—a perfect fusion of strength and vulnerability.",
